<node id="CoEvolution Project">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Project</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Project (101168560) is a significant research initiative designed to enhance the security, resilience, and robustness of artificial intelligence (AI) systems, particularly within supply chain contexts. Operating under the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 grant agreement as part of the Horizon Europe framework, this collaborative effort involves multiple organizations working together to develop comprehensive frameworks and tools aimed at ensuring the security and integrity of AI models throughout their entire lifecycle.

A central goal of the CoEvolution Project is to integrate key principles such as security-by-design, privacy-by-design, and explainability-by-design into AI frameworks. By doing so, the project aims to bolster the trustworthiness and ethical use of AI applications while addressing essential interoperability, security, and data integrity requirements critical for networked AI systems. These efforts also include adherence to notable regulatory frameworks, such as the EU Artificial Intelligence Act, ensuring that ethical practices are maintained throughout the project's lifecycle.

Over its 36-month duration, the project plans to implement structured collaborative activities, develop cascading models, and establish an end-to-end Security, Trust, and Robustness (STR) assessment solution. This assessment will incorporate diverse components to improve the security and ethical management of AI technologies. The CoEvolution Project further addresses challenges related to adversarial attacks on AI applications, thereby enhancing the overall efficiency and cost-effectiveness of AI development.

In addition to its technical objectives, the CoEvolution Project emphasizes dissemination and communication activities to engage stakeholders and maximize visibility and impact of its research outcomes. Through these efforts, the project aspires to foster a trustworthy ecosystem for machine learning and secure interconnected AI solutions, while infusing ethical considerations and compliance with relevant regulations into its practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32cbd08ce6f50d78ff9bcc410caf04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a0f23e95fea1a56df838e0e512fb24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8bb95ba3048fe4ba1a028477aaf2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d36e00d6638001bed983791ad13038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e741d2fb52b5df1d877e151403c66ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ecf64aa779212b37143119b15ede3cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27fa07b6f1f7106aece74437f014454c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7595c8200e32fa30ada5bd766b8a892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9701b9fcb1c10b2c9b20f3e1b27700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e4c02ab56fd93c5cc9c23327e28ccc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c51e62034d566f8ec8ff4a84d94f137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d40ee8239b5807a75857260b7afe44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ae44e85d2d5dcfce82a1281830565f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6ae473e081b0c09042d9b500838d9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613f6432243d121b9ba6b6dbfd90ee39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab48b662719cb842a1786a0c13a6d2cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2a026cf3ae3a1dbeb730bf3d668f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f0d1e34de2be2bf0ff36b6e60cd080b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03709ab50db69591a5a3696b455f47c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1087592f8aa348e94306c4850776be80</data>
