<node id="European Commission-EU">
  <data key="d0">European Commission-EU</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Commission is the granting authority for the CoEvolution Project, demonstrating its involvement in funding and supporting AI and technology initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission-EU is identified as the granting authority responsible for overseeing the funding and direction of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission-EU is the granting authority responsible for the oversight and management of EU funding programs, including grants for research and innovation.</data>
