<node id="AI Act">
  <data key="d0">AI Act</data>
  <data key="d1">economic_policy</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Act is a comprehensive legislative initiative put forth by the European Union, specifically established by the European Commission. Its primary aim is to ensure safety, trustworthiness, and fairness in artificial intelligence (AI) applications across all industries within the EU. This regulatory framework seeks to enhance accountability and compliance, significantly shaping the landscape of AI development, including initiatives like the CoEvolution Project, which illustrates the Act's pivotal role in guiding best practices in AI.

While the AI Act has received praise for fostering a secure and reliable environment for AI technologies, it has also faced criticism. Some detractors have expressed concerns about its potential shortcomings, particularly regarding its effectiveness in managing vulnerabilities within AI supply chains. These criticisms raise questions about the Act’s capability to meet its ambitious objectives. Nevertheless, the AI Act stands as a testament to the European Union's commitment to the responsible regulation and application of AI technologies, aiming to bolster public trust and ensure the ethical development of artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Act refers to EU legislation aimed at ensuring safety and trustworthiness in AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d680583096f4188d4745b78c423dfc52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9701b9fcb1c10b2c9b20f3e1b27700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de9ab24149e20dd885bdf7aa0cbc37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bdd45e641a1d84d501219cd34c72fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750697798fe8d5704aacb6736b165901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a296b5c4f24ed1a5eae98b2e605e9835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e4c02ab56fd93c5cc9c23327e28ccc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02286c7e1707a806f9e9959dada558a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbd9a2bb872299c973114830584e0f5</data>
