<node id="Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d0">Horizon Europe</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Horizon Europe is the European Union's key funding program dedicated to supporting research and innovation projects, operational from 2021 to 2027. It succeeds the previous framework, Horizon 2020, and was established by the European Parliament and the Council. This program is designed to enhance the EU's competitiveness and sustainability by tackling societal challenges through targeted research initiatives.

Horizon Europe plays a critical role in advancing scientific research across various sectors and promotes collaborative efforts among institutions. It includes a wide array of projects, such as the CoEvolution project, which aligns with the program’s broader objectives of fostering research policy and innovation. The program establishes clear rules for participation and dissemination of research results while also emphasizing methodologies aimed at achieving gender equality and promoting open science.

Furthermore, Horizon Europe addresses significant global issues, including climate change, and supports the ambitions of the United Nations’ Sustainable Development Goals. Funding for projects is facilitated through agreements like Grant Agreements and model consortium agreements, ensuring compliance with specific conditions related to the management of research results, including regulations on transfers and licensing.

In summary, Horizon Europe is a vital framework that supports innovative initiatives, advances scientific knowledge, and strengthens collaboration among researchers across Europe, with a particular focus on societal impact and sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68530f7500a72fc731f00e3c4c766df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f209ba7faab244fa0ec2f617b5183fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a93e21225df55c31ecc56184951d00a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77f4d0db61ea04c6dd99be408590bb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2a026cf3ae3a1dbeb730bf3d668f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18adeb9ccf3125e3ad8c543104b15e6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a84d8d7354b37635782731ce52777a46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698ec7ba0564e6bef01ced0b3d7984a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b040918a9ab9d53eb1630a7309bd1d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef03a8059a065d6002cea06de607314&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-496ff2c08e0ff26b59002ce18b9a5411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c811c5c2da7facca7b18e0019c9ea9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0530cf4664cec89a37e5f2b19520ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aeb98f7220f8ac33b9ea96243f02f57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925b1f5a2133d1fdc125c610bbbae027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1226bfbc3ea69059eb3576fcaf4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b00fdd2f27bd284a89482ce01dfb87f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02286c7e1707a806f9e9959dada558a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94df68d0d67efc3c4a863e29734fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd16c3e5393576d24