<node id="Greece">
  <data key="d0">Greece</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Greece is a country in Europe and the location of EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON.&lt;SEP&gt;Greece is an active participant in the CoEvolution consortium, which is dedicated to enhancing AI resiliency through collaborative efforts. As a contributing partner, Greece focuses on the development of secure AI systems. Geographically, the country is home to two significant institutions that play pivotal roles in this advancement: the EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON, located in Athens, and the ATHINA-EREVNITIKO KENTRO KAINOTOMIAS STIS TECHNOLOGIAS TIS PLIROFORIAS. These institutions are instrumental in advancing research and innovation in the fields of information technology and communication systems.

Additionally, Greece hosts PANEPISTIMIO PATRON in Rio Patras, which further contributes to the country’s commitment to technological development and research initiatives. Through these concerted efforts and collaborations, Greece solidifies its role in the international landscape of AI and technology innovation, highlighting its importance within the CoEvolution consortium's research initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;Greece is involved in the CoEvolution project consortium, contributing to research efforts in AI systems and their security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0797f992209f90df906499cd0d556dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337883c2db61f2b342a431e196a403af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc2a026cf3ae3a1dbeb730bf3d668f58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7e190ff7826e647efd60e074ebf9f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd16c3e5393576d245d512c360865185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd2acaeb0d9437c3f09baa7c94ddf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7fd8590e514e02237067258b84c6af2</data>
