  <data key="d0">ATHINA-EREVNITIKO KENTRO KAINOTOMIAS STIS TECHNOLOGIES TIS PLIROFORIAS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The ATHINA-EREVNITIKO KENTRO KAINOTOMIAS STIS TECHNOLOGIES TIS PLIROFORIAS, referred to as ISI, is located in Maroussi, Greece.&lt;SEP&gt;This center in Greece focuses on innovations in information and communication technologies and is a participant in the CoEvolution Project.</data>
