<node id="UNIVERSITA DEGLI STUDI DI CAGLIARI">
  <data key="d0">UNIVERSITA DEGLI STUDI DI CAGLIARI</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The UNIVERSITA DEGLI STUDI DI CAGLIARI, commonly known as UNICA, is a university based in Cagliari, Italy. This institution is actively participating in the CoEvolution project as a beneficiary. It is recognized for its commitment to educational and research activities, contributing significantly to the academic landscape in Italy.&lt;SEP&gt;This university in Italy is involved in the CoEvolution Project, contributing research and expertise.&lt;SEP&gt;UNIVERSITA DEGLI STUDI DI CAGLIARI, abbreviated as UNICA, is an academic institution involved in the CoEvolution Consortium.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
