<node id="INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM">
  <data key="d0">INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM (IMT) is a distinguished higher education institution located in Palaiseau, France, with a focus on engineering and technology. It has been actively involved in education and research within these fields and has played a significant role in various projects. IMT was a key participant in the CoEvolution initiative, where it contributed valuable insights and expertise, thus enhancing collaborative efforts in advancing engineering and technology. However, as of the date following the amendment request submission, INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM's participation in the CoEvolution Project has been terminated. Despite its prior involvement and contributions as a beneficiary in the project, the recent decision indicates a shift in its engagement with this initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM (IMT) was previously a beneficiary of the CoEvolution Project but has had its participation terminated.&lt;SEP&gt;INSTITUT MINES-TELECOM is a French educational institution involved as a beneficiary in the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03709ab50db69591a5a3696b455f47c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5ae44e85d2d5dcfce82a1281830565f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1087592f8aa348e94306c4850776be80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7e190ff7826e647efd60e074ebf9f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
