<node id="SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT">
  <data key="d0">SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT is one of the beneficiaries involved in the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT, commonly referred to as Siemens AG or abbreviated as SIE, is a prominent German multinational company headquartered in Munich. Founded as a leader in engineering and technology solutions, Siemens AG specializes in electrification, automation, and digitalization. The company plays a significant role in various sectors and is known for its commitment to advancing technological innovation.

As a beneficiary of the CoEvolution project, Siemens AG actively contributes its industry expertise and innovative approaches to the development of artificial intelligence (AI) infrastructure and solutions. This participation underscores the company's dedication to ongoing development and innovation within the tech landscape. Additionally, Siemens AG is referenced in financial data for grant purposes, reflecting its importance in the industry and its proactive involvement in projects aimed at fostering new technological advancements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c67b0558b13d1d04ff0092eb88d7122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de</data>
