<node id="AEGIS IT RESEARCH GMBH">
  <data key="d0">AEGIS IT RESEARCH GMBH</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AEGIS IT RESEARCH GMBH, commonly referred to as AEGIS, is a private research organization located in Braunschweig, Germany. The company specializes in information technology research and development, providing insights and technological solutions within the IT sector. AEGIS is actively participating in the CoEvolution project, where it focuses on the security aspects of artificial intelligence models. As a beneficiary organization within the CoEvolution grant agreement, AEGIS plays a significant role in advancing AI research initiatives, contributing to the field of information technology both in Germany and on an international scale. Recognized for its innovative contributions, AEGIS is dedicated to fostering research developments within the IT industry, particularly in the areas of cybersecurity and technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
