<node id="TELEFONICA INNOVACION DIGITAL SL">
  <data key="d0">TELEFONICA INNOVACION DIGITAL SL</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">TELEFONICA INNOVACION DIGITAL SL is a Spanish company involved in the CoEvolution project, focusing on digital innovation.&lt;SEP&gt;TELEFONICA INNOVACION DIGITAL SL, also known as TID, is a subsidiary of Telefónica based in Madrid, Spain. The company is a key beneficiary of the CoEvolution project, where it actively participates in driving innovation in digital solutions and technologies, particularly within the telecommunications sector. TID's involvement emphasizes its commitment to fostering digital transformation and advancements in Spain. As part of the CoEvolution grant agreement, it plays a significant role not only in the development of AI-related innovations but also serves as a legal representative within the project's consortium. This underscores TID's responsibility in managing grant allocations and financial reporting related to their initiatives, highlighting their integral position in promoting digital innovation in the region.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c67b0558b13d1d04ff0092eb88d7122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
