</node>
<node id="UNIVERSITA DI PISA">
  <data key="d0">UNIVERSITA DI PISA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Università di Pisa, commonly referred to as UNIPI, is a prestigious institution located in Pisa, Italy. Renowned for its academic excellence, UNIPI offers a diverse range of programs across various disciplines and actively engages in educational and research initiatives. The university is recognized as a beneficiary organization in the CoEvolution project, which underscores its commitment to collaborative research efforts. As part of this initiative, UNIPI contributes its expertise, particularly in the field of communication technologies, and participates by providing academic research across various scientific fields. Overall, the Università di Pisa plays a significant role in advancing knowledge and innovation within the academic community and beyond.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
