<node id="SECURITY LABS CONSULTING LIMITED">
  <data key="d0">SECURITY LABS CONSULTING LIMITED</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SECURITY LABS CONSULTING LIMITED is involved in the CoEvolution project, providing consultancy in cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;SECURITY LABS CONSULTING LIMITED, abbreviated as SLC, is an Irish consulting firm based in Dublin, Ireland, with additional presence in Cork. The company specializes in providing security solutions, particularly in the field of cybersecurity. SLC is notably involved in the CoEvolution Project, where it serves as a beneficiary organization within the grant agreement. This involvement highlights SLC's commitment to collaborative initiatives aimed at enhancing security measures in various sectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
