</node>
<node id="AVL LIST GmbH">
  <data key="d0">AVL LIST GmbH</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVL LIST GmbH is an Austrian engineering company based in Graz, Austria, that specializes in automotive technology and research. The company focuses on powertrain and vehicle development, providing innovative engineering solutions. AVL LIST GmbH is also involved in the CoEvolution project, where it contributes its expertise to enhance automotive engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;An Austrian firm specializing in automotive research and development, participating in the CoEvolution Project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
