<node id="AviSense.AI technovlastos IKE">
  <data key="d0">AviSense.AI technovlastos IKE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Greek technology company focused on AI, contributing to the CoEvolution Project.&lt;SEP&gt;AviSense.AI technovlastos IKE, abbreviated as AVI, is a technical organization that signed the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;AviSense.AI technovlastos IKE, abbreviated as AVI, is an organization based in Patras, Greece, specializing in aerial technology and artificial intelligence applications. The company is actively involved in the CoEvolution project, serving as a beneficiary. Through its focus on AI technology and its various applications, AviSense.AI aims to advance innovations in the field of aerial technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
