</node>
<node id="DIINEKES S.I. MONOPROSOPI IDIOTIKI KEFALAIOUCHIKI ETAIREIA">
  <data key="d0">DIINEKES S.I. MONOPROSOPI IDIOTIKI KEFALAIOUCHIKI ETAIREIA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DIINEKES S.I. MONOPROSOPI IDIOTIKI KEFALAIOUCHIKI ETAIREIA is a Greek company listed as a beneficiary in the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;DIINEKES S.I. MONOPROSOPI IDIOTIKI KEFALAIOUCHIKI ETAIREIA is involved in the CoEvolution project, focusing on investment and private equity.&lt;SEP&gt;DIINEKES S.I. MONOPROSOPI IDIOTIKI KEFALAIOUCHIKI ETAIREIA, commonly referred to as DIE, is a private equity firm based in Gazi, Greece. The company specializes in capital investments and plays an active role in the financial landscape of Greece. DIE is involved in the CoEvolution Project, participating as a beneficiary in this innovative initiative, which focuses on AI development and other developmental projects within the industry. The firm's engagement in the CoEvolution Consortium highlights its commitment to fostering technological advancement and contributing to significant initiatives in the sector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
