</node>
<node id="CYBERALYTICS LIMITED">
  <data key="d0">CYBERALYTICS LIMITED</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CYBERALYTICS LIMITED, also referred to by its abbreviation CBRL, is a Cypriot company headquartered in Nicosia. The organization specializes in analytics and cybersecurity solutions, contributing significantly to various initiatives aimed at enhancing security measures. As a participant in the CoEvolution project, CYBERALYTICS LIMITED plays a dual role as both a beneficiary and a consulting entity within the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement. 

The company is recognized for its expertise in cybersecurity analytics, particularly in applications involving artificial intelligence (AI). Through its involvement in the CoEvolution project, CYBERALYTICS LIMITED actively engages in data-driven approaches that advance the project’s goals, leveraging its innovative strategies to improve the overall security landscape. Its contributions include collaborative agreements that enhance the effectiveness of cybersecurity initiatives and a commitment to advancing the field through research and development in analytics and cybersecurity solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
