<node id="SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG">
  <data key="d0">SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG (STS) is a technology solutions firm located in Zug, Switzerland, recognized for its significant contributions to the CoEvolution project. As an associated partner and beneficiary within the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement, STS leverages its expertise in technology solutions to aid in achieving the collective objectives of the participating organizations. The company is tasked with implementing specific action tasks that enhance the overall goals of the project. Furthermore, STS leads Work Package 3, which focuses on specification and requirements, underscoring its commitment to technological innovations, particularly in the realm of AI technology solutions. SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG is identified by the unique identification number (PIC) 881338703 and plays a pivotal role in advancing the project’s initiatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c07f9e21489aa565e0113a4b396d22a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce227760b6961446d68e3a6677a900b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-513280f6927e9d616d879baf249f9364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b067a273693cb100c626ffac8631e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef356bf47d4a7662b1eebd219b6efecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
