</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Project Document">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Project Document</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Project Document is a comprehensive report that encapsulates the objectives, methodologies, and participants involved in the CoEvolution project. It serves as a formal record of the agreements and collaborations among various organizations engaged in this initiative, thereby facilitating the implementation and impact of collaborative AI systems. 

The document outlines specific rules regarding confidentiality, security, ethics, and integrity that must be adhered to by beneficiaries involved in grant-funded actions. It is closely connected to a grant agreement under the HORIZON-CL3 funding program, detailing estimated budgets for various actions undertaken within the project. Additionally, it provides guidelines and unit costs pertinent to contributions and operations for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and other beneficiaries participating in European research initiatives.

The CoEvolution Project Document also serves as a model for financial statements related to projects funded by the Horizon Europe program, promoting a standardized approach to financial reporting across related initiatives. Furthermore, it details amendments requested and updates concerning the transition of responsibilities among the participating organizations in the machine learning framework project. 

In summary, the document outlines historical changes, deliverables, associated partners, and necessary budget adjustments, making it a critical tool for fostering collaboration and ensuring the ethical and efficient management of resources within the framework of the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1840a2aa861c08b15185d927867134a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-167b08e854bdbecae98ac74e0774cabf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-777c5064b9d91d9fead9d42c14884581&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5185d69b7c5d3118e3df0ca5a428a0e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa3e6dafd736c20ef4b244c92ce1a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91306f86deee226d4e904fb6737b7337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7627bf3a6479da8bd78bb376ead3b76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daedd8cfb8dad5cd7a0132b3057fb6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41ac125419ee9d10dfde2acdb689a395</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423355</data>
</node>
