<node id="Project CoEvolution">
  <data key="d0">Project CoEvolution</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Project CoEvolution refers to the action described in the agreement focusing on machine learning and AI solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Project CoEvolution refers to the initiative aiming to develop secure interconnected AI solutions and advance machine learning technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Project CoEvolution refers to the initiative aimed at establishing a secure framework for connected machine learning and AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698ec7ba0564e6bef01ced0b3d7984a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180</data>
