<node id="Consortium Body">
  <data key="d0">Consortium Body</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Consortium Body refers to any management body defined in the Consortium Agreement that is responsible for overseeing the project's execution and administration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consortium Body refers to any management body described in the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement responsible for overseeing the project's execution.</data>
