<node id="Consortium Plan">
  <data key="d0">Consortium Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Consortium Plan outlines the tasks and funding agreements for the Parties involved in the project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consortium Plan refers to a comprehensive framework established under the Grant Agreement for the CoEvolution Project. It includes the Description of the Action and outlines the related budget, detailing the allocation of funds among the various parties involved. The Plan specifies the tasks and responsibilities of each party, ensuring clarity in roles and obligations. Additionally, it sets forth the guidelines and principles for collaboration and funding, facilitating effective cooperation among all entities participating in the project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419436</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Consortium Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is a formal document that governs collaboration among various institutions and companies participating in a project under the Horizon Europe framework. This agreement details the roles, responsibilities, and commitments of the participating parties regarding the development of a trustworthy framework for machine learning and artificial intelligence (AI) solutions. Currently in version 0.33 as of October 23, 2024, it outlines the essential terms and conditions related to the rights and liabilities of the involved organizations.

The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement serves as a comprehensive model that includes guidelines for collaboration, access rights, confidentiality, and the management of confidential information. It specifies the roles of each participating organization, provisions regarding publication, and governance regulations within the consortium, thereby ensuring effective collaboration and funding.

Additionally, the agreement establishes procedures and regulations for meetings and decision-making processes among consortium members. It outlines the collaborative framework and conditions for participation in the CoEvolution project, which focuses on connected machine learning and secure AI solutions. Through this structured environment, the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement aims to foster innovation and create a conducive atmosphere for successful co-evolution projects among its members. Overall, it delineates the relationships among the participating parties, including their obligations, rights, and compliance with relevant laws.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a93e21225df55c31ecc56184951d00a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163e8dfb11222dec22dc86de3c28a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698ec7ba0564e6bef01ced0b3d7984a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8daee7887465a1bbc64f6da189934ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c811c5c2da7facca7b18e0019c9ea9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cbcc5a33a538807285883f44a32ffd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf164c706b7b264b8973737a16cc2a90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1226bfbc3ea69059eb3576fcaf4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419431</data>
</node>
<node id="Belgian Law">
  <data key="d0">Belgian Law</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Belgian law is the jurisdiction under which the obligations and principles of the Consortium Agreement are governed.&lt;SEP&gt;Belgian law provides the legal framework regulating the obligations and responsibilities of the Parties participating in the Consortium Agreement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419430</data>
</node>
<node id="Granting Authority">
  <data key="d0">Granting Authority</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Granting Authority, identified as the European Commission-EU within the context of the CoEvolution project under Horizon Europe, is a pivotal entity in the financial management and oversight of projects. This authority is primarily responsible for approving reports, managing allocated funding, and ensuring compliance with the Grant Agreement. Its diligent oversight ensures the proper progress of the CoEvolution project and the delivery of necessary financial support. 

The Granting Authority reviews the tasks performed by all involved parties and examines the justification for incurred costs to ensure that funding is utilized appropriately as stipulated in the Grant Agreement. It plays a significant role in the issuance of grants, decision-making regarding financial contributions, and the enforcement of specific obligations imposed on participating entities. Additionally, the authority is responsible for making decisions related to suspensions and compliance with obligations, including the potential to amend or terminate agreements based on compliance and other considerations.

Moreover, the Granting Authority facilitates collaboration by approving the selection of user groups that require extensive access to research installations, ensuring that participants can collaborate and access necessary resources. It oversees compliance with funding conditions and the rights associated with the results generated during the project, including managing the transfer of ownership or licensing of results and issuing objections or requests for further information when necessary.

In summary, the Granting Authority plays a critical role in maintaining the integrity and success of the CoEvolution project by overseeing financial operations, ensuring adherence to established agreements and requirements, and managing the funding process, including payments to beneficiaries and recovery of funds. It is an essential organization responsible for providing grants and managing funding allocations within projects, particularly in relation to the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f209ba7faab244fa0ec2f617b5183fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da85149284498fc139e8be382b981003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-884efa32a7364a4e3afb2c062c3914da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee906c164033c38c47ee9b5abf0836f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698ec7ba0564e6bef01ced0b3d7984a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8367c05350cd3e59ea1f7a290218e7e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef03a8059a065d6002cea06de607314&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27fa07b6f1f7106aece74437f014454c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc1f667d5d7b593ff074f4172cecd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aeb98f7220f8ac33b9ea96243f02f57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7627bf3a6479da8bd78bb376ead3b76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6587c0a38b949dea5de8a236e80407fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbe105bf419f163813e1e4122e6db8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340cab0aeae7a8a4e864f5fb97fb2b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bef6d6959d6bcf368dc857e36330e25e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422093</data>
</node>
<node id="DESCA">
  <data key="d0">DESCA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DESCA is an organization intimately involved with the Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe, a significant initiative within the European research and innovation landscape. As the primary provider of this model consortium agreement, DESCA offers a comprehensive framework and guidelines that facilitate collaborative projects across various sectors.

The organization specializes in developing and providing standardized consortium agreements tailored specifically for Horizon Europe. This includes not only essential templates and advice but also extensive resources that support project partners in understanding and navigating the complexities of collaboration. With a focus on clarity and effectiveness, DESCA plays a crucial role in enhancing successful partnerships among project members.

In addition to its core function, DESCA offers detailed instructions concerning access rights and exploitation themes, thereby reinforcing its mission to foster effective collaboration. The organization's Model Consortium Agreement serves as a foundational template that is adaptable to various consortium arrangements, including specific initiatives such as the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement.

Moreover, DESCA is responsible for convening meetings and facilitating decision-making processes among its members, thereby ensuring that all involved parties are aligned and informed. Its contributions are significant in streamlining the partnership formation process within Horizon Europe initiatives, equipping stakeholders with the necessary tools and guidelines to promote successful cooperation and project execution. Overall, DESCA is a key entity that underpins the collaborative framework of Horizon Europe, promoting research and innovation across Europe.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1226bfbc3ea69059eb3576fcaf4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8daee7887465a1bbc64f6da189934ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667986d4a34f30cf5bfa22415edc5c10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c811c5c2da7facca7b18e0019c9ea9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419440</data>
</node>
<node id="Associated Partners">
  <data key="d0">Associated Partners</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Associated Partners are entities involved in a Project that play a supportive role without signing the Grant Agreement or directly receiving funding from the Granting Authority. They commit to various obligations and responsibilities related to the implementation of the Project, helping to ensure its success. While they do not have a formal contract with the Granting Authority, Associated Partners contribute to the project by participating in specific tasks as outlined in the agreements that govern the overall implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;Associated Partners are entities participating in the project without signing the Grant Agreement, responsible for their own funding and implementation of specific tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Associated Partners are parties committed to the actions and responsibilities specified in the Grant Agreement, including support for beneficiaries and compliance with regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419431</data>
</node>
<node id="EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal">
  <data key="d0">EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal is a platform for inquiries regarding EU funding, specifically concerning grant conditions and financial management.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal is an electronic platform managed by the European Commission, designed to facilitate access to various EU funding opportunities and provide essential materials for project implementation. This portal serves as a comprehensive resource for organizations seeking information about EU funding details and eligibility, as well as the application process and associated guidelines. 

It plays a critical role in managing EU grants, procurements, and other funding programs, offering administrative support to institutions and agencies involved in these processes. The portal enhances transparency and accessibility for potential applicants, thereby supporting their communication and submission efforts related to EU grants. Notably, it also encompasses specific projects, such as the CoEvolution project, further emphasizing its extensive functionality. Through its user-friendly interface, the EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal aims to streamline the experience for applicants seeking EU financial support.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Funding &amp; Tenders Portal is the platform through which the CoEvolution project is managed concerning EU funding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b72b3e7ba1aaeb63a98bb04479fd99ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f209ba7faab244fa0ec2f617b5183fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61e4eed06e3b3b8ee3a6ee60907c6c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca60b53f4fb08a71c2cabf42d2f6530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb4f50a59cc14eb247934005c503a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4e4ed58eff7ae3d119d2cc4a4dc34f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8367c05350cd3e59ea1f7a290218e7e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5bb32d295f690e6535a7cb23fa6baa</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425819</data>
</node>
<node id="General Assembly">
  <data key="d0">General Assembly</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The General Assembly serves as a vital governing body within the consortium, composed of one representative from each participating member. It is responsible for formulating proposals and making decisions in accordance with established procedures, ensuring the effective management of consortium operations and agreements. Primary responsibilities of the General Assembly include approving minutes from meetings, managing consortium member obligations, and overseeing compliance with the Consortium Agreement.

Additionally, the General Assembly must approve any modifications or withdrawals concerning the project’s Background as outlined in the agreement. It plays a crucial role in addressing issues related to breaches of obligations among members, which includes identifying parties in violation of their commitments and managing any legal actions or procedures that may arise. Regular meetings are convened to discuss various agenda items, facilitating collaboration among members and guiding the consortium's operations.

Through its decision-making processes, the General Assembly also handles financial considerations such as managing additional costs, maintaining a cooperative environment, and ensuring that all members adhere to their respective obligations as set forth in the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement. Overall, the General Assembly is integral to the governance and oversight of the consortium, actively contributing to its operational effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163e8dfb11222dec22dc86de3c28a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698ec7ba0564e6bef01ced0b3d7984a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d78b6916c07894b52e49fb0226ca1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2e8770375019a8ec84b226fe246ed3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
