<node id="European Anti-Fraud Office (OLAF)">
  <data key="d0">European Anti-Fraud Office (OLAF)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Anti-Fraud Office (OLAF) is a key institution responsible for safeguarding the financial interests of the European Union. OLAF examines the use of EU funds and works diligently to combat fraud that affects these financial interests. The office continuously monitors and investigates issues related to fraud impacting the EU budget, and it is also tasked with overseeing the implementation of grants to prevent fraudulent activities and ensure compliance with relevant regulations. In addition to its investigative responsibilities, OLAF promotes fraud prevention measures throughout the EU.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ebde38c3cbda883291428373982665b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755421004</data>
</node>
<node id="European Public Prosecutors Office (EPPO)">
  <data key="d0">European Public Prosecutors Office (EPPO)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">EPPO is an independent prosecuting authority of the EU that combats crimes against the financial interests of the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;EPPO is responsible for investigating and prosecuting crimes affecting the financial interests of the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;EPPO is an institution tasked with investigating and prosecuting crimes against the financial interests of the EU.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419432</data>
</node>
<node id="Consortium Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Consortium Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Consortium Agreement is a formal legal document that establishes the terms and conditions under which the involved parties collaborate and share results in a project. It outlines the roles, responsibilities, and rights of each participant, including the Coordinator, thereby ensuring that every partner understands their obligations and can operate effectively within the project framework.

The Agreement serves to regulate various aspects of the collaboration, such as governance and management, thus specifying the rights and obligations of all parties involved. It details essential elements including access rights to software, confidentiality provisions, publication rights, and the distribution of results or background knowledge among the partners. By addressing these critical components, the Consortium Agreement lays a foundation for a successful partnership, ensuring that all collaborators are aligned in their contributions and responsibilities while adhering to the project's objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consortium Agreement outlines the rules and responsibilities of all project partners, particularly concerning IP ownership and access rights.&lt;SEP&gt;The Consortium Agreement outlines the rules concerning IP ownership, access rights, and management of results generated by the consortium.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2e8770375019a8ec84b226fe246ed3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aeb98f7220f8ac33b9ea96243f02f57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee7f9cc09dacb04da20b5e541d35880&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-496ff2c08e0ff26b59002ce18b9a5411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d78b6916c07894b52e49fb0226ca1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d72b113a4fa1ce0763800ea6022d752f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425741</data>
</node>
<node id="European Court of Auditors (ECA)">
  <data key="d0">European Court of Auditors (ECA)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ECA audits EU finances to ensure accountability and compliance with financial regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;ECA audits the EU's finances to ensure accountability and transparency of financial management.&lt;SEP&gt;ECA is responsible for auditing EU finances and ensuring accountability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654</data>
