  <data key="d5">1755419432</data>
</node>
<node id="DESCA Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d0">DESCA Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The DESCA Model Consortium Agreement is a framework for collaboration on Horizon Europe projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419174</data>
</node>
<node id="Project">
  <data key="d0">Project</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Project is a collaborative initiative involving multiple entities working together under the guidelines established by the Consortium Agreement and the Grant Agreement. This endeavor is characterized by structured cooperation among its members, who are tasked with adhering to specific responsibilities regarding Confidential Information and reporting. The Project encompasses a variety of activities and tasks assigned to the participating partners, which underscores the collective nature of their efforts. Through the aforementioned agreements, the Project outlines the operational framework for the involved parties, emphasizing their roles and cooperative objectives in this joint undertaking. Overall, the Project embodies the joint efforts of the members to achieve specific objectives as delineated in the text, while functioning under defined conditions and limitations for its implementation and exploitation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e8daee7887465a1bbc64f6da189934ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3ab8cb1038a2d7402e7c20f7922fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18adeb9ccf3125e3ad8c543104b15e6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755421630</data>
</node>
<node id="Force Majeure">
  <data key="d0">Force Majeure</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Force Majeure refers to events that prevent a Party from fulfilling its obligations under the Consortium Agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Force Majeure refers to unforeseen events that prevent a Party from fulfilling its obligations under the Consortium Agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Force Majeure refers to unforeseen circumstances that prevent parties from fulfilling their contractual obligations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419434</data>
</node>
<node id="Foreign Trade Regulations">
  <data key="d0">Foreign Trade Regulations</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Foreign Trade Regulations are laws that govern the import and export of goods and are applicable to all Parties in the consortium.&lt;SEP&gt;Foreign Trade Regulations encompass the laws and guidelines governing international trade, import and export restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419298</data>
</node>
<node id="Background">
  <data key="d0">Background</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Background encompasses a range of essential data, know-how, and information crucial for the successful execution of a project and the exploitation of its results. It refers to any pre-existing knowledge or materials that the parties involved in the project contribute, which are owned or licensed by them before the project's effective date. 

Specifically, Background includes initial information or context outlined in Attachment 1 of the agreements that are pivotal to the project’s management and implementation. It comprises various elements such as data, information, or technological solutions provided by entities involved in the project, like AVL. This pre-existing knowledge facilitates the project's execution but is generally restricted to the employees of the involved entities.

Each party must manage their contributions according to the terms specified in the Consortium Agreement, which establishes specific access rights and restrictions over the Background materials. Additionally, the term emphasizes that these contributions include identified limitations and conditions for how the Background knowledge may be utilized throughout the project. Overall, Background is a critical component that supports the project by integrating each participant's prior resources and expertise to enhance its outcomes. It serves as the foundation for the necessary knowledge and materials that beneficiaries must identify for implementing funded actions effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364ff6bf933fe0af2f8dba4b5fab5748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77f4d0db61ea04c6dd99be408590bb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-496ff2c08e0ff26b59002ce18b9a5411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445008e17e64c0438134e1fefbcf5dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420829</data>
</node>
<node id="Party">
  <data key="d0">Party</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Party refers to any entity or individual that participates in the Consortium Agreement, bearing specific obligations and rights.&lt;SEP&gt;A Party refers to any legal entity, individual, or organization that is involved in the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement. Each Party is responsible for specific obligations and rights outlined within the agreement. These Parties include any signatories bound by the terms and provisions of the Consortium Agreement and the Grant Agreement. All members participating in the Project fall under this definition, thereby ensuring they adhere to their designated roles and responsibilities as stipulated in the respective agreements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d78b6916c07894b52e49fb0226ca1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419434</data>
</node>
<node id="DESCA - Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d0">DESCA - Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The DESCA - Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe is an organization that offers a comprehensive model consortium agreement specifically designed for projects funded under the Horizon Europe program. This framework agreement aids parties in managing their collaboration and legal obligations, ensuring that all members of the consortium are aligned. It provides essential guidelines for various aspects of consortium operation, including meetings, decision-making processes, and governance. The agreement outlines the procedures and regulations that govern the interactions and responsibilities of the consortium members, facilitating effective collaboration in Horizon Europe projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163e8dfb11222dec22dc86de3c28a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419436</data>
</node>
<node id="Chairperson">
  <data key="d0">Chairperson</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Chairperson is a designated individual responsible for preparing the agenda, conducting meetings, and managing the documentation of decisions in the consortium.&lt;SEP&gt;The Chairperson is responsible for preparing the meeting agenda, overseeing the General Assembly meetings, and ensuring that minutes are taken and distributed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419435</data>
</node>
<node id="Minutes of meetings">
  <data key="d0">Minutes of meetings</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Minutes of meetings are formal records documenting the decisions taken during the General Assembly meetings and must be circulated to members.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419174</data>
</node>
<node id="Grant Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Grant Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Grant Agreement serves as a crucial legal document that establishes the framework, obligations, and conditions for beneficiaries participating in projects under the HORIZON initiative, including specific projects like HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 and CoEvolution. This Agreement acts as a formal contract, regulating the participation of entities within the consortium and specifying both financial and operational terms. 

It delineates the responsibilities assigned to the Coordinator and other consortium members, ensuring clarity in collaboration and outlining the obligations and commitments of all parties involved. The Grant Agreement details the financial contributions and obligations of the participants, along with the rules governing funding and the outcomes generated by the consortium. 

As a foundational document for project management, it provides a comprehensive framework that governs financial aspects, background rights, access rights, and various procedures relevant to grants and the results they produce. Additionally, the Agreement serves as the legal basis for the consortium's operations, specifying conditions for the implementation and exploitation of results within the Horizon Europe projects, including terms for amendments and potential termination of funding.

Overall, the Grant Agreement ensures that all parties understand their roles and responsibilities in achieving the project's objectives while clearly outlining the expectations placed upon beneficiaries and the conditions associated with financial support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-924177c0e0f362a235f652bd1017e028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5d3c3eaedec46daebd343527b0c0d92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee906c164033c38c47ee9b5abf0836f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0997e404b51fe3aa39a52767ed1caac5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e293777d71c3ca9709a65d86e40e18b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c19c865a25591ddde6bd157a82d4494a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3707e20d16139764030bceade2cbcdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2804b4b4d78b4e8ad4bf46a4086bc654&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d78b6916c07894b52e49fb0226ca1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e901df4ec4c380c4f63b0cd3f4cc859&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0299893c12de3ee2631ab3f6cf4ec2e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aeb98f7220f8ac33b9ea96243f02f57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2e8770375019a8ec84b226fe246ed3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-925b1f5a2133d1fdc125c610bbbae027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e311b0bf4e60d61a3a28a1b7cce6c4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a48cfc1f38ba5b30413053bbdefda5ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
