<node id="PlanIoT">
  <data key="d0">PlanIoT</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PlanIoT enables optimized management of sensor data, extending to context-aware AI resilience in decentralized architectures.&lt;SEP&gt;PlanIoT is an open-source framework developed by IMT to support context-aware AI resilience and facilitate the dynamic updating of IoT data in decentralized architectures. It is designed to manage sensor data efficiently, utilizing optimized methods that align with specific application requirements and context information. Although initially introduced as an asset within a project, PlanIoT has since evolved into IMT's intellectual property, leading to its replacement following IMT's withdrawal from the associated initiatives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d2ff0e7582f72b15822c3c3392a6345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f995ea0aa653e5c578ea2df5d9ff710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424902</data>
</node>
<node id="AEGIS Advanced Visualization Toolkit">
  <data key="d0">AEGIS Advanced Visualization Toolkit</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AEGIS Advanced Visualization Toolkit (AVT) offers a solution for handling large quantities of heterogeneous real-time data and providing visualizations.&lt;SEP&gt;AEGIS is an advanced visualization toolkit mentioned in the agreement, designed to handle real-time data and provide intuitive visualizations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd</data>
