<node id="Houssam Hajj Hassan">
  <data key="d0">Houssam Hajj Hassan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Houssam Hajj Hassan is a researcher involved in scientific articles regarding the PlanIoT framework and its applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Houssam Hajj Hassan is an author associated with scientific articles cited in the Consortium Agreement related to PlanIoT and IoT management.&lt;SEP&gt;Houssam Hajj Hassan is one of the authors of multiple scientific articles regarding the PlanIoT framework and its implementation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd</data>
