</node>
<node id="Georgios Bouloukakis">
  <data key="d0">Georgios Bouloukakis</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Georgios Bouloukakis is a researcher affiliated with the University of Patras who has recently departed from the consortium of the CoEvolution project. He has made significant scientific contributions related to the Project and the PlanIoT framework. Furthermore, Georgios Bouloukakis has collaborated with Houssam Hajj Hassan on various articles focusing on the Internet of Things (IoT) and data management frameworks. He is also a co-author of scientific articles that discuss PlanIoT and its adaptive data flow management, illustrating his active engagement in advancing this field of study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6ae473e081b0c09042d9b500838d9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd</data>
