  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ajay Kattepur is a contributor to the articles referenced in the Consortium Agreement, involved in the development of the PlanIoT framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajay Kattepur is a researcher mentioned in relation to the studies on IoT data management within the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Ajay Kattepur is involved as a co-author in research related to PlanIoT and its architecture.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a2ceee566aef258c4be364a95deb870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bc736562ef02e369a2653a250fd668b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd</data>
