  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Denis Conan has contributed as a co-author to the PlanIoT framework and related research articles.&lt;SEP&gt;Denis Conan is a contributor to the scientific articles focusing on the PlanIoT framework and its studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Denis Conan is one of the authors noted in the Consortium Agreement who contributed to the research associated with PlanIoT.</data>
