  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Djamel Belaid is a researcher involved in writing scientific articles relevant to the project and framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Djamel Belaid is also a co-author of the articles mentioned in the agreement, focusing on IoT data management and visualization.&lt;SEP&gt;Djamel Belaid is noted as a co-author of research articles concerning the PlanIoT project.</data>
