<node id="AVT">
  <data key="d0">AVT</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVT is a tool that allows analysts to gain insights and situational awareness through visualizations of data and relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;AVT is an analytical tool that provides intuitive visualizations for IT and non-IT experts to enhance understanding of events and data.&lt;SEP&gt;AVT is an entity that provides intuitive visualizations for IT and non-IT experts to enhance situational awareness and facilitate analysis in various contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a93e21225df55c31ecc56184951d00a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cbcc5a33a538807285883f44a32ffd6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419441</data>
</node>
<node id="SLC">
  <data key="d0">SLC</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SLC Security Labs Consulting Limited, commonly referred to as SLC, is an Irish small to medium-sized enterprise (SME) that holds a prominent position in the CoEvolution project. This initiative is focused on enhancing AI security research while ensuring that ethical standards are upheld. As a key member and lead beneficiary of the CoEvolution consortium, SLC undertakes significant responsibilities throughout the project's framework.

In its leadership role, SLC is tasked with producing evaluation reports across the project's various work packages. Notably, the organization oversees Deliverable D6.4, which summarizes the project's outcomes in a comprehensive evaluation report. SLC actively works to ensure that project objectives are met by creating final reports and supporting the overall evaluation processes. It leads Task 6.4, which is dedicated to pilot validation and the analysis of project outcomes, thereby underscoring SLC's critical involvement in evaluating and validating the CoEvolution framework.

SLC also contributes to Task 3.4, which focuses on the development of security specifications and the monitoring of cybersecurity activities. Leveraging its expertise in risk assessment for cyber assets, SLC strengthens the consortium's collective efforts to tackle cybersecurity challenges, especially those related to AI technologies. Throughout the project, SLC has demonstrated its dedication by contributing a total of 34 person-months towards various tasks linked to security, evaluation, and analysis.

Additionally, SLC leads Task 5.3, which emphasizes security and risk assessment in the AI development process. Its integral involvement is reflected in the project's budget documents, which detail the financial aspects and contributions of SLC’s participation. The organization is also engaged in exploitation and sustainability activities as part of the CoEvolution project, contributing to multiple tasks related to AI model lifecycle research, along with various work package contributions and staff efforts.

Overall, SLC's collaborative and proactive participation in the CoEvolution project plays a crucial role in addressing cybersecurity challenges associated with AI, with a focus on tasks that enhance AI safety and privacy research.&lt;SEP&gt;SLC is a participating organization in the CoEvolution project, contributing to dissemination and project activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75efa432cb6a9347528127bab93b2e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-167b08e854bdbecae98ac74e0774cabf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4e2865d7233be2941bdb2500bc81cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c8a90d0356b7b59238f88457856e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7199ae710abb0d5cc234ef5e84fcc847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d36e00d6638001bed983791ad13038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16332edc6609bf8b86a878abf63aec55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a849a6c0719d6015ef6c319e7b3a4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c4aae27b4457d3ffe0ecb38813ebd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e809a3ce6da55906320f84dbd54cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c51e62034d566f8ec8ff4a84d94f137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72e3d6c0adc259c792912cb22e5365cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c090092136e198b11011668061264f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cbcc5a33a538807285883f44a32ffd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6067ea806d15eef91a8756966c65e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841013486b274ac183dbe85d18dd9731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb05ac510a5ae593384da886fa21202c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa3e6dafd736c20e