<node id="AVISENSE.AI TECHNOVLASTOS IKE">
  <data key="d0">AVISENSE.AI TECHNOVLASTOS IKE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVISENSE.AI TECHNOVLASTOS IKE is a notable Greek company that plays a pivotal role in the CoEvolution project, a significant initiative focused on the advancement and development of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. The organization, which is also known as AviSense.AI, is actively engaged in advanced technological initiatives and is recognized in financial reports for its contributions. 

AVISENSE.AI TECHNOVLASTOS IKE specializes in research, prototyping, and software solutions that aim to enhance extended perception and awareness through extended reality (XR) interfaces. As a key participant in the CoEvolution project, the company contributes to innovative advancements in the AI field, highlighting its involvement in essential research efforts centered on technology development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f179be12e924e7455c61badff1b4c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c67b0558b13d1d04ff0092eb88d7122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426322</data>
</node>
<node id="AVL">
  <data key="d0">AVL</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVL List GmbH, commonly known as AVL, is a prominent industrial organization focused on advancing automotive engineering and technology. As a key participant in the CoEvolution consortium, AVL plays a critical role in a collaborative research project aimed at fostering innovative automotive solutions, particularly in the field of advanced driver assistance systems (ADAS). The organization leverages its extensive expertise, especially in the integration of vision sensors and artificial intelligence (AI) technologies, to enhance the security and robustness of AI model training and deployment.

Within the CoEvolution project, AVL is tasked with several important responsibilities, including adversarial attack testing, designing defense mechanisms for AI training, and developing deployment tools for various AI applications. Although some of these responsibilities have shifted to a new partner, BEVD, as AVL replaces the previous entity PAN, it remains integral to the project's success by actively addressing tasks that strengthen the AI supply chain for autonomous vehicles. Additionally, AVL's commitment to technical innovation is evident through its careful management of background rights and outcomes from multiple research initiatives, which safeguard advancements in ADAS technology.

AVL also invests significantly in advancing vehicle path planning and control, particularly concerning the sensing and control sub-use case, contributing an impressive 31 person-months across various work packages for Project 101168560. To enhance the simulation environment necessary for testing and integrating connected and autonomous vehicles (CAVs), AVL is adapting its testbed to ensure compatibility with the infrastructure of the CoEvolution hub.

Recognized as a pivotal player in automotive innovation, AVL's extensive involvement in the CoEvolution project and related research initiatives solidifies its position as a leader in the development and deployment of vehicle automation technologies. AVL directs Task 3.2 within the project, which focuses on gathering technological and industrial requirements for the project's use cases, leading to exploitation activities and long-term sustainability strategies. In addition to these efforts, AVL disseminates findings and engages in tasks that pertain to AI model deployment and the development of security technologies, further reinforcing its essential role within the CoEvolution consortium. Furthermore, AVL is involved in developing paradigms for context awareness in networked AI systems and introducing monitoring tools for various use cases, showcasing its comprehensive approach to innovation in the automotive sector.&lt;SEP&gt;AVL is a partner in the CoEvolution project, responsible for specific deliverables such as the Exploitation Plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a0f23e95fea1a56df838e0e512fb24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4e2865d7233be2941bdb2500bc81cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c85ec84436942dd8fc56f3409a58ac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24642f1f9525ded7b8b36983c7df32bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8830be99a56abf88963043f2ab9507b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb9925c33404cf10a29a2c57f9e6874c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c090092136e198b11011668061264f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cbcc5a33a538807285883f44a32ffd6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c87d6a857aafb6563d655e01caf5221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827c0e1b05bc9eac5d2bbfb266ef6562&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce012c5c7284b310263eb73817161dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613f6432243d121b9ba6b6dbfd90ee39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1840a2aa861c08b15185d927867134a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bb7e6360e26602def4ba1d660311269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8bb95ba3048fe4ba1a028477aaf2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e809a3ce6da55906320f84dbd54cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91306f86deee226d4e904fb6737b7337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec24c7171d1f9190641a3a8d0adbdf96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18adeb9ccf3125e3ad8c543104b15e6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9101312bae5650dad5c9bc39d26c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-991c83168528be4a6