  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Carbon-Fiber Spikes enhance performance in athletics, specifically in sprinting events.&lt;SEP&gt;Carbon-fiber spikes are mentioned as an innovative solution tailored to the needs outlined in the varying project developments.</data>
