<node id="Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Agreement is a formal contract that outlines the terms and conditions under which beneficiaries accept a grant and implement the CoEvolution project. It delineates the obligations, rights, and compliance requirements associated with this grant, serving as an official document that establishes the fundamental regulations that beneficiaries must adhere to. Specifically, the Agreement addresses aspects related to personal data processing and management, ensuring clarity on access rights and project results. It functions as a legally binding document that governs the relationships and commitments of the beneficiaries in relation to the granting authority, ensuring that all parties involved clearly understand their responsibilities and the governing terms of their participation in the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-46bfcb1e7800b6d1322402d2cc7c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ba5723f8c11853502f9c64b427fd38b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-884efa32a7364a4e3afb2c062c3914da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77f4d0db61ea04c6dd99be408590bb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbe105bf419f163813e1e4122e6db8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418889b13888444f1b331214c79d5c44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27d0350792bd2bf2a5044cc72cd8959b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb7b908252804f7cc170638a174809eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce05917392d14a6ff1f6d80ad2f3e51f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422071</data>
</node>
