  <data key="d2">AviSense.AI is an organization offering research, prototyping, and software solutions aimed at enhancing perception and awareness through XR interfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;AviSense.AI's offerings are connected to the Background conditions outlined in the Consortium Agreement regarding project implementation and exploitation.</data>
