<node id="TID">
  <data key="d0">TID</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">TID is a partner organization involved in the CoEvolution project, playing a role in project activities.&lt;SEP&gt;TID, which stands for Telefonica Innovacion Digital SL, is a significant participant in the CoEvolution project and serves as a lead beneficiary engaged in multiple work packages, particularly Work Package 4 (WP4). This work package is focused on enhancing the security of AI models, where TID leads tasks aimed at AI model assessment and advancement, along with the development of context awareness technology enablers.

TID plays an essential role in various project deliverables, distinguished by different levels of dissemination. The organization is actively involved in multiple aspects of the CoEvolution project, including quality assurance, gender equality assessment, risk management, and standardization efforts. It is dedicated to promoting ethical artificial intelligence practices and contributes to the development of a software repository for the project's tools, as well as enhancing the AI model STR assessment.

As part of its diverse contributions, TID leads Task 5.5, which focuses on evolutionary strategies for context-awareness adaptation in AI systems, and Task 4.3, dealing with defensive technologies for AI model deployment. Additionally, TID is responsible for facilitating internal training for consortium members and ensuring effective dissemination of the project’s results.

Recognized for its innovative work, TID has developed a peer-to-peer (P2P) engine for realistic simulations in P2P networks, designed to support end-to-end communication and leverage mobile device capabilities for decentralized learning. This approach aligns with the project's objectives to explore distributed learning paradigms while prioritizing user privacy and reducing dependency on external systems.

With a substantial budget allocation, TID dedicates approximately 67 person-months of resources to the CoEvolution project, leading critical milestones and contributing significantly to research and development across various AI domains. Through its comprehensive engagement in the project, TID emerges as a vital contributor, effectively impacting the fields of AI while steadfastly promoting ethical practices throughout its operations.</data>
