<node id="DIE">
  <data key="d0">DIE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">DIE is involved as a partner in the CoEvolution project, participating in various activities.&lt;SEP&gt;DIE, which stands for Diinekes S.I. Monoprosopi Idiotiki Kefalaiouchiki Etairia, is a pivotal small to medium-sized enterprise (SME) actively engaged in the CoEvolution project. The project aims to enhance the security and robustness of artificial intelligence (AI) models. As a key beneficiary and participant within the project's consortium, DIE plays a critical role in various work packages and deliverables, particularly within Work Package 5, which focuses on security assurance and monitoring.

DIE leads Task 3.4, where it investigates data requirements and the lifecycle of AI models, and is also responsible for the deliverable D5.2, which pertains to the management of a security assurance monitoring repository. Additionally, DIE directs Task 6.4, contributing to the validation and feedback for the CoEvolution framework. In its collaborative efforts, DIE participates in the quality assurance task alongside ICCS and is actively involved in Task 5.4, further contributing to the project's overall objectives.

The organization has dedicated significant resources to its activities within the CoEvolution project, allocating a total of 44 person-months of effort and committing 286,000.00 EUR to support its initiatives. Through its extensive involvement, DIE addresses technological requirements, performs risk assessment processes, and engages in liaison and standardization tasks. Its comprehensive efforts are essential for advancing security monitoring and assessment solutions, thereby tackling challenges related to AI robustness and security, as well as maintaining ethical standards in innovative research and practice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a0f23e95fea1a56df838e0e512fb24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4e2865d7233be2941bdb2500bc81cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7199ae710abb0d5cc234ef5e84fcc847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c51e62034d566f8ec8ff4a84d94f137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c090092136e198b11011668061264f99&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce012c5c7284b310263eb73817161dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613f6432243d121b9ba6b6dbfd90ee39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88921885a26ccc1c5504cb6fb467c4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bb7e6360e26602def4ba1d660311269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c07f9e21489aa565e0113a4b396d22a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f8bb95ba3048fe4ba1a028477aaf2b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ef324e25221cc1aac49364c3a0e044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e809a3ce6da55906320f84dbd54cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6067ea806d15eef91a8756966c65e06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-853e3c305e010114288cc805df7be8a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b067a273693cb100c626ffac8631e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb05ac510a5ae593384da886fa21202c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec24c7171d1f91906