  <data key="d5">1755419430</data>
</node>
<node id="European Union">
  <data key="d0">European Union</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Union (EU) is a prominent political and economic union comprising primarily of member states located in Europe. Its pivotal role involves establishing and regulating various agreements and funding policies, with significant emphasis on initiatives such as the Grant Agreement. The EU is deeply committed to strengthening cybersecurity and enhancing digital sovereignty among its member states.

To support these objectives, the EU has developed a comprehensive regulatory framework that focuses on the applications of artificial intelligence (AI). Central to this regulatory approach is the AI Act, which underscores the EU's dedication to promoting the safety, trust, and fairness of AI usage across various industries. Additionally, the EU ensures compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), which plays a crucial role in upholding the integrity and security of AI applications.

The European Commission acts as the granting authority for projects aligned with this framework, such as the CoEvolution project, and sets forth specific conditions related to funding proposals and reporting requirements. This involvement highlights the EU's active participation in various programs, including HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01, further demonstrating its commitment to managing initiatives that conform to its regulatory objectives.

Overall, the European Union strives to foster cooperation and standardization across multiple sectors, especially in AI and cybersecurity. Its regulatory frameworks are instrumental in enhancing the safety and reliability of AI applications among its member states, positioning the EU as a leader in the ever-evolving landscape of technological governance.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is a political and economic union of member states that is actively regulating AI through frameworks like the AI Act for ensuring safety and trust.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union is involved in regulating AI through various frameworks to ensure safety, trust, and compliance across member states.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e4d11e0e789971dbd47542c636e3dd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d680583096f4188d4745b78c423dfc52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6bf63b8e7794868c19826908bb0e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43651fd39e9740f03571d0f1b6d6e77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df83794707f70c47ca48cb0487b40957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7998d7f556fa82a3f85973da5a1f2d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6fbc1a3bfb993cb23f1ec5cd61622f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2066bcd2fa4af3ed144ce8ac5cb90960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337883c2db61f2b342a431e196a403af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de9ab24149e20dd885bdf7aa0cbc37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-788baa379b81a91f164731d4acab9774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42212d8414381cd65827a856614c3743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bdd45e641a1d84d501219cd34c72fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b572f48736ae09487e4539ae10df17a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9870dfcb7b266f6b6ac1dd5222b5f58b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a8719a38bb7a9f42229f7fe81c9bf9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089ed2fed176c26ba2d2a44622231ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418889b13888444f1b331214c79d5c44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-284cd6a9713f3db6c2c93c7cc55157ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86f45cd8bcbd8796ed56c65b2a614309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45b51d1b85498bbe94caadd78db8dc28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31116ac4e46d186dea94d94a7702584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78f662d06ec1bd0b762ad34da27a7259&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084</data>
