<node id="Annex 5">
  <data key="d0">Annex 5</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Annex 5 is a crucial component of the grant documentation, containing specific rules and guidelines essential for the successful implementation of the associated project. It includes important provisions related to intellectual property rights, background, results, communication, dissemination, and visibility for the beneficiaries involved. Annex 5 outlines the detailed regulations concerning "Access Rights to Results and Background," which are vital for managing project outputs.

Additionally, it encompasses rules governing the transfer and licensing of the results produced during the project. While Annex 5 is instrumental in providing a framework for these key aspects, it is categorized as a referenced document within the Grant Agreement. This designation indicates that it holds lower precedence compared to the overarching Terms and Conditions of the Agreement. Furthermore, Annex 5 also refers to other sections of the EU grant documentation that address specific security rules or ethics conditions relevant to the grant. Overall, it serves as a significant reference for understanding and navigating the multifaceted requirements of the grant.</data>
