  <data key="d0">VELEDAR OMAR</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">VELEDAR OMAR is a beneficiary in the project, established in Graz, Austria, as of January 3, 2025.&lt;SEP&gt;VELEDAR OMAR is a legal entity based in Graz, Austria, with the PIC number 879892724. As of January 3, 2025, it has been recognized as a new beneficiary of the CoEvolution Project. VELEDAR OMAR actively participates in the project by contributing technology and analytics perspectives, thereby aiding in the achievement of the project's objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;VELEDAR OMAR is a beneficiary of the CoEvolution Project, affiliated with BEVD, and is established in Graz, Austria.</data>
