  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PANEPISTIMIO PATRON is a participant in the CoEvolution project, likely focused on collaborative research in AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;PANEPISTIMIO PATRON is a participating academic institution in the CoEvolution project, contributing to research and development efforts in AI and cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;PANEPISTIMIO PATRON, also known as the University of Patras (UPatras), is a Greek academic institution located in Rio Patras, Greece. It has recently been identified as a new beneficiary of the CoEvolution Project, effective January 14, 2025. As a participant in this initiative, PANEPISTIMIO PATRON plays an integral role by focusing on research aligned with the project's objectives. The university actively contributes to the CoEvolution Project alongside other participating institutions, showcasing its commitment to advancing the goals of this collaborative effort.</data>
