<node id="Ethical Principles">
  <data key="d0">Ethical Principles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ethical Principles are guidelines that inform the decision-making and conduct of the CoEvolution project in relation to legal and social responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethical Principles guide the project in addressing legal and ethical issues, ensuring the project's alignment with societal and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Ethical principles relate to the standards and considerations that must be observed in the transfer of ownership or licensing, ensuring compliance with EU values.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc3ec14a8116e38b696429a7687340d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc1f667d5d7b593ff074f4172cecd6e</data>
