<node id="Artificial Intelligence Act">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence Act</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Artificial Intelligence Act (AI Act) is a proposed legislative framework introduced by the European Union (EU) with the goal of regulating artificial intelligence technologies across its member states. This Act plays a crucial role in establishing a governance and legal structure that emphasizes ethical practices, compliance, and the safe deployment of AI technologies, ensuring that advancements align with the values and standards upheld by the EU.

Central to the AI Act is its focus on fostering trustworthiness in AI systems, which involves not only ethical management but also rigorous governance of the data utilized in these technologies. Moreover, the Act is recognized as a significant element in managing the integration of AI, which includes impact assessment projects like CoEvolution, aimed at monitoring the effects of AI within the EU.

In summary, the Artificial Intelligence Act represents a pivotal step towards ensuring that AI development and usage are conducted responsibly, reflecting European ethical standards and societal values.&lt;SEP&gt;The Artificial Intelligence Act is a proposed regulation by the EU that aims to govern the use and development of artificial intelligence technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6fbc1a3bfb993cb23f1ec5cd61622f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92873007f0d6549fac4b577e74dc0a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-955c93b159aa0cb5703c155f13b6c924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b8f0f1e7c38faeeea47d2a2b05dab74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b4f9a1d0ca30881b230205e59ea3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32cbd08ce6f50d78ff9bcc410caf04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d81cd4432e3bdb75c5cf56e4525d3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce012c5c7284b310263eb73817161dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9d50812a1d240d82e3f1a2d7627af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449cdb7f2dbaf658674f7d17457a5b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1d59e9a7b134e8ee357ab390899ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e115bd628f8fb0edc5eb2d730569997e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d65865b76581edf9ac1aac0de819fca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc12431b623f53cd11ca16b1437d498</data>
