  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EU-funded projects refer to collaborative initiatives backed by the European Union to advance research and innovation across various sectors.&lt;SEP&gt;EU-funded projects refer to initiatives supported by the European Union, promoting open science and research transparency.&lt;SEP&gt;EU-funded projects refer to various initiatives sponsored by the European Union which aim to support research and development in different fields, including artificial intelligence and cybersecurity.</data>
