<node id="Task 2.1">
  <data key="d0">Task 2.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.1 focuses on outreach planning, communication, and dissemination strategies to document and assess project communication efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.1 is dedicated to dissemination and communication activities among partners within the CoEvolution project. It emphasizes outreach planning and aims to effectively communicate and disseminate the project's results. Additionally, Task 2.1 involves tracking the communication efforts of the partners, ensuring that all outreach and dissemination activities are well-coordinated and aligned with the project's objectives.</data>
