<node id="Task 2.2">
  <data key="d0">Task 2.2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.2 is focused on standardization activities related to AI security and AI-enabled cybersecurity within the CoEvolution project. The task aims to explore and establish standards that enhance the security of artificial intelligence systems and their application in cybersecurity measures. Through these activities, Task 2.2 plays a crucial role in ensuring a cohesive approach to AI security within the context of the CoEvolution project.</data>
