<node id="Task 2.3">
  <data key="d0">Task 2.3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.3 involves liaising with other EU-funded projects and initiatives to facilitate collaboration and mutual learning opportunities. The primary focus of this task is on engaging in liaison activities that promote information exchange and identify potential avenues for collaboration among various EU-funded projects. Through these efforts, Task 2.3 aims to enhance cooperative engagement and foster a collaborative environment among participating entities.</data>
