<node id="Task 2.4">
  <data key="d0">Task 2.4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.4 focuses on exploitation activities and long-term sustainability of the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.4 is a component of the CoEvolution project that focuses on exploitation activities and the planning for long-term sustainability of the technology developed within the project. This task is dedicated to analyzing market potential and formulating business strategies to ensure the continued viability and impact of the project’s outcomes. Through these efforts, Task 2.4 aims to maximize the benefits derived from the project while addressing sustainability in a comprehensive manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.4 involves exploitation activities and long-term sustainability for the CoEvolution project, detailing actions to ensure its viability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d2ff0e7582f72b15822c3c3392a6345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce012c5c7284b310263eb73817161dd3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449cdb7f2dbaf658674f7d17457a5b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb9925c33404cf10a29a2c57f9e6874c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32e809a3ce6da55906320f84dbd54cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc12431b623f53cd11ca16b1437d498</data>
