<node id="CoEvolution Simulator">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Simulator</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Simulator is a multifaceted component integral to the CoEvolution project, designed for generating trusted synthetic data and creating virtual environments that facilitate offline policy learning and adaptation strategies. It plays a crucial role in the context of autonomous vehicle (AV) software development by ensuring that reliable data is utilized during the training and testing phases of AI models. 

By deriving sensory information and enabling comprehensive testing under controlled and trustworthy conditions, the CoEvolution Simulator enhances the validity of the model training process. It allows researchers and developers to rigorously test and validate AI systems before deployment, maintaining high standards of reliability and performance. Overall, the CoEvolution Simulator serves as a pivotal tool for generating trusted data and supporting policy learning within the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Simulator is a tool used to ensure trusted data during AI model training.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ce588e6a41e4a19bd041531ec028f838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc5395556365a730e47d5041142ed23c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a491dd9e4e112c6a3057fa684923aa8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81418f280483fb994ba74151f8e56fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b8b5bf7e419d5685f26851e9d9d67a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f39a1b5cf48158980a9cfbe239a3316&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f735046fbbdc14f326a8f041cac6de9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39c45633c6b079b86215891c3f1d283a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7086ddfd2becc56c4a5d794fb4aa63db</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425667</data>
</node>
<node id="AI Gadgets">
  <data key="d0">AI Gadgets</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Gadgets are sophisticated add-ons designed to enhance the robustness, security, and operational capabilities of AI models during deployment. They play a crucial role in improving model self-awareness and detecting adversarial attacks, thereby strengthening the resilience of AI systems against various vulnerabilities. These tools work in conjunction with AI models, providing essential security measures and maintaining contextual self-awareness to ensure optimal performance in real-world applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8830be99a56abf88963043f2ab9507b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f26601f4c4959a5a23ecaace643d0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425717</data>
</node>
<node id="Decision Support Framework">
  <data key="d0">Decision Support Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Decision Support Framework aims to provide context-aware guidance to improve AI resilience and operational security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419829</data>
</node>
<node id="Project 101168560">
  <data key="d0">Project 101168560</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Project 101168560, also known as CoEvolution, is a dedicated project linked to the CoEvolution initiative, identified by the specific project number 101168560. This initiative is part of the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 funding program, focusing on enhancing the resilience and trustworthiness of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies through innovation in AI and security monitoring.

The CoEvolution project outlines a comprehensive framework that includes specific tasks, deliverables, and contributions from various organizations involved. It aims to address critical cybersecurity aspects via collaborative learning and joint initiatives, making substantial progress in developing robust and secure AI solutions.

The project encompasses all work packages and objectives associated with the CoEvolution initiative, with a strong focus on co-evolutionary processes pertaining to security, trust, and robustness assessments for AI systems. Additionally, it adheres to established financial guidelines concerning expenses and contributions, which are essential for achieving its objectives.

Project 101168560 also integrates ethical considerations in AI development, governed by specific rules and procedures related to grant funding. This aspect underscores its significance as a research endeavor that not only strives to advance AI technologies but also emphasizes the necessity of strong security measures, thereby contributing to the ongoing discourse on the responsible development of technology. Moreover, the project ensures compliance with European laws and innovation standards, further solidifying its role in the field of AI and cybersecurity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-504206f0a7bf9dc2f99c1165d4800618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2997d250b69def216aa03988b3bbd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9101312bae5650dad5c9bc39d26c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2d24cc4a2a88c7af17c3b59914ddb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ef324e25221cc1aac49364c3a0e044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a5bb32d295f690e6535a7cb23fa6baa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4e2865d7233be2941bdb2500bc81cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b12294f744da8f2db1893e5324f5ccd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb7a7f20ec997cb53fbd114a846573bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6587c0a38b949dea5de8a236e80407fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d65865b76581edf9ac1aac0de819fca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbd9a2bb872299c973114830584e0f5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426336</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 4.3">
  <data key="d0">Task 4.3</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 4.3 is an integral component of the CoEvolution project, led by TID, that centers on the development of technologies aimed at safeguarding AI models during their deployment phase. This task focuses on creating gadgets that enhance the secure deployment of these models, ensuring they are tamper-resistant and capable of resisting adversarial attacks. Furthermore, it emphasizes protection against inference adversarial attacks, thereby maintaining the integrity and functionality of deployed AI systems. Overall, Task 4.3 aspires to fortify AI defenses to mitigate potential threats throughout their operational lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc0f669cc4e2bfef891820395ef55650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bbb9e746eec802a40ceda441e1c95e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424118</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 4.4">
  <data key="d0">Task 4.4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 4.4 focuses on researching and developing context-aware AI resilience strategies within federated learning and decentralized architectures.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 4.4 is a component of the CoEvolution project that focuses on AI model context-awareness enablers aimed at enhancing security, robustness, and performance. This task is dedicated to researching and developing context-aware AI resilience through the processes of data sensing and the dynamic updating of context. Furthermore, Task 4.4 involves the exploration of technological frameworks specifically designed for context-aware AI resilience, particularly within distributed learning environments. It emphasizes the importance of designing a framework that prioritizes both security and performance in the development of context-aware AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f26601f4c4959a5a23ecaace643d0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc0f669cc4e2bfef891820395ef55650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bbb9e746eec802a40ceda441e1c95e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424860</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 4.5">
  <data key="d0">Task 4.5</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 4.5 aims to create continuous post-deployment defenses through incremental training technologies to address newly discovered vulnerabilities in AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 4.5 is a designated objective within the CoEvolution project that focuses on enhancing AI model security. This task aims to develop incremental training techniques and technologies that facilitate continuous updates to address newly discovered vulnerabilities. By implementing these strategies, Task 4.5 is dedicated to creating robust post-deployment defense mechanisms that ensure the ongoing protection of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 4.5 aims to develop training techniques for enhancing AI model security and robustness incrementally.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f26601f4c4959a5a23ecaace643d0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc0f669cc4e2bfef891820395ef55650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1bbb9e746eec802a40ceda441e1c95e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424860</data>
</node>
<node id="Work Package WP5">
  <data key="d0">Work Package WP5</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package WP5 focuses on scientific and technical reports of developed tools, including deliverables related to security assurance.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package WP5 is a critical component of the CoEvolution project, overseen by DIE. It specifically addresses security assurance and monitoring throughout the lifecycle of AI models. The primary focus of WP5 is to outline objectives that ensure the secure management and oversight of AI models, highlighting the importance of continuous monitoring and assurance within the context of their development and deployment. Overall, Work Package WP5 aims to enhance the security framework surrounding AI technology in the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f26601f4c4959a5a23ecaace643d0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edc6612637391d476f24729c8ff8104e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e930d25a22cedceebd24b60e07cebcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425680</data>
</node>
<node id="Security and Risk Assessment Engine">
  <data key="d0">Security and Risk Assessment Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security and Risk Assessment Engine is a specialized tool designed to assess the security and risks associated with the implementation of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. Its primary objective is to evaluate cybersecurity threats and offer comprehensive guidelines for securing the entire AI lifecycle, from the design phase through to deployment. Developed as part of WP5, the engine focuses on identifying potential security risks associated with AI models and aims to mitigate these risks effectively. By providing detailed assessments and recommendations, the Security and Risk Assessment Engine addresses not only cybersecurity threats but also compliance issues, ensuring a thorough approach to AI risk management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7086ddfd2becc56c4a5d794fb4aa63db</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425671</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine is a sophisticated and integral system specifically designed to enhance the trustworthiness, fairness, and overall security of artificial intelligence (AI) systems throughout their lifecycle. Its primary objective is to ensure continual security in AI models developed within the CoEvolution project by adhering to established guidelines pertaining to trustworthiness and fairness.

This engine plays a crucial role in managing the security and effectiveness of AI models by orchestrating comprehensive risk analysis and security assurance efforts within the CoEvolution Hub. It effectively integrates reports from various security engines, generating structured histories of AI model security issues. Additionally, the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine is responsible for orchestrating the security assurance flow, managing the generated AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM) structure, and addressing reports on security vulnerabilities within the AI models.

Emphasizing the importance of robust frameworks for ongoing security and reliability, the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine focuses on risk analysis and compliance with fairness guidelines. It contributes to a holistic approach to AI security management by addressing elements such as robustness, context awareness in AI operations, and coordinating the necessary processes to maintain the integrity of AI systems. Through its orchestration of security assurance, risk analysis, and context awareness, the engine enhances the overall security landscape for AI models within the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine is being developed to ensure alignment with AI trustworthiness and fairness guidelines, serving as an orchestrating element of the CoEvolution Hub.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-504206f0a7bf9dc2f99c1165d4800618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73d4bb0dd8d885f8eae5c8842c1ea98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32c9082aac6fd2a45950240834514168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f7c6a9a08e9c022ee9a774571a1ae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107384e3edcbe7422a87890a602648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7086ddfd2becc56c4a5d794fb4aa63db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88921885a26ccc1c5504cb6fb467c4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81697e5e97b55f3fbdb3e229af635af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e930d25a22cedceebd24b60e07cebcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426349</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Runtime Monitoring engine">
  <data key="d0">Security Runtime Monitoring engine</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security Runtime Monitoring engine focuses on monitoring AI operations to identify and manage adversarial attacks and maintain model integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Runtime Monitoring engine is a component being developed as part of the CoEvolution project, aimed at enhancing security monitoring capabilities for AI models. This engine is specifically designed to monitor the operations of AI models, with a particular focus on surveillance of adversarial cyberattacks. By maintaining the integrity of AI Model-Based Operations Management (MBOMs), the Security Runtime Monitoring engine plays a crucial role in ensuring the security and reliability of AI operations against potential threats. Overall, its primary function is to provide comprehensive surveillance for adversarial cyberattacks targeting AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-504206f0a7bf9dc2f99c1165d4800618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e930d25a22cedceebd24b60e07cebcd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425669</data>
</node>
<node id="Security and Risk assessment engine">
  <data key="d0">Security and Risk assessment engine</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security and Risk assessment engine analyzes risks and provides recommendations to secure the AI lifecycle from design to deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security and Risk assessment engine is implemented for assessing and managing cybersecurity risks related to AI operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-504206f0a7bf9dc2f99c1165d4800618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422728</data>
</node>
<node id="Evolutionary strategies for context-awareness adaptation">
  <data key="d0">Evolutionary strategies for context-awareness adaptation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">This task focuses on researching and developing strategies for dynamic adaptation of AI systems against adversarial threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-504206f0a7bf9dc2f99c1165d4800618</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419830</data>
</node>
<node id="Pilot Deployment">
  <data key="d0">Pilot Deployment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Pilot Deployment includes testing prototypes and demonstrating the CoEvolution framework alongside stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilot Deployment refers to the phase where pilot prototypes are tested and demonstrated to ensure project requirements are met.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22</data>
