  <data key="d5">1755422730</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Generation">
  <data key="d0">Data Generation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data Generation is the task involving the creating of synthetic data for training and evaluation purposes within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Generation refers to the mechanism being developed in the CoEvolution project for creating adversarial data during training and evaluation phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b81697e5e97b55f3fbdb3e229af635af</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755421766</data>
</node>
<node id="Work Package WP6">
  <data key="d0">Work Package WP6</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package WP6 is a crucial component of the CoEvolution project, focusing on the integration, evaluation, and project outcomes related to the CoEvolution framework. Specifically, WP6 aims to integrate this framework and implement a simulator for the creation and evaluation of synthetic data. The work package includes several key deliverables, such as a simulator, a minimum viable product, and an integrated framework that supports research and development efforts. This work is guided by AVI and is scheduled to be completed over a timeline of 30 months. Overall, Work Package WP6 encompasses a comprehensive approach to advancing the project's objectives through focused integration and evaluation activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edc6612637391d476f24729c8ff8104e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425674</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 6.1">
  <data key="d0">Task 6.1</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 6.1 is dedicated to the integration and implementation of the CoEvolution hub, which is essential for advancing the project objectives. This task involves a coordinated effort among various participants, with AEGIS taking the lead. It includes a comprehensive outline of the necessary activities, responsibilities, and infrastructure requirements to ensure the successful integration and implementation of the CoEvolution hub. Overall, Task 6.1 encapsulates the specific actions and collaborative efforts related to establishing the CoEvolution hub, highlighting its significance in the broader context of the project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425675</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 6.2">
  <data key="d0">Task 6.2</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 6.2 is a focused initiative centered on simulation for the evaluation and creation of synthetic data related to artificial intelligence (AI) models. The task involves the development of adversarial data generation mechanisms and aims to establish effective methods for generating and assessing datasets that support the CoEvolution framework. Task 6.2 is led by AVI, with participation from ICCS and UPatras. The overarching goal is to enhance the capabilities and validity of AI models by creating a trusted data feed and a robust simulation process for dataset generation and evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425675</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 6.3">
  <data key="d0">Task 6.3</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 6.3 is centered on the pilot deployment, testing, and demonstration of prototypes associated with the CoEvolution project. This task is crucial as it emphasizes the proof of concept and validation of the CoEvolution framework, ensuring that these prototypes are effectively tested and demonstrated in practical scenarios. Led by SIE, Task 6.3 integrates various elements to facilitate a comprehensive evaluation of the CoEvolution system, showcasing the prototypes as proofs of concept designed to address different use cases. Overall, the task plays a significant role in demonstrating the functionalities and effectiveness of the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425677</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 6.4">
  <data key="d0">Task 6.4</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 6.4 is dedicated to the validation, evaluation, and reporting on the outcomes of the CoEvolution framework following its implementation under realistic conditions. This task involves a thorough examination of the project outcomes derived from pilot studies associated with the CoEvolution framework. Its primary focus is to assess the effectiveness of the CoEvolution project and to summarize its impact, including best practices and feedback from the SLC and various participants. By comprehensively documenting these outcomes, Task 6.4 aims to provide a detailed understanding of the framework's effectiveness and insights gained from the initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 6.4 refers to pilot validation and evaluation processes in the CoEvolution project, guided by the task leader and involving participant collaboration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-577bd3edffb92fe21986d68a6eb2cc22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426352</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution hub">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution hub</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution hub is a central entity involved in the management and security of AI models, housing multiple data pools and providing oversight through various engines and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution hub is a central platform that plays a crucial role in the CoEvolution project, which is dedicated to ensuring the trustworthiness and fairness of artificial intelligence (AI). This hub coordinates a wide range of activities, overseeing trusted AI models and data pools, while conducting security assessments throughout the lifecycle of these models. It integrates various components of the CoEvolution Framework, which facilitates efforts concentrated on the security, robustness, and context awareness of AI systems.

In addition to its coordinating role, the CoEvolution hub supports a comprehensive knowledge base that includes trusted AI models and relevant data pools essential for managing AI models and their security. It also provides tools and services, such as a Data Generation Mechanism, which aids in the training and enhancement of AI models. Overall, the CoEvolution hub significantly enhances the security and reliability of AI operations, contributing to a more trustworthy AI ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution hub is a project-focused initiative aimed at enhancing data sharing and integration of vehicles and equipment with infrastructural tools and services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-66fca2dcc4ffc686abf4bc2b366e1860&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc5395556365a730e47d5041142ed23c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f25b7f6ba3568504f9c7a701e1f5090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9765c6de5d09adbaa4008d62e0503a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16b97eafd52b6ff9bbda7799176dd86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81418f280483fb994ba74151f8e56fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424871</data>
</node>
