  <data key="d0">Work Package Number WP6</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package Number WP6 details the integration, evaluation, and project outcomes as part of the CoEvolution framework, covering activities from month 6 to month 36.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package Number WP6 encompasses various tasks related to the integration, evaluation, and outcomes of the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e0445a20d7ba0635033f2f217666f7e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c01a4f4fce25ef615aa8d96cea16200a</data>
