<node id="BEVD">
  <data key="d0">BEVD</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">BEVD is a newly introduced partner in the CoEvolution project consortium, taking the place of a previous partner, SAP. As a small to medium-sized enterprise (SME), BEVD is recognized for its expertise in technology transfer and business sustainability strategies, particularly within the automotive industry. It holds a leadership position in Task 3.2 of the project, where it focuses on technology and industry requirements, as well as the specifications and requirements of use cases.

In its active role, BEVD has reported a contribution of 9 person-months and is engaged in various project activities, including attendance at project meetings and involvement in dissemination efforts aimed at promoting the project’s overarching goals. The organization is also accountable for specific exploitation activities and technology transfer, emphasizing its commitment to ethical compliance in technology use.

Financially, BEVD contributes 48,600.00 EUR to the consortium budget, which supports its personnel and travel costs related to project meetings. Adjustments have been made to resource distribution within the project to effectively incorporate BEVD's contributions, which demonstrates alignment with the consortium's objectives. Additionally, BEVD is focused on enhancing AI system resilience and security protocols as part of the project framework.

Overall, BEVD plays a critical role in advancing the goals of the CoEvolution project, leveraging its experience in sustainability and technology expertise within the automotive sector. The project also involves a participant named Veledar Omar, although details of their contributions have not been specified.&lt;SEP&gt;BEVD is a partner involved in the CoEvolution project, aiding in various project tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75efa432cb6a9347528127bab93b2e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4e2865d7233be2941bdb2500bc81cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c85ec84436942dd8fc56f3409a58ac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beb4f50a59cc14eb247934005c503a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d2ff0e7582f72b15822c3c3392a6345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd021e77c6a98f8d589a96e248297baf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb9925c33404cf10a29a2c57f9e6874c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daedd8cfb8dad5cd7a0132b3057fb6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91306f86deee226d4e904fb6737b7337&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72e3d6c0adc259c792912cb22e5365cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-841013486b274ac183dbe85d18dd9731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827c0e1b05bc9eac5d2bbfb266ef6562&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-613f6432243d121b9ba6b6dbfd90ee39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5bd329614b1182e2be9469625326eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27983f12f5c86c0463eca065b4d5542d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1840a2aa861c08b15185d927867134a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f2e8aebdfb355f313ea068cac55423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce96797e723874f84f3ba02a22d09d8a</data>
