<node id="Project Manual">
  <data key="d0">Project Manual</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Project Manual (D1.1) is a deliverable created by ICCS that serves as a comprehensive guide for the CoEvolution project. It outlines the project's framework, structure, and guidelines, providing essential information for the execution of the project. This document is included under the project's deliverables and is crucial for ensuring all aspects of the CoEvolution project are well-defined and systematically addressed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Manual is a key deliverable that outlines guidelines and protocols for the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;The Project Manual outlines the processes for day-to-day operations and quality management within the project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426352</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Management Plan">
  <data key="d0">Data Management Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Data Management Plan (DMP) is a vital document tailored for the CoEvolution project, detailing comprehensive strategies for the collection, management, and sharing of data throughout the project's lifecycle. This structured framework addresses all aspects of data handling, ensuring adherence to ethical and legal standards relevant to the research activities.

Specifically, the DMP outlines the management of various types of project data, incorporating applicable standards and methodologies. It places special emphasis on handling sensitive data, reinforcing the importance of ethical practices and regulatory compliance in research endeavors. The document is recognized as a sensitive deliverable and promotes best practices in data management, thereby fostering effective data stewardship.

Characterized as a living document, the DMP is designed to adapt and reflect the evolving requirements of data management as the CoEvolution project progresses. Prepared by AEGIS, it serves as a crucial component of responsible research, ensuring that strategies for managing project data—including its generation, accessibility, and compliance with legal and ethical standards—are explicitly defined and consistently followed throughout the duration of the initiative.

In summary, the DMP is essential for the successful management of sensitive data and compliance within the CoEvolution project, outlining strategies that align with legal and ethical requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7199ae710abb0d5cc234ef5e84fcc847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c33ff0da3223617dcddd9463b4752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb05ac510a5ae593384da886fa21202c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99ddd092d2b8685079c5b87c6675e59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c655315fcd0b9413217de724415bfd65</data>
