<node id="Security Runtime Monitoring Engine">
  <data key="d0">Security Runtime Monitoring Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME) is an essential component of the CoEvolution solution, specifically crafted to oversee the AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM) and ensure its validity, authenticity, and integrity. This sophisticated system plays a critical role in monitoring AI models throughout their entire lifecycle, ensuring secure and reliable operation during deployment.

A key function of the SRME is its capability to perform adversarial cyberattack surveillance, systematically collecting data related to potential security incidents linked to AI models. This functionality significantly enhances the overall security posture of AI operations. In addition to monitoring for adversarial attacks, the SRME effectively manages the deployment of continuous defense updates, focusing on incorporating security considerations at every stage of the AI models’ lifecycles.

The Security Runtime Monitoring Engine is also responsible for overseeing the update and decommission processes of these AI models, maintaining vigilant oversight against vulnerabilities and ensuring compliance with security standards. Developed as part of Work Package 5, the SRME strengthens the security mechanisms surrounding AI technologies, making it a vital element of the CoEvolution initiative.

Overall, the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine plays a pivotal role in ensuring the operational integrity and resilience of AI systems against adversarial threats, monitoring runtime activities for potential dangers, and providing incident reporting mechanisms. By ensuring that the defenses of AI models remain effective, the SRME contributes significantly to the protection and management of AI technologies within the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Runtime Monitoring Engine is designed to monitor AI models for adversarial cyberattacks and ensure continuous updates of AI MBOM.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fbd5dafa81256fe9f82cfcb884bca559&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d1f4cd119004da61bb670635808ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107384e3edcbe7422a87890a602648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-237babba3957b0c4786b5021cd8884d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa547865cf460d6e73617a01a0b88537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ef324e25221cc1aac49364c3a0e044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3ca67a0bb25d96a23d5612a2c95b2d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7086ddfd2becc56c4a5d794fb4aa63db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f40649ce109d07f952bef06c2fd267e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce588e6a41e4a19bd041531ec028f838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd3e0daceca0971b7e14ec00e716a540&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4486370e0771aa76fa9c8a98d04ffc56</data>
