  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">MVP Release is a milestone in the CoEvolution project marking the completion of a minimum viable product.&lt;SEP&gt;MVP Release is a significant milestone in the CoEvolution project involving the launch of the minimum viable product.</data>
