<node id="Evaluation Report">
  <data key="d0">Evaluation Report</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Evaluation Report, designated as Deliverable D6.4, serves as a comprehensive project deliverable that summarizes the results of the evaluation process related to project uptake and post-implementation support within the CoEvolution project. It encapsulates the evaluation processes and outcomes, providing critical insights that support the development and implementation of the project. Overall, the Evaluation Report is integral in conveying the effectiveness and support mechanisms established during and after the project's implementation phase.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c8a90d0356b7b59238f88457856e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65e8629ae207ceb542cf05ec02b99e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7199ae710abb0d5cc234ef5e84fcc847</data>
