</node>
<node id="Deliverable D5.1">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D5.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D5.1 is a comprehensive Security Assurance and Monitoring Science and Technology (S&amp;T) report that serves as a key outcome of the CoEvolution project. Produced by ISI, this deliverable offers detailed insights into the security measures implemented throughout the project, emphasizing the importance of security in alignment with the project's objectives and initiatives. The report focuses on technical aspects, including the security tools and techniques that were developed, and provides a thorough examination of the security assurance and monitoring processes that were integral to the project's execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9556cf6e6d132fab455ec031cef17</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
