</node>
<node id="Deliverable D5.2">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D5.2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D5.2 is a Security Assurance and Monitoring Repository that contains software tools and documentation for monitoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D5.2 is a comprehensive repository focused on security assurance and monitoring, developed as part of the CoEvolution project. It encompasses a collection of security assurance and monitoring tools and techniques. This deliverable has been produced under the guidance of the project lead, DIE, and serves as a software repository dedicated to security tools.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9556cf6e6d132fab455ec031cef17</data>
