<node id="Deliverable D6.1">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D6.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D6.1 includes a Simulator and Datasets intended to support research and development activities in the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D6.1 is a comprehensive output of the CoEvolution project, led by AVI. It consists of a simulator and associated datasets specifically designed to support research and development efforts within the project. The primary focus of Deliverable D6.1 is to enhance R&amp;D activities by providing essential tools and data resources that facilitate analytical and experimental work related to the project's objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9556cf6e6d132fab455ec031cef17</data>
