<node id="Deliverable D6.2">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D6.2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D6.2 is the Minimum Viable Product (MVP) of the integrated framework, scheduled for validation and demonstration.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D6.2 is the minimum viable product (MVP) of the integrated framework developed under the CoEvolution project, which is led by UPatras. This deliverable is designed to be validated and demonstrated as part of the project's objectives. It represents a significant step in the project's implementation, showcasing a functional framework for further validation within the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8bee6728a0eb29b6a3c4f9a4ccf3996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dac9556cf6e6d132fab455ec031cef17</data>
