<node id="Deliverable D6.3">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D6.3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D6.3 is a comprehensive entity produced under the CoEvolution project, which is led by SIE. This deliverable encompasses the final integrated framework and prototypes that have been developed as part of the project. Specifically, Deliverable D6.3 includes these integrated frameworks and prototypes, showcasing the culmination of efforts within the CoEvolution initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D6.3 is focused on the Integrated Framework that consolidates the overall project deliverables and functionalities.</data>
