<node id="Deliverable D6.4">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D6.4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D6.4 is an evaluation report that captures the summary of the evaluation process for the CoEvolution project, which is led by SLC. This deliverable includes a comprehensive overview of the results related to uptake, as well as post-implementation support and development. By consolidating information from various aspects of the evaluation, Deliverable D6.4 provides an integral summary of both the procedures and outcomes associated with the CoEvolution project.</data>
