<node id="EU funding bodies">
  <data key="d0">EU funding bodies</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">EU funding bodies are organizations involved in overseeing and providing financial support for projects like CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;EU funding bodies provide financial support for projects like CoEvolution, influencing project planning and adaptation strategies.</data>
