<node id="WP1">
  <data key="d0">WP1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">WP1 is a designated work package within the CoEvolution project that focuses on specific components of the research effort. It encompasses a range of tasks and deliverables primarily related to project management and coordination activities. WP1 is responsible for resource allocation to engage with standardization bodies, playing a crucial role in organizing and managing various aspects of the project. This includes ensuring alignment with the project's objectives and facilitating efficient collaboration among the involved entities. Furthermore, WP1 involves the redistribution of certain responsibilities originally assigned to SAP, with ICCS taking over these tasks. The deliverables associated with WP1 include project management manuals and planning documents, highlighting its central role in the overall success of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;WP1 refers to a specific work package within the project where significant responsibilities have been reassigned due to changes in partners.&lt;SEP&gt;WP1 refers to one of the work packages in the CoEvolution project, involved in the management and execution of specific tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99b3cd45c7b1f82f0e5ceb4d19d8492e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f2e8aebdfb355f313ea068cac55423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5954618a5ba5f9a63e629b838f5a752e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84670dae929f0474fd75c1904113c7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5cbf16cd814360775473b61c07db9e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9101312bae5650dad5c9bc39d26c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-672abb4b4d866c235db2385a6641554e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425681</data>
</node>
<node id="WP2">
  <data key="d0">WP2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">WP2 denotes the second work package in the CoEvolution project, focusing on Dissemination, Exploitation, and Sustainability. This work package is critical for effectively communicating the results of the CoEvolution project and maximizing its impact among stakeholders. WP2 is responsible for providing dissemination recommendations and managing resources for engaging with standardization bodies, ensuring that various roles and responsibilities are effectively allocated to support the project’s overall objectives. Additionally, WP2 addresses specific aspects of project execution and management, highlighting its importance in relation to impact analysis and dissemination activities. Notably, tasks from SAP were reassigned to WP2, involving collaboration with both ISI and AEGIS in taking over part of SAP's work. Overall, WP2 plays an integral role in the successful execution and communication of the goals of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;WP2 is one of the work packages that reflects task distributions among the project partners, especially concerning SAP's responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;WP2 refers to another work package that plays a role in the project and is assigned specific responsibilities for project goals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99b3cd45c7b1f82f0e5ceb4d19d8492e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f2e8aebdfb355f313ea068cac55423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5954618a5ba5f9a63e629b838f5a752e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84670dae929f0474fd75c1904113c7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5cbf16cd814360775473b61c07db9e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089ed2fed176c26ba2d2a44622231ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9101312bae5650dad5c9bc39d26c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbc12431b623f53cd11ca16b1437d498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-672abb4b4d866c235db2385a6641554e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425681</data>
</node>
<node id="European Regulations">
  <data key="d0">European Regulations</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">European Regulations encompass laws and guidelines that must be followed by the CoEvolution project, particularly concerning data protection and AI regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;European Regulations refer to the set of legal standards that guide ethical principles and activities related to the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;European Regulations refer to the legal frameworks that CoEvolution must comply with, particularly regarding privacy, data protection, and AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e115bd628f8fb0edc5eb2d730569997e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9d50812a1d240d82e3f1a2d7627af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424100</data>
</node>
<node id="Deliverable D1.4">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D1.4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D1.4 is a comprehensive report produced as part of the CoEvolution project. It focuses on the analysis of legal and ethical issues, particularly in relation to the Artificial Intelligence Act and the activities of the project's Ethical Board. The deliverable addresses matters of compliance and governance, ensuring that the project's ethical considerations are thoroughly explored and documented.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D1.4 is an analysis of legal and ethical issues pertinent to the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425677</data>
</node>
<node id="Deliverable D1.3">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D1.3</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D1.3 involves the innovation management and ethics oversight report within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D1.3 is a report produced within the CoEvolution project that focuses on innovation management and the oversight of ethical considerations related to innovation processes. This report, titled the Innovation Management and Ethics Oversight Report, details the ethical implications that arise during the innovation process and serves to ensure that these considerations are appropriately addressed. Through its comprehensive examination, Deliverable D1.3 plays a crucial role in guiding ethical practices within the overarching framework of the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5fb9a196fd79cf2ad7253020f3005f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425677</data>
</node>
<node id="PAN">
  <data key="d0">PAN</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PAN is an organization that initially played a significant role in the CoEvolution Project, contributing to project management and oversight, as well as actively participating in standardization efforts. Its responsibilities included contributing to deliverables and work packages, particularly focusing on validation and evaluation to assess the project's outcomes. PAN was involved in coordinating various initiatives and contributed to security assessment tools. Financial records indicated that PAN had specific monetary allocations and was included in the estimated budget, reflecting its administrative and evaluative roles at the time.

However, PAN decided to discontinue its participation in the CoEvolution Project, which has been confirmed by multiple sources. Following its withdrawal, the organization's tasks and responsibilities were reassigned and redistributed to other partners, specifically AVL and AVI, for improved project execution. AVL subsequently took over PAN's responsibilities, marking a significant transition for the project consortium. Despite its exit, PAN's prior contributions were deemed substantial, underscoring its influential role within the project until its cessation of involvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b72b3e7ba1aaeb63a98bb04479fd99ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6fbc1a3bfb993cb23f1ec5cd61622f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1840a2aa861c08b15185d927867134a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827c0e1b05bc9eac5d2bbfb266ef6562&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f2e8aebdfb355f313ea068cac55423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa3e6dafd736c20ef4b244c92ce1a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5cbf16cd814360775473b61c07db9e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d976f2ffb8ad5255bb083a125919929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c51e62034d566f8ec8ff4a84d94f137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daedd8cfb8dad5cd7a0132b3057fb6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84670dae929f0474fd75c1904113c7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-672abb4b4d866c235db2385a6641554e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425683</data>
</node>
<node id="SAP">
  <data key="d0">SAP</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SAP SE is a prominent German software corporation that has played a significant role in the CoEvolution project as a lead beneficiary. The company was instrumental in defining the project's scope and led Milestone 2, which focused on codifying the project's objectives. As a major contributor to the CoEvolution consortium, SAP engaged in research related to artificial intelligence (AI) systems and their applications, with a strong emphasis on the standardization and security of these technologies.

Throughout its involvement in the project, SAP contributed to architectural tasks and was actively engaged in delivering key documentation and reports. The company focused on enhancing the privacy and security of AI applications, providing services such as data anonymization and the generation of synthetic datasets. SAP also demonstrated a commitment to knowledge sharing and capacity building by organizing internal training sessions for its staff to ensure they were well-acquainted with the project’s outcomes.

Despite its earlier significant contributions and leadership during the project's initial phases, SAP has since withdrawn from the CoEvolution project. This withdrawal necessitated the redistribution of its responsibilities among other partners, particularly organizations such as ICCS, ISI, and AEGIS, who will take over SAP's tasks within different work packages. Although SAP's references have been removed from some project documents, its historical significance and contributions are still acknowledged in budget documentation related to funding estimates for the project. This recognition solidifies SAP's position as a key player in advancing innovative security solutions and researching AI systems, despite its exit from the collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;SAP is identified as a terminated beneficiary in the CoEvolution project due to non-signature of accession forms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a6eef347ebd1953e222397f7f754e5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84670dae929f0474fd75c1904113c7d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7fd8590e514e02237067258b84c6af2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7199ae710abb0d5cc234ef5e84fcc847&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef6fbc1a3bfb993cb23f1ec5cd61622f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1fb0f79a7142225a7d2dfaedc44c958&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3ab8cb1038a2d7402e7c20f7922fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99d40ee8239b5807a75857260b7afe44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1840a2aa861c08b15185d927867134a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-daa3e6dafd736c20ef4b244c92ce1a68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb05ac510a5ae593384da886fa21202c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e930d25a22cedceebd24b60e07cebcd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-827c0e1b05bc9eac5d2bbfb266ef6562&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-911f0045819caa0ee2d858aae2c793ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25f2e8aebdfb355f313ea068cac55423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c51e62034d566f8ec8ff4a84d94f137&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3daedd8cfb8dad5cd7a0132b3057fb6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65e8629ae207ceb542cf05ec02b99e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c85ec84436942dd8fc56f3409a58ac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426201</data>
</node>
