  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">D1.3 is an event marking the changes in the description and title related to innovation management and ethics oversight, crucial for milestone tracking.&lt;SEP&gt;D1.3 refers to a previously titled report that has now been updated to include ethics oversight, indicating a focus on innovation management and ethical considerations.</data>
