  <data key="d2">D6.2 is a deliverable for which the responsible partner has changed from AEGIS to IMT to balance contributions among partners.&lt;SEP&gt;D6.2 refers to a milestone deliverable concerning the minimum viable product managed previously by IMT.</data>
