<node id="MVP">
  <data key="d0">MVP</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">MVP refers to a milestone deliverable focusing on innovation management for the project.&lt;SEP&gt;MVP refers to the Minimum Viable Product, which is a crucial milestone and deliverable within the context of project management. Specifically, it is associated with the integrated framework created by UPatras and plays a significant role in a project involving multiple partners. As a deliverable, the MVP represents a key aspect of the project tasks and responsibilities, intended to be validated and demonstrated as part of the overall project framework.</data>
