  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Milestone 2 involves the verification of the project scope, reflecting the goals and deliverables scheduled within the project timeline.&lt;SEP&gt;Milestone 2 is a specific project milestone involving the codification of the project scope.</data>
