</node>
<node id="Context Vectors">
  <data key="d0">Context Vectors</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context Vectors are data structures generated within CoEvolution that encapsulate sensory information to enable context-aware decision-making and enhance AI model adaptability.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors are representations of situational information utilized in AI algorithms to aid in decision-making and adaptation in cybersecurity environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors are data representations constructed from sensory inputs that help in understanding environmental conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f5c42e7d5f67c2de98328269247dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea46f2ec6b238b94a61ace6d4787996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df6cb12c1afd7894243ba7d6eda4b8f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
