<node id="Dynamic Adaptation Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Adaptation Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dynamic Adaptation Strategy is a method used in CoEvolution to continuously evolve context vectors using genetic algorithms to enhance AI performance.&lt;SEP&gt;The dynamic adaptation strategy is a core objective of CoEvolution aimed at adjusting AI systems in real-time to evolving cybersecurity challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f40649ce109d07f952bef06c2fd267e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df6cb12c1afd7894243ba7d6eda4b8f</data>
