<node id="AI Supply Chain Ecosystem">
  <data key="d0">AI Supply Chain Ecosystem</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Supply Chain Ecosystem is a comprehensive framework aimed at providing secure and trusted AI models and training datasets, which facilitates their effective utilization in various supply chains. It encompasses all elements necessary for the sourcing, creation, and deployment of AI models and datasets, with a strong focus on ensuring security and trustworthiness throughout the entire lifecycle of AI technologies. 

This interconnected network includes AI models, tools, and services, all designed to enhance the development and deployment of AI technologies while maintaining compliance and addressing critical needs for reliability and safety in AI applications. Proposed by CoEvolution, the ecosystem seeks to foster the secure and trustworthy advancement of AI technologies, establishing essential relationships and structures vital for the effective deployment of AI systems. It prioritizes security and risk management, ensuring that the interactions among different AI components and systems are robust and secure. Overall, the AI Supply Chain Ecosystem encapsulates a comprehensive approach to securing, trusting, and reinforcing AI models used across various industries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02fa9dfe5b39b5ec1975df01d2e4f7d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b73d4bb0dd8d885f8eae5c8842c1ea98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2a45c222140df04434355f127ac357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d31a9f46c18f75b8bffad97afd44ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f7c6a9a08e9c022ee9a774571a1ae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9260f7f87786fb6b762b6bf5a25591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2df6cb12c1afd7894243ba7d6eda4b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2248d6022b436a47f7e30a79038af6d0</data>
