<node id="Siemens">
  <data key="d0">Siemens</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Siemens is a leading multinational company specializing in manufacturing and technology. Currently, it is at the forefront of a pilot project aimed at validating the CoEvolution framework specifically within supply chain manufacturing scenarios. This initiative focuses on enhancing the security and trustworthiness of artificial intelligence models utilized in the manufacturing industry. By engaging in this pilot project, Siemens seeks to improve the overall infrastructure related to supply chain management while addressing critical concerns associated with AI security. Overall, Siemens plays a pivotal role in enhancing security in manufacturing infrastructure through its leadership in this innovative project.&lt;SEP&gt;Siemens is a leading technology company involved in validating the CoEvolution framework within manufacturing scenarios, emphasizing zero-trust architecture for AI models.</data>
