  <data key="d0">AVL &amp; AVI</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVL &amp; AVI are involved in a pilot project supporting AI supply chains in the autonomous vehicles domain, focusing on Federated Learning and model security.&lt;SEP&gt;AVL &amp; AVI are organizations that collaborate in the second pilot of the CoEvolution project, focusing on the AI supply chain for autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;AVL &amp; AVI are organizations involved in the second pilot of the CoEvolution framework, supporting AI model designs in the autonomous vehicles domain.</data>
