  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EU Regulations refer to the framework of laws applicable to project activities in the CoEvolution initiative, including ethical and data protection standards.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Regulations refer to the legal frameworks established by the European Union to govern the development, deployment, and use of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. These regulations aim to ensure trustworthy and ethical standards, emphasizing compliance and safety for AI models and systems within the EU. Additionally, compliance with these regulations is a significant aspect highlighted within the CoEvolution project, underscoring the importance of adhering to the established legal frameworks in the realm of AI technologies.</data>
