<node id="MLDevOps">
  <data key="d0">MLDevOps</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MLDevOps is a comprehensive framework that integrates machine learning with DevOps practices, specifically designed to enhance the AI lifecycle. It encompasses a set of best practices that bring together machine learning, DevOps, and data engineering, enabling the effective deployment and management of machine learning algorithms and applications. By promoting collaboration and efficiency, MLDevOps facilitates the deployment of AI models in adherence to regulatory frameworks. The integration of machine learning with IT operations further improves collaboration and operational efficiency in AI projects, as exemplified by initiatives such as the CoEvolution project. Overall, MLDevOps represents a significant advancement in the development and operational practices concerning machine learning, ensuring alignment with both technological and regulatory standards.</data>
