<node id="Context Awareness">
  <data key="d0">Context Awareness</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context Awareness in AI refers to the capability of AI systems to consider and respond to contextual information, which significantly enhances their operational effectiveness and security. This concept is a core feature of the CoEvolution project, which aims to enable AI models to adapt to their evolving environments. By integrating Context Awareness, these models can improve their resilience and performance, as they adjust their behavior based on the specific situational context in which they operate. The principle of Context Awareness involves perceiving and responding to environmental conditions, thereby empowering AI systems to dynamically respond to changes in their surroundings and emerging threats. Overall, Context Awareness is essential for enhancing the robustness and effectiveness of AI models within the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;Context awareness in AI refers to the ability of AI systems to adapt based on environmental inputs, crucial for enhancing security and robustness within the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5dfa0262d9cf1261fde3b563bc7f361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddfc5f9eb88fc57c1e7d42c942cb16c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff71b865dc936679ff717845aef86de4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4af943851da76b28e80907078f658e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e539403d1165017fce38ab358660244c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73c97665e3b0a28f5563a3906757580a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df19f3e87623e77b4872532b8e5d92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11568e1141436db1fb558509a57b48c8</data>
