  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI5.1 is a key performance indicator aimed at providing at least 4 trusted AI models in the Trusted model pool as part of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI5.1 is a key performance indicator regarding the provision of at least 4 Trusted AI models in the Trusted model pool as part of the CoEvolution initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI5.1 is a performance indicator aimed at providing at least 4 Trusted AI models in the Trusted model pool as part of the CoEvolution project objectives.</data>
