<node id="Federated Learning (FL)">
  <data key="d0">Federated Learning (FL)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Federated Learning (FL) is an innovative and decentralized machine learning approach that facilitates collaboration among multiple clients, such as mobile devices and other computing entities, to train machine learning models while ensuring data privacy. This paradigm prioritizes the preservation of user information, allowing devices to participate in the training of a shared model without the necessity of exchanging sensitive data. 

In Federated Learning, raw user data remains localized on individual devices, which enhances security and confidentiality throughout the machine learning process. Instead of sharing raw data, clients share model parameters, enabling them to collaboratively refine and update the machine learning model. This collaborative learning framework not only protects user privacy but also creates a more secure and efficient method for developing and deploying machine learning solutions across diverse environments. 

Overall, Federated Learning represents a significant advancement in machine learning. It enables multiple parties to work together in the creation of AI models while keeping data decentralized and secure, thus addressing major privacy concerns associated with traditional data-sharing methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b95c94affa550c2a005eb66b83e0f70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f13e4e9d2acd6290e2eddd212bdd3df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf0ef74c7d451fed43129ef79275910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a552b8b0b6e1c9d217e2714e332435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7d7dd122ed2c0928bca9de4f77ffb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2186aff847bb122f1f1a8eba737faf56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f98f10ca7967e7c93ebec461a36b56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad886edb819a72a00a95a3d6cb0423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8a78502e4359c56e2de032610b38aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdd9d3fe303a1bbac3d5da89d437759c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6eb6aae1af8d6225c491ae5dedc4268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261</data>
