  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security-by-design is a concept that emphasizes incorporating security measures into the design of systems and processes from the outset.&lt;SEP&gt;Security-by-design is a concept that integrates security measures into the development process of AI systems from the outset.</data>
