  <data key="d5">1755425698</data>
</node>
<node id="FlecLeCo v2">
  <data key="d0">FlecLeCo v2</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">FlecLeCo v2 is a Side Channel leakage collection and analysis platform that assesses hardware and software implementations against side channel attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;FlecLeCo v2 is a comprehensive platform dedicated to the collection and analysis of side channel leakage, specifically targeting power consumption and electromagnetic emission. The platform specializes in performing security assessments on both hardware and software implementations, ensuring robust protection against side channel attacks. Additionally, FlecLeCo v2 emphasizes the evaluation of side channel vulnerabilities in artificial intelligence models, thereby broadening its scope of analysis and enhancing security protocols in various applications. Through its multifaceted approach, FlecLeCo v2 aims to provide thorough insights into potential security risks associated with side channel leakage.&lt;SEP&gt;FlecLeCo v2 is a side channel leakage collection and analysis platform designed for assessing security on hardware and software implementations through power consumption and electromagnetic emission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20c0cc0a37ebaa1bdc18241b7b7a42f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6047665c4bd29f334a06022d100213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adc3d9c69d7abcc740f761a0cbbf43e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81b5e09ae3d0f914dccc0db6a5f91e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e76862a3bd9d83846a1046dc8821573f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425700</data>
</node>
