<node id="STR Assessment Engine report">
  <data key="d0">STR Assessment Engine report</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The STR Assessment Engine report includes the metrics generated by the CoEvolution Security Assessment engine, which serves as a basis for enhancing AI models against adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The STR Assessment Engine report is a document generated from the CoEvolution Security Assessment engine that includes metrics for security assessment regarding adversarial attack defenses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef3f714a2a32270c0d8af28dae9557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424149</data>
</node>
<node id="Adversarial Attack Defences">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Attack Defences</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attack Defences are a set of strategies and technologies aimed at safeguarding AI models from adversarial manipulations and threats that may compromise their integrity and privacy. These defences encompass various techniques and methodologies that are implemented throughout the lifecycle of AI models, specifically designed to protect against a range of potential adversarial attacks. By addressing vulnerabilities and enhancing security, Adversarial Attack Defences play a crucial role in the development and maintenance of robust AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-21a53e39ebeb53771231e5e60fb82f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dd67768c95c1d599e1e7d53f932c680&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28af3e5b46628e98e598a3a3fb2df917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422759</data>
</node>
<node id="Ensemble Learning AI technology">
  <data key="d0">Ensemble Learning AI technology</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ensemble Learning AI technology is a sophisticated approach that involves combining multiple base models to enhance performance and ensure robustness against various challenges, including adversarial attacks. This technology is designed to improve prediction accuracy by structuring the models as a cooperative system during the design phase. The collaboration of these models enables Ensemble Learning to significantly boost predictions and classifications in AI systems, ultimately leading to more reliable and effective outcomes in various applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef3f714a2a32270c0d8af28dae9557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033993b2e553c1db5bbfda0fcb2881da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425713</data>
</node>
<node id="Defense-in-Depth">
  <data key="d0">Defense-in-Depth</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Defense-in-Depth is a security principle advocating multiple layers of defenses to protect against adversarial attacks in AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Defense-in-Depth is a security principle that employs multiple defenses to protect systems and applications, ensuring that if one defense fails, others continue to provide protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Defense-in-depth is a security principle involving multiple layers of defense strategies to protect systems from attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425713</data>
</node>
<node id="Poisoned Detection Rate">
  <data key="d0">Poisoned Detection Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Poisoned Detection Rate is a critical metric that evaluates how effectively an AI model can detect poisoned data. It specifically measures the effectiveness of identifying whether training data has been contaminated by adversarial actions and assesses how well a system can identify poisoned inputs within a dataset. This metric is essential for understanding the robustness of AI systems against adversarial attacks, as it helps in determining their ability to recognize data that has been compromised.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf89d2914639395cf5f6232246af9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425714</data>
</node>
<node id="Poisoned Repair Rate">
  <data key="d0">Poisoned Repair Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Poisoned Repair Rate is a comprehensive metric that indicates how well a system can recover from the effects of poisoned data. This metric assesses the success of remediation actions taken against data identified as contaminated by adversarial poisoning attacks. It evaluates the ability of a system to repair data that has been affected and measures the effectiveness of restoring AI models after their exposure to such poisoned data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf89d2914639395cf5f6232246af9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425715</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Clean Detection Rate">
  <data key="d0">Data Clean Detection Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Data Clean Detection Rate is a key metric that evaluates the effectiveness of a system in recognizing clean, untainted data inputs. It serves as a measure of accuracy for identifying untainted training data within the context of AI model assessments. Additionally, the Data Clean Detection Rate is crucial for determining a system's ability to identify unaltered or valid data, particularly amidst adversarial attacks. This metric is an integral part of security assessment strategies, focusing on the identification of clean data to enhance overall system reliability and security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf89d2914639395cf5f6232246af9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425714</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Clean Repair Rate">
  <data key="d0">Data Clean Repair Rate</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Data Clean Repair Rate is a critical metric that evaluates the effectiveness of a system in maintaining or restoring the integrity of clean data in response to security threats, particularly within AI models. It measures how well a system can restore valid data that has been compromised by adversarial attacks, reflecting the actions taken to ensure the integrity of identified clean data. Overall, the Data Clean Repair Rate serves as an essential indicator of a system’s capability to protect and recover clean data after it faces security challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa30290535797abf91b21ba17f34f254&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf89d2914639395cf5f6232246af9fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-624f2387785876b8e9add5d5b236075f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425714</data>
</node>
<node id="Homomorphic Encryption">
  <data key="d0">Homomorphic Encryption</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Homomorphic Encryption (HE) is a specialized encryption method that enables computations to be performed directly on ciphertexts without the need to decrypt the data, thereby preserving the confidentiality of the underlying plaintext. This unique capability is crucial for enhancing data privacy, particularly in contexts such as artificial intelligence (AI), where secure data sharing is essential for protecting sensitive information.

HE is recognized as a valuable defense technology and has been thoroughly evaluated in the context of the CoEvolution project. This initiative focuses on preventing privacy leakage and mitigating risks associated with model extraction and adversarial attacks during AI operations. As a result, Homomorphic Encryption emerges as a significant tool in safeguarding privacy within various AI applications, ensuring that computations on encrypted data can take place seamlessly without compromising the confidentiality of the information involved.

Additionally, Homomorphic Encryption plays a key role in preserving the confidentiality of data during processing in decentralized learning systems. Thus, it stands as a robust technique that facilitates secure computation on encrypted data, ensuring that sensitive information remains protected throughout the processing stages.&lt;SEP&gt;Homomorphic Encryption is a defense technology researched within the CoEvolution project to prevent privacy leakage in AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20c0cc0a37ebaa1bdc18241b7b7a42f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36d4368a91cfa20fb1fbc19cc60bc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d69ac7cb43276601482059fe1cb59288&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb9ddb0c5f55caea9f52e4feaa7073c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f995ea0aa653e5c578ea2df5d9ff710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba3c184b92e7717afad2ff103dd68dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033993b2e553c1db5bbfda0fcb2881da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4af943851da76b28e80907078f658e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28af3e5b46628e98e598a3a3fb2df917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4258dad8667e5dd4d7e54cbdb071a5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-702b309f7879ea6c02c535b54964d126</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425732</data>
</node>
<node id="Secure Multiparty Computation">
  <data key="d0">Secure Multiparty Computation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Secure Multiparty Computation (SMPC) is a cryptographic protocol specifically designed to enable multiple parties to collaboratively compute a function based on their individual inputs, while simultaneously ensuring the confidentiality of those inputs. This technology is particularly advantageous in the realm of artificial intelligence (AI) projects, as it allows for secure computations without exposing sensitive data. SMPC has been recognized as a key defensive technology within the CoEvolution project, where it was rigorously analyzed to enhance security and data privacy in AI communications. 

The protocol plays a crucial role in maintaining the integrity of AI models and preventing unauthorized extraction of these models. SMPC establishes a secure framework for data exchanges among various entities involved in collaborative computations, thus promoting both privacy and secure data processing. CoEvolution assesses SMPC as an effective method to bolster data protection and model security against unauthorized access. Through its robust mechanisms, Secure Multiparty Computation is a vital tool in facilitating safe and private collaborative efforts in computational tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Secure Multiparty Computation is also a defense technology assessed by the CoEvolution project to secure AI models against unauthorized access and model extraction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f36d4368a91cfa20fb1fbc19cc60bc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d69ac7cb43276601482059fe1cb59288&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb9ddb0c5f55caea9f52e4feaa7073c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba3c184b92e7717afad2ff103dd68dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-033993b2e553c1db5bbfda0fcb2881da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4af943851da76b28e80907078f658e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4258dad8667e5dd4d7e54cbdb071a5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-702b309f7879ea6c02c535b54964d126</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425732</data>
</node>
<node id="AI supply chain agents">
  <data key="d0">AI supply chain agents</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI supply chain agents refer to entities involved in the flow and processing of data and models within an AI ecosystem, focusing on interoperability and security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419849</data>
</node>
<node id="distributed learning paradigm">
  <data key="d0">distributed learning paradigm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The distributed learning paradigm involves methods where learning is spread across multiple systems or nodes, often for improved efficiency and data handling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419849</data>
</node>
<node id="GDPR">
  <data key="d0">GDPR</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), officially known as Regulation (EU) 2016/679, is a comprehensive legislative framework established by the European Union (EU) to govern the collection and processing of personal data. It aims to protect individuals' privacy rights and safeguard personal information within the EU and the European Economic Area (EEA). GDPR sets stringent guidelines for responsible data handling practices, emphasizing the importance of ethical data management strategies and risk assessments.

As a foundational element of EU data law, GDPR influences various sectors, particularly in the realm of artificial intelligence (AI). It governs data protection and privacy, which are crucial for maintaining trust and compliance in the management of AI applications. Organizations, such as those within the CoEvolution consortium, prioritize alignment with GDPR in their data management practices, as adherence to its provisions is essential for fostering responsible data practices and enhancing transparency in data processing activities.

In summary, GDPR serves as a vital legal benchmark for data protection and privacy across Europe, shaping data laws and ethical data usage. Compliance with GDPR guidelines is critical for organizations engaged in data processing, ensuring the protection of individual privacy rights in the digital age.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5dfa0262d9cf1261fde3b563bc7f361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6eef347ebd1953e222397f7f754e5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f31094c83ab0284e8e350e82c94a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-174fbb753863f4c7c5541414531510d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6fbf5dd7af05fd0e193c115784651e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a849a6c0719d6015ef6c319e7b3a4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bed3e842d53d9202844347e7525f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d680583096f4188d4745b78c423dfc52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b8f0f1e7c38faeeea47d2a2b05dab74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c655315fcd0b9413217de724415bfd65&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d31a9f46c18f75b8bffad97afd44ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27983f12f5c86c0463eca065b4d5542d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b47fa4d5e8d983c7d35feee9e94172d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f7c6a9a08e9c022ee9a774571a1ae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32cbd08ce6f50d78ff9bcc410caf04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5bd329614b1182e2be9469625326eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0530cf4664cec89a37e5f2b19520ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d5842c87deb6e2b18fa93961d6c8fbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c366ab8df2f44a9f385a6868c2d6be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750697798fe8d5704aacb6736b165901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f735046fbbdc14f326a8f041cac6de9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a296b5c4f24ed1a5eae98b2e605e9835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca60b53f4fb08a71c2cabf42d2f6530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd021e77c6a98f8d589a96e248297baf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4e4ed58eff7ae3d119d2cc4a4dc34f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae1b1bd730a128c6aa8545dadc45ad37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24ba2d35feb8defe20b38929b8da11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c2a45c222140df04434355f127ac357&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b4f9a1d0ca30881b230205e59ea3ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94df68d0d67efc3c4a863e29734fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c33ff0da3223617dcddd9463b4752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32c9082aac6fd2a45950240834514168&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f0d1e34de2be2bf0ff36b6e60cd080b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72e3d6c0adc259c792912cb22e5365cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c59208a0ecce67d91fc2e55e630e3efd</data>
