</node>
<node id="Threat Models">
  <data key="d0">Threat Models</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Threat Models are frameworks used to understand and categorize potential adversarial attacks and their impact on AI systems, described as black-box, white-box, or grey-box.&lt;SEP&gt;Threat Models in CoEvolution represent various types of adversarial attacks, outlining the capabilities of attackers and potential strategies for exploitation of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Threat models outline the assumptions and capabilities of attackers, highlighting different strategies to undermine AI systems' security and privacy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c4cfff2edf2dca18d266e6392c6acf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8def759f18995b41ea21003cc5dcc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425703</data>
</node>
<node id="Adversarial Attack Countermeasures">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Attack Countermeasures</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attack Countermeasures are strategies and actions aimed at preparing AI models to resist various types of adversarial attacks during different lifecycle phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial Attack Countermeasures are strategies and techniques implemented to prevent or mitigate the effects of adversarial attacks on AI models during their lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-702b309f7879ea6c02c535b54964d126&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420446</data>
</node>
<node id="Model Extraction Attacks">
  <data key="d0">Model Extraction Attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Model Extraction Attacks involve efforts by adversaries to reconstruct AI models by observing their behavior, usually through side-channel information during execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419849</data>
</node>
<node id="Membership Inference Attacks">
  <data key="d0">Membership Inference Attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Membership Inference Attacks are a type of attack aimed at determining whether a given data point was part of the training dataset, posing risks to data privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Membership Inference Attacks are threats that attempt to infer whether a certain data point was part of a training dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;Membership Inference Attacks are types of attacks where the adversary seeks to determine whether a particular data point was part of the training dataset of a model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-05ba33a72c094c154f14017eb9f433f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423381</data>
</node>
<node id="Convolution Layer">
  <data key="d0">Convolution Layer</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Convolution Layer is a specific layer within certain deep learning architectures, particularly prominent in Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs). It plays a crucial role in processing data by employing convolutional operations, which is especially effective for handling grid-like structured data such as images. As a vital component of neural networks, the Convolution Layer utilizes a series of filters to analyze visual data, making it essential for various deep learning tasks. Additionally, due to its importance, the Convolution Layer is also a focus for developing countermeasures against adversarial attacks targeting these neural networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f13e4e9d2acd6290e2eddd212bdd3df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4258dad8667e5dd4d7e54cbdb071a5ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8a78502e4359c56e2de032610b38aa</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425716</data>
</node>
<node id="Client-Server Flows">
  <data key="d0">Client-Server Flows</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Client-Server Flows describe the interactions between client devices and central servers in a federated learning ecosystem where models are trained and updated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419850</data>
</node>
<node id="Peer-to-Peer Learning">
  <data key="d0">Peer-to-Peer Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Peer-to-Peer Learning is a decentralized collaborative learning approach that facilitates AI model training through the collective efforts of multiple devices, which operate without reliance on a central server. This method enhances cooperation and knowledge sharing among participating entities, allowing models to communicate and learn from each other autonomously. The principle of Peer-to-Peer Learning is emphasized in the security framework addressed by CoEvolution, highlighting its importance in promoting secure and efficient AI model collaboration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be6b7a96133b91256e1b5134cbf3d08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9db1412409c67345807388c3e65bc86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11568e1141436db1fb558509a57b48c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e82353b035ba082060e064ac9ff6c2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424144</data>
</node>
<node id="Ensemble Learning">
  <data key="d0">Ensemble Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ensemble Learning is a core technology in the field of artificial intelligence that focuses on the combination of multiple learning algorithms or models to enhance performance and robustness. This machine learning paradigm aims to improve predictive accuracy and resilience against adversarial attacks by integrating various base models. By leveraging the strengths of multiple models, Ensemble Learning effectively enhances the overall effectiveness of AI systems, making them more robust and reliable. It refers to a method where predictions from multiple models are combined, ultimately leading to improved prediction accuracy and enhanced defense against potential attacks. Overall, Ensemble Learning stands out as a powerful approach in the AI domain, significantly contributing to the performance and reliability of machine learning systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Ensemble Learning refers to a machine learning paradigm where multiple models are trained to improve model robustness and performance by combining their predictions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79ea744ae4e3f1f659f9ca366d26d3a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a53e39ebeb53771231e5e60fb82f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dd67768c95c1d599e1e7d53f932c680&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad886edb819a72a00a95a3d6cb0423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb4344e03dd54c5451fb9791afdbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28af3e5b46628e98e598a3a3fb2df917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425715</data>
</node>
<node id="Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART)">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART) is a comprehensive library designed to support the development of defenses and mitigation strategies against adversarial attacks targeting artificial intelligence (AI) models. It plays a crucial role in enhancing the security and reliability of AI technologies by offering a wide range of tools for both evaluating and improving the robustness of machine learning models against various types of attacks, including both utility-based and privacy-based threats. Furthermore, ART is utilized within the STR Assessment Engine to assess the robustness of AI models against such adversarial challenges, facilitating the implementation and evaluation of effective adversarial defenses in machine learning.&lt;SEP&gt;The Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART) is a toolkit designed to help researchers and developers create robust machine learning systems against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79ea744ae4e3f1f659f9ca366d26d3a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a53e39ebeb53771231e5e60fb82f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f799d77b58dcf9852f1c75b35188b0e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ba33a72c094c154f14017eb9f433f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dd67768c95c1d599e1e7d53f932c680&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80ad886edb819a72a00a95a3d6cb0423&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb4344e03dd54c5451fb9791afdbfc</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425715</data>
</node>
<node id="SMPC">
  <data key="d0">SMPC</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Secure Multi-Party Computation (SMPC) is a cryptographic method that allows parties to compute a function over their inputs while keeping those inputs private.&lt;SEP&gt;Secure Multi-Party Computation (SMPC) is a cryptographic technique that plays a crucial role in enhancing the security of AI model operations, particularly among interconnected agents in systems such as CoEvolution. It enables multiple parties to collaboratively compute a function over their private inputs while keeping those inputs confidential, thereby safeguarding data access. SMPC operates on the principle that computations can be performed on encrypted data without exposing sensitive information, making it a valuable method for combating threats such as Membership Inference attacks in AI systems. Overall, SMPC serves as a significant component in protecting privacy and ensuring secure multi-party collaborations in the realm of artificial intelligence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28af3e5b46628e98e598a3a3fb2df917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5210e5acaba1db19cd65c4e39977b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424920</data>
</node>
<node id="HE">
  <data key="d0">HE</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Homomorphic Encryption (HE) is a sophisticated encryption technique designed to ensure secure communication flow between AI agents within collaborative environments. HE enables computations to be performed on encrypted data, allowing operations to be carried out on ciphertexts without requiring decryption. This capability not only maintains the privacy of the data but also ensures that the results, once decrypted, accurately correspond to the outcomes of operations conducted on the original plaintexts. In summary, Homomorphic Encryption facilitates secure and private processing of information, making it a vital tool for enhancing security in AI-driven collaborative settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5210e5acaba1db19cd65c4e39977b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424924</data>
</node>
<node id="Adversarial Attack Mitigation Library">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Attack Mitigation Library</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attack Mitigation Library is a category encompassing platforms like SecML and ART, aimed at defending AI models from various forms of adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial Attack Mitigation Library refers to a collection of resources and tools designed to help defend AI systems against various adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Adversarial Attack Mitigation Library is a resource that provides various methods and techniques to alleviate the impact of adversarial attacks on AI models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-05ba33a72c094c154f14017eb9f433f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb4344e03dd54c5451fb9791afdbfc</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424152</data>
</node>
<node id="Input Validation">
  <data key="d0">Input Validation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Input Validation is a security measure in AI systems aimed at ensuring data integrity by checking inputs for anomalies before processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Input Validation refers to the measures taken to ensure that the data being fed into AI models is appropriate and does not compromise the model's integrity through adversarial examples.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423382</data>
</node>
<node id="Anomaly Detection Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Anomaly Detection Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Anomaly Detection Algorithms are sophisticated methods designed to identify unusual patterns in data that may indicate underlying issues, such as malicious activity or data corruption. These algorithms are essential tools that play a crucial role in safeguarding the input data utilized in artificial intelligence (AI) models. They function by identifying and filtering out atypical inputs that could compromise the integrity of AI systems, effectively helping to maintain their performance and reliability.

By recognizing and rejecting suspicious or malicious inputs during testing phases, Anomaly Detection Algorithms contribute significantly to the security and robustness of AI applications. Furthermore, they are instrumental in ensuring that AI systems operate securely, addressing potential vulnerabilities and threats that could arise from abnormal data behavior. Overall, these algorithms are vital in the ongoing effort to protect and enhance the reliability of AI technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79ea744ae4e3f1f659f9ca366d26d3a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a53e39ebeb53771231e5e60fb82f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb4344e03dd54c5451fb9791afdbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425717</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Poisoning Attacks">
  <data key="d0">Data Poisoning Attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data Poisoning Attacks are attempts to compromise the integrity of training data to negatively affect the performance of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Poisoning Attacks are malicious attempts to compromise the integrity of training datasets, which can significantly affect the performance and reliability of artificial intelligence (AI) models. These attacks occur when an attacker injects harmful data into the training dataset, introducing hidden vulnerabilities that manipulate the quality of the data used for training. The consequences of such attacks pose serious risks to AI systems, undermining their effectiveness by compromising both data integrity and model performance. Techniques employed in Data Poisoning Attacks aim to manipulate the training data of machine learning models, thereby impacting their behavior. The significance of these attacks is recognized in initiatives like the CoEvolution framework, which addresses the threats posed by such manipulations to ensure the security and functionality of AI models. Overall, Data Poisoning Attacks represent a critical threat to the security and reliability of AI systems by undermining the foundational quality of their training data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-79ea744ae4e3f1f659f9ca366d26d3a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a53e39ebeb53771231e5e60fb82f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28af3e5b46628e98e598a3a3fb2df917&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5210e5acaba1db19cd65c4e39977b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0300fc77e55d052b584b44facfc08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425715</data>
</node>
<node id="Runtime Detection Mechanisms">
  <data key="d0">Runtime Detection Mechanisms</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Runtime Detection Mechanisms are systems implemented during the operational phase to monitor and detect adversarial attacks on AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Runtime Detection Mechanisms are tools or methods implemented during the operational phase of AI models to identify and respond to potential adversarial threats in real-time.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb3c5a6faf3b857ba8d43ec98eb973c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-623872b535f731e898e49b91d42e77f8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424921</data>
</node>
<node id="Defense GANs">
  <data key="d0">Defense GANs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Defense GANs are a category of advanced generative learning techniques specifically designed to enhance the security and robustness of artificial intelligence (AI) models against adversarial attacks. These defense mechanisms integrate generative adversarial networks (GANs) to generate synthetic data, which disrupts the optimization processes exploited by potential adversaries. Within the CoEvolution framework, Defense GANs play a significant role in improving the performance and resilience of AI systems, ensuring they are well-prepared to withstand various adversarial challenges.

By generating synthetic data explicitly tailored to counteract malicious intrusions, Defense GANs serve as essential components in optimizing AI systems for enhanced security and reliability. Their innovative approaches not only bolster AI models, making them more resistant to attacks but also significantly enhance their overall robustness. In summary, Defense GANs are crucial elements in defending AI systems against adversarial threats, leveraging generative learning techniques to fortify their defenses—thereby playing a pivotal role in the broader CoEvolution project aimed at advancing AI resilience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d69ac7cb43276601482059fe1cb59288&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3d753a5ba3bfc0d8c4ec414093b1cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb9ddb0c5f55caea9f52e4feaa7073c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd242577c3ba63c0f548e5aa31a5820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba3c184b92e7717afad2ff103dd68dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425719</data>
</node>
<node id="Poisoned AI Models">
  <data key="d0">Poisoned AI Models</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Poisoned AI models refer to artificial intelligence models that have been compromised through adversarial attacks, leading to incorrect outputs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419850</data>
</node>
<node id="Obfuscation Defence Flow">
  <data key="d0">Obfuscation Defence Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An obfuscation defense flow is a structured process in AI model deployment that includes techniques to obscure model parameters from potential attackers.&lt;SEP&gt;Obfuscation defence flow involves techniques utilized to protect AI models by making their operations less interpretable or predictable to attackers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424924</data>
</node>
<node id="Dynamic Obfuscation">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Obfuscation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Dynamic Obfuscation is a technique utilized as a defense mechanism to protect AI models from adversarial attacks. This approach involves the periodic alteration of obfuscation methods or parameters that obscure the operations of AI models. By frequently changing the characteristics of obfuscation techniques, Dynamic Obfuscation enhances model security and makes it increasingly challenging for attackers to adapt their methods targeting the model. Overall, this strategy serves to improve the resilience of AI systems against potential threats by varying the obfuscation strategies employed during deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Dynamic obfuscation is a technique used in AI to alter model parameters periodically to hinder adversaries from successfully adapting their methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Dynamic obfuscation refers to techniques that change model parameters or obfuscation strategies during deployment to hinder attackers' abilities to adapt.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd242577c3ba63c0f548e5aa31a5820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425717</data>
</node>
<node id="Continual Defences Update Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Continual Defences Update Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The continual defenses update mechanism is a process within CoEvolution aimed at consistently refreshing security measures as new threats are identified.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37ef9abce30618ad5e36237ec9cb39f6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="AI Model Lifecycles">
  <data key="d0">AI Model Lifecycles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Model Lifecycles refer to the various phases an AI model undergoes, including deployment, operation, and decommission, each requiring specific processes and management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="P2P Learning">
  <data key="d0">P2P Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">P2P Learning refers to the decentralized approach in machine learning where peers in a network collaboratively learn from one another, enhancing models without relying on centralized data stores.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="Context-Aware AI Systems">
  <data key="d0">Context-Aware AI Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context-Aware AI Systems are designed to adapt to dynamic environments by interpreting and responding to contextual information, ensuring resilience against evolving threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="Decommission Phase">
  <data key="d0">Decommission Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Decommission Phase is a crucial and staged process within the AI lifecycle that involves the removal of an AI model from a specific application. This phase is especially significant for ensuring compliance with regulatory standards, such as those outlined in the EU AI Act. During the Decommission Phase, the emphasis is placed on adhering to safety and regulatory requirements, thereby guaranteeing that the removal of the AI model is conducted in a manner that meets all necessary legal obligations. This process is vital in managing the lifecycle of AI models responsibly and effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce588e6a41e4a19bd041531ec028f838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3ca67a0bb25d96a23d5612a2c95b2d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424925</data>
</node>
<node id="Operational Update Phase">
  <data key="d0">Operational Update Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Operational Update Phase is a subcategory within the AI lifecycle focused on the continual updates and improvements made to AI models during their operational period.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operational Update Phase is part of the AI lifecycle focused on regularly updating the AI model to ensure its security and effectiveness.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operational Update Phase is the initial stage in the AI model lifecycle that focuses on updating and enhancing the model's security and functionality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ce588e6a41e4a19bd041531ec028f838&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3ca67a0bb25d96a23d5612a2c95b2d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424153</data>
</node>
<node id="Decentralized Peer-to-Peer Learning (P2PL)">
  <data key="d0">Decentralized Peer-to-Peer Learning (P2PL)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Decentralized Peer-to-Peer Learning (P2PL) refers to the collaborative learning method where AI models communicate and learn from one another in a decentralized manner, enhancing their performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f988512ec39614cc4546bf6fcbeb31e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Context-Aware Decision Support (CDS)">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Context-Aware Decision Support (CDS)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CDS is a component of the CoEvolution organization that operationalizes information from the environment to extract actionable insights and choose optimal mitigation actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Context-Aware Decision Support (CDS) is a critical component designed to enhance decision-making by operationalizing contextual and environmental information. It focuses on extracting actionable insights that facilitate optimal mitigation actions, particularly in the domains of network security and data privacy. The CDS acts as a decision support agent, leveraging contextual data to improve security measures and privacy protocols, ultimately ensuring more effective responses to various scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca81f943b62a3047ee028498003fcafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8908f5d82a665a2008f9859e10755f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368e0742f36b9f4943d23f312bee77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f39a1b5cf48158980a9cfbe239a3316</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425718</data>
</node>
<node id="Central Context Awareness Engine">
  <data key="d0">Central Context Awareness Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Central Context Awareness Engine is a pivotal system within the CoEvolution architecture, tasked with the generation, selection, and combination of context vectors during the adaptation process. This engine is crucial for adaptive strategies in AI models, as it processes and evaluates context vectors that are essential for adjusting responses to various threats, ultimately enhancing the resilience of the system. The Central Context Awareness Engine utilizes dynamic adaptation techniques, including crossover and mutation processes, to optimize the context vectors. It also plays a significant role in facilitating performance evaluation and improvement, ensuring that the system can effectively adapt to changing environmental conditions and provide reliable decision support.&lt;SEP&gt;The Central Context Awareness Engine is part of the CoEvolution system, facilitating the selection and combination of features from context vectors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f5c42e7d5f67c2de98328269247dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cea46f2ec6b238b94a61ace6d4787996&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a491dd9e4e112c6a3057fa684923aa8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca81f943b62a3047ee028498003fcafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8908f5d82a665a2008f9859e10755f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368e0742f36b9f4943d23f312bee77a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f39a1b5cf48158980a9cfbe239a3316</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425718</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME)">
  <data key="d0">Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The SRME is a dual-role component monitoring AI model security and managing AI Model Bill of Materials (AI MBOM) within the CoEvolution system.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME) is a robust system dedicated to the continuous monitoring of the security status of AI models, ensuring their operational efficiency within the CoEvolution hub. Its primary functions include managing incident reports, maintaining the integrity of AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOMs), and providing critical feedback to facilitate responses to adversarial attacks. The SRME also plays a pivotal role in associating attack incidents with known categories, thereby enhancing the overall security framework of AI operations within the CoEvolution environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f5c42e7d5f67c2de98328269247dec4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a491dd9e4e112c6a3057fa684923aa8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca81f943b62a3047ee028498003fcafd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9765c6de5d09adbaa4008d62e0503a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424154</data>
</node>
<node id="Policy Learning">
  <data key="d0">Policy Learning</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Policy learning involves the processes used by the CoEvolution system to improve AI decision-making and enhance context-awareness through information extraction from the environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution STR">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution STR</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CoEvolution STR is a framework designed to enhance AI model security through a flow that addresses all phases of the AI model lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution STR refers to the system architecture used within CoEvolution to enhance security resilience in AI models by integrating context awareness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b717d4f1dbabcdf423e3b9ee479caad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424892</data>
</node>
<node id="P2P Network">
  <data key="d0">P2P Network</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">P2P Network refers to a peer-to-peer network structure outlined in the context of CoEvolution, crucial for collaborative learning among AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;P2P Network refers to the peer-to-peer networking model that allows decentralized communication among users or devices in the context of the CoEvolution system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a491dd9e4e112c6a3057fa684923aa8b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424155</data>
</node>
<node id="FL Network">
  <data key="d0">FL Network</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">FL Network refers to a federated learning network which facilitates collaborative training of AI models without centralized data collection.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cea29209e72133bb93f48ee121efe0a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419851</data>
</node>
<node id="PKI Certificates">
  <data key="d0">PKI Certificates</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">PKI Certificates are integral components of the security mechanisms employed by the SRME (Secure Resource Management Environment) to ensure the authenticity and integrity of AI MBOMs (Artificial Intelligence Manufacturing Bill of Materials). These certificates function as security credentials that work in conjunction with digital signatures, enabling the verification of the issuer's identity and the preservation of the integrity of the AI MBOMs. Specifically, PKI Certificates are utilized in digital signature schemes within the SRME, playing a crucial role in establishing trust and validating the authenticity of the AI MBOM Management Mechanism.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b65576c05d96906d2692fc35b3941f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169bce82366b2fa52a6ddd1e7e226f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4c1166600f780f6e57409778e6ccb9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425723</data>
</node>
<node id="AI MBOM Management Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">AI MBOM Management Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI MBOM Management Mechanism is a component of the SRME that manages the lifecycle of AI MBOMs, including validation, updates, and authenticity checks.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM Management Mechanism is part of the SRME, dedicated to handling requests regarding the AI MBOM, ensuring that it remains secure and up-to-date.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM Management Mechanism is a system that manages the AI MBOM, validating and authenticating AI models within a supply chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b65576c05d96906d2692fc35b3941f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d1f4cd119004da61bb670635808ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425719</data>
</node>
<node id="Risk Assessment, Guidelines and Recommendations Reports">
  <data key="d0">Risk Assessment, Guidelines and Recommendations Reports</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">These reports are produced as part of the CoEvolution framework, assessing risks related to AI models and providing guidelines for ensuring security and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419852</data>
</node>
<node id="DECOMISSION Defense Flow Gadget">
  <data key="d0">DECOMISSION Defense Flow Gadget</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">DECOMISSION Defense Flow Gadget is a tool used for decommissioning AI models when inconsistencies are found between the AI MBOM and the AI model.&lt;SEP&gt;The DECOMISSION defense flow gadget is utilized in the SRME process to decommission AI models whose associated AI MBOMs are found inconsistent.&lt;SEP&gt;The DECOMISSION Defense Flow Gadget is a tool used to decommission an AI model when inconsistencies are found between the AI MBOM and its associated AI model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3d1f4cd119004da61bb670635808ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169bce82366b2fa52a6ddd1e7e226f5c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422762</data>
</node>
<node id="Trustworthy AI">
  <data key="d0">Trustworthy AI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Trustworthy AI refers to the principles and standards established for AI development to ensure ethical practices and mitigate biases, in line with EU guidelines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419852</data>
</node>
<node id="EU Artificial Intelligence Act">
  <data key="d0">EU Artificial Intelligence Act</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The EU Artificial Intelligence Act is a proposed regulatory framework aimed at establishing a comprehensive legal structure for the use of artificial intelligence technologies within the European Union. Its primary objectives include promoting fairness, security, and ethical deployment of AI applications. This Act seeks to ensure the safety and compliance of AI systems, protecting users and society as a whole.

The framework is designed to address the complexities and challenges posed by rapidly advancing AI technologies, aligning them with established ethical standards. It emphasizes transparency and security in AI applications, exemplified by initiatives such as the CoEvolution Project, which assists organizations in meeting compliance requirements laid out by the Act.

Ultimately, the EU Artificial Intelligence Act strives to create standardized compliance guidelines across EU member states, fostering responsible use of AI technologies and ensuring adherence to ethical practices and safety standards in their development and application.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5dfa0262d9cf1261fde3b563bc7f361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0797f992209f90df906499cd0d556dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f31094c83ab0284e8e350e82c94a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70312df5ac32f2a784376ec9acd8debe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170412c84e579196d88270b9230595c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab48b662719cb842a1786a0c13a6d2cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c59208a0ecce67d91fc2e55e630e3efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425692</data>
</node>
<node id="Network/Edge Management AI">
  <data key="d0">Network/Edge Management AI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Network/Edge Management AI is a model that manages the operational efficiency of edge resources and applications within a connected edge network.&lt;SEP&gt;Network/Edge Management AI is a specialized artificial intelligence model designed to effectively manage and optimize network resources and edge infrastructure within manufacturing environments. Its primary focus is on the efficient management of edge resources and installed applications, ensuring that network infrastructure operates at its peak performance. This AI model aims to enhance the capabilities of network and edge management by providing solutions tailored specifically for the unique challenges present in manufacturing settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Network/Edge Management AI refers to an AI model that aids in managing network and edge infrastructure effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e3ec6d317ec9c38e6e681a34f1fe29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424929</data>
</node>
<node id="Localization AI">
  <data key="d0">Localization AI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Localization AI assists in the logistics of a manufacturing environment by enhancing accuracy in tracking assets.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization AI is an advanced artificial intelligence model designed to enhance the accuracy of asset tracking and management within manufacturing environments. This initiative focuses on improving logistics processes by refining the tracking capabilities of assets. By leveraging its sophisticated functionalities, Localization AI supports effective asset management, ultimately optimizing operational efficiency and accuracy in logistics. Overall, Localization AI plays a crucial role in facilitating better logistics and asset management in the manufacturing sector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e3ec6d317ec9c38e6e681a34f1fe29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425720</data>
</node>
<node id="Edge Device">
  <data key="d0">Edge Device</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">An Edge Device is a crucial piece of hardware designed to deploy AI models for managing and controlling processes within industrial automation and connected applications. These devices play a vital role in the edge computing ecosystem, serving as remote computing points that facilitate data processing and storage at the edge of a network. Often utilized in conjunction with AI models, Edge Devices enhance performance and are essential for managing edge infrastructures, particularly in the context of manufacturing processes.&lt;SEP&gt;An Edge Device is the hardware that hosts deployed AI models for real-time processing and management tasks in manufacturing.&lt;SEP&gt;Edge devices are hardware components that process data at the edge of the network, often in real-time, and are considered during AI model deployment for security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425716</data>
</node>
<node id="Network Switch Devices">
  <data key="d0">Network Switch Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Network Switch Devices facilitate the creation of connected networks in edge computing environments, allowing for the integration of AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Network Switch Devices play a vital role in the establishment of connected edge networks, which are essential for efficient communication and data movement within various networking environments. These devices enable the creation of interconnected networks, allowing for effective management of network resources. They are particularly important in edge computing environments and are critical in manufacturing settings, where they facilitate seamless connectivity and data exchange. Overall, Network Switch Devices are fundamental for enhancing network functionality and resource management across different applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425722</data>
</node>
<node id="Localization Beacon Devices">
  <data key="d0">Localization Beacon Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Localization Beacon Devices are devices used to enable the wireless localization of assets within a manufacturing infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization Beacon Devices are technological tools designed to facilitate the wireless localization and tracking of assets within manufacturing environments. They play a crucial role in managing these assets, enhancing logistics management by providing real-time tracking capabilities. These devices are adept at wirelessly identifying and monitoring various assets within a designated area, ensuring efficient operations in manufacturing settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization beacon devices are used to wirelessly localize tracked assets in the manufacturing supply chain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425722</data>
</node>
<node id="Localization Tag Devices">
  <data key="d0">Localization Tag Devices</data>
  <data key="d1">equipment</data>
  <data key="d2">Localization Tag Devices are carried by assets and help in their tracking via signals from localization beacons.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization Tag Devices are specialized devices that are attached to tracked assets, facilitating their tracking through interaction with localization beacons. These devices enhance inventory management by providing accurate tracking information, as they work in conjunction with beacons to determine the precise location of various assets. Their primary function is to improve the efficiency of asset tracking, ensuring that locations can be monitored effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Localization tag devices are attached to tracked assets and are localized by the beacons for accurate tracking.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4991d2b2e76403b019f2f16989b2a93f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425722</data>
</node>
<node id="AI MBOM Pool">
  <data key="d0">AI MBOM Pool</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI MBOM Pool is a centralized repository designed for the storage, management, and retrieval of AI Model Bills of Materials (AI MBOMs). It is specifically managed by the CoEvolution Security Runtime monitoring engine, which facilitates access for multiple organizations and end-users. This shared repository enables users to efficiently utilize AI MBOMs generated by CoEvolution, allowing for their review and management in a collaborative environment. Through the AI MBOM Pool, organizations can streamline their processes related to AI models by having a dependable location for all created AI MBOMs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e3d1f4cd119004da61bb670635808ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169bce82366b2fa52a6ddd1e7e226f5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6c63ecefae511a920b168080d05faae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424161</data>
</node>
<node id="Essential Workflow Chains">
  <data key="d0">Essential Workflow Chains</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Essential Workflow Chains refer to critical sequences of processes within manufacturing environments that are facilitated by multiple applications, underscoring the importance of security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4e2cc45e905008af3bd387b458c2d616</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419852</data>
</node>
<node id="CAVs">
  <data key="d0">CAVs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CAVs stands for Connected Autonomous Vehicles, which use multiple onboard sensors for environmental awareness and decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;CAVs, or Connected Autonomous Vehicles, refer to vehicles that are equipped with various onboard sensors designed for navigation and environmental understanding. These vehicles utilize multiple sensors to assess their surroundings, which is essential for their operation. CAVs operate with varying levels of automation, relying on advanced data management systems to ensure safe and effective functioning. They are characterized by their ability to cooperate with other vehicles and systems to enhance overall transportation efficiency and safety.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51db1d0ebfb384f2340004d2031fd42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424928</data>
</node>
<node id="Toyota Prius">
  <data key="d0">Toyota Prius</data>
  <data key="d1">vehicle</data>
  <data key="d2">The Toyota Prius is a hybrid electric vehicle equipped with advanced sensors and data acquisition setups for autonomous vehicle testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Toyota Prius is a hybrid-electric vehicle used in testing autonomous driving functions and equipped with advanced sensors for data acquisition.&lt;SEP&gt;The Toyota Prius is a hybrid electric vehicle used for CAV testing, equipped with sensors and a fully developed data acquisition setup for autonomous driving.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422763</data>
</node>
<node id="LiDAR">
  <data key="d0">LiDAR</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">LiDAR, which stands for Light Detection and Ranging, is an advanced, laser-based sensor technology utilized primarily in connected and autonomous vehicles (CAVs) for environmental perception and understanding. This innovative technology operates by using laser light to measure distances, providing comprehensive insights into the surrounding environment. It plays a crucial role in aiding navigation and detection tasks within autonomous vehicles, contributing significantly to their functionality. However, LiDAR is not without its challenges; it may encounter issues like jamming under certain conditions, which can affect its performance. Overall, LiDAR remains a vital component for enhancing the environmental understanding capabilities of CAVs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423390</data>
</node>
<node id="AI-based Localization for Asset Tracking">
  <data key="d0">AI-based Localization for Asset Tracking</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">AI-based localization for asset tracking is a use case aimed at enhancing the tracking of assets in industrial logistics using AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;This use case involves using AI technology to accurately track assets in industrial logistics, securing the implementation through the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;This initiative involves using artificial intelligence to improve localization capabilities for tracking assets in industrial logistics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51db1d0ebfb384f2340004d2031fd42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424157</data>
</node>
<node id="AI-based Edge/Network Management">
  <data key="d0">AI-based Edge/Network Management</data>
  <data key="d1">use case</data>
  <data key="d2">AI-based edge/network management refers to the application of AI to optimize the management of edge resources in connected environments.&lt;SEP&gt;This use case refers to managing edge resources in a network efficiently and securely, with a focus on enhancing performance and security through the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422763</data>
</node>
<node id="Cyber-Security Engine">
  <data key="d0">Cyber-Security Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">The cyber-security engine developed by CoEvolution aims to enhance the security of autonomous navigation and cooperative multi-modal scene awareness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419853</data>
</node>
<node id="Evaluation Scenarios">
  <data key="d0">Evaluation Scenarios</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Evaluation Scenarios refer to specific test cases developed to evaluate CoEvolution’s cyber-security engine in multi-agent environments.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluation scenarios are tests designed to validate the performance and security of technologies being developed within the CoEvolution framework for CAVs.&lt;SEP&gt;Evaluation scenarios are tests involving cooperative multi-agent scenarios with CAVs to establish autonomous navigation and awareness of the vehicle's surroundings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423389</data>
</node>
<node id="Asset Tracking in Industrial Logistics">
  <data key="d0">Asset Tracking in Industrial Logistics</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Asset Tracking in Industrial Logistics is a use case focusing on utilizing AI for efficient tracking of logistics assets, implemented through the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419853</data>
</node>
<node id="Autonomous Vehicles Domain">
  <data key="d0">Autonomous Vehicles Domain</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Autonomous Vehicles Domain involves the application of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies in the development and operation of self-driving vehicles. It encompasses a broad range of technologies and innovations aligned with the advancement of autonomous vehicles, including various techniques for their operation and management. Additionally, the Autonomous Vehicles Domain is a target area for the CoEvolution project, which emphasizes enhancing the security of AI models within this field.&lt;SEP&gt;The Autonomous Vehicles Domain is an area of application targeted in the CoEvolution framework, emphasizing the design, training, and secure deployment of AI models in vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;The autonomous vehicles domain represents the area where the CoEvolution framework will be piloted to support AI models through Federated Learning and runtime operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02fa9dfe5b39b5ec1975df01d2e4f7d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddfc5f9eb88fc57c1e7d42c942cb16c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df19f3e87623e77b4872532b8e5d92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-589ff2c6b80ad5646240c13df874e58a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425694</data>
</node>
<node id="Indoor/Outdoor Environments">
  <data key="d0">Indoor/Outdoor Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Indoor/Outdoor Environments refer to the different physical locations where autonomous vehicles are tested, encompassing various conditions and complexities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419853</data>
</node>
<node id="Cooperative Perception">
  <data key="d0">Cooperative Perception</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cooperative Perception is an innovative approach utilized by Connected and Autonomous Vehicles (CAVs) designed to enhance environmental modeling and extend their sensing capabilities. This methodology centers around the sharing of information and knowledge among interacting CAVs, allowing them to overcome the limitations inherent in individual sensors. By collaborating and pooling information, these vehicles improve their overall performance and resilience in various driving conditions. Cooperative Perception fundamentally elevates the efficiency and effectiveness of environmental perception in autonomous driving scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;Cooperative Perception refers to the method of sharing knowledge among multiple interacting agents to enhance the environmental modeling capabilities of CAVs and extend their sensing range.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1085773cd43df1afe7247dd49f7475fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425723</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Training">
  <data key="d0">Security Training</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Training involves educating organization personnel on the CoEvolution framework to ensure a secure deployment of AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Security training focuses on the CoEvolution framework and is aimed at the personnel of organizations involved in deploying AI use cases to improve trust and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;Security training focused on the CO-EVOLUTION framework aims to increase trustworthiness in AI components among personnel.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424929</data>
</node>
<node id="Environmental Modelling Capabilities">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Modelling Capabilities</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Environmental Modelling Capabilities refer to the ability of a CAV to understand and interpret its surroundings accurately.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419853</data>
</node>
<node id="Interacting Traffic Agents (ITAs)">
  <data key="d0">Interacting Traffic Agents (ITAs)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Interacting Traffic Agents (ITAs) refer to a combination of mobile and static sensors or landmarks that play a crucial role in enhancing the navigation and environmental awareness of Connected and Automated Vehicles (CAVs). These agents provide essential data that contributes to cooperative awareness within CAV systems and aids in vehicle perception and path planning. By interacting with both mobile and static elements in the environment, ITAs facilitate improved understanding of surroundings, thereby optimizing CAV operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Interacting Traffic Agents refer to both mobile and static entities that can include sensors and landmarks, which are integral to cooperative perception strategies in CAVs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1085773cd43df1afe7247dd49f7475fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425723</data>
</node>
<node id="HEU-SECURED">
  <data key="d0">HEU-SECURED</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">HEU-SECURED is a project dedicated to developing scalable privacy-preserving libraries aimed at creating defenses against privacy-based adversarial attacks. The initiative focuses on utilizing these libraries to provide robust protection against threats that compromise user privacy. By addressing the evolving landscape of adversarial challenges related to privacy, HEU-SECURED ensures that users can maintain their confidentiality in various contexts. The project emphasizes the importance of scalable solutions in order to effectively counteract these privacy threats.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-SECURED is a project utilizing scalable privacy-preserving libraries to defend against privacy-based adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="Avalanche">
  <data key="d0">Avalanche</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Avalanche focuses on developing incremental security defenses and studying attacks in incremental learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Avalanche is a project aimed at developing incremental security defenses through security patches and studying attacks in incremental learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Avalanche is a project associated with UNIPI, dedicated to advancing the security landscape through research in incremental learning. The initiative focuses on developing incremental security defenses and studying various attack scenarios within this context, aiming to enhance the resilience of systems as they update and adapt. Through its comprehensive efforts, Avalanche seeks to explore defensive strategies that evolve alongside learning systems, thereby addressing potential threats in incremental learning environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="AI-Toolkit">
  <data key="d0">AI-Toolkit</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AI-Toolkit is a comprehensive project aimed at providing essential components and design philosophies for the implementation of applications related to CoEvolution, particularly within the field of artificial intelligence (AI). It collaborates with the University of Pisa (UNIPI) and the Institute of Communication and Computer Systems (ICCS), highlighting a joint effort to advance CoEvolution technologies. The project focuses on leveraging its well-defined resources to facilitate the effective development and execution of CoEvolution applications. Overall, the AI-Toolkit plays a significant role in shaping the landscape of CoEvolution by offering valuable components and strategic design insights for practitioners in the field.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425726</data>
</node>
<node id="HEU-EMERGE">
  <data key="d0">HEU-EMERGE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">HEU-EMERGE is a research project associated with UNIPI that focuses on the study of distributed and continual learning. This project is significant for achieving the objectives of CoEvolution, an initiative in the field of artificial intelligence (AI) development. The research conducted by HEU-EMERGE is closely aligned with CoEvolution's goals, emphasizing the importance of both distributed learning and continual learning in realizing these objectives. Overall, HEU-EMERGE is dedicated to advancing knowledge and methodologies related to these learning paradigms, which are essential for the ongoing evolution of AI.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-EMERGE studies distributed learning and continual learning, relevant to the objectives of CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-EMERGE studies distributed learning and continual learning relevant to CoEvolution's objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020-I-BIDAAS">
  <data key="d0">H2020-I-BIDAAS</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020-I-BIDAAS focuses on data sharing in industrial environments and can contribute best practices to CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-I-BIDAAS is a project that aims to break down silos in industrial environments through effective data sharing and the dissemination of best practices related to CoEvolution. In collaboration with entities such as AEGIS and TID, the project emphasizes the importance of fostering collaboration and efficiency by facilitating data exchange. Through its initiatives, H2020-I-BIDAAS seeks to create a more integrated and cooperative atmosphere within industrial contexts, ultimately enhancing overall operational effectiveness and informing practices that align with the principles of CoEvolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020-CONCORDIA">
  <data key="d0">H2020-CONCORDIA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020-CONCORDIA is a project dedicated to enhancing cybersecurity and promoting collaborative learning technologies essential for CoEvolution. It focuses on leveraging knowledge in cybersecurity technologies and ecosystems to benefit CoEvolution, aiming to provide valuable insights and technologies that strengthen the cybersecurity framework. By supplying crucial technologies and expertise, H2020-CONCORDIA supports the objectives of CoEvolution, ensuring a robust and effective approach to the challenges in the cybersecurity landscape. This initiative incorporates various technologies and cybersecurity ecosystems that are vital for the progress and innovations within CoEvolution, thereby playing a significant role in the development of a comprehensive cybersecurity ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-CONCORDIA provides technologies and cybersecurity ecosystem benefits that are useful for CoEvolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020-ACCORDION">
  <data key="d0">H2020-ACCORDION</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020-ACCORDION brings in various R&amp;D efforts on private and leakage-free machine learning technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-ACCORDION is an initiative dedicated to the research and development (R&amp;D) of private and leakage-free machine learning technologies, particularly in the context of collaborative learning. The project emphasizes the importance of ensuring safety and confidentiality among entities engaged in collaboration, making significant strides in the understanding and implementation of private artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. H2020-ACCORDION involves key participants such as TID and ICCS, who contribute to the advancement of these technologies. Through its diverse R&amp;D efforts, H2020-ACCORDION aims to enhance knowledge and expertise in privacy-preserving machine learning, which plays a crucial role in shaping the landscape of this growing field and contributes valuable insights to the broader CoEvolution context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020-SPATIAL">
  <data key="d0">H2020-SPATIAL</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020-SPATIAL is an initiative that emphasizes the development of privacy-preserving and trustworthy machine learning (ML) technologies, particularly in the context of CoEvolution. This project is closely connected with TID and aims to enhance the security of AI algorithms while also establishing accountability and relevant metrics. H2020-SPATIAL plays a crucial role in shaping CoEvolution's approach to AI security and accountability, contributing significantly to research and development efforts in this field. Furthermore, the initiative addresses resilience metrics, thereby enriching the understanding of the implications and effectiveness of privacy-preserving ML technologies. Overall, H2020-SPATIAL is dedicated to advancing both the theoretical and practical aspects of secure and accountable AI.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-SPATIAL is involved in research on privacy-preserving ML technologies and related algorithmic solutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020-HEIR">
  <data key="d0">H2020-HEIR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020-HEIR assesses data quality through its vulnerability sources aggregator and analyzer.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-HEIR is a project that develops tools aimed at assessing data quality, particularly concerning vulnerability sources. It involves the participation of UPatras and is closely aligned with the objectives of CoEvolution projects. The primary focus of H2020-HEIR is to evaluate and analyze data quality in relation to vulnerabilities, providing essential insights and resources that can be utilized by CoEvolution and similar initiatives. The project includes various components designed specifically for this assessment, systematically evaluating data quality to enhance understanding and management of vulnerabilities. Through its comprehensive analysis and tools, H2020-HEIR contributes significant value to efforts aimed at improving data quality in the context of vulnerability assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="HEU-ELSA">
  <data key="d0">HEU-ELSA</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">HEU-ELSA is a project dedicated to enhancing the robustness of artificial intelligence (AI) models that are subject to continual updates. It is associated with UNICA and is part of the CoEvolution initiative, which focuses on the development of foundational tools specifically designed to improve the reliability and performance of AI systems operating in dynamic environments. By creating tools that enhance the robustness of continuously updated AI models, HEU-ELSA seeks to ensure that these systems remain effective despite regular updates. Through its initiatives, HEU-ELSA aims to significantly contribute to the advancement of reliable AI technologies, reinforcing the overall objectives of CoEvolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6fbf5dd7af05fd0e193c115784651e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425728</data>
</node>
<node id="CAV">
  <data key="d0">CAV</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CAV refers to Connected and Autonomous Vehicles, which are advanced automated vehicles equipped with sophisticated systems designed to navigate complex trajectories and enhance safety against various challenges, including cyber-security threats. These vehicles are integral to ongoing research aimed at improving their robustness against such cyber threats. CAVs utilize advanced sensing and planning capabilities to detect and respond to potential cyber-attacks effectively. Additionally, they are equipped with a perception engine that facilitates tasks such as geo-localization, as well as multi-object detection and tracking, enabling them to operate safely and efficiently in dynamic environments.&lt;SEP&gt;CAV stands for Connected and Automated Vehicles, which are referenced in the text regarding their geo-localization and trajectory planning during cyber-attack mitigations.&lt;SEP&gt;CAV refers to connected and automated vehicles which are central to discussions on vehicle path planning and cyber-attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c85ec84436942dd8fc56f3409a58ac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="MAPP">
  <data key="d0">MAPP</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MAPP relates to Multi-Agent Path Planning, an approach used in the context of coordinating vehicle trajectories and handling uncertainties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419854</data>
</node>
<node id="Cyber-attacks">
  <data key="d0">Cyber-attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cyber-attacks encompass various threats, such as GPS spoofing and attacks on vehicle sensors, which pose risks to vehicle functionalities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-606871ba2aa4073ddace8ae05a5da7a8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419854</data>
</node>
<node id="H2020 HEIR">
  <data key="d0">H2020 HEIR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">H2020 HEIR is a project that develops an aggregator and analyzer of vulnerability sources to assess data quality in the context of machine learning.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020 HEIR is an initiative that aggregates and analyzes vulnerability sources to assess data quality.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020 HEIR is a project within the Horizon 2020 framework, related to vulnerability assessment and data quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b94df68d0d67efc3c4a863e29734fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424162</data>
</node>
<node id="HEU-Sec4AI4Sec">
  <data key="d0">HEU-Sec4AI4Sec</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">HEU-Sec4AI4Sec focuses on enhancing AI security testing and robustness.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-Sec4AI4Sec focuses on improving AI security testing and robustness in development and operational settings.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-Sec4AI4Sec is an initiative dedicated to enhancing the security of artificial intelligence (AI) systems. Its primary focus is on improving AI security testing and robustness, particularly within continuous development and operational environments. The initiative aims to support CoEvolution's objectives by advancing the security testing processes applied to AI during developmental contexts. In collaboration with UNICA, HEU-Sec4AI4Sec strives to ensure that AI technologies are not only effective but also secure against potential vulnerabilities, thereby reinforcing the overall integrity and safety of AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8ca9646ce3ce824381983ab4c7f3cb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6205dbd68fc8bd585195fe14e81b0d57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425724</data>
</node>
<node id="Social Sciences and Humanities (SSH)">
  <data key="d0">Social Sciences and Humanities (SSH)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Social Sciences and Humanities (SSH) encompass a broad range of academic disciplines that focus on investigating human behavior, social structures, and the relationships within human society. These disciplines adopt an interdisciplinary approach by integrating social sciences with project methodologies, which is essential for understanding complex societal issues. SSH disciplines play a significant role in the CoEvolution project, where they are considered for stakeholder engagement and participatory methods in various project activities. 

Through their integration, SSH contributes to the project's methodology by assessing the impacts of different solutions and actively involving stakeholders. This engagement is crucial for ensuring that the project's initiatives are responsive to the needs and insights of the communities it aims to serve. Overall, SSH provides valuable knowledge and frameworks that shape the CoEvolution project's assessment and stakeholder engagement strategies, facilitating efforts to effectively address societal challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6fbf5dd7af05fd0e193c115784651e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62d913cb5322e69bb504986e2098e6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94df68d0d67efc3c4a863e29734fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fad8c45296704b976d9974fb6ccbcc41</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425683</data>
</node>
<node id="Gender Equality Strategy for 2020-2025">
  <data key="d0">Gender Equality Strategy for 2020-2025</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Gender Equality Strategy for 2020-2025, developed by the European Commission, aims to promote gender equality across various policies and initiatives. This strategy provides comprehensive guidelines intended to enhance gender equality, particularly in the realms of research and innovation. CoEvolution endorses this strategy and actively supports its provisions, emphasizing the importance of incorporating gender-specific considerations throughout project phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6fbf5dd7af05fd0e193c115784651e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425729</data>
</node>
<node id="Universal Declaration of Human Rights">
  <data key="d0">Universal Declaration of Human Rights</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Universal Declaration of Human Rights is a vital international document that outlines the fundamental human rights and freedoms to which all individuals are entitled. This declaration establishes essential rights that must be respected, including the right to privacy. It emphasizes the importance of protecting these rights universally, highlighting their significance for human dignity and liberty across the globe. The document serves as a crucial reference point in various contexts, including data processing and protection, reinforcing the necessity of upholding fundamental human rights in all aspects of life.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0530cf4664cec89a37e5f2b19520ed</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425731</data>
</node>
<node id="Trust Building">
  <data key="d0">Trust Building</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Trust Building refers to the social interaction and legitimacy processes emphasized by CoEvolution to facilitate dialogue and negotiation among diverse participants.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419855</data>
</node>
<node id="Impact">
  <data key="d0">Impact</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Impact represents the intended societal changes and benefits that emerge from the integrations and findings of the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419855</data>
</node>
<node id="Convention 108">
  <data key="d0">Convention 108</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Convention 108 is an international treaty designed to protect individuals with respect to the automatic processing of their personal data. The primary goal of this treaty is to ensure the safeguarding of individuals' rights in the context of automated data processing. Through its provisions, Convention 108 aims to enhance the protection of personal information against misuse and to promote greater transparency and accountability in the handling of such data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425730</data>
</node>
<node id="Zenodo">
  <data key="d0">Zenodo</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Zenodo is a trusted Open Data repository that specializes in assigning Digital Object Identifiers (DOIs) to research outputs, including datasets. This functionality ensures that these outputs are easily findable and accessible within the realm of academic research. By providing DOIs, Zenodo enhances the visibility of research data, making it a vital tool for researchers seeking to share and disseminate their findings effectively. Through its commitment to facilitating access and discoverability, Zenodo supports the broader academic community in the pursuit of open science.&lt;SEP&gt;Zenodo is an open data repository that assigns DOIs to ensure the findability of research data and outputs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0530cf4664cec89a37e5f2b19520ed</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425729</data>
</node>
<node id="Creative Commons licenses">
  <data key="d0">Creative Commons licenses</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Creative Commons licenses are legal tools designed to offer a versatile array of protections and freedoms for authors, artists, and educators. These licenses enable the legal sharing of creative works, allowing individuals to specify how their work can be used by others. By providing a standardized approach, Creative Commons licenses grant the public permission to share and utilize creative outputs in a variety of ways. Notably, licenses such as CC BY and CC0 are implemented by organizations like CoEvolution to promote open access and enhance the reusability of data and research outputs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a0530cf4664cec89a37e5f2b19520ed</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423395</data>
</node>
<node id="AI Developers">
  <data key="d0">AI Developers</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Developers are professionals dedicated to the creation and enhancement of artificial intelligence technologies and systems. They are involved in designing and building AI applications, focusing on security and trustworthiness in their outputs. AI Developers benefit significantly from the tools and frameworks offered by the CoEvolution project, which supports their initiatives aimed at improving AI models and systems. Overall, AI Developers play a crucial role in advancing AI technologies while adhering to important ethical standards and security measures.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Developers are professionals in the field of artificial intelligence creating and enhancing AI models and systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425729</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Professionals">
  <data key="d0">Security Professionals</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Professionals are individuals focused on ensuring the security and resilience of systems against adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Professionals are individuals focused on protecting information systems from security threats and ensuring the safety of AI systems against adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Professionals focus on ensuring the integrity and safety of systems against threats, such as adversarial attacks in AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425730</data>
</node>
<node id="Government and Regulatory Bodies">
  <data key="d0">Government and Regulatory Bodies</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Government and Regulatory Bodies are essential authorities responsible for setting standards and regulations concerning the acceptance and deployment of AI-based security systems. These entities are tasked with the creation, legislation, and enforcement of laws related to artificial intelligence (AI) technologies and security, playing a pivotal role as stakeholders in the development and implementation of AI systems. Their responsibilities include crafting comprehensive policies and regulations that govern AI and cybersecurity practices, as well as establishing industry standards.

As part of their involvement, Government and Regulatory Bodies participate in initiatives such as the CoEvolution project, which enhances their policies and decision-making frameworks. This initiative specifically focuses on improving the robustness and resilience of AI technologies against adversarial threats. They evaluate the robustness of AI-based security systems and influence their acceptance through rigorous assessments aligned with the recommendations of the CoEvolution initiative.

Furthermore, these bodies ensure compliance with established laws and regulations associated with AI systems, fostering an environment conducive to the safe and responsible use of AI practices. Their engagement is crucial for ensuring that the development and deployment of AI technologies adhere to legal and ethical standards. In summary, Government and Regulatory Bodies serve as key players in regulating compliance, setting standards, and enhancing the security of AI systems, thereby ensuring that AI technologies are developed and implemented safely and responsibly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1c9f3141d753938298cb0137770fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70312df5ac32f2a784376ec9acd8debe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-596574041ec0c369e8cbf7ec7ac9da13</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144348</data>
</node>
<node id="Technology Companies">
  <data key="d0">Technology Companies</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Technology Companies are businesses that specialize in the development and deployment of technology-based solutions, particularly in the realm of artificial intelligence (AI) applications. These companies play a critical role in the AI ecosystem by contributing essential tools and frameworks that enhance the security and integrity of AI systems. Many Technology Companies are actively involved in the CoEvolution project, an initiative focused on improving AI models and addressing various challenges related to AI deployment.

As primary participants in CoEvolution, Technology Companies gain significant advantages from the innovations produced through the project, which allows them to enhance their effectiveness and reliability in delivering technology solutions. Their participation enables them to leverage comprehensive frameworks that strengthen the security of their AI supply chains, fostering a more secure environment for the application of AI technologies.

Furthermore, Technology Companies emphasize the importance of cybersecurity measures while creating and deploying their technological solutions. By engaging with CoEvolution, these firms address critical challenges such as interoperability, security, and data integrity, which are essential for advancing technological innovation within the scope of AI. Overall, Technology Companies are integral to the evolution and enhancement of AI solutions, benefiting from collaborative efforts to improve both their security frameworks and the broader implications of AI technology deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Technology Companies are targeted by CoEvolution to assist them in securing their AI supply chains and ensuring data integrity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1c9f3141d753938298cb0137770fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70312df5ac32f2a784376ec9acd8debe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-596574041ec0c369e8cbf7ec7ac9da13</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144344</data>
</node>
<node id="Software and Hardware Vendors">
  <data key="d0">Software and Hardware Vendors</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Software and Hardware Vendors are essential players in the technological landscape, particularly in the domain of artificial intelligence (AI) and its various applications. They are key stakeholders in the advancements introduced by the CoEvolution Project, which focuses on enhancing the capabilities of AI technologies. These vendors are responsible for developing a wide array of technological products and tools that form the backbone of the infrastructure for AI applications, ensuring the deployment and functionality of diverse AI models and systems.

As they engage with the outcomes of the CoEvolution Project, Software and Hardware Vendors face an increasing demand for improved security measures. This heightened need for security is particularly relevant given the disruptive technologies emerging from advancements in AI. Consequently, these vendors must create technology solutions that prioritize the safety and protection of both their products and the end-users who rely on them. Their efforts are critical in ensuring the secure and effective deployment of AI systems, as they navigate the ongoing pressure to enhance security within their technologies. Ultimately, Software and Hardware Vendors play a pivotal role in producing the hardware and software necessary for secure AI technologies and solutions, thereby solidifying their importance in the ongoing evolution of AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Software and Hardware Vendors are involved in CoEvolution to address the need for secure technologies in AI hardware and software.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70312df5ac32f2a784376ec9acd8debe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-596574041ec0c369e8cbf7ec7ac9da13</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144344</data>
</node>
<node id="Industry and Business Leaders">
  <data key="d0">Industry and Business Leaders</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Industry and Business Leaders are individuals leading businesses that rely on AI technologies, seeking to enhance operational resilience.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry and Business Leaders are pivotal decision-makers across multiple sectors, significantly influencing the integration and application of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. They play a crucial role in promoting AI application security and building trust among users, while also overseeing the commercialization and management of innovations stemming from the CoEvolution project. As key stakeholders, they actively drive the adoption of methodologies developed within this initiative, emphasizing the need for contextual awareness and resilience in AI applications. 

Their profound understanding of context awareness is vital for enhancing organizational resilience and effectiveness, enabling them to shape strategies and guide directions within their organizations regarding AI integration. This capability allows Industry and Business Leaders to improve the robustness of applications in various sectors, ultimately influencing the future landscape of technology deployment in their industries. By leveraging context awareness in AI systems, they contribute significantly to enhancing the resilience and reliability of technology applications across the board.&lt;SEP&gt;Industry and Business Leaders are part of the CoEvolution project's target groups, demonstrating the value of resilient AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-596574041ec0c369e8cbf7ec7ac9da13</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144344</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Management Plan (DMP)">
  <data key="d0">Data Management Plan (DMP)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Data Management Plan (DMP) is a framework established by CoEvolution to detail data generation, standards, and methodologies for data handling.&lt;SEP&gt;The Data Management Plan (DMP) is a strategic document designed to delineate the management and sharing of data during a research project. Specifically, within the context of the CoEvolution project, the DMP encompasses a comprehensive outline detailing how data will be generated, stored, and made accessible. It provides clear guidelines and methodologies for managing and structuring data produced throughout the project, while also addressing the specific formats, standards, and accessibility measures that will be employed.&lt;SEP&gt;The Data Management Plan (DMP) is a strategic framework developed within the project to address data handling, compliance, and ethical standards across the project's lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed663f83e00c26d63223d3e166e75c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27983f12f5c86c0463eca065b4d5542d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425729</data>
</node>
<node id="European Code of Conduct for Research Integrity">
  <data key="d0">European Code of Conduct for Research Integrity</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Code of Conduct for Research Integrity establishes a comprehensive framework of principles and standards that beneficiaries must adhere to in their research activities. It delineates the norms for ethical research practices, providing crucial guidelines to ensure integrity in scientific research. By outlining expectations for responsible and ethical conduct, the Code serves as a vital resource for maintaining high standards within the research community.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Code of Conduct for Research Integrity provides guidelines aimed at ensuring ethical standards and integrity in research practices across Europe.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Code of Conduct for Research Integrity provides guidelines for ethical practices in scientific research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7627bf3a6479da8bd78bb376ead3b76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b</data>
