  <data key="d2">The Guidelines on Data Management in Horizon Europe provide frameworks for effective data management practices in research projects.&lt;SEP&gt;These guidelines provide directions on effective data management practices within the Horizon Europe program, ensuring proper handling of research data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Guidelines on Data Management in Horizon Europe provide frameworks for managing research data within the Horizon Europe funding program.</data>
