<node id="AI MBOM Data Structure">
  <data key="d0">AI MBOM Data Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI MBOM Data Structure is a comprehensive framework developed by CoEvolution, aimed at enhancing the security and robustness of AI models. This initiative, known as Model-Based Object Management, focuses on improving the integrity of the AI supply chain ecosystem by providing a structured approach to managing AI models. Through its various components, the AI MBOM Data Structure contributes to the overall reliability and security of AI systems, ensuring that they meet the necessary standards for performance and safety within the CoEvolution project.</data>
