</node>
<node id="Security-by-design concept">
  <data key="d0">Security-by-design concept</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security-by-design concept emphasizes incorporating security features into AI systems from the initial design phase to enhance resilience against threats.&lt;SEP&gt;The security-by-design concept is a principle applied within the CoEvolution project to enhance the security and resilience of AI systems through proactive measures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ba3c184b92e7717afad2ff103dd68dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb9ddb0c5f55caea9f52e4feaa7073c</data>
