<node id="AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM)">
  <data key="d0">AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM) is a structured framework developed by CoEvolution that provides a comprehensive representation of artificial intelligence models. It details critical aspects such as data, usage, dependencies, and security-related information, extending the traditional Software Bill of Materials (BOM) to incorporate essential security considerations throughout the lifecycle of AI models.

The AI Model MBOM meticulously tracks various components, including training datasets, model ownership, dependencies, and security credentials. By integrating crucial security data, it enhances accountability and transparency, allowing for thorough security assessments. This framework is essential for ensuring that stakeholders have access to vital information regarding AI models, thereby promoting governance, trust, and ethical oversight in AI development and deployment.

Overall, the AI Model Bill of Materials serves as a vital documentation component within the CoEvolution framework, significantly contributing to security assurance and the responsible management of AI models. It encapsulates ethical considerations alongside technical aspects, thereby fostering a more secure and responsible approach within the field of artificial intelligence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-141753ac9ec7e83b0090d110cb431232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff534ba90f98663c29a13338a46795d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef20bc6bd70a2d4b389a72d582866c02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95e581cb78a2c2aad223dc49965291dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4cfff2edf2dca18d266e6392c6acf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9db1412409c67345807388c3e65bc86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96f98f10ca7967e7c93ebec461a36b56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8908f5d82a665a2008f9859e10755f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c33ff0da3223617dcddd9463b4752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e82353b035ba082060e064ac9ff6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f0d1e34de2be2bf0ff36b6e60cd080b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9260f7f87786fb6b762b6bf5a25591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4011fe5c8f325cbfb6257057dcfc79c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31852725a164a4dd52957ae5c1baa452&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2248d6022b436a47f7e30a79038af6d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1adafa6fef16a603952c1b37f916c47e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b8f0f1e7c38faeeea47d2a2b05dab74</data>
