<node id="Public Sector">
  <data key="d0">Public Sector</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Public Sector encompasses government services and organizations that operate for the public good and are impacted by AI technologies and security measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The Public Sector encompasses the government institutions and agencies that are involved in implementing AI regulations and standards under the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Public Sector refers to government entities that are involved in the adoption and regulation of AI technologies and cybersecurity measures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-86f45cd8bcbd8796ed56c65b2a614309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4011fe5c8f325cbfb6257057dcfc79c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6bf63b8e7794868c19826908bb0e0c</data>
