</node>
<node id="AI Engineers">
  <data key="d0">AI Engineers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Engineers are professionals involved in the design, development, and maintenance of AI systems, ensuring they meet security and operational standards.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Engineers are professionals who develop and implement AI systems, utilizing the frameworks and tools provided by initiatives like CoEvolution to enhance model security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-86f45cd8bcbd8796ed56c65b2a614309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4011fe5c8f325cbfb6257057dcfc79c3</data>
