</node>
<node id="AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine">
  <data key="d0">AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine is a specialized tool developed to enhance the security of AI systems by detecting anomalies and preventing cyber attacks during their operational phase. Its primary function involves identifying irregular behaviors within AI environments, which is essential for maintaining the security and integrity of these systems. Introduced by the CoEvolution project, this engine plays a critical role in safeguarding AI technologies against potential cybersecurity threats through its advanced anomaly detection capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine is a tool developed to detect anomalies and prevent attacks against AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bed3e842d53d9202844347e7525f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425734</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Context Decision Transformer (CDT)">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Context Decision Transformer (CDT)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Context Decision Transformer (CDT) is an advanced tool designed to process context vectors and develop strategies aimed at addressing the behavioral challenges presented by AI models. It serves as a mechanism for identifying optimal strategies that manage AI model behavior, particularly in adversarial conditions and during complex scenarios. The CDT effectively navigates these challenges by analyzing context vectors to formulate solutions for intricate AI model behaviors encountered in adversary situations.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Context Decision Transformer (CDT) processes context vectors to define optimal strategies for AI model behavior under adversarial conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Context Decision Transformer (CDT) processes context vectors to optimize strategies for AI models under adversarial conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bed3e842d53d9202844347e7525f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425734</data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Objective Deep Reinforcement Learning (MODRL)">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Objective Deep Reinforcement Learning (MODRL)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MODRL framework addresses complex AI behavior and decision-making in uncertain situations where single-objective methods fall short.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-Objective Deep Reinforcement Learning (MODRL) is a specialized framework developed to address complex decision-making scenarios that traditional single-objective methods find challenging. This framework is particularly relevant in the realm of artificial intelligence (AI), where it focuses on effectively managing multiple objectives simultaneously, thereby enhancing the decision-making capabilities of AI systems. MODRL was introduced as part of the CoEvolution project, aiming to tackle intricate AI model behaviors and the associated decision-making difficulties that arise in multifaceted environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425735</data>
</node>
<node id="AI MBOM Repository">
  <data key="d0">AI MBOM Repository</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI MBOM Repository is a central database and critical architecture designed to ensure the trustworthiness, reliability, and resilience of AI systems. It serves as an information hub that provides comprehensive details about AI models, facilitating continuous monitoring and evaluation to maintain the integrity and security of these systems. By enabling ongoing assessments, the repository plays a vital role in supporting efficient oversight and management of AI technologies, thereby enhancing their trustworthiness and security.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM Repository serves as a central architecture for AI model information to ensure security and continuous evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-380d907a4d19fe1f921d130a17586031&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9bed3e842d53d9202844347e7525f7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425735</data>
</node>
<node id="AI HLEG">
  <data key="d0">AI HLEG</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI High-Level Expert Group (AI HLEG) is a European Union initiative that provides guidelines and recommendations to ensure the ethical and trustworthy development and application of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The High-Level Expert Group on AI (AI HLEG) is tasked with formulating guidelines for trustworthy AI within the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The High-Level Expert Group on AI (AI HLEG) provides guidelines for trust, fairness, and compliance for AI applications as part of the European regulatory environment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425736</data>
</node>
<node id="TensorFlow Federated">
  <data key="d0">TensorFlow Federated</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">TensorFlow Federated is a framework designed for building machine learning models that emphasizes distributed training and privacy-preserving analysis. It supports federated learning, allowing for the development of AI models across decentralized data sources. The framework facilitates collaborative machine learning, ensuring data privacy is maintained throughout the AI system development process. TensorFlow Federated is integral to advancing efficient and secure AI applications in a decentralized environment.&lt;SEP&gt;TensorFlow Federated is a framework that allows for the development of machine learning models using decentralized data sources.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425735</data>
</node>
<node id="ROS">
  <data key="d0">ROS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">ROS (Robot Operating System) is a flexible and open-source framework designed for writing robot software. It serves as a middleware suite that facilitates the development of robotic applications and has a significant influence on AI development. ROS is recognized for its capability to be applied in real-time AI systems, contributing to various AI applications. As an open-source project, it promotes collaboration and integration within the robotics community, enabling the utilization of its frameworks within AI contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec</data>
