<node id="OpenFog Consortium">
  <data key="d0">OpenFog Consortium</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The OpenFog Consortium is a collaborative effort aimed at advancing fog computing by creating open standards and best practices applicable to AI and IoT applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The OpenFog Consortium is a collaborative organization focused on advancing fog computing and its applications, including in AI.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
