<node id="Kafka">
  <data key="d0">Kafka</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Kafka is a distributed, open-source event streaming platform that is capable of handling real-time data feeds. It plays a significant role in building real-time data pipelines and streaming applications, making it an essential tool for data processing within AI systems. Kafka is noted for its potential influence on various projects, including the CoEvolution project, suggesting that it may impact outcomes in AI-related initiatives. Overall, Kafka is recognized as a key platform for stream processing, facilitating the efficient management and analysis of data in real-time contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec</data>
