<node id="IEEE Int. Conference on Big Data Security on Cloud">
  <data key="d0">IEEE Int. Conference on Big Data Security on Cloud</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE Int. Conference on Big Data Security on Cloud is a conference focused on the intersection of big data and security in cloud computing.&lt;SEP&gt;The IEEE Int. Conference on Big Data Security on Cloud is a scientific conference related to data security important for the dissemination of CoEvolution's results.&lt;SEP&gt;The IEEE International Conference on Big Data Security on Cloud is a prominent scientific conference dedicated to exploring the security aspects of big data used in cloud computing environments. It serves as a global platform for addressing various security issues associated with big data in these contexts. The conference aims to bring together experts and researchers to share insights, promote collaboration, and contribute to the advancement of effective security measures specifically tailored for big data applications in the cloud. With a focus on recent developments in data security practices, the conference covers a wide range of topics related to cloud security, making it a key event for stakeholders involved in the intersection of big data and cloud computing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a6eef347ebd1953e222397f7f754e5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab497e544c296443450429be95baf420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e47c432d30f5d9b35bdcd2fb1f8f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa6ec9ed386aca3a32d0190477b7a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f2512422b89fb0b4ab5429166b5bbec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d5842c87deb6e2b18fa93961d6c8fbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d80577ca1c86241f8708f0eaee5fa6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a06cde9d8efe27678e672f257f4a88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ae0f0567a0d81633f1194f5d9d67365</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425735</data>
</node>
<node id="End Users of AI Systems">
  <data key="d0">End Users of AI Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">End Users of AI Systems are individuals or organizations that leverage AI technologies across a wide range of sectors, including healthcare, finance, and transportation. This diverse group encompasses both the general public and professionals who engage with AI applications in their everyday operations. Their experiences and interactions with these systems are crucial, as they significantly influence acceptance and trust in AI solutions.

These End Users explicitly rely on the reliability, ethical standards, and security features of AI applications, which are designed to address their diverse needs and enhance usability. As a broad segment of society, they stand to benefit from ongoing advancements in AI systems. Initiatives like CoEvolution emphasize reliability and safety, acknowledging the importance of trust and security in these technologies.

Ultimately, End Users of AI Systems seek trustworthy and effective AI applications that provide improved security and robustness guarantees, ensuring that their interactions with these technologies are both beneficial and secure. Their trust and security are particularly impacted by the outcomes of projects like CoEvolution, highlighting the interconnectedness of user experience and technological advancement in the AI landscape.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e83932cac414ab182d7cef2b7c6fd7a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cff534ba90f98663c29a13338a46795d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b95887f0a735a53175d3a901822dbf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70312df5ac32f2a784376ec9acd8debe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3d753a5ba3bfc0d8c4ec414093b1cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f665d8e26a0a00c021a92d89140e92fe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb9ddb0c5f55caea9f52e4feaa7073c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ec108fe9a6c2b1c0e24131118c1e82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba3c184b92e7717afad2ff103dd68dc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-596574041ec0c369e8cbf7ec7ac9da13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9260f7f87786fb6b762b6bf5a25591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2248d6022b436a47f7e30a79038af6d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1adafa6fef16a603952c1b37f916c47e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
