  <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">GitHub is a distributed source code platform where CoEvolution plans to publish its open-source software repositories.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a distributed version control platform that facilitates open-source collaboration and access to source code.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is a platform for hosting open-source code, which CoEvolution will use to promote transparency in its software repositories.</data>
