<node id="EU Data Week">
  <data key="d0">EU Data Week</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">EU Data Week is a comprehensive series of events dedicated to the themes of data governance, the digital economy, and data-driven innovation across Europe. It serves as a platform for promoting awareness and fostering collaboration among various stakeholders in the data landscape. The week includes an industrial exhibition where participants engage in discussions regarding data practices and innovations, highlighting the importance of the European data ecosystem. Through its multifaceted approach, EU Data Week encourages dialogue and exploration of data-related topics, aiming to enhance understanding and implementation of effective data strategies across the continent.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Data Week is an event included in the list of activities associated with the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Data Week is a key event in which CoEvolution aims to showcase and promote its project results to a wider audience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab497e544c296443450429be95baf420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b6f2491ad8b1f2573a35a413e0218d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c6684e2d5110fe51294f244c64154d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a06cde9d8efe27678e672f257f4a88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b165dd4582e70acf9bca3d12028767fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e237a48ad98792e9118fcb292819faee</data>
