<node id="EBDVF">
  <data key="d0">EBDVF</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Big Data Value Forum (EBDVF) is an important event organized under the initiatives of the CoEvolution project, aimed at connecting stakeholders to disseminate outcomes and findings related to big data. It serves as a platform for exploring the significance of big data across various sectors and industries, showcasing advancements in big data technologies. The EBDVF facilitates discussions on innovation, the application of big data, and artificial intelligence (AI), highlighting the value of big data in driving growth and innovation within the industry. As a key event for stakeholders interested in the future of data-driven solutions, the EBDVF emphasizes the benefits of big data for both the economy and society.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ab497e544c296443450429be95baf420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e47c432d30f5d9b35bdcd2fb1f8f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b6f2491ad8b1f2573a35a413e0218d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c6684e2d5110fe51294f244c64154d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a06cde9d8efe27678e672f257f4a88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b165dd4582e70acf9bca3d12028767fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e237a48ad98792e9118fcb292819faee</data>
