  <data key="d0">Digital Future Congress</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Digital Future Congress is an important industry forum where CoEvolution will participate to promote technological advancements.&lt;SEP&gt;Digital Future Congress is listed as a significant event for CoEvolution project activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Digital Future Congress is an event dedicated to exploring future trends, technological advancements, and innovations across various fields. This forum aims to address the developments in technology and digital transformation, providing a platform for discussions on strategies for harnessing digital technologies to foster future advancements. Through its focus on future technologies, the Digital Future Congress seeks to facilitate understanding and collaboration among stakeholders interested in navigating the implications of these emerging trends.</data>
