  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">e-Newsletters are effective communication tools employed by CoEvolution to engage with stakeholders. They are designed to share snapshots of the organization's activities and achievements, keeping stakeholders informed about CoEvolution's main initiatives. As a component of CoEvolution's communication strategy, e-Newsletters provide targeted updates to specific audiences, ensuring that the information is relevant and accessible. Overall, these e-Newsletters serve to strengthen CoEvolution's connection with its stakeholders by highlighting important developments and successes.</data>
