  <data key="d2">The Project Website is a central and core source of information for the CoEvolution project, designed to facilitate easy navigation and access for users. It provides comprehensive details about CoEvolution's objectives and activities, ensuring that users can retrieve key action data effortlessly. The Project Website is intended to remain online for three years following the conclusion of the project, thereby continuing to serve as a valuable resource for information related to CoEvolution.</data>
