  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Promotional Material encompasses a variety of resources produced by CoEvolution to advocate for their project at events and to engage with the public. This material includes brochures, flyers, catalogues, and posters, which are designed for both dissemination at events and broader distribution. Additionally, it extends to various forms of media, including online content, aimed at promoting CoEvolution's activities and results effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Promotional material includes brochures, catalogues, and other resources used by CoEvolution to promote its initiatives at various events.</data>
