  <data key="d0">Projects KER</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Project’s KER refers to the outcome of the CoEvolution project focusing on the commercialization of various technological results.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419862</data>
</node>
<node id="Intellectual Property Rights (IPR)">
  <data key="d0">Intellectual Property Rights (IPR)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Intellectual Property Rights (IPR) are legal protections for innovations created during the CoEvolution project, ensuring ownership and access rights among partners.&lt;SEP&gt;Intellectual Property Rights (IPR) encompass the legal rights that protect the innovations and creations resulting from the CoEvolution project's work. These rights are crucial for safeguarding the inventions, designs, and artistic works developed during the project. IPR provides legal mechanisms that enable creators to secure their intellectual creations, thereby fostering innovation. Furthermore, IPR management involves establishing rules concerning intellectual property ownership and access rights, which are essential for the effective execution of the project and the protection of its results.&lt;SEP&gt;Intellectual Property Rights (IPR) cover the legal rights that result from intellectual activity in the industrial, scientific, literary and artistic fields, crucial for protecting the consortium’s innovations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cafddfb6023f95166fd0911d6de46cf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7a35ac3afd89edc447fd80276a26a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445008e17e64c0438134e1fefbcf5dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a51bbd5d1752076fc6d00e1c7fb0a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d72b113a4fa1ce0763800ea6022d752f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425741</data>
</node>
<node id="Exploitation Activities">
  <data key="d0">Exploitation Activities</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Exploitation Activities refer to the actions taken by the CoEvolution consortium to promote and ensure the long-term sustainability of its results.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploitation activities refer to the tasks undertaken by the CoEvolution consortium to ensure that results from the project lead to sustainable outcomes for stakeholders in various industries.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploitation activities encompass actions taken to promote the adoption and commercialization of the consortium's technology and knowledge.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b6a51bbd5d1752076fc6d00e1c7fb0a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d72b113a4fa1ce0763800ea6022d752f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425741</data>
</node>
<node id="Exploitation Plan">
  <data key="d0">Exploitation Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Exploitation Plan serves as a comprehensive framework that details the strategies and activities designed to maximize the impact and sustainability of the CoEvolution project's results after its completion. This plan outlines the various mechanisms that the CoEvolution consortium will employ to promote and ensure the long-term adoption of its innovations. By focusing on both immediate and future outcomes, the Exploitation Plan aims to achieve widespread adoption of the project's innovations, ensuring that the benefits and outcomes are sustained well beyond the project's duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b573e7bb5a4593f8be0bc8fdb90d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7a35ac3afd89edc447fd80276a26a37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ecf64aa779212b37143119b15ede3cd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144344</data>
</node>
<node id="SWOT Analysis">
  <data key="d0">SWOT Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SWOT Analysis is a strategic planning tool that facilitates the assessment of strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, and threats associated with a project or business. It is utilized by various entities, including a consortium, to comprehensively analyze the internal and external factors that can influence the success of a project. Specifically, SWOT Analysis serves to identify the strengths and weaknesses pertinent to the business model for CoEvolution, as well as to evaluate the overall landscape surrounding a project or organization. Through this multifaceted approach, SWOT Analysis aids in guiding strategic decisions and fostering informed planning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-32e809a3ce6da55906320f84dbd54cb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d72b113a4fa1ce0763800ea6022d752f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426347</data>
</node>
<node id="Service Types">
  <data key="d0">Service Types</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Service Types refer to the various offerings such as support, training, consultation, and extension that CoEvolution may provide as part of its exploitation strategy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419862</data>
</node>
<node id="Market Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Market Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Market Analysis involves reviewing the current market status to capture value-chain trends and understand industry challenges in data analytics.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Analysis is a critical activity in the CoEvolution project that entails assessing current market trends, dynamics, and consumer behavior to identify potential stakeholders and understand relevant industry challenges. This comprehensive evaluation framework is designed to inform business planning and strategic decision-making by analyzing the changing conditions within the market. Through this process, Market Analysis aims to provide insights that are essential for navigating the complexities of the industry's landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;Market analysis involves evaluating market conditions, trends, and drivers, which is a critical part of CoEvolution's exploitation strategy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f83b9a010b72a12ec39799a44f8c865&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8536b77a28a4d77fb291854c1693e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce0736a59c30f8d082e4197fbe818d3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a51bbd5d1752076fc6d00e1c7fb0a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d72b113a4fa1ce0763800ea6022d752f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425741</data>
</node>
