<node id="Cyprus">
  <data key="d0">Cyprus</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Cyprus is an island country located in the Eastern Mediterranean and is a participant in the CoEvolution Consortium. As a recognized contributor within this consortium, Cyprus actively engages in collaborative efforts to advance technology, particularly in the fields of cybersecurity and artificial intelligence (AI). The country's involvement underscores its commitment to enhancing cooperation among nations in research related to these critical areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Cyprus is one of the countries represented in the CoEvolution project consortium, working on AI model robustness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0797f992209f90df906499cd0d556dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd2acaeb0d9437c3f09baa7c94ddf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df83794707f70c47ca48cb0487b40957</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425743</data>
