<node id="Switzerland">
  <data key="d0">Switzerland</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Switzerland is a key partner in the CoEvolution consortium, which focuses on innovative models in artificial intelligence (AI) and cybersecurity. The country plays an active role in the CoEvolution project, represented through established organizations that support the consortium's efforts. This involvement includes participation in various research activities aimed at advancing the project's objectives related to cybersecurity practices and AI insights. Switzerland's contributions highlight its commitment to international collaboration in the field of technology and security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0797f992209f90df906499cd0d556dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd2acaeb0d9437c3f09baa7c94ddf8</data>
