</node>
<node id="Spain">
  <data key="d0">Spain</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Spain is an active participant in the CoEvolution Consortium, a collaborative effort dedicated to advancements in artificial intelligence (AI) research, particularly in the realms of cybersecurity, AI security, and trust. As one of the countries represented in this consortium, Spain plays a significant role in contributing to the collective goals alongside other partner organizations. Through its involvement, Spain aims to enhance the integrity and reliability of AI technologies, underscoring its commitment to fostering innovation and collaboration in the field. Additionally, Spain is engaged in the development of secure AI systems, emphasizing its dedication to ensuring the safety and security of AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0797f992209f90df906499cd0d556dd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80dbc2c57631e342a48a24b95f6e1b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f0e52ffd2cfc0cefb2f4e79d13f201&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd2acaeb0d9437c3f09baa7c94ddf8</data>
