  <data key="d2">Project Coordination involves managing activities and progress within the CoEvolution Project to ensure successful execution and impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Project Coordination refers to the non-technical work package in the CoEvolution project dedicated to managing activities and ensuring smooth collaboration among partners.</data>
