<node id="Cybersecurity Systems">
  <data key="d0">Cybersecurity Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cybersecurity Systems refer to a set of measures and protocols designed to protect computer systems from cyber threats, mentioned in the context of addressing vulnerabilities in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Cybersecurity systems are critical infrastructures aimed at protecting networks, devices, and data from unauthorized access, attacks, and damage, as mentioned in the context of AI security research.</data>
