  <data key="d0">consortium members</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Consortium members are recognized experts and legal entities with expertise in EU-funded activities, committed to complying with legal and ethical standards during the project.&lt;SEP&gt;The consortium members are recognized experts and legal entities with extensive experience in EU-funded activities and compliance with regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c33ff0da3223617dcddd9463b4752</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
