  <data key="d0">Community-Wide Adoption and Standards</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Community-Wide Adoption and Standards refer to the collective agreements within communities for adopting established norms regarding ethical AI practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419865</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Consortium">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Consortium</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Consortium is a collaborative partnership comprised of fifteen well-established organizations from various countries, including industry participants, small and medium enterprises (SMEs), research institutions, and academia. This consortium is dedicated to promoting research excellence and innovation, particularly in the fields of cybersecurity and artificial intelligence (AI) systems. They work together to address project challenges associated with these areas, specifically targeting the robustness of machine learning (ML) and the effective management of AI technologies.

A notable aspect of the CoEvolution Consortium's mission is its commitment to compliance with crucial regulatory frameworks such as the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the Artificial Intelligence Act. The consortium emphasizes ethical data governance and responsible data handling practices, providing assurances that all activities are conducted in alignment with regulatory standards and ethical considerations. Furthermore, the consortium is focused on ensuring the ethical management of data used in both AI training and inference, thereby navigating the evolving landscape of AI with due diligence towards legal and ethical compliance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a4f80aa6caf939e06fbb5e4bab717d20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d32cbd08ce6f50d78ff9bcc410caf04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8536b77a28a4d77fb291854c1693e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d680583096f4188d4745b78c423dfc52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750697798fe8d5704aacb6736b165901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecef4657b9eaa07737a23410c0933ea8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424971</data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Requirements Helpdesk">
  <data key="d0">Legal Requirements Helpdesk</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Legal Requirements Helpdesk is a support mechanism established to aid compliance with all applicable legislation within the CoEvolution project. Its primary function is to assist the CoEvolution consortium in navigating various legal frameworks, ensuring that the project adheres to relevant legal requirements. The helpdesk plays a critical role in facilitating compliance with legislation that impacts the project's outcomes, providing necessary support and guidance to ensure all legal obligations are met effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal Requirements Helpdesk is a support structure set up by the CoEvolution consortium to assist in compliance with applicable legislation and regulatory frameworks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d32cbd08ce6f50d78ff9bcc410caf04d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d680583096f4188d4745b78c423dfc52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750697798fe8d5704aacb6736b165901&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d81cd4432e3bdb75c5cf56e4525d3ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424968</data>
</node>
