  <data key="d0">Horizon Europe Ethics Manual</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Horizon Europe online ethics manual provides guidance on ethical research standards and practices in projects funded by the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The Horizon Europe online ethics manual provides guidelines for conducting ethical research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-568b86d237d97cad5eb967bde956e56d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-750697798fe8d5704aacb6736b165901</data>
