<node id="Proceedings of the ACM SIGSAC Conference on Computer and Communications Security">
  <data key="d0">Proceedings of the ACM SIGSAC Conference on Computer and Communications Security</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The event referred to is a conference where various papers on security topics, including deep learning and information leakage, are presented.&lt;SEP&gt;This is a compilation of research papers presented during the ACM SIGSAC Conference in 2017, addressing topics in computer security and communications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c</data>
