<node id="arXiv">
  <data key="d0">arXiv</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">arXiv is a preprint repository that serves as a platform for researchers to upload and disseminate research articles in various scientific domains, including mathematics, computer science, and statistics. It is specifically designed to host preprints—manuscripts submitted by researchers before they undergo formal peer review. The repository allows researchers to share their findings and contribute to ongoing discussions in their respective fields. Among the wide array of papers hosted on arXiv, there are notable preprints related to collaborative learning and machine learning, as well as specific works such as the preprint regarding the SecML library. As an open-access platform, arXiv enables greater accessibility to scholarly articles, facilitating collaboration and communication within the scientific community.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e7c3a99346fbbe87f9977443bb6d30d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe098796fa5d6be15d6c84fbf01bf26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be52efab763a40f8468f52ebfb67c374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545b11fa7875be1f0b2880b7d1353c82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3cd138afdd4c8ce77f816e48769d91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc7108c4595e4bb4501f0013cf316c6d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424979</data>
</node>
<node id="NIPS17">
  <data key="d0">NIPS17</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">NIPS’17 is a prominent conference on neural information processing systems held in 2017, highlighting significant research in the field.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419866</data>
