<node id="International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Statistics">
  <data key="d0">International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Statistics</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The International Conference on Artificial Intelligence and Statistics is an event where research related to AI and statistics is presented, including studies on personalized peer-to-peer machine learning.&lt;SEP&gt;This conference focuses on AI and statistics, providing a platform for presenting novel research in these domains.&lt;SEP&gt;This conference includes discussions on personalized and private peer-to-peer machine learning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6ca2454f8ebf3a2d518cc9e43a4d9f2</data>
