<node id="Cloud Computing">
  <data key="d0">Cloud Computing</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">This refers to the delivery of computing services over the internet, including storage, processing, and data management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755419866</data>
</node>
<node id="Nature">
  <data key="d0">Nature</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nature is a prominent scientific journal that publishes peer-reviewed research across various scientific disciplines. It is particularly noted for its contributions to the field of artificial intelligence, including significant studies on deep neural networks and machine learning. Among its noteworthy publications is research related to mastering the game of Go, demonstrating the journal's role in disseminating groundbreaking findings in game playing and related technologies. Nature serves as a vital platform for sharing advancements in both theoretical and practical applications within the realms of science and technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ad5a51575e116fa48f860794b0b1b648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3cd138afdd4c8ce77f816e48769d91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6ca2454f8ebf3a2d518cc9e43a4d9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-545b11fa7875be1f0b2880b7d1353c82</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424972</data>
</node>
<node id="IEEE">
  <data key="d0">IEEE</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE, or Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers, is a prominent professional association that significantly contributes to the fields of electrical and electronic engineering. It is dedicated to advancing technology and innovation, primarily through the establishment of standards and the organization of various conferences. As part of its mission, IEEE publishes a wide range of research and conference proceedings, including those focused on cutting-edge topics such as adaptive dynamic programming, reinforcement learning, and deep reinforcement learning specifically for robotic applications. Furthermore, IEEE is recognized as a crucial initiative within the CoEvolution project, where it is mentioned for its role in influencing standards and facilitating interaction among professionals. Overall, IEEE serves as a vital resource and platform for engineers and technologists, fostering collaboration and the exchange of knowledge within the industry.</data>
