  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems is a prominent conference in artificial intelligence and machine learning, featuring various studies including decentralized algorithms.&lt;SEP&gt;Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems is a series of conferences dedicated to showcasing research and developments in machine learning, neural networks, and artificial intelligence. These conferences present cutting-edge research in the field of neural information processing, bringing together experts and researchers to discuss various topics, including the comparison of decentralized versus centralized algorithms in machine learning applications. Through these gatherings, Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems serves as a significant venue for fostering discussions and advancements in the rapidly evolving landscape of AI and machine learning.</data>
