  <data key="d0">Giuseppe Ateniese</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Giuseppe Ateniese is a researcher specializing in the field of information security, particularly within the context of collaborative deep learning and machine learning. He has co-authored several papers, including one presented at the ACM SIGSAC Conference, which focuses on security challenges and solutions in collaborative deep learning environments. In 2017, he was involved in significant research addressing information leakage in these contexts, further demonstrating his expertise and contributions to the field. His collaborative efforts emphasize the importance of ensuring security in machine learning applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Giuseppe Ateniese is an author who contributed to the research paper discussing information leakage from collaborative deep learning.</data>
