  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Fernando Perez-Cruz is a researcher and co-author who has made significant contributions to the field of collaborative learning. He showcased his work at AISTATS'17, where he focused on the analysis of information leakage from collaborative deep learning approaches. In 2017, he co-authored a paper that specifically addressed the issue of information leakage in deep learning models, further emphasizing his involvement in research concerning the vulnerabilities associated with these advanced learning techniques. Overall, Fernando Perez-Cruz's work highlights the intersection of collaborative learning and deep learning, with a particular focus on ensuring data security and integrity within these frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;Fernando Perez-Cruz is an author involved in the study of information leakage in collaborative deep learning.</data>
