  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Vitaly Shmatikov is a researcher and co-author known for his contributions to the field of security, particularly concerning inference attacks in collaborative learning. He has co-authored multiple works that delve into the implications of these inference attacks and their effects on collaborative learning systems. Notably, one of his papers on this subject was published in 2018, underscoring his commitment to advancing understanding in this critical area of cybersecurity. Vitaly Shmatikov's work is vital in exploring how these attacks can exploit vulnerabilities in collaborative environments, making his research relevant to ongoing discussions in security and privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Vitaly Shmatikov is an author known for his work on security and privacy in machine learning, specifically inference attacks.</data>
