  <data key="d0">IEEE Symposium Series on Computational Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE Symposium Series on Computational Intelligence is a prominent academic conference dedicated to showcasing advancements in the field of computational intelligence. This event, which took place in April 2013, brought together researchers, practitioners, and academics to discuss a wide array of topics related to computational intelligence, including reinforcement learning. The symposium has been held at various locations, with Singapore being one of the notable sites for the conference in 2013. Through this series, the IEEE facilitates valuable exchanges of ideas and innovations in computational intelligence.</data>
