  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE International Conference on Networking, Sensing and Control is a conference focused on advancements in the fields of networking, sensing, and control systems. It took place in Delft, the Netherlands, from April 11 to April 13, 2011. The event aimed to address a variety of topics related to these areas, providing a platform for discussing innovative developments and research in control systems and their applications.</data>
