<node id="IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence">
  <data key="d0">IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence is a prestigious scholarly journal dedicated to the publication of significant research in the fields of image processing, pattern analysis, and machine intelligence. It features a variety of research articles and surveys that address critical advancements and challenges within these domains. Notably, the journal has published impactful works, including a survey by K. N. Kumar that examines the effects of adversarial attacks on federated learning. Recognized for its substantial contributions to the field, the IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence serves as a key platform for disseminating vital research and fostering academic discourse in pattern analysis and machine intelligence.</data>
