<node id="Applied Soft Computing">
  <data key="d0">Applied Soft Computing</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Applied Soft Computing is a journal dedicated to the publication of research that applies soft computing techniques across various domains. It features articles that explore innovative applications, including notable topics such as ensemble federated learning and its relevance to pneumonia diagnosis. The journal has a focus on collaborative approaches in healthcare, evidenced by the publication of research pertaining to collaborative pneumonia diagnosis. Overall, Applied Soft Computing serves as a platform for disseminating knowledge and advancing the field of soft computing in medical diagnostics and beyond.&lt;SEP&gt;Applied Soft Computing is a journal where various articles regarding soft computing methods are published, including research on pneumonia diagnosis using ensemble federated learning.</data>
