<node id="Madalina M. Drugan">
  <data key="d0">Madalina M. Drugan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Madalina M. Drugan is a notable researcher in the field of multi-objective reinforcement learning, having contributed significantly through her co-authorship of a research paper that focuses on scalarized multi-objective reinforcement learning. Her work, published in 2013, encompasses design techniques that advance the understanding and application of multi-objective reinforcement learning strategies. Throughout her research career, she has been recognized as an author and contributor in this domain, emphasizing the innovative approaches she has brought to the study of reinforcement learning techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;Madalina M. Drugan is involved in studying scalarized multi-objective reinforcement learning designs.</data>
