<node id="Ann Nowé">
  <data key="d0">Ann Nowé</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ann Nowé is a prominent researcher known for her contributions to the design techniques in multi-objective reinforcement learning. She has specifically focused on scalarized multi-objective reinforcement learning approaches, having co-authored research and published significant work in this area as early as 2013. Ann Nowé plays a key role in advancing understanding and methodologies related to multi-objective reinforcement learning, with her studies emphasizing scalarized design techniques that are instrumental in this field.&lt;SEP&gt;Ann Nowé is engaged in research within the field of reinforcement learning and adaptive systems.</data>
