<node id="Simone Parisi">
  <data key="d0">Simone Parisi</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Simone Parisi is a researcher and co-author recognized for his contributions to the field of multi-objective reinforcement learning. His work focuses on various aspects of the discipline, including design techniques and the approximation of the Pareto frontier. Parisi's research has been featured in notable proceedings, including those from the IEEE Symposium, highlighting his involvement in advancing the study of this complex area. He collaborates with fellow researcher Matteo Pirotta, further enhancing the body of work in multi-objective reinforcement learning.&lt;SEP&gt;Simone Parisi is noted as an author who contributed to the research on multi-objective reinforcement learning with continuous Pareto frontier approximation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-084175cf40e1017e4d88e3d24530a078&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-353ef7f826378ce1a36bf963412c479b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baf120bd02482c6b5e1ef64c734077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe098796fa5d6be15d6c84fbf01bf26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfa31071d35121fae851cd169db2f541</data>
