  <data key="d0">Signal Processing: Image Communication</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Signal Processing: Image Communication is a scholarly journal that focuses on the publication of research related to signal processing, with a particular emphasis on image communications. It serves as a platform for various studies, including those addressing adversarial attacks in image processing. Notably, research pertaining to ensemble adversarial attacks has been featured in this journal, showcasing its commitment to advancing knowledge in both signal processing and the challenges posed by adversarial techniques in image communication.</data>
