<node id="J. Emerg. Technol. Comput. Syst.">
  <data key="d0">J. Emerg. Technol. Comput. Syst.</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Journal of Emerging Technologies in Computing Systems (J. Emerg. Technol. Comput. Syst.) is a scholarly journal focused on publishing research related to emerging technologies in the field of computing. This includes publications on both hardware and software developments. Notably, in July 2022, the journal published a paper that specifically addressed the critical issue of guarding machine learning hardware against physical side-channel attacks. The journal serves as a platform for researchers to share innovative findings and advancements, particularly in the context of safeguarding machine learning hardware and other related areas.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfa31071d35121fae851cd169db2f541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42e0bb84f87fb98c98fd4b4ef1c0cd89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-084175cf40e1017e4d88e3d24530a078&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fe098796fa5d6be15d6c84fbf01bf26</data>
