  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">B. G. Stottelaar authored a piece on practical cyber-attacks targeting autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;B. G. Stottelaar is a researcher who has conducted studies on practical cyber-attacks on autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;B. G. Stottelaar is an author known for discussing practical cyber-attacks on autonomous vehicles in 2015.</data>
