<node id="National Transportation Safety Board">
  <data key="d0">National Transportation Safety Board</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) is a U.S. government agency dedicated to investigating transportation accidents across various modes of transport, including those related to autonomous vehicles and self-driving cars. The NTSB plays a critical role in enhancing transportation safety through comprehensive investigations and analyses of incidents. Notably, in 2018, the agency released a preliminary report focusing on the challenges posed by emerging transportation technologies, further underscoring its commitment to addressing issues related to automated vehicles. Additionally, the NTSB documents preliminary reports on various transportation accidents, ensuring accountability and promoting safety within the transportation sector, including highway incidents. Overall, the agency is integral to advancing safety measures and understanding within the rapidly evolving field of transportation.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Transportation Safety Board is a governmental organization involved in investigating transportation accidents, including those involving autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Transportation Safety Board is referenced as a body that produced a preliminary report related to a highway incident in 2018.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6af819647c9c59cd69b68bf06821ed32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e82de3282af4e384da3c6698d8f6a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16332edc6609bf8b86a878abf63aec55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6926cccac37b74cab2b0acdae6794c42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be52efab763a40f8468f52ebfb67c374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db15753633e13066899afb7067d1b475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964065d9cfca78eacd342a9c89646e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c4aae27b4457d3ffe0ecb38813ebd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7eb27e85547c9abe2d9ef4fddd0513a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425817</data>
</node>
<node id="Google Self-Driving Car">
  <data key="d0">Google Self-Driving Car</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Self-Driving Car is an autonomous vehicle project that experienced a crash incident, highlighting challenges in safety.&lt;SEP&gt;The Google Self-Driving Car is a project developed by Google aimed at creating advanced autonomous vehicle technology. This initiative gained significant attention when, in 2016, the Google Self-Driving Car was involved in its first notable crash, marking a pivotal moment in the history of autonomous vehicles. This incident raised safety concerns and highlighted the challenges associated with self-driving technology. The project continues to represent a significant advancement in the development of autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Google Self-Driving Car is an autonomous vehicle project known for its significant role in developing self-driving technology and has been associated with a crash incident.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6af819647c9c59cd69b68bf06821ed32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16332edc6609bf8b86a878abf63aec55&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db15753633e13066899afb7067d1b475&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964065d9cfca78eacd342a9c89646e25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c4aae27b4457d3ffe0ecb38813ebd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7eb27e85547c9abe2d9ef4fddd0513a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
