  <data key="d0">Highway HWY18MH010</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Highway HWY18MH010 refers to a specific accident investigation conducted by the National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) involving an incident with an autonomous vehicle. This investigation pertains to a particular incident that occurred on this highway, and a preliminary report regarding the accident was released in 2018. The NTSB's inquiry into Highway HWY18MH010 focuses on understanding the circumstances surrounding the incident related to autonomous vehicles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6af819647c9c59cd69b68bf06821ed32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e82de3282af4e384da3c6698d8f6a5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2c4aae27b4457d3ffe0ecb38813ebd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-964065d9cfca78eacd342a9c89646e25</data>
