<node id="AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM)">
  <data key="d0">AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AIMBOM refers to a system used to manage and describe AI models in supply chains, providing insight into security, trust, and robustness compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM) is a comprehensive framework and categorization system designed for the contextual management and description of AI models utilized within supply chains. As a significant component of the CoEvolution project, AIMBOM focuses on generating context-aware AI models while ensuring transparency and security in AI supply chains. This framework is instrumental in characterizing AI models and managing the associated software components, thereby enhancing the capability to track and oversee the various elements involved in AI applications across different sectors. AIMBOM ultimately aims to provide an organized approach to managing the complexities of AI technology within supply chains.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM) is a framework intended to enhance security and compliance in AI models by detailing their components and risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7595c8200e32fa30ada5bd766b8a892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e4c02ab56fd93c5cc9c23327e28ccc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c67b0558b13d1d04ff0092eb88d7122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b4e4ed58eff7ae3d119d2cc4a4dc34f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425819</data>
</node>
