  <data key="d0">Security, Trust, and Robustness Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security, Trust, and Robustness Assessment pertains to the evaluation of AI systems to ensure they are secure, reliable, and compliant with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Security, Trust, and Robustness Assessment refers to a comprehensive evaluation framework that CoEvolution aims to establish for AI models.</data>
