<node id="European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre">
  <data key="d0">European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre is a pivotal granting authority responsible for overseeing projects that enhance cybersecurity standards and practices. Delegated by the European Commission, the Centre plays a crucial role in the CoEvolution Project, where it manages funding and support for various cybersecurity initiatives. Its mission focuses on advancing cybersecurity and technology research, particularly in the areas of research and innovation actions concerning both cybersecurity and artificial intelligence. Overall, this agency is instrumental in facilitating funding for projects related to cybersecurity and technology research throughout the European Union.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e741d2fb52b5df1d877e151403c66ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f179be12e924e7455c61badff1b4c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca60b53f4fb08a71c2cabf42d2f6530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09c826db6cef6eb005a363f6b7421e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbd9a2bb872299c973114830584e0f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4490ece625d5431730795ad841da7ddd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425824</data>
</node>
<node id="A COMPREHENSIVE TRUSTWORTHY FRAMEWORK FOR CONNECTED MACHINE LEARNING AND SECURE INTERCONNECTED AI SOLUTIONS">
  <data key="d0">A COMPREHENSIVE TRUSTWORTHY FRAMEWORK FOR CONNECTED MACHINE LEARNING AND SECURE INTERCONNECTED AI SOLUTIONS</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The project, titled "A COMPREHENSIVE TRUSTWORTHY FRAMEWORK FOR CONNECTED MACHINE LEARNING AND SECURE INTERCONNECTED AI SOLUTIONS," is designed to tackle cybersecurity challenges in artificial intelligence (AI) applications through a unified and integrated framework. It aims to establish a comprehensive approach that addresses critical aspects of trust, security, and data governance in AI solutions, particularly within supply chains. By focusing on the development of a trustworthy framework for machine learning and AI solutions, the project seeks to enhance security and compliance in interconnected environments. This initiative is also associated with CoEvolution, underscoring its commitment to fostering reliable and secure AI systems in connected settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d09c826db6cef6eb005a363f6b7421e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca60b53f4fb08a71c2cabf42d2f6530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4490ece625d5431730795ad841da7ddd</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424204</data>
</node>
