  <data key="d0">Security Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Monitoring involves the processes and technologies used to ensure that AI systems are secure, functioning as intended, and protected against vulnerabilities and potential threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Monitoring is a key aspect of the CoEvolution project that enhances the capabilities of assessing risks and vulnerabilities in AI applications.</data>
