  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context-Aware AI Models are advanced AI systems that can adapt their responses based on the context in which they operate, enhancing their effectiveness and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Context-aware AI models are AI systems designed to adapt their behavior based on the context in which they operate, aiming for enhanced performance and reliability.</data>
