  <data key="d2">Threats and Vulnerabilities Modelling is a key focus area of the CoEvolution project, aiming to assess and manage risks associated with AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Threats and Vulnerabilities Modelling is a process of identifying and analyzing potential security threats and vulnerabilities in AI systems to mitigate risks.</data>
