<node id="Late Payment Interest">
  <data key="d0">Late Payment Interest</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Late Payment Interest indicates the additional rate charged on delayed payments, set at ECB + 3.5%.&lt;SEP&gt;Late Payment Interest is set at the European Central Bank rate plus 3.5% according to the terms of the agreement laid out in the document.&lt;SEP&gt;Late Payment Interest refers to the additional costs incurred when payments are delayed, calculated based on the European Central Bank rate plus a margin.</data>
