<node id="Task 1.5">
  <data key="d0">Task 1.5</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 1.5 is dedicated to the examination and application of ethical principles, European regulations, and the social sciences within the context of the CoEvolution project. This task aims to ensure compliance with relevant legal and ethical standards, particularly concerning artificial intelligence (AI). It focuses on the analysis of legal and ethical issues, monitoring compliance, and addressing these concerns to uphold the integrity of the project. Through its multifaceted approach, Task 1.5 seeks to navigate the complex landscape of ethics and regulation in relation to emerging technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef6fbc1a3bfb993cb23f1ec5cd61622f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9d50812a1d240d82e3f1a2d7627af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629a66671e0d7bfd5b1d963981d598c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c37b90adda874cb8932da7490275709</data>
