  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 6.2 aims at developing a data generation simulator for training AI models using synthetic data and involves evaluating the generated models.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 6.2 is dedicated to developing a simulator for adversarial data generation and evaluating AI models through synthetic data.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 6.2 involves the development of a simulator for creating synthetic data used in training and evaluation phases of AI models.</data>
