<node id="Project 101168560 – CoEvolution">
  <data key="d0">Project 101168560 – CoEvolution</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Project 101168560 – CoEvolution is a specific initiative that outlines objectives and requirements related to data processing and compliance under the EU regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Project 101168560, known as CoEvolution, is a research project under the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 framework focusing on multiple deliverables and collaborative efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Project 101168560 – CoEvolution is a specific initiative within the EU framework mentioned as part of the grant agreement.</data>
