<node id="Plan for Impact Delivery">
  <data key="d0">Plan for Impact Delivery</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 'Plan for Impact Delivery' is a strategic document that outlines the comprehensive approach for the dissemination, communication, and exploitation of the CoEvolution project's outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Plan for Impact Delivery is a sensitive document associated with the CoEvolution project, developed by AEGIS. It focuses on strategizing the impact of research results by defining comprehensive communication, dissemination, and exploitation strategies. This document plays a crucial role in outlining the methods through which the project's results will be effectively communicated and utilized.&lt;SEP&gt;This document outlines the plan for communication, dissemination, and exploitation of the project’s outcomes.</data>
