<node id="First Impact Analysis">
  <data key="d0">First Impact Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The First Impact Analysis is a sensitive report produced as part of the CoEvolution project, which is led by CBRL. This report evaluates the initial impacts of the project's findings and activities. It summarizes the early activities conducted within the project and assesses their potential impact, thus providing an overview of the initial effects resulting from the project's efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Impact Analysis presents initial activities and their potential impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Impact Analysis occurs at the end of the Active Dissemination phase to evaluate the effectiveness of outreach efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-64237dd32571fef88fdcaeb9aa30c3d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb05ac510a5ae593384da886fa21202c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99ddd092d2b8685079c5b87c6675e59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079</data>
