  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Final Impact Report consists of findings and indications on the overall impact of project activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Final Impact Report is a comprehensive deliverable that encapsulates the overall impacts and outcomes of the CoEvolution project. Prepared by CBRL, this concluding document evaluates the various activities undertaken throughout the project's duration, while also highlighting their overall significance and effects. It is specified as sensitive, reflecting the importance of the information contained within it. Through this report, stakeholders are provided with a clear understanding of the project's achievements and the long-term impacts generated over time.&lt;SEP&gt;The Final Impact Report is a comprehensive summary of the CoEvolution project's success in achieving its dissemination goals.</data>
