  <data key="d1">deliverable</data>
  <data key="d2">D6.2 is a deliverable that focuses on a minimum viable product for the integrated framework within the CoEvolution project, overseen by IMT.&lt;SEP&gt;D6.2 is a project deliverable associated with the CoEvolution project, specifically aimed at creating a minimum viable product (MVP) of an integrated framework. This deliverable is managed and overseen by IMT. D6.2 is often referred to simply as the "MVP" and serves as a public document related to the work package WP6 within the project. It encapsulates the efforts and developments to produce the MVP, reflecting the collaborative work undertaken in the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
