<node id="Work Package 1">
  <data key="d0">Work Package 1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package 1 (WP1) is a crucial segment of the CoEvolution project that focuses on specific tasks and deliverables within the project's overall structure. It involves the allocation of resources, which were later observed to undergo changes due to organizational shifts. WP1 encompasses a variety of deliverables that include project management and ethical considerations related to the CoEvolution initiative. Additionally, this work package is dedicated to the standardization of practices and influencing the development of policies and guidelines in the field of artificial intelligence (AI).&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package 1 (WP1) is one of the components of the project's structure, involved in managing specific tasks and responsibilities within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package 1 is one of the designated segments of the CoEvolution project associated with specific tasks and deliverables.</data>
