  <data key="d0">Work Package 2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package 2 (WP2) is a key segment of the CoEvolution project that has undergone resource reallocation to improve communication and dissemination efforts. It encompasses designated activities and responsibilities among the project partners, emphasizing community engagement and dissemination strategies. In addition to these engagement efforts, Work Package 2 also focuses on impact delivery and related analyses, ensuring that the activities conducted within the project are thoroughly evaluated for their effectiveness and reach.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package 2 (WP2) is part of the project structure, focusing on designated tasks that contribute to the overall objectives of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package 2 is another designated segment of the CoEvolution project, addressing particular tasks within the project scope.</data>
