<node id="Work Package 3">
  <data key="d0">Work Package 3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package 3 (WP3) is a key section of the CoEvolution initiative, dedicated to specific activities that contribute to the overarching goals and deliverables of the project. It collaborates with other work packages to ensure a cohesive approach to project execution. WP3 is actively involved in the analysis of tasks and has experienced changes in project manager (PM) allocations, which reflects its dynamic role within the project framework. Additionally, Work Package 3 encompasses the project scope and the technical specifications necessary for the successful implementation of the CoEvolution project, highlighting its importance in achieving the project's objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Package 3 is part of the CoEvolution project, involved in various tasks and responsibilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-932f1546ff56a5a50a861aaa39f75771&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2997d250b69def216aa03988b3bbd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3ab8cb1038a2d7402e7c20f7922fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65e8629ae207ceb542cf05ec02b99e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd</data>
