<node id="Work Package 4">
  <data key="d0">Work Package 4</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package 4 (WP4) is an integral segment of the CoEvolution project, focusing on the assessment, enhancement, and context awareness of AI models, specifically in relation to security and resilience throughout their lifecycle. WP4 aims to advance technology enablers in AI model STR (Security, Trust, and Resilience) assessment, which is critical for ensuring that AI applications are robust against potential threats. 

This work package has specific objectives and deliverables that contribute significantly to the overall success of the CoEvolution project. It is characterized by a collaborative approach, with resources allocated from various organizations to support its activities. Moreover, WP4 is committed to the development and reporting of essential scientific and technical tools, which further the project's mission of enhancing AI technologies. Through the execution of designated project tasks, WP4 plays a key role in meeting the overarching goals of the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c4f7b898ba71a7016ad21ff4ed438387&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932f1546ff56a5a50a861aaa39f75771&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-853e3c305e010114288cc805df7be8a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2997d250b69def216aa03988b3bbd6e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6a0f23e95fea1a56df838e0e512fb24&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c3ab8cb1038a2d7402e7c20f7922fb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65e8629ae207ceb542cf05ec02b99e6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd</data>
