  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package 5 (WP5) is an organizational subset within the project framework of the CoEvolution initiative, focusing on specific aspects of its implementation. WP5 is responsible for handling security assurance and monitoring, ensuring that the relevant aspects of the CoEvolution project are adequately addressed. It outlines particular contributions and tasks associated with the initiative, emphasizing its collective goals and objectives. WP5 represents a distinct section of the CoEvolution project that is dedicated to achieving specific work and outcomes that contribute to the overall success of the initiative.</data>
