  <data key="d2">The AI market is projected to accelerate beyond $2575.16 billion by 2032, indicating significant growth and evolution in artificial intelligence applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI market is projected to exceed $2575.16 billion by 2032, highlighting significant growth and investment in the sector.</data>
