<node id="Collaborative Systems">
  <data key="d0">Collaborative Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Collaborative systems in AI describe interconnected systems like federated learning designed to work together while presenting unique vulnerabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative systems refer to integrated AI solutions that enable shared processing and decision-making across different AI models or platforms.</data>
