</node>
<node id="KPI4.1">
  <data key="d0">KPI4.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI4.1 is a Key Performance Indicator (KPI) that focuses on the identification and design of at least three context-specific vectors tailored for the adaptation of AI models. This KPI is particularly relevant within the CoEvolution framework and project, emphasizing the importance of developing these vectors to enhance AI applicability in various contexts. It aims to foster advancements in AI by ensuring that the vectors designed are specific to the needs and nuances of the environment in which the AI will operate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e5dfa0262d9cf1261fde3b563bc7f361&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09248fc5918c5f1aba6cb3c5425fc34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7db5c56a64621f032196bb4e5b41ca86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-994816b1606be733f0a98e855a2dbf9f</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425695</data>
</node>
<node id="Autonomous Vehicles">
  <data key="d0">Autonomous Vehicles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Autonomous Vehicles are self-driving cars that operate independently, leveraging advanced artificial intelligence (AI) models for navigation and ensuring operational safety. These vehicles possess the capability to sense their environment, allowing them to navigate without human intervention. The development and deployment of Autonomous Vehicles involve secure AI models that are critical for both safety and performance. They utilize a variety of sensors to understand their surroundings; however, they also encounter challenges, such as limitations in sensor technology and concerns related to data security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4d2ff0e7582f72b15822c3c3392a6345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e539403d1165017fce38ab358660244c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbbc377e2e04f5a8e60be464dfc0a17e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6c9cfb6e7abe8b52771b95508dd1919</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424932</data>
</node>
<node id="Manufacturing Plant">
  <data key="d0">Manufacturing Plant</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">Manufacturing Plant is a facility where goods are produced and where the CoEvolution framework will be applied to enhance AI model security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6c9cfb6e7abe8b52771b95508dd1919</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420433</data>
</node>
<node id="STR AI Models">
  <data key="d0">STR AI Models</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">STR AI Models are AI models characterized by their Security, Trust, and Robustness features, utilized in various applications within the AI community.&lt;SEP&gt;STR AI Models refer to Security, Trust, and Robustness AI models designed to assess and enhance the performance and reliability of AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-09248fc5918c5f1aba6cb3c5425fc34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6c9cfb6e7abe8b52771b95508dd1919</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424137</data>
</node>
<node id="Risk Assessment and Security Assurance Flow">
  <data key="d0">Risk Assessment and Security Assurance Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk Assessment and Security Assurance Flow is a comprehensive process designed to evaluate and enhance the security of AI models throughout their lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6c9cfb6e7abe8b52771b95508dd1919</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420433</data>
</node>
<node id="AI Community">
  <data key="d0">AI Community</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Community is a collaborative network comprising individuals and organizations actively involved in the research, development, and application of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies. This inclusive community encompasses a diverse range of stakeholders, including developers, researchers, and other participants who contribute to the evolution and implementation of AI solutions.

A significant focus of the AI Community is to foster collaboration and standardization within the field, ensuring that AI technologies are developed and deployed effectively. The community highlights the importance of security measures in relation to the AI systems it creates and utilizes, recognizing that robust security is vital as AI technologies are increasingly integrated into various applications.

Additionally, the AI Community is particularly engaged with frameworks such as CoEvolution, which emphasizes the dynamic interplay between technological advancement and societal impact. Overall, the AI Community is dedicated to advancing artificial intelligence through innovative practices that prioritize security and responsible implementation, ultimately contributing to the evolution of AI across various sectors, including those within the European Union (EU).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02fa9dfe5b39b5ec1975df01d2e4f7d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db75b2cab1362b7796ff2a8753c4245e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6bf63b8e7794868c19826908bb0e0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d188b520ae593ffa16184991a28ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9e31e2b7ee95a5a60fd9f2a49c2647</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424900</data>
</node>
<node id="KPI">
  <data key="d0">KPI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI, which stands for Key Performance Indicators, refers to measurable values utilized to evaluate the success of various decision-making actions within an organization or project. These metrics serve to gauge how effectively an organization is accomplishing its key business objectives and are instrumental in assessing the overall effectiveness of specific initiatives. In the context of the CoEvolution project, KPIs are specifically used to measure the effectiveness of various objectives, highlighting their role in both general performance evaluation and project-specific assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b22cc6f8a153f6e262c2284ced50068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f31094c83ab0284e8e350e82c94a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425691</data>
</node>
<node id="Data-Driven AI">
  <data key="d0">Data-Driven AI</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data-Driven AI refers to artificial intelligence systems that rely heavily on data inputs for their learning and operational processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Data-driven AI involves the use of data analysis to inform and enhance the performance and functionality of artificial intelligence systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-86a552b8b0b6e1c9d217e2714e332435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424139</data>
</node>
