  <data key="d0">Resilience to Adversarial Attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Resilience to Adversarial Attacks refers to the ability of AI systems to withstand and defend against attacks that attempt to compromise their functionality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420435</data>
</node>
<node id="Supply Chain Evaluation">
  <data key="d0">Supply Chain Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Supply Chain Evaluation is an assessment process to verify the integrity and performance of the supply chain in the context of project deliverables and AI framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420435</data>
</node>
<node id="Business Model Canvas">
  <data key="d0">Business Model Canvas</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Business Model Canvas is a strategic management tool utilized for developing, describing, and innovating various business models and financing strategies. It is particularly effective in both creating new business models and documenting existing ones, making it a versatile framework for businesses. The tool is commonly applied in planning the exploitation of the CoEvolution framework and is also used to design models specific to AI solutions, illustrating its adaptability in different fields.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2d188b520ae593ffa16184991a28ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b717d4f1dbabcdf423e3b9ee479caad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87919fcacc4b2972be3a6837bf783ae</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424899</data>
</node>
<node id="Lean Value Proposition Design">
  <data key="d0">Lean Value Proposition Design</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Lean Value Proposition Design focuses on creating a compelling value proposition for customers in a way that aligns with lean startup principles, enhancing business viability.&lt;SEP&gt;Lean Value Proposition Design is a methodology focused on creating value propositions that meet the needs of customers in a sustainable way.&lt;SEP&gt;Lean Value Proposition Design is a methodology used to align product offerings with customer needs, ensuring the business model for the CoEvolution framework effectively addresses market demands.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2d188b520ae593ffa16184991a28ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87919fcacc4b2972be3a6837bf783ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423369</data>
</node>
<node id="Exploitation Plans">
  <data key="d0">Exploitation Plans</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Exploitation Plans are strategic outlines that define how the CoEvolution framework and associated solutions will be commercially developed and utilized.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c021e32ade43efb9ce7c9f584aa7a10c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420436</data>
</node>
<node id="FoolBox">
  <data key="d0">FoolBox</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">FoolBox is a tool developed to optimize attacks against AI/ML models, requiring knowledge of AI/ML security problems for effective use.&lt;SEP&gt;FoolBox is a tool produced by the research community for optimizing attacks against AI/ML models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424898</data>
</node>
<node id="Cleverhans">
  <data key="d0">Cleverhans</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cleverhans is a framework designed to facilitate the evaluation of machine learning algorithms’ vulnerabilities to adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleverhans is a tool aimed at optimizing attacks against AI/ML models, requiring strong knowledge of AI/ML security problems for correct use.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424898</data>
</node>
<node id="IBM ART">
  <data key="d0">IBM ART</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">IBM ART is a security tool designed to enhance AI/ML models by optimizing defenses against potential attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;IBM ART is a tool aimed at enhancing the robustness of AI/ML models against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424899</data>
</node>
<node id="Trusted Execution Environments">
  <data key="d0">Trusted Execution Environments</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Trusted Execution Environments are specialized hardware solutions designed to enhance security in machine learning frameworks and secure applications. They consist of secure areas within a processor that ensure the integrity and confidentiality of code and data during processing. These environments play a critical role in protecting sensitive computations and data from unauthorized access, thereby facilitating the secure deployment of artificial intelligence models. While they significantly bolster the security of sensitive information and operations within technological applications, it is important to note that their use in centralized systems may introduce scalability issues. Overall, Trusted Execution Environments are essential for secure data processing and the protection of machine learning systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-237babba3957b0c4786b5021cd8884d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7d7dd122ed2c0928bca9de4f77ffb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-125a6d8c6730e236d423f077d38dc767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425701</data>
</node>
<node id="Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems">
  <data key="d0">Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems are collaborative learning frameworks that do not rely on a centralized server to operate, enhancing privacy and efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems are decentralized models that allow users to collaboratively learn without central authority or sharing of sensitive data.&lt;SEP&gt;Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems are frameworks that enable decentralized learning among users without relying on a centralized server.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422748</data>
</node>
<node id="AVISENSE CAV Simulation Platform">
  <data key="d0">AVISENSE CAV Simulation Platform</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVISENSE CAV is a simulation platform designed for developing and testing Autonomous Driving software, with an emphasis on constrained spaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420437</data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Objective Reinforcement Learning (MORL)">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Objective Reinforcement Learning (MORL)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Multi-Objective Reinforcement Learning (MORL) is a specialized branch of reinforcement learning that tackles problems characterized by multiple, potentially conflicting objectives. It aims to discover optimal solutions by integrating specified preferences, focusing on maximizing rewards across these diverse objectives. MORL approaches are specifically designed for real-world scenarios where the need to balance conflicting goals is crucial, thereby enabling the development of strategies that consider various trade-offs inherent in complex environments. Through its formulation, MORL seeks to address the challenges associated with achieving optimal outcomes in the presence of competing objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-125a6d8c6730e236d423f077d38dc767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db265e7c9ab51303f55c5c0f855e6e6</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425702</data>
</node>
<node id="Pareto-Optimal Problem">
  <data key="d0">Pareto-Optimal Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Pareto-optimal problem refers to scenarios where no objective can be improved without degrading at least one other objective.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420437</data>
</node>
<node id="Context-Aware Decision Support System">
  <data key="d0">Context-Aware Decision Support System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context-aware decision support systems are designed to choose optimal mitigation actions based on context vectors and candidate actions from threat intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Context-Aware Decision Support System is designed to choose optimal actions based on context information and candidate actions in threat mitigation scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-125a6d8c6730e236d423f077d38dc767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425699</data>
</node>
<node id="Decision Transformer (DT)">
  <data key="d0">Decision Transformer (DT)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Decision Transformer (DT) algorithms are utilized in multi-objective decision support frameworks to choose optimal actions based on various preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision Transformer is an algorithm proposed for developing a multi-objective decision support framework that adapts to varying KPIs and contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b22cc6f8a153f6e262c2284ced50068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755423371</data>
</node>
<node id="Deep Q-Networks">
  <data key="d0">Deep Q-Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep Q-Networks are a state-of-the-art reinforcement learning algorithm that integrates deep learning techniques to enhance decision-making capabilities within complex environments. This algorithm leverages deep neural networks to approximate the optimal action-value function, thereby enabling agents to make informed decisions based on their perceptions of the environment. By combining Q-learning with deep learning, Deep Q-Networks facilitate effective learning and adaptation in various decision-making tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-81b5e09ae3d0f914dccc0db6a5f91e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b22cc6f8a153f6e262c2284ced50068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6047665c4bd29f334a06022d100213</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425702</data>
</node>
<node id="Actor-Critic Approaches">
  <data key="d0">Actor-Critic Approaches</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Actor-Critic approaches are a class of algorithms in reinforcement learning that merge value-based and policy-based methods to enhance decision-making processes. These approaches operate using two key components: an actor, which is responsible for determining the actions to take, and a critic, which assesses the actions proposed by the actor. By maintaining both a policy (the actor) and a value function (the critic), Actor-Critic methods optimize decision-making by integrating the selection and evaluation of actions. This combination allows for improved learning and performance in various reinforcement learning tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-81b5e09ae3d0f914dccc0db6a5f91e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f105761f4d01e1ada210e596eb4751c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6047665c4bd29f334a06022d100213&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20c0cc0a37ebaa1bdc18241b7b7a42f8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425703</data>
</node>
<node id="AVISENSE CAV">
  <data key="d0">AVISENSE CAV</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AVISENSE CAV is an organization that provides a simulation platform for developing, validating, and testing Autonomous Driving software focused on constrained spaces.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420438</data>
</node>
<node id="TRUSTEE project">
  <data key="d0">TRUSTEE project</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The TRUSTEE project is related to AI technologies and methodologies that influence the development practices of AVISENSE.&lt;SEP&gt;The TRUSTEE project provides experience in modern model-based network design methodologies, influencing the designs at AviSense.&lt;SEP&gt;The TRUSTEE project provides experience in model-based AI network design methodologies incorporated by AVISENSE.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e76862a3bd9d83846a1046dc8821573f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f995ea0aa653e5c578ea2df5d9ff710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424902</data>
</node>
<node id="UNICA Secure">
  <data key="d0">UNICA Secure</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">UNICA develops SecML, an open-source library enhancing adversarial robustness in AI and machine learning applications.&lt;SEP&gt;UNICA provides SecML, an open-source library aimed at enhancing AI robustness against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f995ea0aa653e5c578ea2df5d9ff710</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424902</data>
</node>
<node id="AI model lifecycle">
  <data key="d0">AI model lifecycle</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI model lifecycle encompasses various phases like design, training, and deployment, which are essential for developing robust AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI model lifecycle refers to the comprehensive progression of an AI model from its initial design phase through to deployment and ongoing monitoring. It encompasses several critical phases, which include design, training, testing, validation, deployment, and operation. Throughout these stages, there is a significant focus on infusing security and robustness into AI models, as well as on mitigating potential security and privacy risks. Overall, the AI model lifecycle is essential for ensuring that machine learning models are effectively developed, validated, and maintained throughout their operational existence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef3f714a2a32270c0d8af28dae9557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f36d4368a91cfa20fb1fbc19cc60bc70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81418f280483fb994ba74151f8e56fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4292aa5c93583e2c12ff833c47b4de66</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425711</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Assurance Mechanisms">
  <data key="d0">Security Assurance Mechanisms</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security assurance mechanisms are tools and methods aimed at providing guarantees regarding the security and robustness of AI models throughout their lifecycle, included in the CoEvolution approach.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420439</data>
</node>
<node id="Defence Flow">
  <data key="d0">Defence Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Defence Flow is a continuous approach integrated into the AI model lifecycle for security enhancement and robustification.&lt;SEP&gt;Defence Flow is a continuous approach to security measures throughout the AI model lifecycle, from design to operation and deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Defence Flow is a continuous approach within the CoEvolution framework that integrates security measures throughout the entire lifecycle of an AI model, from the initial design phase through to its deployment and ongoing operation. This approach aims to ensure comprehensive protection by embedding security considerations at every stage of the AI model's development and execution. By following the Defence Flow, organizations can achieve a seamless integration of security practices that accompany AI models, fostering resilience and safeguarding against potential vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-141753ac9ec7e83b0090d110cb431232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446792d60e5d93623fac9c294023d709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef20bc6bd70a2d4b389a72d582866c02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9db1412409c67345807388c3e65bc86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f995ea0aa653e5c578ea2df5d9ff710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31852725a164a4dd52957ae5c1baa452</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424903</data>
</node>
