  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The STR Assurance Flow in CoEvolution outlines the security assessment and enhancement processes for AI models, addressing risks associated with their design and training data.&lt;SEP&gt;The STR Assurance Flow is an operational process within the CoEvolution Framework that allows users to assess and enhance the security and trust of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The STR Assurance Flow outlines the steps and processes for assessing and enhancing the security and robustness of AI models throughout their lifecycle.</data>
