  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Security Assurance Engine is a system that generates security credentials for AI models, enhancing the traceability and trustworthiness of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Assurance Engine is an integral part of the CoEvolution framework, responsible for generating, verifying, and revoking AI MBOMs based on operational statuses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Assurance Engine is part of the CoEvolution framework that generates the AI MBOM structure and assesses AI model security vulnerabilities.</data>
