  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">RAGRE provides a novel way to evaluate risks in the AI supply chain, focusing on potential cyber threats and compliance with legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;RAGRE provides effective risk management practices, addressing cyber security and AI-related attacks while ensuring compliance with relevant legislation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d31a9f46c18f75b8bffad97afd44ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32c9082aac6fd2a45950240834514168</data>
