<node id="Supply Chain AI Approaches">
  <data key="d0">Supply Chain AI Approaches</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Supply Chain AI Approaches refer to methodologies that involve the utilization of third-party AI models to enhance the performance and capabilities of existing AI applications within the supply chain sector. These approaches are designed to improve AI applications in a secure manner while ensuring compliance with relevant guidelines, specific security measures, and applicable standards. By integrating third-party AI models, Supply Chain AI Approaches provide a framework that emphasizes both enhancement of application capabilities and adherence to necessary security assessments and compliance protocols.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5f7c6a9a08e9c022ee9a774571a1ae2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f735046fbbdc14f326a8f041cac6de9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c366ab8df2f44a9f385a6868c2d6be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32c9082aac6fd2a45950240834514168</data>
