  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CoEvolution Risk Assessment refers to the systematic evaluation of risks associated with AI models, aimed at compliance with regulations such as the EU AI Act.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2be40177ccd661e4813abe35732bfb90</data>
