  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Pilot 1 focuses on securing the AI supply chain specifically for manufacturing infrastructure as part of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilot 1 is an initiative within CoEvolution aimed at enhancing the security and management of AI components in manufacturing infrastructure.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilot 1 is a use case within the CoEvolution project aiming to secure the AI supply chain for manufacturing.</data>
