<node id="Human in the Loop">
  <data key="d0">Human in the Loop</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Human in the Loop refers to the process and system involving human operators in the monitoring, decision-making, and intervention within artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This approach emphasizes the importance of human involvement in AI processes, enabling oversight, testing, and evaluation to maintain trust and ensure appropriate control. By incorporating human intervention when necessary, Human in the Loop aims to enhance the reliability of AI systems and uphold ethical standards throughout their development and operational phases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a591c892291649de34c3de312c2e971a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbd5dafa81256fe9f82cfcb884bca559&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4c1166600f780f6e57409778e6ccb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be40177ccd661e4813abe35732bfb90</data>
