  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attack Vulnerabilities are weaknesses in AI models that can be exploited by attackers to manipulate model outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial Attack Vulnerabilities refer to weaknesses in AI models that can be exploited by attackers, necessitating monitoring and mitigation.</data>
