  <data key="d2">The AI Supply Chain of Manufacturing Infrastructure refers to the use of AI components in industrial automation processes, including management of logistics, machine control, and predictive maintenance.&lt;SEP&gt;This event details the critical role of AI components in automating manufacturing processes, logistics, and predictive maintenance in industry.</data>
