<node id="PASEU">
  <data key="d0">PASEU</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">PASEU is an organization involved in the development and testing of autonomous vehicle systems, specifically focusing on valet parking setups in urban and suburban environments.&lt;SEP&gt;PASEU is an organization that provides premises in Langen, Germany for developing and validating valet parking setup configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;PASEU is the location where the autonomous vehicle use case will occur, specifically for validating valet parking setups in urban and suburban settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-04eb3908a7e782600d03aac5599f2893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1b93aa71559fbb79284d33ce689351&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c4e03def65d484eab2ad54aa7cdf54e</data>
