<node id="AviSense">
  <data key="d0">AviSense</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AviSense is a technology organization specializing in providing a comprehensive suite of perception-oriented solutions aimed at enhancing the sensor quality and multi-agent perception for Autonomous Connected Vehicles (CAVs). The organization offers various products, including data enhancement kits and simulation platforms specifically designed for Autonomous Driving software. Through these solutions, AviSense focuses on improving sensor capabilities and facilitating effective simulations, thereby advancing the technology and functionality of autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;AviSense is an organization providing perception-oriented solutions for enhancing the quality and reliability of autonomous vehicle sensors and systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afe62a9898a9c027310dea499cc4c9f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04eb3908a7e782600d03aac5599f2893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1b93aa71559fbb79284d33ce689351</data>
