  <data key="d5">1755424932</data>
</node>
<node id="Toyota-Prius">
  <data key="d0">Toyota-Prius</data>
  <data key="d1">vehicle</data>
  <data key="d2">The Toyota-Prius is a hybrid electric vehicle used in CAV testing, equipped with a full sensing and data acquisition setup for development and validation of autonomous driving software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Toyota-Prius is a hybrid electric vehicle utilized as a test platform for Connected and Autonomous Vehicle (CAV) technology. It is equipped with an extensive array of sensing and data acquisition tools, making it suitable for thorough testing of CAV infrastructure. Specifically, the Toyota-Prius serves as a test vehicle for evaluating its comprehensive sensing capabilities, which are essential for advancing CAV technologies. PASEU employs the Toyota-Prius in its testing efforts due to its advanced setup that supports the collection and analysis of data crucial for CAV development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1085773cd43df1afe7247dd49f7475fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04eb3908a7e782600d03aac5599f2893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c51db1d0ebfb384f2340004d2031fd42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1b93aa71559fbb79284d33ce689351</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425723</data>
</node>
<node id="Cyber-Resilience Approach">
  <data key="d0">Cyber-Resilience Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cyber-Resilience Approach refers to strategies developed to ensure the reliability and trustworthiness of autonomous vehicles against cyber threats and sensor attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cyber-Resilience Approach is a comprehensive framework developed by CoEvolution, designed to enhance the security, reliability, and robustness of autonomous vehicles against a range of security threats and failures. This approach focuses on ensuring robust and context-aware navigation for Connected and Autonomous Vehicles (CAVs), integrating various methods of data processing and sensing. By prioritizing the development of systems that are resistant to cyber threats, the Cyber-Resilience Approach aims to protect autonomous vehicles from potential attacks and improve their overall resilience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1085773cd43df1afe7247dd49f7475fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdbd860797355477b1a599735726a034&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04eb3908a7e782600d03aac5599f2893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc1b93aa71559fbb79284d33ce689351</data>
