<node id="Data Enhancement Kit">
  <data key="d0">Data Enhancement Kit</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Data Enhancement Kit is a solution developed by AVI to improve the quality of data captured by low-cost visual and LiDAR sensors used in CAVs.&lt;SEP&gt;The Data Enhancement Kit is a tool provided by AviSense for improving the quality of low-cost visual and LiDAR sensors.&lt;SEP&gt;The Data Enhancement Kit is a tool provided by AviSense to improve the quality of data from low-cost visual and LiDAR sensors used in autonomous driving.</data>
