  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Hyper-Sensing Kit delivers trusted multi-agent perception localization and mapping solutions for autonomous systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hyper-Sensing Kit is a suite of solutions aimed at ensuring trusted localization and mapping for multi-agent perception in autonomous vehicles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hyper-Sensing Kit is a perception solution from AVI aimed at delivering trusted multi-agent perception localization and mapping in autonomous vehicles.</data>
