<node id="Human-Machine Interactions">
  <data key="d0">Human-Machine Interactions</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Human-machine interactions involve the ways in which users engage with AI systems, which can influence user trust and acceptance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39e3880f9db30fa735ddba92055e2f7b</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420454</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Professionals and Researchers">
  <data key="d0">Security Professionals and Researchers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Professionals and Researchers are individuals committed to the principles of security-by-design and resilience against adversarial attacks. They play a vital role in various initiatives, particularly related to the CoEvolution project, significantly contributing to its objectives. Their expertise in network security is essential for safeguarding AI systems against a range of threats, including adversarial attacks. 

These professionals actively utilize resources provided by CoEvolution to address adversarial threats in network security, with a strong focus on critical areas such as intrusion detection and malware detection. Emphasizing effective defenses in information security, they implement security measures specifically tailored to counter adversarial attacks while ensuring the trust and integrity of AI systems. Overall, Security Professionals and Researchers are dedicated to enhancing security and trust within the realm of AI technologies, playing a crucial role in shaping the future of secure AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Professionals and Researchers are targeted by the CoEvolution project to enhance security by design in AI systems and defend against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1c9f3141d753938298cb0137770fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144343</data>
</node>
<node id="End Users of AI Systems and General Public">
  <data key="d0">End Users of AI Systems and General Public</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution project targets End Users of AI Systems and the General Public to enhance awareness regarding the security and trustworthiness of AI technologies. These groups, comprising individuals and communities utilizing AI across diverse sectors such as healthcare, transportation, and finance, are recognized as the ultimate beneficiaries of improved AI systems aimed at increasing reliability and trust. A central goal of the CoEvolution project is to ensure that these users fully understand the security and reliability aspects of AI applications, highlighting the critical nature of these components in their interactions with the technology. Furthermore, the initiative focuses on promoting AI applications that adhere to ethical standards, thus reinforcing the security and trust that End Users and the General Public rely on. Overall, the CoEvolution project seeks to foster a landscape where AI technologies are not only effective but also reliable and ethically sound, ultimately benefiting all stakeholders involved.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ebc1662a6a8a74f0b8c8d360bafee25&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d69ac7cb43276601482059fe1cb59288&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1756144348</data>
</node>
<node id="Healthcare Pilots">
  <data key="d0">Healthcare Pilots</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Healthcare pilots are practical demonstrations of the CoEvolution framework intended to show its effectiveness in mission-critical applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-284cd6a9713f3db6c2c93c7cc55157ba</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420455</data>
</node>
<node id="EU Cybersecurity Capacities">
  <data key="d0">EU Cybersecurity Capacities</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EU Cybersecurity Capacities pertain to the ability of the European Union to defend against cyber threats and maintain digital sovereignty through advanced technologies and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Cybersecurity Capacities refer to the collective tools, techniques, and strategies adopted by the European Union to bolster security against cyber threats in digital technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-284cd6a9713f3db6c2c93c7cc55157ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4af943851da76b28e80907078f658e0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424942</data>
</node>
