  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Webinars are online events organized by CoEvolution to disseminate information and facilitate engagement with participants.&lt;SEP&gt;Webinars are online seminars that are part of CoEvolution's strategy for knowledge transfer and outreach to stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;Webinars are online seminars that provide educational content and discussions on various topics to a virtual audience.</data>
