<node id="Technical Publications &amp; White Papers">
  <data key="d0">Technical Publications &amp; White Papers</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Technical Publications &amp; White Papers are documents that disseminate scientific and technological knowledge related to cybersecurity and AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Publications &amp; White Papers are materials produced by CoEvolution aimed at sharing findings and enhancing understanding of AI security and technology. These publications encompass a variety of written works, including articles, position papers, and reference materials, all related to the project's technological advancements. Their purpose is to disseminate knowledge and innovations, effectively informing the audience about research findings and providing references from technology providers. Through these publications, CoEvolution contributes to the field of AI by promoting awareness and understanding of key developments and best practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Technical Publications &amp; White Papers comprise various forms of deliverables produced by CoEvolution to share knowledge and research.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2a6eef347ebd1953e222397f7f754e5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9e47c432d30f5d9b35bdcd2fb1f8f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa6ec9ed386aca3a32d0190477b7a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3a06cde9d8efe27678e672f257f4a88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d80577ca1c86241f8708f0eaee5fa6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425739</data>
