  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Workshops and Info-Days are events organized by CoEvolution to engage with stakeholders, provide education, and promote awareness about AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Workshops and info-days are organized by the CoEvolution project to address public concerns and foster dialogue regarding networked AI systems.</data>
