</node>
<node id="Stakeholders">
  <data key="d0">Stakeholders</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Stakeholders are entities that engage with AI technologies for various applications and play a significant role in the CoEvolution project. They encompass a broad range of involved parties affected by the project's outcomes, including industry partners, academic institutions, and civil society groups. This diverse group also includes AI researchers, cybersecurity professionals, and policymakers, all of whom contribute to and benefit from the project's initiatives. Furthermore, stakeholders engage with the CoEvolution technologies by providing valuable feedback during pilot studies, thereby influencing the development and implementation of the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Stakeholders encompass all groups and individuals that CoEvolution aims to engage and inform through its communication efforts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-42212d8414381cd65827a856614c3743&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a6eef347ebd1953e222397f7f754e5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c472b58c25e3714c3e83d561e34d32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d6bf63b8e7794868c19826908bb0e0c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424172</data>
</node>
<node id="NGI">
