  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">IT Future Expo is an event focused on IT innovations where CoEvolution will interact with stakeholders and industry leaders.&lt;SEP&gt;IT Future Expo is an exhibition focused on exploring the future of information technology and its diverse applications. The event features the latest innovations in the IT sector, showcasing cutting-edge solutions and advancements. Moreover, it serves as a platform for networking among professionals within the technology industry. IT Future Expo is also recognized as a significant event within the CoEvolution project, aimed at highlighting innovative efforts in the field of information technology.</data>
