  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">AI &amp; Big Data Expo is a venue for showcasing capabilities related to AI and Big Data, relevant to CoEvolution's objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI &amp; Big Data Expo is an event dedicated to showcasing the latest innovations and applications in artificial intelligence and big data technologies. This exhibition and conference serves as a platform for presenting advancements in these fields, aimed at both industry professionals and the general public. Additionally, the AI &amp; Big Data Expo is positioned under the public engagement initiative known as CoEvolution, highlighting its commitment to fostering awareness and understanding of these transformative technologies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b9e47c432d30f5d9b35bdcd2fb1f8f87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85b6f2491ad8b1f2573a35a413e0218d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c6684e2d5110fe51294f244c64154d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b165dd4582e70acf9bca3d12028767fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e237a48ad98792e9118fcb292819faee</data>
