  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Knowledge Management refers to the strategic processes involved in capturing, sharing, and utilizing knowledge assets within the CoEvolution project. It emphasizes the management and dissemination of knowledge produced throughout the project's lifecycle, aiming to enhance innovation and promote the effective reuse of information. Through these practices, Knowledge Management plays a crucial role in facilitating collaboration and ensuring that valuable insights are accessible to stakeholders involved in the project.</data>
