<node id="Adversarial Attacks on AI Models">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Attacks on AI Models</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attacks on AI Models are malicious attempts to manipulate AI algorithms, which the CoEvolution project aims to mitigate.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial attacks on AI models involve methods that compromise the integrity of machine learning systems, such as poisoning and evasion attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial attacks on AI models include various forms of malicious attempts to compromise the functionality of AI algorithms, identified as significant threats in AI research.</data>
