  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Personal Data refers to any data that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, as defined under the GDPR, which the CoEvolution consortium must protect during its activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Personal data refers to any information that relates to an identified or identifiable individual, which must be managed according to GDPR rules.</data>
