<node id="Google Developers">
  <data key="d0">Google Developers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Developers is a division and organization dedicated to providing resources and information that enhance technology development, specifically in the areas of proximity and cross-device communication technologies. This platform shares various tools aimed at helping developers improve communication methods and advance their technological capabilities. Overall, Google Developers serves as a valuable resource for developers looking to navigate and innovate within these specialized fields.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bc7108c4595e4bb4501f0013cf316c6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19c3df02680dda5cc2badd5ac6d69054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97a3313621eefb917746103c785eb45c</data>
