  <data key="d2">Collaborative Perception Solutions utilizes Peer-to-Peer Learning methods to enhance the performance of autonomous vehicle systems under various conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;P2PL refers to fully distributed Peer-to-Peer Learning, designed to improve collaborative device and application models while focusing on security and privacy.</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
