  <data key="d2">Online Publishing is a key strategy employed by CoEvolution to disseminate its findings and reach a broader audience. This approach encompasses various platforms and magazines that facilitate the sharing of nonconfidential project information. Through online publishing activities, CoEvolution aims to effectively disclose project details and findings, ensuring that they engage with a wider demographic interested in their work. By utilizing diverse online platforms, CoEvolution enhances its visibility and communication with the public, thereby fulfilling its mission to share knowledge and insights from its projects.</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424961</data>
</node>
