  <data key="d0">Direct Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Direct Costs are expenses that can be directly attributed to the implementation of a specific project or action. This includes expenditures for personnel, travel, subcontracting, and other services that are explicitly outlined in the budget. Direct Costs encompass all expenses that can be traced directly to the project activities, ensuring that financial resources are allocated efficiently and transparently.</data>
