<node id="EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON (ICCS)">
  <data key="d0">EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON (ICCS)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">ICCS is the coordinating entity for the project, based in Athens, Greece, involved in cybersecurity and communication systems research.&lt;SEP&gt;The EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON (ICCS) is a research institution established in Greece. It plays a pivotal role as the coordinating organization for the CoEvolution project, having entered into a formal agreement known as the CoEvolution Agreement with the European Union. As a signatory to this agreement, ICCS actively participates alongside PIC 886488239, solidifying its status as a key player in collaborative initiatives aimed at advancing research and innovation in the field of communication systems and computer science. Moreover, ICCS is recognized within the context of the grant funding process, highlighting its essential involvement in securing and managing funding for the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;The EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON (ICCS) is mentioned as a current coordinator involved in a funding program effective from July 6, 2024.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2066bcd2fa4af3ed144ce8ac5cb90960&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337883c2db61f2b342a431e196a403af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e741d2fb52b5df1d877e151403c66ef0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d59b8f25e569d0889a7d7bf44bb2ea2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-315481829958213fce3674f0a85f2bf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43651fd39e9740f03571d0f1b6d6e77f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df83794707f70c47ca48cb0487b40957</data>
