  <data key="d0">Annex 2a</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Annex 2a includes additional information on unit costs and contributions relevant to the budget of the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex 2a provides additional information on the estimated budget, detailing units and cost per unit.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex 2a provides additional information regarding the estimated budget including units and cost per unit.</data>
