<node id="Beneficiaries">
  <data key="d0">Beneficiaries</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Beneficiaries are entities involved in the CoEvolution project that receive funding under the terms specified in a Grant Agreement. These entities are critical to the execution of specific projects, particularly those funded under Horizon Europe or Euratom actions. As signatories of the Grant Agreement, beneficiaries are required to report on their progress and expenditures, fulfilling various obligations outlined in the agreement's articles. 

Beneficiaries must implement the project in accordance with the terms of the agreement and adhere to stipulated conditions concerning data protection, public procurement, access to results, dissemination of findings, and licensing of results. They play a pivotal role in protecting and exploiting the outcomes of their work, which is supported by legal agreements. Throughout the project lifecycle, beneficiaries are tasked with following a comprehensive set of rules and guidelines to ensure effective compliance with their obligations related to the funding.

Additionally, beneficiaries have financial responsibilities, including managing payments and recoveries related to the grants received under the EU framework. It is essential for them to maintain accurate records and uphold their commitments according to the guidelines provided in the agreement. While specific names or identities of the beneficiaries are not detailed, they are fundamentally the individuals or organizations that accept the grant and execute project activities as mandated by the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-da85149284498fc139e8be382b981003&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46bfcb1e7800b6d1322402d2cc7c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4d11e0e789971dbd47542c636e3dd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8367c05350cd3e59ea1f7a290218e7e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7019b56e282d7e9dc7527aa2932219f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7998d7f556fa82a3f85973da5a1f2d77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cef03a8059a065d6002cea06de607314&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66b48a08b5a1dfe503764abaf73f0cad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fed663f83e00c26d63223d3e166e75c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0299893c12de3ee2631ab3f6cf4ec2e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418889b13888444f1b331214c79d5c44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7627bf3a6479da8bd78bb376ead3b76c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb7b908252804f7cc170638a174809eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-445008e17e64c0438134e1fefbcf5dfa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e311b0bf4e60d61a3a28a1b7cce6c4af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db0d8aa15d17a4b672a2dd3371a4ca0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6587c0a38b949dea5de8a236e80407fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbe105bf419f163813e1e4122e6db8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66775d2ca4e61f236e59e3423f42a76e</data>
