<node id="Artificial Intelligence">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Artificial Intelligence encompasses a range of technologies aimed at enabling machines to learn, adapt, and perform tasks that typically require human intelligence. It is the field of study and technology that seeks to advance through robust risk analysis and security assessment frameworks, particularly highlighted in the CoEvolution project. Central to this initiative, Artificial Intelligence refers to the simulation of human intelligence processes by machines, especially computer systems. These systems are designed to perform tasks that usually necessitate human intelligence while being influenced by ethical considerations and security measures. Overall, Artificial Intelligence plays a critical role in the development of intelligent machines that can think and learn.</data>
