<node id="Project 101168560 - CoEvolution">
  <data key="d0">Project 101168560 - CoEvolution</data>
  <data key="d1">project</data>
  <data key="d2">Project 101168560, known as CoEvolution, is a funded initiative under the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 program, operating within the Horizon Europe framework. The project aims to improve the security and lifecycle management of AI models through innovative strategies, with a particular emphasis on enhancing AI model security and context awareness. CoEvolution promotes collaboration and innovation, embodying a commitment to advancing cooperative research across various specific fields. It is recognized as a significant action supported by an EU grant, highlighting its role in fostering collaborative efforts in the development of advanced AI systems and security measures. Although the project is referenced as part of a broader agreement, further details regarding its scope and specific activities are not provided in the available descriptions. Overall, Project 101168560 represents a structured investment in innovative research and development, underscoring its importance within the EU funding landscape.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-925b1f5a2133d1fdc125c610bbbae027&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f26601f4c4959a5a23ecaace643d0bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61e4eed06e3b3b8ee3a6ee60907c6c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a8719a38bb7a9f42229f7fe81c9bf9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95e9aa7ab49a00972f3d46c56705b630&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ee3eb87a546ba8ada176f900494902b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc0f669cc4e2bfef891820395ef55650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d88921885a26ccc1c5504cb6fb467c4e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cdadb910463745fc32934e593a1c6de</data>
