<node id="EU Financial Regulation 2018/1046">
  <data key="d0">EU Financial Regulation 2018/1046</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The EU Financial Regulation 2018/1046 establishes comprehensive financial rules applicable to the general budget of the European Union. It delineates regulations concerning grants and financial contributions while also setting the standards for financial management within the EU. This regulation is referenced multiple times throughout its text, highlighting its significance in guiding financial operations, including audits, financing practices, and the management of recipient information. Furthermore, the regulation governs the procedures related to grant agreements, ensuring a structured approach to financial governance in the European Union.</data>
