  <data key="d5">1755420992</data>
</node>
<node id="Micro, Small or Medium-Sized Enterprises (SME)">
  <data key="d0">Micro, Small or Medium-Sized Enterprises (SME)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SMEs are defined enterprises engaged in economic activities, employing fewer than 250 persons and meeting specific turnover or balance sheet criteria.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420992</data>
</node>
<node id="Costs">
  <data key="d0">Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Costs encompass various expenses that beneficiaries must manage in accordance with the terms set in the grant agreement, including eligible and ineligible expenses.&lt;SEP&gt;Costs refer to the expenses associated with purchases for actions or projects, categorized into direct and indirect costs as per the eligibility conditions defined.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0299893c12de3ee2631ab3f6cf4ec2e8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422081</data>
</node>
<node id="Travel and Subsistence">
  <data key="d0">Travel and Subsistence</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Travel and Subsistence encompasses the various costs associated with travel and related expenses for personnel involved in project activities. This includes expenses for travel, accommodation, and meals that are incurred while on duty. Specifically, Travel and Subsistence refers to cost categories that cover these expenditures, ensuring they meet specific calculation requirements. Overall, it serves as an essential expense category for managing the costs related to personnel travel during project execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Travel and Subsistence includes costs related to actual travel expenses, accommodation, and daily allowances necessary for project-related activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-167b08e854bdbecae98ac74e0774cabf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef1f5817b40d920cdf33d4c4a68e437e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbc421c0c6c9b08031c3d61a5013a3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675b33dd17c4669f5a8bcc3fc405a6a9</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425825</data>
</node>
<node id="Equipment">
  <data key="d0">Equipment</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equipment refers to assets used for the action that must be depreciated and accounted for according to international accounting standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipment refers to assets used for the action that must be reported as depreciation costs according to accounting standards and practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Equipment refers to tangible assets used by the organization to facilitate its operations and activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ef1f5817b40d920cdf33d4c4a68e437e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccbc421c0c6c9b08031c3d61a5013a3e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422808</data>
</node>
<node id="Purchases of Other Goods, Works and Services">
  <data key="d0">Purchases of Other Goods, Works and Services</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">This category refers to the costs incurred for consumables and services related to the project that must comply with general eligibility conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9941c6cbac26f2073168a5b30c17afcf</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420993</data>
</node>
<node id="Loan Costs">
  <data key="d0">Loan Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Loan costs refer to financial obligations related to borrowing and debt that are specifically excluded from eligibility for EU funding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420993</data>
</node>
<node id="Currency Exchange Losses">
  <data key="d0">Currency Exchange Losses</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Currency exchange losses are not eligible for reimbursement under EU grants as stated in the conditions outlined in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420993</data>
</node>
<node id="Bank Costs">
  <data key="d0">Bank Costs</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bank costs incurred during the transfer of funds from the granting authority are not eligible for funding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420993</data>
</node>
<node id="In-kind Contributions">
  <data key="d0">In-kind Contributions</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">In-kind contributions by third parties are considered not applicable in this context according to the grant's conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
<node id="Excessive Expenditure">
  <data key="d0">Excessive Expenditure</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Excessive or reckless expenditure is deemed ineligible for funding under the EU grant conditions outlined in the text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d11aa6e28f787c2ae7a7561e62d0a74</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
<node id="beneficiaries">
  <data key="d0">beneficiaries</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Beneficiaries are the parties receiving the grant who must adhere to the communication, visibility, and compliance rules outlined in the agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Beneficiaries refers to the entities involved in the CoEvolution project that receive funding and have specific responsibilities laid out in the Agreement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-513280f6927e9d616d879baf249f9364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31116ac4e46d186dea94d94a7702584</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
<node id="subcontractors">
  <data key="d0">subcontractors</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Subcontractors are entities that may participate in the CoEvolution project, provided they implement their tasks according to the established guidelines and conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-513280f6927e9d616d879baf249f9364</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
<node id="third parties">
  <data key="d0">third parties</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Third parties refer to entities that may provide in-kind contributions to the CoEvolution project, aiding in its implementation without charging costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-513280f6927e9d616d879baf249f9364</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
<node id="Directive 2006/43/EC">
  <data key="d0">Directive 2006/43/EC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Directive 2006/43/EC is a European Union directive that establishes a comprehensive legislative framework concerning statutory audits of annual accounts and consolidated accounts. The directive aims to ensure transparency and reliability in financial reporting by regulating the practices and procedures associated with audits. It sets standards for statutory audits and is recognized as a benchmark for independent audits, highlighting its significance in maintaining the integrity of financial information within the European Union.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68530f7500a72fc731f00e3c4c766df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b345cada8d617efdc8dbd31168fa0f9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b040918a9ab9d53eb1630a7309bd1d09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66775d2ca4e61f236e59e3423f42a76e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755422085</data>
</node>
<node id="Contractual Obligations">
  <data key="d0">Contractual Obligations</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Contractual obligations refer to the legal commitments that beneficiaries must adhere to under the agreement, covering implementation, confidentiality, and ethics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-66775d2ca4e61f236e59e3423f42a76e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755420994</data>
</node>
