<node id="Regulation 2016/679">
  <data key="d0">Regulation 2016/679</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Regulation 2016/679 is also known as the GDPR, which mandates data protection and privacy in the European Union and the European Economic Area.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation 2016/679 is the EU legislation on data protection and privacy, crucial for beneficiaries processing personal data within the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation 2016/679, also known as GDPR, establishes principles for data processing and rights of individuals regarding their personal data in the EU.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b65321e5c497565cf717aab53e5aa7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbe105bf419f163813e1e4122e6db8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7019b56e282d7e9dc7527aa2932219f0</data>
