<node id="Project: 101168560">
  <data key="d0">Project: 101168560</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Project 101168560, related to CoEvolution, represents an initiative funded for specific research and development goals.&lt;SEP&gt;Project: 101168560 is referred to in the document as CoEvolution and is associated with the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 grant agreement.&lt;SEP&gt;Project: 101168560 is titled 'CoEvolution' and is part of the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 initiative, focusing on collaborative innovation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83e1fb202d9cabb7b747aef687ac4527&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46bfcb1e7800b6d1322402d2cc7c05f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce96797e723874f84f3ba02a22d09d8a</data>
