</node>
<node id="grant amount">
  <data key="d0">grant amount</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The grant amount indicates the total financial contribution allocated to a project or beneficiary, subject to audits and adjustments.&lt;SEP&gt;The grant amount refers to the total financial allocation calculated by the granting authority based on submitted reports and activities conducted by beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-153d0d25b1dc6cfa0bcf7a7947b40d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1e6845be0998259ad41a50c2e648ae7</data>
