  <data key="d2">EU Executive Agencies are established by the EU to manage specific tasks and responsibilities related to various EU activities and funding programs.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Executive Agency refers to agencies established to manage specific EU programs and carry out tasks on behalf of the European Commission.</data>
