<node id="Article 43">
  <data key="d0">Article 43</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Article 43 describes the measures that can be taken in case of breaches of obligations by beneficiaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 43 pertains to legal actions that can be taken by the granting authority in the context of grants and recovery procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ee3eb87a546ba8ada176f900494902b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cabeefd7ae48c25ad0cbe6631c0ecc22</data>
