<node id="Ethics Self-Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Ethics Self-Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ethics Self-Assessment is a comprehensive evaluation process associated with the CoEvolution project, focused on assessing AI projects against established ethical standards and principles. This assessment examines the ethical considerations and implications pertaining to the project's objectives, methodologies, and overall impact of AI technologies. By ensuring responsible innovation and implementation, the Ethics Self-Assessment seeks to guarantee that the CoEvolution project aligns with ethical standards throughout its development and execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-62d913cb5322e69bb504986e2098e6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-589ff2c6b80ad5646240c13df874e58a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27983f12f5c86c0463eca065b4d5542d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75efa432cb6a9347528127bab93b2e22</data>
