  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Potential Barriers and Requirements refer to challenges and prerequisites that must be considered for successful implementation and impact of AI technologies in various domains.&lt;SEP&gt;Potential Barriers and Requirements refer to obstacles and necessary conditions that could affect the implementation of AI systems and technologies.</data>
