  <data key="d0">Feedback to Policy Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Feedback to Policy Measures indicates the necessary input and suggestions for shaping policy in response to the outcomes of AI initiatives such as CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Feedback to Policy Measures refers to the insights and evaluations provided regarding existing policies in relation to AI developments and effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-62d913cb5322e69bb504986e2098e6b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-589ff2c6b80ad5646240c13df874e58a</data>
