<node id="Secure AI Framework (SAIF)">
  <data key="d0">Secure AI Framework (SAIF)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Secure AI Framework (SAIF) is a conceptual framework published by Google to identify and address AI security vulnerabilities and risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Secure AI Framework (SAIF) is a conceptual framework that identifies critical AI security issues, particularly in the AI supply chain.&lt;SEP&gt;The Secure AI Framework is a conceptual framework developed by Google to address AI security vulnerabilities and risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-788baa379b81a91f164731d4acab9774&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2be5c8354db5456b4254a51a65a6f69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8de9ab24149e20dd885bdf7aa0cbc37</data>
