  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A risk assessment framework in AI aims to identify, quantify, and mitigate risks associated with AI models and their supply chains.&lt;SEP&gt;The Risk Assessment Framework is a structured approach to identifying and evaluating risks associated with AI systems in their supply chains.</data>
