<node id="Security-by-Design">
  <data key="d0">Security-by-Design</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security-by-Design is a concept emphasized by CoEvolution to ensure that AI models are built with security considerations from the ground up.&lt;SEP&gt;Security-by-Design is a principle advocating the integration of security measures throughout the lifecycle of an AI model from design to deployment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f24ba2d35feb8defe20b38929b8da11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755421325</data>
</node>
<node id="Adversarial Attack">
  <data key="d0">Adversarial Attack</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Attack events involve challenges in which malicious techniques are executed to deceive or manipulate AI models, compromising their performance and outputs. These attacks employ a variety of methods aimed at disrupting and misleading AI systems by introducing carefully crafted inputs that exploit vulnerabilities within the models. They can occur at various stages of an AI model's lifecycle, including both the training and operational phases. By targeting the fundamental weaknesses of AI systems, adversarial attacks pose significant risks, as they can lead to incorrect predictions or classifications, thereby threatening the overall security of AI technologies.

The significance of adversarial attacks highlights the critical need for robust defense mechanisms to protect AI models against such threats. The CoEvolution project specifically aims to counter these attacks by addressing the vulnerabilities that adversarial tactics exploit. In summary, adversarial attacks represent substantial challenges in the context of AI reliability, necessitating ongoing vigilance and strategic responses to safeguard against their detrimental effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f13e4e9d2acd6290e2eddd212bdd3df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f24ba2d35feb8defe20b38929b8da11b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53f31094c83ab0284e8e350e82c94a02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bdd45e641a1d84d501219cd34c72fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f5d57fd30405ff0a9f46bc2a7e01ff0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa83eb77b884af99d8cd56eafdf08c61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2feb4344e03dd54c5451fb9791afdbfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c7cbb33ab30b7a655c9e6abee10258&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-402e243c2b3772441ea35e8dba3c710c</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425692</data>
</node>
