  <data key="d0">Machine Learning DevOps (MLDevOps)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MLDevOps encompasses practices and tools for deploying and managing machine learning models effectively within an organization.&lt;SEP&gt;MLDevOps refers to practices that aim to integrate machine learning system development and operations for improved AI lifecycle management.&lt;SEP&gt;Machine Learning DevOps, abbreviated as MLDevOps, integrates machine learning development and operations to enhance the performance and reliability of AI models over their lifecycles.</data>
