  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep Unrolling is a technique mentioned for achieving explainability-by-design in AI models to address ethical issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Unrolling is an advanced AI method aimed at transforming optimization solvers into interpretable deep learning architectures for better performance and robustness.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Unrolling is a technique used in AI to enhance explainability and transparency in model decisions.</data>
