  <data key="d2">The AI community comprises various stakeholders interested in the development and deployment of artificial intelligence and machine learning technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI community consists of researchers, developers, and users engaged in the study and application of artificial intelligence technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI community refers to a collective of organizations, individuals, and researchers engaged in the development and application of artificial intelligence technologies.</data>
