<node id="Market Research">
  <data key="d0">Market Research</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Market Research is a systematic and ongoing process that involves the gathering, recording, and analyzing of data related to the AI landscape, consumers, competitors, and market dynamics. It supports the development of a viable business case for the CoEvolution framework by providing insights into consumer needs and preferences, as well as the specific challenges faced by targeted markets. Through this comprehensive approach, Market Research informs strategies for adopting new AI security measures and serves as a foundational element in shaping business strategy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3dda1f142513f65880057e0292e6bbdc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87919fcacc4b2972be3a6837bf783ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe5653cf25a54988a2dce7d8d44ba13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d188b520ae593ffa16184991a28ba19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b717d4f1dbabcdf423e3b9ee479caad5</data>
