  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Exploitation Group is a collaborative entity aimed at developing business models and financing strategies within the scope of the CoEvolution framework, established with at least 10 stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;The exploitation group is a team established to utilize the CoEvolution framework, consisting of at least 10 stakeholders to drive business and financing models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Exploitation Group is a collaborative entity established to promote the sustainable business models resulting from the CoEvolution framework.</data>
