<node id="Traditional Machine Learning Systems">
  <data key="d0">Traditional Machine Learning Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Traditional Machine Learning Systems are centralized systems that require data to be transferred and processed in the cloud, which raises privacy concerns and creates a single point of failure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261</data>
