  <data key="d0">Deep Unrolling Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deep Unrolling Networks are AI architectures that incorporate mathematical model optimizations and enhance data quality through deep regularizers.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Unrolling Networks are deep learning architectures utilized in modern model-based network design methodologies to improve data quality and resist adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Unrolling Networks are a type of network architecture designed to integrate optimization solvers with deep learning, focusing on performance efficiency and explainability.</data>
