<node id="black-box attacks">
  <data key="d0">black-box attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Black-box attacks involve adversaries who manipulate AI systems without prior knowledge of its architecture, typically relying on trial and error strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Black-box attacks involve threats to AI models where the attacker has no prior knowledge of the model's architecture or data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd5d99a66a08e8bad40aa04612a33b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27653816af61fd8b863293d976ca9654</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
