<node id="gray-box attacks">
  <data key="d0">gray-box attacks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Gray-box attacks involve attackers who possess partial knowledge of an AI model's architecture.&lt;SEP&gt;Gray-box attacks refer to a hybrid approach where adversaries have partial knowledge of the AI model, enabling them to exploit specific vulnerabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fd5d99a66a08e8bad40aa04612a33b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27653816af61fd8b863293d976ca9654</data>
