<node id="AI Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME)">
  <data key="d0">AI Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME) is a crucial system designed to monitor AI operations and provide real-time feedback on adversarial cyberattacks. It plays an essential role in overseeing the security status of AI models and managing the AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOMs) throughout the entire lifecycle of these models. The SRME focuses on surveillance of AI operations, emphasizing the detection and response to adversarial attacks that may occur during the runtime of AI models. Overall, the SRME is tasked with ensuring the integrity of AI models by actively monitoring for potential threats and safeguarding against cyber intrusions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9510fe2b92ae882d551007b5ee87df2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-81418f280483fb994ba74151f8e56fb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368e0742f36b9f4943d23f312bee77a5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425706</data>
</node>
<node id="CoEvolution Security Assurance Process">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Security Assurance Process</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution Security Assurance Process is an orchestration component designed to manage the risk and security assessments associated with AI models within the CoEvolution hub. It coordinates security assessments and enhancements to ensure the trustworthiness and fairness of these AI models. This process plays a crucial role in orchestrating activities related to risk assessment and security improvements within the CoEvolution ecosystem, thereby enhancing the overall reliability of AI implementations.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Security Assurance Process orchestrates risk and security assessments for AI models within the CoEvolution ecosystem.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dc5395556365a730e47d5041142ed23c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c9765c6de5d09adbaa4008d62e0503a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39c45633c6b079b86215891c3f1d283a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9510fe2b92ae882d551007b5ee87df2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425704</data>
</node>
