  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Collaborative AI refers to AI models that work together, often utilizing federated learning and peer-to-peer approaches for improved outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative AI refers to a paradigm where multiple AI models, particularly those designed for federated learning and peer-to-peer learning, work together to enhance learning outcomes and robustness.</data>
