<node id="CoEvolution Defence Flows">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution Defence Flows</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">CoEvolution Defence Flows are processes developed within the CoEvolution framework, aimed at providing various protective measures for AI models throughout their lifecycle. These flows consist of structured sequences of complementary defense techniques that are specifically designed to enhance the security and robustness of AI models. CoEvolution Defence Flows encompass strategic approaches formulated by CoEvolution Solutions to safeguard AI systems against potential attacks during their operational phases. Overall, they ensure that models remain robust by applying a series of integrated defense techniques throughout different stages of the AI lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79851ac919cf8bc22fc5597de36064b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0300fc77e55d052b584b44facfc08</data>
