  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI models are algorithms designed to perform tasks typically requiring human intelligence, undergoing various phases such as design, training, and deployment to ensure robustness against adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;AI models are structures of artificial intelligence that require assessments and enhancements for security, trust, and robustness.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI model refers to the computational structure used to perform AI tasks, which undergoes assessment and enhancement processes within the CoEvolution framework.</data>
