<node id="Fully Connected Layer">
  <data key="d0">Fully Connected Layer</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Fully Connected Layer is a layer of neurons in a neural network where each neuron is connected to every neuron from the previous layer, typically used for classification tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fully Connected Layer is another component of neural networks used for classification and predictions, also subject to security measures against attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f13e4e9d2acd6290e2eddd212bdd3df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4258dad8667e5dd4d7e54cbdb071a5ed</data>
