<node id="Post-Training Operations">
  <data key="d0">Post-Training Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Post-Training Operations involve a series of processes applied to AI models following their initial training, aimed at ensuring these models are secure and capable of effectively managing new types of attacks. This includes modifying pre-trained AI models to enhance their security and robustness against potential threats. The actions taken during Post-Training Operations may encompass the integration of additional security measures and enhancements, ultimately focusing on improving the models' effectiveness against adversarial attacks. These operations are crucial for maintaining the integrity and reliability of AI systems in an evolving threat landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;Post-training operations involve processes applied to AI models after their initial training, aimed at enhancing their security and robustness against identified threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6f1fe0ecca82dae0573c929fdb53a66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd242577c3ba63c0f548e5aa31a5820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93da09e739b2b1da529a083098c37db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3efd11c9b0ab72e885216df0907238fd</data>
