  <data key="d0">ARM Trust Zone</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">ARM Trust Zone is a hardware-based security feature that allows the creation of a secure environment for the execution of sensitive operations in devices.&lt;SEP&gt;ARM Trust Zone is a security architecture that enables the secure execution of applications, enhancing the trustworthiness of AI model deployments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-237babba3957b0c4786b5021cd8884d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477</data>
