  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Intel SGX (Software Guard Extensions) is a set of security-related instruction codes that provides software developers with a way to create secure enclaves for sensitive data processing.&lt;SEP&gt;Intel SGX is a set of security-related architectural enhancements to Intel's x86 processors intended to create secure enclaves for sensitive computations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-237babba3957b0c4786b5021cd8884d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477</data>
