<node id="Collaborative AI Paradigm">
  <data key="d0">Collaborative AI Paradigm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Collaborative AI Paradigm involves interconnected AI agents working together to enhance AI capabilities and resilience against adversarial threats.&lt;SEP&gt;The Collaborative AI Paradigm involves multiple AI agents working together to improve learning outcomes and system effectiveness, promoting shared knowledge and resources.&lt;SEP&gt;The Collaborative AI Paradigm refers to a framework in which multiple AI agents work together, sharing data and tasks to enhance overall efficiency and performance.</data>
