  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Policy learning is a method used to derive optimal operational parameters and enhance the adaptability of AI systems based on contextual information.&lt;SEP&gt;Policy learning refers to the method of deriving insights and decision-making processes in the context-aware framework, either offline or via simulations.</data>
