  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial attack incidents are specific events that involve attempts to exploit vulnerabilities in AI models, typically monitored and reported by the SRME.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial attack incidents refer to security threats that target AI models, leading to potential breaches or malicious interference.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial attack incidents refer to security threats identified during the operation of AI models, which are logged and reported by the SRME.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36176d0f31881be69e8416ed157129c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8908f5d82a665a2008f9859e10755f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368e0742f36b9f4943d23f312bee77a5</data>
