<node id="context vectors">
  <data key="d0">context vectors</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Context vectors are structured representations of sensory input used in CoEvolution to optimize the use of available data and resources in AI processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Context vectors represent a diverse population of datasets, undergoing operations to optimize context-awareness in systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8908f5d82a665a2008f9859e10755f6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-368e0742f36b9f4943d23f312bee77a5</data>
