<node id="fitness function">
  <data key="d0">fitness function</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A fitness function evaluates and selects the most effective context vectors during the evolutionary process of the CoEvolution system.&lt;SEP&gt;A fitness function is utilized to evaluate and select context vectors for propagation based on system resilience and performance metrics.&lt;SEP&gt;A fitness function is utilized to evaluate and select the most effective context vectors based on system resilience and performance metrics.</data>
