  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Digital Signature Schemes are security mechanisms used to validate the integrity and authenticity of documents related to AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Digital signature schemes are security mechanisms used to authenticate the integrity of AI MBOMs and ensure legitimacy in transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b65576c05d96906d2692fc35b3941f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-169bce82366b2fa52a6ddd1e7e226f5c</data>
