<node id="AI Model Supply Chain">
  <data key="d0">AI Model Supply Chain</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Model Supply Chain represents the interconnected network of AI models and their components involved in collaborative learning.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI model supply chain refers to the sequence of processes and entities involved in the development, deployment, and management of AI models.</data>
