  <data key="d0">Security Scrutiny Guarantee</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Security Scrutiny Guarantee is a concept that indicates a specific AI model has undergone thorough vetting and testing by the CoEvolution solution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Scrutiny Guarantee is a tier of transparency provided in the CoEvolution framework, ensuring that a specific AI model has passed rigorous security evaluations.</data>
