<node id="Tier 1">
  <data key="d0">Tier 1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Tier 1 is the first level of access to the AI MBOM, visible to everyone, which guarantees that a specific model has been vetted by CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;Tier 1 provides a basic level of access to AI MBOM information, ensuring a Security Scrutiny Guarantee for the models evaluated by CoEvolution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a4c7b68e7ffd62eeeb39e4a632bfc606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87e3ec6d317ec9c38e6e681a34f1fe29</data>
