  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The IEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy focuses on the latest advancements in security and privacy and is relevant for CoEvolution's dissemination.&lt;SEP&gt;The IEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy is a significant event that addresses a wide range of topics pertaining to security and privacy issues within various computing contexts, particularly within computing and information systems. This symposium serves as a platform for discussions revolving around critical aspects of cybersecurity and data privacy. Notably, it has featured presentations on groundbreaking research, including a paper on adversarial perturbations, highlighting its role in advancing the understanding of security challenges in the digital landscape.&lt;SEP&gt;The IEEE Symposium on Security and Privacy is a technical conference that discusses security and privacy issues in computing.</data>
