<node id="Diederik M. Roijers">
  <data key="d0">Diederik M. Roijers</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Diederik M. Roijers is a prominent researcher known for his contributions to the field of multi-objective decision-making in artificial intelligence. He has played a significant role in discussions surrounding multi-objective reinforcement learning, particularly noted in a survey published in 2013. In addition to this, he is recognized as an author who has contributed to surveys focused on multi-objective sequential decision-making. His work in this area has garnered citations, highlighting his impact on the academic discourse related to multi-objective decision-making methodologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Diederik M. Roijers is a researcher who co-wrote a survey on multi-objective sequential decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;Diederik M. Roijers is studying multi-objective decision-making in artificial intelligence.</data>
