  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Shimon Whiteson contributes to studies on sequential decision-making frameworks in AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Shimon Whiteson is a co-author contributing to the exploration of sequential decision-making methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Shimon Whiteson is a prominent researcher in the field of multi-objective decision-making strategies. His contributions extend to multi-objective sequential decision-making, with notable studies published in 2013. Whiteson is recognized for his work at the intersection of multi-objective decision-making and reinforcement learning, showcasing his expertise in these areas. Additionally, he is cited as an author in a survey on multi-objective decision-making, further establishing his role as a key contributor to the academic discourse in this domain.</data>
