  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Andrea Castelletti is a researcher featured in a paper discussing multi-objective fitted Q-iteration presented at the IEEE International Conference on Networking, Sensing and Control.&lt;SEP&gt;Andrea Castelletti is a researcher who specializes in multi-objective decision-making processes and is notably a co-author of a paper that explores multi-objective fitted Q-iteration methods. He has made significant contributions to the field of reinforcement learning, particularly in the area of fitted Q-iteration. His work is recognized within the academic community as he is mentioned as an author on research that delves into the applications and theoretical underpinnings of multi-objective fitted Q-iteration.</data>
