<node id="Task 5.1">
  <data key="d0">Task 5.1</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 5.1 is dedicated to the definition, design, and management of AI Model Bills-of-Material (MBOM). This entity aims to enhance transparency and accountability in the AI development process by providing detailed information regarding the development and security of AI models. Through its focus on AI MBOM, Task 5.1 plays a crucial role in ensuring that the development processes behind AI models are clear and understood, thereby fostering trust and responsibility in the field of artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.1 refers to the specific work package focused on defining, designing, and managing the AI Model Bill-of-Materials (MBOM).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426348</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 5.2">
  <data key="d0">Task 5.2</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 5.2 aims to develop the Security Runtime Monitoring engine for cybersecurity surveillance of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.2 aims to develop the Security Runtime Monitoring engine, which will facilitate real-time surveillance of AI operations. This task is dedicated to ensuring the security of AI systems by monitoring them against adversarial attacks and cyberattacks. Through the development of this engine, Task 5.2 focuses on implementing measures to effectively surveil and protect AI operations from potential threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.2 involves the development of the Security Runtime Monitoring engine for monitoring AI operations against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426348</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 5.3">
  <data key="d0">Task 5.3</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 5.3 aims to develop a comprehensive security and risk assessment engine designed to secure the entire AI lifecycle, ranging from design to deployment. This initiative focuses on creating risk assessment analyses and security assessment engines that ensure robust protection throughout the overall AI lifecycle, emphasizing the importance of security in every phase of AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.3 is dedicated to developing security and risk assessment engines to secure the AI lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.3 focuses on developing the risk assessment analysis and security assessment engines, aimed at securing the AI lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426349</data>
</node>
<node id="Task 5.4">
  <data key="d0">Task 5.4</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 5.4 encompasses the development and implementation of mechanisms aimed at ensuring continuous security assurance and maintaining the trustworthiness of artificial intelligence systems. This task involves the creation of a trusted AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM) mechanism for model updates, which is crucial for keeping AI systems reliable and secure. Additionally, Task 5.4 is tasked with establishing the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine, which focuses on risk and security management while aligning with guidelines for trustworthiness and fairness. Through these efforts, Task 5.4 plays a pivotal role in ensuring that AI technologies are developed and updated with a commitment to security and ethical standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.4 involves creating a mechanism for generating trusted AI MBOMs and ensuring alignment with AI trustworthiness guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.4 is responsible for the development of the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine to enhance risk analysis and security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755426349</data>
</node>
