  <data key="d0">Adversarial Threats</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Adversarial Threats refer to various malicious attacks targeted at AI systems, being a focus area for resilience in the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Adversarial threats involve contexts that can undermine the effectiveness and security of machine learning models and algorithms.</data>
