  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Pilot Prototypes are the initial models deployed for testing and demonstration in the CoEvolution initiative to validate use case requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Pilot prototypes are used as proofs of concept intended to test and validate the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b81697e5e97b55f3fbdb3e229af635af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495</data>
