<node id="Innovation Management and Ethics Oversight Report">
  <data key="d0">Innovation Management and Ethics Oversight Report</data>
  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Innovation Management and Ethics Oversight Report is a comprehensive document detailing the management and oversight of innovation activities, with a particular focus on ethical aspects. This sensitive report, designated as D1.3, has been created by AEGIS and concerns ethical practices within the CoEvolution project. It evaluates innovation management practices while overseeing the ethical considerations associated with the project, ensuring that all activities align with established ethical standards.&lt;SEP&gt;This report addresses the management of innovation and ethical considerations within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;This report focuses on oversight of ethics and innovation management within the project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99ddd092d2b8685079c5b87c6675e59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16ec89c88f17eab253fcbabae20f2eff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b</data>
