  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">The Analysis of the Legal and Ethical Issues is aimed at reviewing legal frameworks and ethical implications related to the project, specifically referencing the Artificial Intelligence Act.&lt;SEP&gt;This document provides an analysis of the ethical implications of the Artificial Intelligence Act and related activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The analysis provides insights into the implications of the Artificial Intelligence Act as it pertains to the project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99ddd092d2b8685079c5b87c6675e59f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd293dc4bf55a53d90c2406f6a87c548</data>
