<node id="Deliverable D3.1">
  <data key="d0">Deliverable D3.1</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D3.1 is a key document associated with the CoEvolution project, produced by the Institute of Communication and Computer Systems (ICCS). It serves as the Project Scope Definition, providing a comprehensive overview of the project's aims and requirements. This deliverable outlines the state of the art in the relevant field, presents threat models, and includes codified requirements essential for the project's execution. Overall, Deliverable D3.1 is focused on meticulously defining the project scope through detailed reporting and requirement specification.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D3.1 is the Project scope definition document for the CoEvolution project, outlining specific objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30</data>
