  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D3.2 encompasses the Technical specifications related to the technological aspects of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D3.2 is a comprehensive document that comprises the Technical Specifications pertaining to the architecture of the CoEvolution project's framework. It provides detailed insights into the technological aspects and architecture design, making it a critical component of project documentation. Led by ISI, this deliverable is officially categorized as a public document, ensuring accessibility and transparency regarding the project's technical foundations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9439f586c1b31de13fd7c269ff9fb63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30</data>
