  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Deliverable D4.1 refers to the Enablers Development Science and Technology (S&amp;T) Report associated with the CoEvolution project. This report encapsulates the scientific and technical advancements achieved within the project, specifically detailing the development of various tools and techniques by UNICA. In essence, Deliverable D4.1 serves as a comprehensive overview, presenting significant insights into the tools developed throughout the project and their underlying scientific and technical frameworks.</data>
