  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">COVID-19 refers to the global pandemic that impacted project operations and led to the switch to remote work.&lt;SEP&gt;COVID-19 refers to the pandemic that disrupted operations, necessitating remote work and potentially extending project durations.</data>
