  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Project Management Bodies refers to groups involved in overseeing and coordinating project activities, ensuring effective resource usage and schedule adherence.&lt;SEP&gt;Project management bodies oversee the monitoring and corrective actions of the project's work, ensuring its successful completion.</data>
