<node id="Standardization Bodies">
  <data key="d0">Standardization Bodies</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Standardization bodies are organizations that play a crucial role in the CoEvolution project by developing threat models and protection profiles. These bodies are engaged in the creation of relevant standards in collaboration with project partners, ensuring that the standards align with the project's objectives. The CoEvolution project actively involves these organizations in the standardization process to enhance the project's effectiveness and security measures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-99b3cd45c7b1f82f0e5ceb4d19d8492e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-829fe07ae9fd6dec1e25c0e00e71475c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aee9c47f6af302c020a5f1cbcb50807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c1513849fed8288aa7e5eef91460421</data>
