<node id="Work Packages">
  <data key="d0">Work Packages</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Packages (WPs) are structured segments of the CoEvolution project, designed to achieve specific objectives and efficiently manage and coordinate efforts. They address distinct tasks and risks within the overall scope of the project, allowing for effective execution and management. The organization of Work Packages encompasses both technical and non-technical domains, facilitating a systematic approach to handling the diverse activities associated with the CoEvolution Project.&lt;SEP&gt;Work Packages are specific segments of the CoEvolution project that contribute content and knowledge aimed at dissemination.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-829fe07ae9fd6dec1e25c0e00e71475c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aee9c47f6af302c020a5f1cbcb50807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab48b662719cb842a1786a0c13a6d2cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ecf64aa779212b37143119b15ede3cd</data>
