</node>
<node id="Grant Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Grant Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Grant Preparation encompasses a comprehensive process related to the planning, organization, and submission of project grants, specifically for the CoEvolution initiative and Project 101168560. This event involves not only the meticulous management of financial resources but also the coordination of project deliverables and the organization of project proposals. Participants in the CoEvolution project are engaged in defining their roles and responsibilities to ensure effective collaboration and successful outcomes. Overall, Grant Preparation is critical for establishing a well-structured approach to securing funding and managing resources for these projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Grant Preparation refers to the processes involved in preparing documents and proposals for securing funding for projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Grant Preparation is a category representing the work package aimed at preparing and managing grants for the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c07f9e21489aa565e0113a4b396d22a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2aee9c47f6af302c020a5f1cbcb50807&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b9101312bae5650dad5c9bc39d26c4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d6fba577b81094056c9337ad52c3ec3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-672abb4b4d866c235db2385a6641554e</data>
