  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.1 aims to establish a framework for partners to document their communication efforts within the CoEvolution project, ensuring consistent outreach and raising awareness of project results among diverse stakeholders.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.1 focuses on establishing a framework for partners to document their communication and dissemination efforts, ensuring consistent communication to stakeholders about the project's progress.</data>
