  <data key="d2">Task 2.2 aims to investigate opportunities for CoEvolution to contribute to existing standards related to AI security and provide feedback to standardization bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.2 involves investigating opportunities for the CoEvolution project to contribute to existing AI security and cybersecurity standards.</data>
