  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.4 aims to ensure the sustainability and commercial viability of the CoEvolution project by investigating market opportunities and delivering exploitation reports.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.4 involves activities aimed at ensuring the sustainability and continuity of the CoEvolution project, including market analysis and exploitation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 2.4 is designed to investigate market potential and prepare a business plan for the sustainability of CoEvolution after its completion.</data>
