<node id="Task 2.5 - End user internal organization training activities">
  <data key="d0">Task 2.5 - End user internal organization training activities</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 2.5 encompasses the end user internal organization training activities aimed at addressing the training requirements for stakeholders, ensuring they are well-equipped to utilize the outcomes of the CoEvolution project effectively. This task focuses on promoting the uptake of project findings across various organizational departments within large organizations involved in the project. Task 2.5 is specifically designed to facilitate this uptake through the development of training materials and the organization of workshops, ultimately enhancing the capacity of participating organizations to implement the project findings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-841013486b274ac183dbe85d18dd9731&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92873007f0d6549fac4b577e74dc0a67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-991c83168528be4a6f6d89078a6d75ac</data>
