<node id="CoEvolution framework">
  <data key="d0">CoEvolution framework</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The CoEvolution framework is a multifaceted project designed to develop and implement artificial intelligence (AI) technologies with a strong emphasis on security, interoperability, and data integrity. It aims to provide a sustainable and compelling business model for AI solutions, specifically focusing on security and verification against adversarial attacks. Additionally, the CoEvolution framework serves as a conceptual structure for simulating and validating use cases across various domains. It also incorporates a structured approach aimed at enhancing data integration and sharing among vehicles and networks, further solidifying its role in promoting cohesive and secure networked environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ce96797e723874f84f3ba02a22d09d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfaacf3af6603ac9cb26af5c77f318ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f87919fcacc4b2972be3a6837bf783ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0362c884f52f6e88e18946d6287d4495</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755424875</data>
</node>
