<node id="Work Package WP4">
  <data key="d0">Work Package WP4</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Work Package WP4 is a segment of the CoEvolution Project, focusing on the assessment, enhancement, and development of context awareness technology enablers for AI models. Led by TID, this work package encompasses the creation and description of tools specifically designed for these purposes. Additionally, it includes a deliverable related to security assurance and monitoring, further emphasizing its commitment to ensuring the integrity and effectiveness of AI technologies within the project. Overall, Work Package WP4 plays a crucial role in advancing AI model capabilities and their application in responsive, context-aware environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e66856c7c61c57841b490bae9b068261&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-edc6612637391d476f24729c8ff8104e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19d36e00d6638001bed983791ad13038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de811e88e375a0427133f48114ab4084</data>
