<node id="Task 5.5">
  <data key="d0">Task 5.5</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Task 5.5 aims to research adaptive evolutionary strategies for artificial intelligence (AI) in order to improve its resilience against various threats. This includes a focus on genetic operations that facilitate AI adaptation, which are crucial for enhancing resilience. Additionally, Task 5.5 is dedicated to developing strategies for context-awareness adaptation in AI systems, further reinforcing their ability to respond effectively to challenges. Overall, the task targets the integration of evolutionary strategies that promote both adaptability and resilience in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Task 5.5 researches evolutionary strategies for context-aware AI adaptation to enhance resilience against adversarial threats.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-041a92c5d6ba00b1fe79852f2d1bcf19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d2c1e316de666f7e622f4fd8100245&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-156a8e85a6eb2d84a8dc90300df66a77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4810c9b22b0ce26c963075600f4dbd84</data>
