  <data key="d2">Deliverable D1.1 is the Project Manual for the CoEvolution project. This comprehensive document details the project processes related to operations, management, and quality management. It provides essential guidelines and documentation that are crucial for the effective execution of the project. The Project Manual serves as a foundational resource for ensuring that all project-related operations are conducted efficiently and in alignment with established standards.</data>
