  <data key="d2">Deliverable D1.2 is a comprehensive Data Management Plan integral to the CoEvolution project. This deliverable focuses on analyzing and addressing the legal and ethical requirements pertinent to the project. It outlines the necessary processes for managing data effectively, emphasizing day-to-day operations and quality management. Additionally, Deliverable D1.2 specifies strategies aimed at ensuring compliance with both legal and ethical standards in data handling throughout the duration of the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Deliverable D1.2 is the Data Management Plan for the CoEvolution project, focusing on data handling strategies.</data>
