  <data key="d0">AI model training/testing/validation phases</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI model training/testing/validation phases comprise the stages in which AI models are developed and evaluated for effectiveness, including defense mechanisms against adversarial attacks.</data>
