  <data key="d0">KPI4.2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI4.2 is a Key Performance Indicator aimed at demonstrating AI model changes in response to context variations.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI4.2 is a key performance indicator aimed at demonstrating at least two AI model changes due to context variation per pilot within the CoEvolution initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI4.2 refers to a Key Performance Indicator focused on demonstrating at least two AI model changes due to context variation per pilot project.</data>
