<node id="KPI7.1">
  <data key="d0">KPI7.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI7.1 is a key performance indicator associated with the establishment of an exploitation group for the CoEvolution project, focusing on project sustainability in AI initiatives. This indicator is aimed at ensuring active participation from a minimum of 10 stakeholders, which is essential for measuring stakeholder involvement and enhancing project management in AI development. Furthermore, KPI7.1 plays a crucial role in the creation of a business plan for the CoEvolution framework, intended to sustain the project's objectives and initiatives beyond its formal duration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b95c94affa550c2a005eb66b83e0f70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a552b8b0b6e1c9d217e2714e332435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6eb6aae1af8d6225c491ae5dedc4268&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df19f3e87623e77b4872532b8e5d92</data>
