  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI7.2 is a key performance indicator for developing business models and financing strategies within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI7.2 represents a key performance indicator for creating business model canvases related to financing models in AI projects.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI7.2 refers to creating a business model canvas for two types of business and financing models within AI projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b95c94affa550c2a005eb66b83e0f70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a552b8b0b6e1c9d217e2714e332435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6eb6aae1af8d6225c491ae5dedc4268</data>
