  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI7.3 indicates the development of over three exploitation plans and business plans to ensure project viability.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI7.3 is a key performance indicator focusing on the development of multiple exploitation plans for project sustainability in CoEvolution.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI7.3 is a key performance indicator for developing multiple exploitation plans and business plans intended for project sustainability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4b95c94affa550c2a005eb66b83e0f70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86a552b8b0b6e1c9d217e2714e332435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6eb6aae1af8d6225c491ae5dedc4268</data>
