<node id="Pareto-Optimal Solutions">
  <data key="d0">Pareto-Optimal Solutions</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Pareto-Optimal Solutions refer to outcomes in which no objective can be improved without worsening another, commonly used in multi-objective optimization scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2</data>
