<node id="Deep Unrolling (DU) Networks">
  <data key="d0">Deep Unrolling (DU) Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">DU Networks are deep learning architectures that integrate mathematical principles to improve data quality and resilience against attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Deep Unrolling (DU) Networks are meaningful deep learning architectures incorporating deep regularizers for data quality enhancement, and employed for resilience against adversarial attacks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-20c0cc0a37ebaa1bdc18241b7b7a42f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef20bc6bd70a2d4b389a72d582866c02</data>
