  <data key="d0">Risk Assessment, Guidelines and Recommendations Engine (RAGRE)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">RAGRE is an engine that conducts risk assessments and provides guidelines and recommendations, integral to the CoEvolution security process.&lt;SEP&gt;RAGRE is an initial risk assessment tool that works alongside the CoEvolution STR Testing/Assessment Engine to support regulatory risk assessments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fdf0ef74c7d451fed43129ef79275910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bf89d2914639395cf5f6232246af9fc</data>
