  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AI Supply Chain Agents are autonomous entities in AI systems that are interconnected for collaborative learning and ensuring security and privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Supply Chain Agents are components involved in the AI supply chain that communicate and collaborate to enhance AI model performance and security.&lt;SEP&gt;AI Supply Chain Agents refer to interconnected AI systems aimed at enhancing collaborative efforts while maintaining security and privacy in data processing.</data>
