<node id="Membership Inference Attack">
  <data key="d0">Membership Inference Attack</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Membership Inference Attack is a method used by adversaries to determine if a specific data point was included in the training dataset of a model, compromising privacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Membership Inference Attack is a privacy-related attack technique that aims to identify whether a particular data point was included in the training dataset of an AI model.</data>
