  <data key="d2">Collaborative Training Paradigm is a learning method where different AI models are trained cooperatively across multiple clients to enhance performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative Training Paradigm refers to a method where multiple models are trained and updated collaboratively among peers instead of relying on a single model.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative Training Paradigm refers to the approach in model training where multiple parties contribute to the learning process while maintaining data privacy.</data>
