  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The AI Security Research Community is a collective of researchers focused on discovering and mitigating potential vulnerabilities in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI security research community is a collaborative network dedicated to discovering and addressing vulnerabilities in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI security research community refers to a collective of researchers and practitioners focused on discovering vulnerabilities in AI models and developing corresponding defenses.</data>
