  <data key="d2">Government &amp; Regulatory Bodies are institutions responsible for overseeing and enforcing regulations related to technology and data protection policies.&lt;SEP&gt;Government &amp; Regulatory Bodies are institutions that develop and implement regulations for cybersecurity and AI ethics, which are pertinent to the work of CoEvolution.</data>
