  <data key="d2">ENISA is the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, playing a role in the development and implementation of cybersecurity measures in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;ENISA is the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity, which plays a role in enhancing the overall cybersecurity capabilities of the EU, particularly regarding AI technologies.</data>
