<node id="Privacy-Preserving Measures">
  <data key="d0">Privacy-Preserving Measures</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Privacy-Preserving Measures are strategies, such as differential privacy and encryption, aimed at safeguarding sensitive data used in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy-preserving measures include techniques such as differential privacy and encryption to protect sensitive data in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Privacy-Preserving Measures include techniques like differential privacy and encryption implemented within CoEvolution to safeguard sensitive data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db75b2cab1362b7796ff2a8753c4245e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b977bae012f1a149c35d078f2c64ab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd07e02da457ab40f95f32db9e1c6587</data>
