  <data key="d0">EU Directives on Trust and Fairness</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EU Directives on Trust and Fairness aim to establish standards for trust and ethical practices in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Directives on Trust and Fairness are regulatory guidelines meant to ensure fair practices and trust in AI systems among users and developers.&lt;SEP&gt;EU Directives on Trust and Fairness outline the regulatory requirements that AI models must meet to ensure ethical and reliable use in systems, relevant to CoEvolution's framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9260f7f87786fb6b762b6bf5a25591c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2248d6022b436a47f7e30a79038af6d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54b95887f0a735a53175d3a901822dbf</data>
