  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The High-Level Expert Group on AI (AI HLEG) provides recommendations and guidance for ensuring trustworthiness and safety in AI systems as part of the European Union's regulatory framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The High-Level Expert Group on AI is an initiative within the European Union aimed at providing guidelines and recommendations for the development and deployment of trustworthy AI systems.</data>
