  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EIT IoT LSP is an initiative within the European Union that aims to foster innovation in the Internet of Things (IoT) sector. It serves as a key component of the CoEvolution project, which is focused on promoting outcomes related to IoT and engaging with various stakeholders. Through EIT IoT LSP, CoEvolution seeks to create synergies and enhance cooperation among organizations involved in the IoT space, thereby facilitating knowledge transfer and innovation.</data>
