  <data key="d0">EIP-SCC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">EIP-SCC, which stands for the European Innovation Partnership on Smart Cities and Communities, is an initiative aimed at promoting smart city projects and fostering cooperation among various stakeholders. The initiative is focused on creating synergies and facilitating outreach in connection with the objectives of the CoEvolution project. CoEvolution seeks to collaborate with EIP-SCC to network and share results, reinforcing its commitment to advancing smart city solutions. Overall, EIP-SCC serves as a crucial platform for collaboration and innovation in the realm of smart cities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b165dd4582e70acf9bca3d12028767fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e237a48ad98792e9118fcb292819faee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77b573e7bb5a4593f8be0bc8fdb90d44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aee7be6462d19ea3f06423c876252cf7</data>
