  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Innovation Tracking and Data Management is a task aimed at creating an integrated approach for capturing and sharing knowledge assets within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Innovation Tracking and Data Management is a task aimed at developing a strategy for Knowledge Management and intellectual property rights within the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;Innovation Tracking and Data Management refers to task T1.4 that aims to develop methods for tracking innovations and managing information in the CoEvolution project.</data>
