<node id="Patents">
  <data key="d0">Patents</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Patents are a crucial aspect of the CoEvolution project, serving as legal protections for the innovative technologies developed throughout the initiative. The project aims to file at least three patents to safeguard the intellectual property generated as a result of its outcomes. These patents represent the legal rights granted for inventions, highlighting CoEvolution's commitment to preserving and protecting its technological advancements. Overall, the pursuit of patents is integral to achieving the objectives set forth by the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-04015f7fafd71cfbdff147b595674db3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8536b77a28a4d77fb291854c1693e874&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75efa432cb6a9347528127bab93b2e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1c9f3141d753938298cb0137770fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9cd2acaeb0d9437c3f09baa7c94ddf8</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425744</data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge Management and IPR Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Management and IPR Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Knowledge Management and IPR Strategy is a comprehensive plan formulated during the CoEvolution project aimed at effectively managing knowledge and intellectual property rights. This strategy focuses on identifying, capturing, retrieving, and managing the information and knowledge assets generated throughout the course of the project. It delineates specific methods for how these assets will be identified, managed, and utilized, thereby ensuring that they contribute to maximizing innovation impact. Overall, the Knowledge Management and IPR Strategy represents a structured approach to enhancing both knowledge management and intellectual property management within the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59ff7acc22c62d7a4184fa090eb2a7c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba1c9f3141d753938298cb0137770fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04015f7fafd71cfbdff147b595674db3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee7f9cc09dacb04da20b5e541d35880</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1755425744</data>
</node>
<node id="Security Challenges">
