<node id="Rajarshi Das">
  <data key="d0">Rajarshi Das</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rajarshi Das is a researcher who focuses on managing power consumption and performance in computing systems through the application of reinforcement learning techniques. He has contributed significantly to this field, with noteworthy publications dating back to 2007. Das is recognized as an author and expert in discussing the intersection of reinforcement learning and power management, highlighting his work on systems optimization. His research encompasses the development of methodologies aimed at improving performance while effectively managing power consumption in computing environments.</data>
