<node id="Hoi Chan">
  <data key="d0">Hoi Chan</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hoi Chan is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of power management and performance through the application of reinforcement learning. In 2007, Hoi Chan was part of a team that studied these topics, leading to the publication of important research. His work extends to various studies concerning power consumption management and is frequently cited in related literature. Additionally, Hoi Chan actively participates in projects specifically focusing on energy management within AI systems, further demonstrating his commitment to the integration of reinforcement learning in enhancing power and performance management strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baf120bd02482c6b5e1ef64c734077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19c3df02680dda5cc2badd5ac6d69054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3cd138afdd4c8ce77f816e48769d91</data>
