<node id="Jeffrey O. Kephart">
  <data key="d0">Jeffrey O. Kephart</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jeffrey O. Kephart is a prominent researcher known for his contributions to advancing optimization techniques in artificial intelligence (AI) through the application of reinforcement learning. He has co-authored significant research focused on power management and energy efficiency, specifically addressing power consumption in computing systems. His work has highlighted the potential of reinforcement learning in effectively managing systems, with notable discussions in publications dating back to 2007. Through these efforts, Jeffrey O. Kephart has played a key role in enhancing the understanding and implementation of optimization strategies in various technological contexts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baf120bd02482c6b5e1ef64c734077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19c3df02680dda5cc2badd5ac6d69054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3cd138afdd4c8ce77f816e48769d91</data>
