<node id="David Levine">
  <data key="d0">David Levine</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">David Levine is a researcher recognized for his contributions to the study of power consumption and performance management, particularly through the application of reinforcement learning. His work, which includes publications dating back to 2007, emphasizes management strategies for energy consumption in artificial intelligence (AI) systems. Levine has been mentioned as an author discussing the broader aspects of performance management in computing systems, highlighting his expertise and influence in this field. His research not only focuses on optimizing performance but also addresses the critical issue of energy efficiency in various technological applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-982f3025d9a427791d44ea6a2957bf9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47baf120bd02482c6b5e1ef64c734077&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19c3df02680dda5cc2badd5ac6d69054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de3cd138afdd4c8ce77f816e48769d91</data>
