  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Freeman L. Rawson III focuses on the performance aspects of machine learning systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Freeman L. Rawson III is a researcher known for his significant contributions to the management of power consumption and performance in computing systems through the application of reinforcement learning. He has been active in this field since at least 2007, when he published work specifically focused on power management using reinforcement learning techniques. In addition to his publications, Freeman L. Rawson III is noted as an author who has contributed to various studies related to reinforcement learning and its implications for computing systems. His research also extends to performance management in artificial intelligence (AI) systems, highlighting his expertise in optimizing both power usage and system performance.</data>
