  <data key="d0">Kristof Van Moffaert</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Kristof Van Moffaert is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of multi-objective reinforcement learning. He co-authored a paper on scalarized multi-objective reinforcement learning, where he presented novel design techniques that enhance the understanding and implementation of these approaches. His research, which includes work on multi-objective reinforcement learning design techniques, has been published, with notable contributions dating back to 2013. Overall, Van Moffaert's work focuses on advancing the methodologies and applications within the multi-objective reinforcement learning domain, particularly through scalarization strategies.</data>
