  <data key="d2">Multi-objective reinforcement learning aims to solve problems with multiple, conflicting objectives, producing Pareto-optimal solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective reinforcement learning is a subset of reinforcement learning that focuses on optimizing multiple, potentially conflicting objectives.</data>
