  <data key="d0">Pareto Frontier</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Pareto Frontier in this context represents the set of optimal solutions where no objective can be improved without degrading another.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pareto Frontier is a set of optimal solutions in multi-objective optimization where no objective can be improved without worsening another.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2b22cc6f8a153f6e262c2284ced50068&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4db265e7c9ab51303f55c5c0f855e6e6</data>
