  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Training and Data Management Phase Defences in CoEvolution focus on establishing defenses related to the training, testing, and validation of AI models to enhance robustness against attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Training and Data Management Phase Defences include strategies related to data collection, cleaning, and management aimed at bolstering AI model resilience against attacks.</data>
