  <data key="d0">Teacher/Student Networks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Teacher/Student Networks are frameworks used in defensive distillation within ensemble models to enhance robustness against adversarial attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;Teacher/Student Networks refer to a specific mechanism within ensemble learning used to enhance robustness against adversarial attacks through cooperative learning between models.</data>
