<node id="KPI-UC2.1">
  <data key="d0">KPI-UC2.1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI-UC2.1 is a key performance indicator focused on measuring the efficiency in mitigating cyber-attacks in vehicle perception, such as geo-localization and multi-object detection.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.1 is a key performance indicator measuring efficiency in mitigating cyber-attack impacts on the CAV’s perception engine, including geo-localization and multi-object detection.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.1 measures the efficiency in mitigating attacks in terms of the CAV's geo-localization.</data>
