  <data key="d0">KPI-UC2.2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI-UC2.2 assesses the deviation of the originally planned trajectory after the attack mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.2 is a key performance indicator assessing the deviation between the originally planned trajectory and the modified trajectory after a cyber-attack mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.2 measures the deviation of planned trajectories after the mitigation of cyber-attacks on vehicle planning systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
