<node id="KPI-UC2.3">
  <data key="d0">KPI-UC2.3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI-UC2.3 focuses on the curvature of trajectory planning before and after the cyber-attack.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.3 is a key performance indicator that evaluates the curvature of trajectory planning before and after a cyber-attack.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.3 is a key performance indicator that assesses curvature changes in trajectory planning before and after an attack.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887086309908477c67923883cfe88f91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
