  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">KPI-UC2.4 evaluates the energy overhead in computational resources during attack mitigation.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.4 is a key performance indicator that measures the computational resources allocated to mitigate cyber-attack impacts on the CAV.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.4 focuses on the energy overhead related to computational resources used for mitigating cyber-attacks during vehicle operation.</data>
