<edge source="European Commission" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">152.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution aims to shape the policy strategies for the European Commission based on its research outputs.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution aligns its methodology and objectives with the strategic goals of the European Commission, particularly around gender equality in innovation.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a collaborative project operating under the framework of the HORIZON initiative, prominently funded and overseen by the European Commission. The project aims to shape policies and strategies that align with the objectives of the European Commission, particularly in enhancing AI security. CoEvolution's objectives resonate with the Commission's efforts to develop regulatory frameworks for AI safety, ensuring its deliverables closely match the Commission's policy strategies.

The European Commission not only provides financial support to CoEvolution but also plays a vital role in regulatory oversight. It administers the grant agreement for the project on behalf of the European Union, ensuring compliance with established EU regulations throughout the funding process. This includes receiving funding approvals and managing the financial contributions associated with CoEvolution. To maintain adherence to EU funding regulations, the project is subject to audits and reviews conducted by the European Commission, which assesses its compliance with EU grant management standards.

In summary, CoEvolution represents a significant initiative aimed at strengthening AI policy and security, supported by the European Commission through robust financial and regulatory frameworks, thereby contributing to the development of effective AI safety regulations.</data>
  <data key="d8">7,EU project,administration,collaboration,compliance,ethical AI,funding,funding governance,funding relationship,government policy,grant oversight,granting authority,influence,organizational alignment,organizational collaboration,oversight,policy alignment,policy development,policy influence,project administration,project funding,project governance,project influence,project oversight,project regulation,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,research impact,strategic influence</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63daf77ed4db04707c5e7f33947f8edf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc6fbf5dd7af05fd0e193c115784651e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83520039a2f79f9b345e28a4597ef09b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da375f8b4e8a6a6ffe987d5b6505217a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84cf7d8377823cd2796ee572ef8df58e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d56ef1cf53c2212152cd66342d256a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b94df68d0d67efc3c4a863e29734fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b12294f744da8f2db1893e5324f5ccd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-897fe30d76da92eef8ab39f6f37362da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-153d0d25b1dc6cfa0bcf7a7947b40d51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b345cada8d617efdc8dbd31168fa0f9b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340cab0aeae7a8a4e864f5fb97fb2b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed127c900f359169178e10d5facbb50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce05917392d14a6ff1f6d80ad2f3e51f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66775d2ca4e61f236e59e3423f42a76e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df83794707f70c47ca48cb0487b40957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e989c1f120fe4fad4e22404bc5b4449</data>
