<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="AI Act">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The AI Act and the CoEvolution Project are intrinsically linked through their shared focus on compliance, safety, and trustworthiness in artificial intelligence (AI) applications. The AI Act sets forth a regulatory framework that emphasizes the importance of these elements, influencing the operational parameters of the CoEvolution Project. In turn, the CoEvolution Project actively addresses the regulatory needs identified by the AI Act, ensuring that its objectives are in alignment with the Act's emphasis on security and trust. By guaranteeing compliance with the AI Act, the CoEvolution Project not only adheres to the new regulatory standards for AI applications but also reinforces its commitment to fostering a secure and trustworthy AI ecosystem.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI safety,project alignment,project goals,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-181669b03e4ddc55f13a32a92489775e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb9701b9fcb1c10b2c9b20f3e1b27700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-932990ed344e37eccd1a99284c64597c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f58584ea79a787e820a9f9468f6603f</data>
