  <data key="d7">ICCS is involved in various tasks within the CoEvolution Project, contributing to architecture and security assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Project includes the participation of ICCS, which plays a significant role as a contributor across various aspects of the initiative. Specifically, ICCS is involved in Task 4.2, where it focuses on developing security-oriented methodologies for AI models. As a key beneficiary of the CoEvolution Project, ICCS contributes to the project's overall objectives and development through its engagement in several tasks and areas of research.&lt;SEP&gt;ICCS participates in the CoEvolution project, contributing to its dissemination and communication efforts.</data>
