  <data key="d6">41.0</data>
  <data key="d7">ISI collaborates with the CoEvolution Project in managing outreach to relevant projects and initiatives.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Project involves multiple beneficiaries working collaboratively toward shared goals and deliverables, with ISI playing a significant role in its development. ISI is responsible for leading Task 3.3, which focuses on architectural frameworks, indicating its pivotal involvement in the project. Additionally, ISI contributes its expertise in various data-related aspects as part of its participation in multiple tasks within the CoEvolution Project. Overall, ISI's contributions are critical to the project's success, highlighting its commitment to advancing the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
