  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Project is significantly advanced through the contributions of UNICA, which participates actively in various capacities. As a participant organization, UNICA focuses on AI-related advancements while also leading Task 4.2. In this leadership role, UNICA is instrumental in developing secure AI model design and training processes. Additionally, UNICA assists with communication and dissemination activities, further highlighting its vital role in achieving the objectives of the CoEvolution Project. Overall, UNICA's multifaceted involvement underscores its commitment to the project's goals and its expertise in the field of artificial intelligence.</data>
