<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="AEGIS">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AEGIS is a key player in the CoEvolution Project, where it is involved in various significant activities. As the leader of the project, AEGIS guides its overall operations and ensures effective communication and dissemination of information. Specifically, AEGIS contributes to Task 3.4 of the CoEvolution Project, where it focuses on the data requirements and goals related to artificial intelligence research. In addition to its leadership role, AEGIS offers its expertise in research as part of the project team and is responsible for leading dissemination activities, ensuring the project's visibility and stakeholder engagement throughout its duration.</data>
