<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine">
  <data key="d6">45.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine is a crucial tool that is being developed as part of the CoEvolution Project. Its primary purpose is to enhance the security of artificial intelligence systems during their operation. Through this initiative, the CoEvolution Project aims to fortify AI systems against potential attacks, ensuring safer and more reliable performance. The development of the Runtime Monitoring Engine reflects the project's commitment to addressing security challenges in the evolving landscape of AI technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Project introduces the AI Cybersecurity Runtime Monitoring Engine to monitor AI systems and prevent security breaches.</data>
