<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="Multi-Objective Deep Reinforcement Learning (MODRL)">
  <data key="d6">25.0</data>
  <data key="d7">MODRL is implemented within the CoEvolution Project to tackle complex AI decision-making challenges where single-objective methods fall short.&lt;SEP&gt;MODRL is utilized in the CoEvolution Project to address complex AI decision-making challenges that require multiple objectives to be managed.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Project employs MODRL to tackle complex decision-making challenges encountered in AI models.</data>
