<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="AI MBOM Repository">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The AI MBOM Repository is a crucial component of the CoEvolution Project, established as a tool to centralize AI model data while ensuring the ongoing evaluation and security of AI systems. It functions as a central repository within the CoEvolution Project's infrastructure, aimed at maintaining and enhancing the trustworthiness of AI models. Through its implementation, the AI MBOM Repository plays a vital role in managing AI model information securely and effectively, contributing to the overall objectives of the CoEvolution Project.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Project establishes the AI MBOM Repository to enhance monitoring and evaluation processes for AI model information.</data>
