<edge source="CoEvolution Project" target="DIE">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Project is a collaborative initiative in which DIE plays a significant role, specifically leading Task 3.4. This task is dedicated to exploring various data-related aspects, which are vital to the project's overarching goals. DIE's responsibilities within Task 3.4 include facilitating research on data requirements and handling AI models, as well as focusing on data collection requirements essential for the success of the project. Additionally, DIE is recognized as a contributing partner in the CoEvolution Project, further emphasizing its integral involvement and commitment to advancing the project's objectives.</data>
