<edge source="AI Act" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">74.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to aligning its security assessment solutions with the requirements of the AI Act, underscoring its commitment to the safety and trustworthiness of AI applications. The initiative emphasizes the significance of these principles in the deployment of AI technologies, striving to enhance the ethical use of AI by adhering to the framework established by the AI Act. CoEvolution actively incorporates the principles outlined in the AI Act, positioning safety and trust at the core of its objectives in the development and application of AI. Furthermore, the AI Act serves as a regulatory context for CoEvolution's goals, highlighting the importance of managing risk levels associated with AI technologies. Overall, CoEvolution's efforts reflect a strong alignment with the safety and trust principles set forth by the AI Act, reinforcing its commitment to responsible AI deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project aligns with the objectives of the AI Act, focusing on enhancing security and compliance in AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project aligns with the objectives of the AI Act by addressing safety and compliance issues in AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d8">ethical AI,legislative alignment,project alignment,project objectives,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,safety,safety enhancement,safety standards,security compliance,security emphasis</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e6f41ca720ca6805e6230d8c394f058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bdd45e641a1d84d501219cd34c72fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02286c7e1707a806f9e9959dada558a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa49b759b9aace6986ad6fa60df42057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a296b5c4f24ed1a5eae98b2e605e9835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d36effac07d2e19625fcc31b88101b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bbd9a2bb872299c973114830584e0f5</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426364</data>
</edge>
<edge source="AI Act" target="Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The AI Act is an initiative within the Horizon Europe framework aimed at regulating AI technologies for safety and trustworthiness.</data>
