<edge source="AIMBOM" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">49.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AIMBOM is part of the CoEvolution project's framework, aimed at enhancing AI model descriptions and compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;AIMBOM plays a crucial role in the CoEvolution project, serving as a foundational element in the management of AI model risks and descriptions. CoEvolution leverages AIMBOM to improve both the description and management of AI models within its security assessment framework. This structured approach ensures that the management of AI models is effective in terms of security and robustness. Furthermore, AIMBOM is integral to the CoEvolution project as it facilitates the effective management of AI models throughout the supply chain.&lt;SEP&gt;The AIMBOM provides a framework for describing AI models within the context of the CoEvolution project's objectives.</data>
