<edge source="HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">462.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a prominent project that is funded by the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 initiative, a key component of the European Union's research funding programs focused on enhancing advancements in cybersecurity. This initiative emphasizes collaboration and innovation, aligning CoEvolution with its specific objectives aimed at addressing pressing issues related to cybersecurity, particularly through the lens of artificial intelligence (AI).

The primary focus of the CoEvolution project is the development of advanced cybersecurity solutions that incorporate AI technologies along with robust security features. It adheres to the guidelines established by the HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 initiative, showcasing a commitment to tackling critical challenges posed by AI innovations within the cybersecurity domain.

CoEvolution actively collaborates with multiple beneficiaries, underscoring its vital role in fostering innovation, standardization, and the implementation of enhanced cybersecurity measures across Europe. Through its efforts, CoEvolution contributes significantly to the European Union's broader mission to drive innovation in this crucial sector, thereby solidifying its position as a key player in advancing cybersecurity research. The HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 serves not only as the project identifier but also as the grant agreement that establishes the funding relationship and operational framework for CoEvolution.</data>
