<edge source="HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01" target="Project 101168560">
  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 refers to an initiative that funds various projects, one of which is Project 101168560. Project 101168560, also known as the CoEvolution project, operates under the funding framework of HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 and is specifically focused on advancements in artificial intelligence (AI). The descriptions highlight that HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 details the financial rules and structure for Project 101168560, emphasizing its role as a key project within the broader initiative.</data>
