  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 is a funding initiative established by the European Union to support various research and innovation projects. This program is governed by the European Union, which provides the necessary funding and regulatory framework for its activities. Through HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01, the European Union facilitates the financing of projects such as CoEvolution, ensuring that they align with its broader research and innovation goals. Overall, HORIZON-CL3-2023-CS-01 plays a crucial role in advancing collaborative efforts in research under the auspices of the European Union.</data>
