<edge source="Belgium" target="EU General Court">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Belgium is the jurisdiction in which the EU General Court is located, playing a crucial role in overseeing legal matters concerning grants and disputes related to EU beneficiaries. Legal conflicts stemming from various agreements may be resolved in Belgium's courts or by the EU General Court. The EU General Court operates under Belgian law, which influences its jurisdiction and legal proceedings.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU General Court operates under the jurisdiction of Belgium concerning cases involving EU law.</data>
  <data key="d8">dispute resolution,jurisdiction,legal framework,legal jurisdiction,legal matters,legal venue</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-6f94199efc5d89e82849d9cfe93dfb68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418889b13888444f1b331214c79d5c44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675b33dd17c4669f5a8bcc3fc405a6a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2800fd1db09254940cc4a13a8d3cb57c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0796cf55497f532b00e0a5347e46781a</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426167</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Belgium" target="EU Court of Justice">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Belgium is involved in disputes concerning the jurisdiction of the EU Court of Justice, particularly regarding issues that affect non-EU beneficiaries. The EU Court of Justice functions as an appellate body for disputes that arise under both Belgian law and EU law, signifying its role in interpreting legislation that impacts Belgium. Additionally, the court addresses legal matters within Belgium that are related to European Union laws and appeals, thereby underscoring its comprehensive jurisdiction over such issues.</data>
  <data key="d8">judicial authority,jurisdiction,legal authority,legal framework,legal interpretation,legal oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-2800fd1db09254940cc4a13a8d3cb57c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-418889b13888444f1b331214c79d5c44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675b33dd17c4669f5a8bcc3fc405a6a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0796cf55497f532b00e0a5347e46781a</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426169</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Belgium" target="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement">
  <data key="d6">28.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement governs operations within the jurisdiction of Belgium and follows its laws.&lt;SEP&gt;The terms of the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement are governed by the laws of Belgium.&lt;SEP&gt;The provisions of the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement are governed by the laws of Belgium.</data>
  <data key="d8">jurisdiction,legal governance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-d9af1226bfbc3ea69059eb3576fcaf4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8daee7887465a1bbc64f6da189934ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c811c5c2da7facca7b18e0019c9ea9e</data>
