<edge source="Personnel Costs" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">24.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Personnel Costs are part of the budgeting process for the CoEvolution project under the Horizon Program.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project has specific guidelines for calculating Eligible Personnel Costs under its budget proposals.&lt;SEP&gt;Personnel costs represent a significant portion of CoEvolution’s budget, indicating the project's resource allocation toward human resources.</data>
