<edge source="ICCS" target="EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON">
  <data key="d6">17.0</data>
  <data key="d7">ICCS is the legal abbreviation for the EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON, indicating it is the coordinating organization for the CoEvolution project.&lt;SEP&gt;ICCS manages the CoEvolution project in which EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO contributes its expertise in communication systems.</data>
  <data key="d8">abbreviation,organization involvement,organization role,project collaboration</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-3d16a55d1d3dc5f1ef6966990760ab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
