  <data key="d11">1755419878</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ICCS" target="CoEvolution">
  <data key="d6">370.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution project is coordinated by the International Centre for Climate Studies (ICCS), which serves as the lead beneficiary responsible for managing the project's activities and objectives. ICCS plays a pivotal role in the CoEvolution initiative, overseeing project management and communication, which are essential for the project's success. Under Agreement No. 101168560, ICCS defines the project's scope and manages day-to-day operations and processes.

As the lead organization, ICCS not only coordinates key deliverables but also oversees administrative and financial responsibilities throughout the project lifecycle. It actively leads Work Package 1, focusing on essential project management tasks such as the development of the Project Manual, a crucial resource for the consortium's members. Additionally, ICCS contributes to the development of synthetic data for evaluation, applying its technological and research expertise to produce important outputs.

ICCS brings valuable expertise in open-source projects to the CoEvolution consortium, fostering collaboration among its members and supporting an interdisciplinary approach to achieving the project's goals. In particular, ICCS's specialized knowledge in the areas of cybersecurity and artificial intelligence aligns closely with the objectives of CoEvolution, enhancing the effectiveness of the project. As part of its contributions, ICCS focuses on analyzing risks and enhancing security strategies within AI systems, thereby addressing crucial components related to AI security.

Overall, ICCS's leadership, technical knowledge, and extensive contributions are indispensable for advancing the CoEvolution initiative, emphasizing its critical role in ensuring the project's success and achieving meaningful research outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d8">7,9,administrative coordination,collaboration,collaborative work,community engagement,consortium contribution,consortium partnership,consortium role,contribution,coordination,cybersecurity focus,data generation,evaluation support,expertise contribution,lead beneficiary,lead organization,leadership,management,management responsibility,milestone leadership,open-source,open-source expertise,operational role,organization contribution,organization leadership,organizational effort,organizational leadership,partnership,project collaboration,project contribution,project coordination,project initiation,project involvement,project leadership,project management,project participation,research collaboration,research contribution,research support,responsibility,scope definition,technological collaboration,technology development</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-dc3ec14a8116e38b696429a7687340d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16a849a6c0719d6015ef6c319e7b3a4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f179be12e924e7455c61badff1b4c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64a23b1d8ad6fd3128ebdb600d00c5bd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd182fd514d7984966c94b99cabf64e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df83794707f70c47ca48cb0487b40957&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-beda666afc02f488950a3cdbad5279e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce227760b6961446d68e3a6677a900b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d73074b1924aa842a3445bc526263079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d16a55d1d3dc5f1ef6966990760ab1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e5bd329614b1182e2be9469625326eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b26ea5c9fd025a1c37710d2d39cf836d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51eaae3a3d54576dbf82c1b062f1bf4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11c94330a60dc34a0bfa60748253c8dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef356bf47d4a7662b1eebd219b6efecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c84806ce6d96fb7e10ee2de2ef7fc30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c8a90d0356b7b59238f88457856e99b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c07f9e21489aa565e0113a4b396d22a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5954618a5ba5f9a63e629b838f5a752e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75efa432cb6a9347528127bab93b2e22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-089ed2fed176c26ba2d2a44622231ee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-812fdbf446b497f8be08cbf393777bcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ca60b53f4fb08a71c2cabf42d2f6530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b067a273693cb100c626ffac8631e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd021e77c6a98f8d589a96e248297baf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909ff0598aa7c312fae851a154fae81b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-629a66671e0d7bfd5b1d963981d598c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c37b90adda874cb8932da7490275709&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e00a0c381689061b9602b16e3966e85a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3b7d48470cd2d0de2fb4466e3c766fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d798311ba09f5fcfd50eafd690ade83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-017e7c3267b01fc259f8929e89a0b812&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7dc9d50812a1d240d82e3f1a2d7627af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72e3d6c0adc259c792912cb22e5365cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3601f2df51a8a247b13dc91952cf725&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c8f906156d591b56c5d91cad01ec85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-058ed07f1aefaf589dd90391c1ba40a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad