<edge source="ICCS" target="TID">
  <data key="d6">29.0</data>
  <data key="d7">ICCS and TID are engaged in a collaborative project where ICCS participates in Task 4.3, which is led by TID. This establishes a direct relationship between the two entities in their project collaboration. TID takes the lead on tasks related to AI security, in which ICCS also participates to improve the overall project outcomes. Moreover, TID is involved in quality assurance and risk management activities overseen by ICCS, ensuring that both entities work together to maintain high standards throughout the project. Additionally, they collaborate to conduct assessments for gender equality and to ensure quality assurance, further reinforcing their commitment to a comprehensive and inclusive project framework.</data>
