  <data key="d6">36.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON is a prominent institution actively involved in the CoEvolution project, which aims to enhance cybersecurity and technological capacity. Serving as the Coordinator of the CoEvolution project, this institution plays a central role in the management and oversight of the initiative. Additionally, it is recognized as a key partner in the CoEvolution grant agreement, further solidifying its position as a leading body in the project's development and execution. The EREVNITIKO PANEPISTIMIAKO INSTITOUTO SYSTIMATON EPIKOINONION KAI YPOLOGISTON facilitates valuable academic contributions to the Horizon Europe program through its engagement in the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d8">academic contribution,coordination,core partner,organization role,project coordination,project involvement,project leadership,project participation</data>
