<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d6">124.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project funded under the Horizon Europe program, establishing a significant relationship with this prominent research initiative aimed at enhancing research and innovation across various fields within the European Union. The primary focus of CoEvolution is on advancing artificial intelligence (AI) security and trustworthiness, contributing to the broader objectives of Horizon Europe, which supports innovative developments. 

CoEvolution aligns its policies and data management practices with the guidelines provided by Horizon Europe, particularly in the areas of open access and research integrity. Furthermore, the project incorporates methodologies and strategies for gender research, demonstrating a commitment to inclusive and diverse approaches. Overall, CoEvolution plays a crucial role within Horizon Europe by advancing key technological areas while ensuring compliance with EU priorities. Its participation within the Horizon Europe framework highlights its connection to broader research and innovation efforts in Europe, benefiting from the funding and research standards established by this initiative.</data>
  <data key="d8">EU funding,EU initiative,collaboration,framework influence,funding,funding alignment,funding continuity,funding program,initiative affiliation,policy compliance,project development,project funding,project support,project transition,research alignment,research collaboration,research framework,research funding,research initiative,research integrity</data>
