<edge source="CoEvolution" target="SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT">
  <data key="d6">55.0</data>
  <data key="d7">SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT, a prominent entity in the technology sector, is actively participating in the CoEvolution project. As a pivotal contributor, Siemens brings industry insights, technological solutions, and innovations to the initiative, significantly enhancing the collaboration focused on the development of artificial intelligence models. The company provides its extensive technical expertise and resources, applying its knowledge to foster innovation in secure AI solutions. Furthermore, Siemens is not only a participant but also acts as a beneficiary of the project, highlighting its commitment to investing in the advancement of the CoEvolution initiative. Through these contributions, SIEMENS AKTIENGESELLSCHAFT aims to enhance the development of cutting-edge AI technologies, playing a crucial role in the project's overall objectives.</data>
