<edge source="CoEvolution" target="SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG">
  <data key="d6">58.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a collaborative initiative that includes SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG as a key associated partner. In this capacity, SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG plays a significant role in implementing the project by offering its technological expertise and solutions. The company not only serves as a beneficiary of the CoEvolution project but also actively engages in its endeavors, particularly by leading Work Package 3. This work package is crucial as it focuses on defining the specifications and requirements essential for the project's success. Additionally, SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG contributes its advanced technology solutions to enhance AI security, thus supporting the overarching objectives of the CoEvolution initiative. Through its contributions, SPHYNX TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AG ensures that the project moves forward effectively, integrating innovative technological approaches.</data>
  <data key="d8">8,collaboration,contribution,leadership,partner,project contribution,project involvement,project participation,project partnership,project specifications,task implementation,technological solutions,technology expertise,technology solutions,technology support</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-3cd6f072e1b8e8ae5414ff101a0d6b5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c07f9e21489aa565e0113a4b396d22a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce227760b6961446d68e3a6677a900b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb38bd592e74cfd0c261f9fdcdf9aba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-513280f6927e9d616d879baf249f9364&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b067a273693cb100c626ffac8631e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef356bf47d4a7662b1eebd219b6efecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdf2425f890b3ae59f4929d1cd4a0994</data>
