<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AEGIS">
  <data key="d6">333.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AEGIS is an integral entity within the CoEvolution project, collaborating with various participants to contribute significantly to the initiative's success. As a prominent member of the CoEvolution consortium, AEGIS focuses on integrating security considerations into artificial intelligence (AI), which is a core objective of this collaborative effort. The organization oversees critical deliverables related to data management, innovation tracking, and ethical oversight, all of which are essential for advancing the CoEvolution project.

In its capacity as a lead beneficiary, AEGIS plays a pivotal role in managing and executing the project's milestones, beginning with the vital bootstrapping phase that lays the foundation for its advancement. Additionally, AEGIS spearheads outreach and communication efforts to ensure effective dissemination of the project's objectives and results to relevant stakeholders.

AEGIS is particularly responsible for leading tasks centered on innovation tracking and data management, ensuring that research and innovation activities are aligned with market needs. The organization commits to developing comprehensive data management plans while prioritizing ethical compliance with EU regulations, aiming to embed ethical considerations throughout the CoEvolution initiative. This commitment strengthens the security and resilience of AI models within the project's framework.

In summary, AEGIS coordinates various tasks and work packages within the CoEvolution project, driving technical efforts and ensuring security assurance. Its strategic involvement, robust project management, compliance, and governance efforts establish AEGIS as a key actor in advancing AI research and integration, thus playing a crucial role as a small and medium-sized enterprise (SME) in achieving the project’s goals and activities.&lt;SEP&gt;AEGIS leads the CoEvolution project, orchestrating dissemination and communication efforts to enhance AI security.</data>
