<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Artificial Intelligence Act">
  <data key="d6">86.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is an initiative dedicated to ensuring compliance with the proposed Artificial Intelligence Act, emphasizing ethical oversight and trustworthy management of artificial intelligence. The project actively monitors the European Union's approach to this legislation, aiming to harmonize its outcomes with the guidelines established in the Act. Through continuous assessment of the implications of the Artificial Intelligence Act, CoEvolution effectively navigates the evolving legal standards in the field of AI. The initiative is committed to enhancing trustworthiness and security in AI systems, aligning its objectives with the regulatory requirements of the Act to foster a responsible and ethical approach to artificial intelligence. Overall, CoEvolution prioritizes ethical data use and compliance, ensuring its activities remain relevant and aligned with the proposed regulations.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI governance,AI regulation,AI safety,compliance,ethical AI,ethical standards,project alignment,project compliance,regulation,regulation compliance,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance,regulatory impact,regulatory monitoring,trustworthiness</data>
