<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Task 2.4">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Task 2.4 is a critical component of the CoEvolution project, dedicated to addressing and enhancing exploitation and sustainability to ensure the continuity of the project's results. This task emphasizes sustainability and exploitation activities specifically related to the outcomes of the CoEvolution project. It aims to investigate market sustainability for these outcomes and outlines various exploitation activities designed to maintain the project's continuity even after its completion.</data>
