<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Project 101168560">
  <data key="d6">57.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is the name of Project 101168560, which involves creating a STR (Strategic Threat Response) assessment solution for the AI landscape. This project encompasses various activities and goals related to AI development, with a specific emphasis on fostering collaboration in the field of cybersecurity. Additionally, Project 101168560, also known as the CoEvolution project, is financed under European Union guidelines, ensuring adherence to regulatory frameworks while advancing the objectives of the initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is the title of the project under which Project 101168560 is being developed, focusing on AI model security.".&lt;SEP&gt;Project 101168560 refers to the CoEvolution initiative, which is structured to comply with EU regulations and promote innovation.</data>
