<edge source="CoEvolution" target="European Commission's AI Act">
  <data key="d6">25.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution seeks to establish a framework that complies with the guidelines set forth by the European Commission's AI Act.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project aligns with the goals of the European Commission's AI Act by focusing on secure AI practices and addressing the related challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution's objectives align with the goals of the European Commission's AI Act, focusing on enhancing security and trust in AI models.</data>
