<edge source="CoEvolution" target="EU High-Level Expert Group on AI (AI HLEG)">
  <data key="d6">66.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution aims to align its security and trust standards with the guidelines set by the EU High-Level Expert Group on AI.".&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an organization committed to enhancing trust and fairness in artificial intelligence systems. Its objectives are closely aligned with the directives and principles set forth by the EU High-Level Expert Group on AI (AI HLEG). CoEvolution is dedicated to adhering to and implementing these guidelines, which advocate for the development of AI that meets established standards of trustworthiness and fairness.

To achieve these aims, CoEvolution is actively developing frameworks that are in accordance with the recommendations of the EU HLEG. This collaborative effort ensures that the AI models they work with not only comply with best practices but also uphold the critical standards promoted by the EU HLEG. Through these initiatives, CoEvolution demonstrates its commitment to fostering a responsible and ethical approach to AI development.</data>
