<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Bayesian Techniques">
  <data key="d6">28.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Bayesian Techniques are set to be thoroughly investigated within the context of CoEvolution. The primary goal of this exploration is to enhance algorithm calibration and mitigate risks associated with overconfidence in decision-making. Through this research, CoEvolution aims to improve the reliability and performance of algorithms across various applications, particularly in safety-critical environments. By leveraging Bayesian techniques, CoEvolution aspires to advance decision-making algorithms, ensuring greater reliability and effectiveness in their operational capabilities.</data>
