<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Genetic Algorithms">
  <data key="d6">60.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is an innovative entity that applies Genetic Algorithms as a crucial component of its strategy to enhance cybersecurity measures. By focusing on the continuous evolution of context vectors, CoEvolution improves AI's ability to address dynamic environments and emerging threats. The utilization of Genetic Algorithms allows CoEvolution to dynamically adapt and optimize context vectors over time, leading to a system that is increasingly responsive and effective in addressing cybersecurity challenges. This ongoing refinement process ensures that CoEvolution not only enhances its overall performance but also remains well-equipped to tackle a range of cybersecurity threats as they arise.</data>
