  <data key="d6">26.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution aims to enhance security in the AI Supply Chain Ecosystem by implementing various security measures and tools.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution seeks to establish an AI supply chain ecosystem that supports secure and robust AI models for the community.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution aims to provide the foundation for a secure and robust AI Supply Chain Ecosystem, essential for the deployment of AI technologies.</data>
