<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Collaborative Learning">
  <data key="d6">78.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution addresses the security and risk assessment challenges associated with Collaborative Learning methodologies in AI development.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an organization focused on enhancing the development and security of AI models through collaborative learning techniques. It addresses cybersecurity challenges within the collaborative learning paradigm, particularly concerning the security of communication flows between AI agents. CoEvolution advocates for innovative approaches that improve the robustness of AI systems, implementing various strategies that leverage collaborative learning methodologies. These efforts are aimed at bolstering the security and durability of AI models throughout their lifecycle, ensuring their protection across different devices.

Moreover, CoEvolution explores collaborative learning as a means to strengthen AI model defenses against adversarial attacks and seeks to implement effective defenses within its collaborative learning approaches. By employing techniques that enable shared knowledge among multiple agents, CoEvolution enhances both the security and performance of AI models, making significant strides in safeguarding against potential cybersecurity threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Collaborative Learning techniques are part of the innovative methods used in CoEvolution to increase AI systems' resistance to attacks.</data>
