<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Siemens">
  <data key="d6">57.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is collaborating with Siemens in a pilot project designed to validate and enhance its framework for improving security within manufacturing supply chains. This partnership focuses on the implementation of CoEvolution's framework to bolster the security and efficiency of artificial intelligence models specifically utilized in manufacturing environments. Siemens plays a pivotal role in this initiative, leading the pilot project that aims to showcase the capabilities and effectiveness of the CoEvolution framework in real-world manufacturing scenarios. Through this collaboration, both entities are working to demonstrate the practical applications of the security enhancements provided by CoEvolution in Siemens' manufacturing processes.</data>
