<edge source="CoEvolution" target="MLDevOps">
  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to establishing secure MLDevOps practices aimed at fostering valid and trustworthy AI model development. By integrating MLDevOps methodologies, CoEvolution enhances the efficiency and collaboration of AI model deployments while ensuring adherence to regulatory frameworks. The project's approach is designed to incorporate security assessments within machine learning development, thereby aligning with best practices in MLDevOps. CoEvolution's framework emphasizes the importance of security and trust throughout the entire AI lifecycle, ultimately supporting operational efficiency and security in AI model deployments.</data>
