<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Solutions">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to enhancing AI Solutions by focusing on security and reliability. The organization strives to provide verifiable frameworks that protect against various adversarial threats while simultaneously improving practices aimed at bolstering the robustness and trustworthiness of these AI systems. Through a comprehensive approach, CoEvolution develops frameworks that specifically target vulnerabilities within AI solutions, ultimately aiming to enhance their overall security and reliability.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI deployment,AI development,AI frameworks,project focus,security,security enhancement,trust enhancement</data>
