<edge source="CoEvolution" target="P4L">
  <data key="d6">78.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"P4L is part of the CoEvolution framework, offering a decentralized solution for collaborative learning.")&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is developing the P4L system as an innovative framework aimed at enhancing decentralized collaborative learning. This approach emphasizes user privacy and eliminates dependence on traditional centralized or external systems. The P4L system is integrated within the broader CoEvolution project, which seeks to address privacy concerns and improve collaborative learning methodologies through a peer-to-peer learning model. CoEvolution presents P4L as a solution that not only enhances decentralized collaborative learning but also bolsters privacy and security measures, effectively resolving the challenges posed by centralized systems.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution proposes the P4L system to improve decentralized collaborative learning processes in AI/ML applications.</data>
