<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AVISENSE Simulation Platform">
  <data key="d6">52.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"The AVISENSE Simulation Platform contributes to CoEvolution by providing simulation tools focused on Autonomous Driving technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution leverages the AVISENSE platform to validate AI software under realistic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution utilizes the AVISENSE Simulation Platform as a key component of its operational strategy, leveraging its capabilities to test AI models in realistic environments. The AVISENSE Simulation Platform plays a crucial role in the CoEvolution project, providing vital simulation capabilities necessary for developing software for autonomous vehicles. By integrating with CoEvolution, the AVISENSE Simulation Platform facilitates the creation of virtual test environments that are essential for validating AI operations in real-world scenarios, thus ensuring the reliability and effectiveness of automated vehicle software.</data>
