<edge source="CoEvolution" target="FlecLeCo v2">
  <data key="d6">25.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"FlecLeCo v2's assessment capabilities support the goals of CoEvolution by examining vulnerabilities in AI models against side channel attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;FlecLeCo v2 operates within the CoEvolution framework to assess AI models against security vulnerabilities from side channel attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;FlecLeCo v2's platform for assessing side channel security is utilized in the CoEvolution project to secure AI model implementations.</data>
