  <data key="d11">1755425946</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Federated Learning">
  <data key="d6">93.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"CoEvolution promotes Federated Learning as a key strategy for decentralized AI model development.")&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution applies its defence mechanisms to the Federated Learning paradigm to enhance its security and robustness.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an initiative that integrates techniques from Federated Learning to enhance the privacy, security, and robustness of collaborative AI model training. By exploring various Federated Learning approaches, CoEvolution aims to improve the collaborative training process, ensuring that AI models can be securely trained across diverse devices and environments. This is particularly relevant in applications such as autonomous vehicles, where security is paramount.

In the CoEvolution framework, Federated Learning serves as a crucial component, augmenting the collaborative learning experience while simultaneously preserving privacy. The initiative focuses on implementing security enhancements and adaptations to provide essential defenses against potential attacks, thus fostering a robust and secure environment for AI collaborative learning. Overall, CoEvolution not only supports the principles of Federated Learning but also prioritizes security to safeguard decentralized AI models.</data>
