<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Homomorphic Encryption">
  <data key="d6">66.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a research entity that focuses on enhancing data privacy and security in AI systems through the use of advanced technologies. One of the key techniques they employ is Homomorphic Encryption, which allows for secure computations without compromising data privacy. CoEvolution is actively involved in assessing and researching this encryption method to protect data during both the training and sharing processes of AI models.

By incorporating Homomorphic Encryption, CoEvolution aims to safeguard privacy during AI computations, addressing potential privacy-related threats effectively. Their efforts are directed towards utilizing this advanced encryption technique as a defense strategy, significantly improving privacy protection in various AI applications. Overall, CoEvolution's initiatives center around enhancing the security and privacy of AI models, making Homomorphic Encryption a critical element of their research and development focus.&lt;SEP&gt;Homomorphic Encryption is researched within CoEvolution to safeguard AI model privacy against potential leaks.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI security,cryptographic techniques,data protection,defense technologies,encryption technique,privacy protection,privacy technology,security evaluation,technological evaluation</data>
