<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART)">
  <data key="d6">52.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution employs the ART toolkit as part of its strategy to mitigate adversarial attacks on AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution leverages the ART for implementing defense mechanisms against AI model attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Adversarial Robustness Toolbox (ART) plays a crucial role in the CoEvolution strategy by providing essential tools designed to defend against adversarial attacks targeting AI models. CoEvolution collaborates closely with ART to develop and implement comprehensive defenses that enhance the robustness of AI systems against such threats. Specifically, CoEvolution leverages tools from the ART to strengthen AI models against a variety of adversarial challenges, including both utility-based and privacy-based attacks. This partnership highlights the importance of integrating ART's resources into CoEvolution's approach to ensuring the resilience of AI technologies in the face of adversarial adversities.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI security,attack mitigation,collaboration,defence technology,defense mechanism,defense strategy,defensive strategies,project collaboration,robust systems,tool integration</data>
