</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution" target="SecML">
  <data key="d6">91.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a company dedicated to enhancing the security of artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning (ML) models, leveraging the SecML library to bolster its data protection strategies during both the training and management phases. The partnership between CoEvolution and SecML focuses on fortifying AI models against a range of adversarial attacks, addressing critical security concerns that arise in the development of AI and ML systems. 

CoEvolution is committed to improving the SecML libraries, specifically targeting advancements in defenses during the training phase to mitigate potential adversarial threats. By effectively utilizing SecML’s functionalities, CoEvolution can introduce robust defense methods that enhance the adversarial robustness of its AI models. This collaboration plays a pivotal role in CoEvolution’s efforts to safeguard its AI models from both utility-based and privacy-based adversarial attacks throughout their entire lifecycle.

In summary, CoEvolution’s utilization of the SecML library not only strengthens its models against adversarial threats but also demonstrates a strong commitment to enhancing security in AI development through advanced tools and techniques.</data>
