<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Security Runtime Monitoring Engine">
  <data key="d6">85.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution collaborates closely with the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine to enhance the security and robustness of AI models against potential attacks. As a vital component of CoEvolution, the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine oversees operations related to monitoring and reporting incidents affecting AI model security. Its primary responsibilities include managing updates, reporting adversarial attacks on deployed AI models, overseeing defense updates, and facilitating the decommissioning of AI models when necessary. This collaboration ensures the integrity and security of AI systems across various applications. CoEvolution plays a supportive role, aiding the functions of the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine in managing AI security and incident reporting during operations. Together, they work in tandem to solidify the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine's role as an essential element within the CoEvolution framework.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI management,AI security,defensive strategy,incidence reporting,incident detection,incident reporting,model management,monitoring,operational management,operational oversight,operational security,organizational management,organizational synergy,security collaboration,security management,security oversight,security process</data>
