<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Model">
  <data key="d6">70.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to securing AI Models by integrating defensive measures and innovative gadgets throughout their entire lifecycle. Its primary focus is on improving AI models through continuous updates and robust defense mechanisms, playing a crucial role in enhancing the security and governance of these models. CoEvolution implements ongoing defense updates and safeguards that protect AI Models against various cyber threats, ensuring their resilience and integrity.

In addition to its defensive strategies, CoEvolution emphasizes the importance of transparency and accountability in AI development. It governs the requirements for AI Models by conducting security assessments and making necessary enhancements to mitigate vulnerabilities. By enhancing the robustness of AI models against adversarial attacks, CoEvolution not only contributes to their development but also fortifies their defenses through innovative obfuscation and update processes. This comprehensive approach ensures that AI Models remain secure and effective throughout their operational lifespan.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI development,AI management,AI security,defense mechanisms,defense strategy,ethical practices,focus area,governance,model enhancement,model protection,model security,operational security,security assurance,security enhancement,security measures</data>
