<edge source="CoEvolution" target="EU Artificial Intelligence Act">
  <data key="d6">92.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is an initiative dedicated to ensuring that its AI model frameworks comply with the regulations established by the EU Artificial Intelligence Act. The project focuses on aligning its AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM) with the Act's requirements and guidelines, promoting transparency and trust in AI models while ensuring their ethical deployment. CoEvolution's efforts are specifically designed to uphold the provisions of the EU Artificial Intelligence Act, thereby enhancing compliance and addressing ethical standards in AI development. Through these measures, CoEvolution aims to facilitate the safe and responsible use of AI technologies, aligning its frameworks with the objectives of the Act to support ethical AI development and uphold security standards.</data>
