<edge source="CoEvolution" target="HEU-SECURED">
  <data key="d6">68.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution utilizes HEU-SECURED's libraries to address privacy-based adversarial attacks, enhancing cybersecurity measures.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution utilizes the privacy-preserving technologies and libraries developed by HEU-SECURED to strengthen its cyber resilience frameworks and bolster its defenses against potential adversarial and privacy attacks. By integrating HEU-SECURED's scalable privacy solutions, CoEvolution enhances its capacity to protect against cyber threats, ensuring a robust defense system that effectively addresses various vulnerabilities. The collaboration between these two entities highlights HEU-SECURED's crucial role in supporting CoEvolution's cybersecurity strategies, enabling a more resilient approach to combating emerging cyber risks.</data>
