<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Avalanche">
  <data key="d6">71.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Avalanche plays a pivotal role in supporting CoEvolution's objectives through a strong focus on security defense and incremental learning methodologies. By developing innovative security defenses specifically designed to protect against incremental learning attacks, Avalanche directly contributes to CoEvolution's cybersecurity goals. The incremental security innovations produced by Avalanche are integral to strengthening CoEvolution's strategies for defending against adversarial threats. 

CoEvolution, in turn, employs the methodologies derived from the Avalanche project to enhance its defenses against various attack models. This collaboration allows CoEvolution to gain valuable insights from Avalanche's advancements, which facilitates comprehensive studies on adversarial attacks. Together, the efforts of Avalanche and CoEvolution create a synergistic relationship that aims to improve security measures in response to the constantly evolving landscape of cyber threats. Through this partnership, both entities work collectively towards enhancing security and understanding of adversarial dynamics in the realm of cybersecurity.&lt;SEP&gt;Avalanche's development of incremental security defenses can directly contribute to CoEvolution's goals of mitigating cyber threats.&lt;SEP&gt;Avalanche's development of security defenses supports CoEvolution's objectives in tackling incremental attacks during learning.</data>
