<edge source="CoEvolution" target="HEU-EMERGE">
  <data key="d6">55.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution significantly benefits from the distributed learning studies conducted by HEU-EMERGE, which play a crucial role in enhancing its resilience strategies. By utilizing insights gained from HEU-EMERGE's research, CoEvolution aims to further its artificial intelligence objectives, particularly in improving AI robustness against attacks. The findings from HEU-EMERGE are particularly relevant and actively support the technological capabilities and strategic goals of CoEvolution in the domain of advanced learning methods. Overall, the collaboration between CoEvolution and HEU-EMERGE serves as a prime example of how distributed learning can contribute to strengthening AI systems and aligning with the resilience objectives of CoEvolution.</data>
