<edge source="CoEvolution" target="H2020-I-BIDAAS">
  <data key="d6">58.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Best practices from H2020-I-BIDAAS related to data sharing can inform CoEvolution's implementation strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a project that aims to improve data sharing in industrial environments by building upon the insights and best practices derived from H2020-I-BIDAAS. Leveraging the knowledge acquired from H2020-I-BIDAAS, CoEvolution focuses on breaking down data silos, which fosters enhanced collaborative learning among various stakeholders. The integration of these practices highlights CoEvolution's commitment to advancing its mission through the lessons learned in the field of data sharing. The comprehensive knowledge gathered from H2020-I-BIDAAS directly informs and enhances CoEvolution's strategies for addressing industrial challenges and optimizing data sharing practices. Overall, CoEvolution’s efforts are significantly informed by the foundational work established by H2020-I-BIDAAS, aiming to create a more interconnected and efficient industrial landscape.</data>
