<edge source="CoEvolution" target="H2020-ACCORDION">
  <data key="d6">62.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution integrates advanced machine learning technologies that are derived from the H2020-ACCORDION initiative, which focuses on enhancing safety in machine learning applications. Specifically, CoEvolution benefits from private and leakage-free machine learning technologies developed under the H2020-ACCORDION initiative. This collaboration brings essential expertise in machine learning technologies that are pivotal for CoEvolution's objectives. The initiative contributes vital research and development (R&amp;D) efforts in artificial intelligence (AI), which are crucial for CoEvolution's collaborative framework aimed at secure collaborative learning. Through these advancements, CoEvolution is able to adopt cutting-edge machine learning techniques that enhance its collaborative learning goals, thereby ensuring a robust and secure environment for data analysis and learning processes.&lt;SEP&gt;H2020-ACCORDION's R&amp;D efforts on ML technologies can support CoEvolution's goals for secure collaborative training.</data>
