<edge source="CoEvolution" target="H2020-SPATIAL">
  <data key="d6">60.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that integrates privacy-preserving machine learning (ML) technologies developed in the H2020-SPATIAL project to achieve its objectives. The advancements made by H2020-SPATIAL in privacy-preserving technologies significantly support and enhance CoEvolution's goals, particularly in the realm of artificial intelligence (AI) security. H2020-SPATIAL focuses on developing trustworthy ML technologies, which closely aligns with CoEvolution's objectives, especially regarding implementing secure and privacy-conscious AI systems aimed at countering cyber threats. Additionally, the research and development efforts from H2020-SPATIAL inform CoEvolution's strategies for improving AI robustness, further aiding its drive for secure AI systems.</data>
