<edge source="CoEvolution" target="HEU-ELSA">
  <data key="d6">92.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that builds upon the foundational work of the HEU-ELSA project, utilizing its specialized tools and methodologies to enhance the robustness of artificial intelligence (AI) models. HEU-ELSA plays a vital role by developing essential tools designed to improve AI model robustness, which are crucial for achieving the objectives of CoEvolution. By integrating insights and innovations from HEU-ELSA, CoEvolution aims to extend and refine its strategies, particularly in defending AI models against potential attacks. The robust improvement tools created by HEU-ELSA are instrumental in supporting CoEvolution's efforts to implement continuous updates and enhancements to its methodologies, ultimately strengthening CoEvolution's overall approach to AI model robustness. In summary, HEU-ELSA significantly contributes to the broader objectives of CoEvolution regarding AI development and robustness, with its tools being effectively utilized within CoEvolution's framework.</data>
