  <data key="d6">68.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution intends to deposit project data in Zenodo for ensuring findability and accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a project that actively utilizes Zenodo as its primary platform for depositing research outputs and data. By doing so, CoEvolution aims to enhance the findability and accessibility of its research results, promoting transparency and the proper documentation of its research data. The project is committed to compliance with open data practices, thereby ensuring that its findings are easily discoverable and accessible to the public. Through this initiative, CoEvolution seeks to facilitate the dissemination of its research outputs, utilizing Zenodo as an Open Data repository to guarantee visibility and adherence to best practices in data management.</data>
