  <data key="d6">44.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to offering AI developers a suite of tools and frameworks designed to build robust AI models that can effectively counter adversarial threats. The project focuses on enhancing the security and robustness of AI models by providing valuable resources that assist developers in creating more secure AI systems. Through these comprehensive offerings, CoEvolution aims to empower AI developers to strengthen their models against potential vulnerabilities and enhance their overall integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project provides tools for AI Developers to build secure and robust AI models.</data>
