<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Government and Regulatory Bodies">
  <data key="d6">87.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution involves Government and Regulatory Bodies to support the establishment of standards for AI security.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an initiative that actively collaborates with Government and Regulatory Bodies to establish comprehensive risk and security frameworks specifically tailored for artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This partnership aims to influence AI standards and safety regulations, ensuring they are effective and relevant. Through this collaboration, CoEvolution is positioned to provide valuable frameworks that regulatory entities can utilize to enhance their policies for overseeing AI technologies.

Government and Regulatory Bodies play a crucial role in this relationship, as they are responsible for setting compliance frameworks that guide the CoEvolution project and impact the evaluation of AI-based security systems. They are also essential stakeholders in shaping the standards and requirements that CoEvolution aims to meet. Their involvement helps ensure that the AI systems developed under the CoEvolution initiative conform to existing legal frameworks and standards.

Together, CoEvolution and Government and Regulatory Bodies work towards improving the security of AI technologies, reinforcing the significance of their collaboration in achieving optimal oversight and governance of AI systems.</data>
