<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Technology Companies">
  <data key="d6">91.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution and Technology Companies are engaged in a collaborative initiative focused on enhancing and innovating artificial intelligence (AI) models, with a particular emphasis on improving security frameworks. This partnership allows Technology Companies to leverage CoEvolution's resources and strategies, which are essential for securing their AI supply chains and ensuring data integrity.

Through the security frameworks developed by CoEvolution, Technology Companies are equipped to effectively address a variety of security challenges associated with their AI products. In this collaboration, Technology Companies not only utilize the comprehensive framework provided by CoEvolution to fortify their AI supply chains but also contribute critical tools and insights that enhance the overall security of AI systems.

The cooperation between CoEvolution and Technology Companies aims to establish a more robust and secure environment for the development and deployment of AI technologies, highlighting the essential role of both parties in advancing secure AI practices.</data>
