<edge source="CoEvolution" target="End Users of AI Systems">
  <data key="d6">103.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is an initiative dedicated to improving the security, reliability, and ethical standards of artificial intelligence (AI) systems, specifically aimed at benefiting the End Users of AI Systems. The primary goal of CoEvolution is to develop reliable and trustworthy AI applications across various sectors. By focusing on enhancing the trust and reliability of AI models, CoEvolution seeks to address the specific needs and benefits pertinent to these end users.

The initiative's commitment to advancing AI security is expected to lead to the creation of better and more trustworthy AI applications. This enhancement not only positively impacts the operations of the End Users of AI Systems but also offers significant advantages to various industries that depend on AI technologies. As a direct outcome of the CoEvolution project, End Users of AI Systems will experience heightened security and trust in AI applications, which contributes to a more reliable and ethical AI landscape for all stakeholders involved. Overall, CoEvolution is focused on fostering safe and ethical AI systems that enhance the effectiveness and experience of end users in multiple sectors.</data>
