<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Policy Makers">
  <data key="d6">92.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is an initiative dedicated to delivering frameworks designed to assist policy makers in aligning AI governance with ethical standards and European Union regulations. It recognizes the critical role that policy makers have in shaping the regulatory landscape governing artificial intelligence, and as such, aims to support them in addressing essential governance and ethical considerations during AI development.

By adopting the frameworks provided by CoEvolution, policy makers can ensure compliance with ethical standards in AI governance, thereby enhancing the development of trustworthy AI applications. CoEvolution not only provides these frameworks but also actively promotes improved governance practices by offering recommendations and resources. This guidance is intended to empower policy makers in establishing secure and ethical AI regulations.

Additionally, policy makers are viewed as integral to the process of creating guidelines that arise from advancements made within the CoEvolution project. Ultimately, CoEvolution supports policy makers in the development of comprehensive AI governance frameworks, facilitating their ability to effectively navigate the complexities of the field while upholding principles of ethics and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d8">ethical AI,ethical governance,ethical guideline,framework establishment,governance,guidance,policy alignment,policy assistance,policy development,policy framework,policy support,project engagement,project influence,regulation,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance,regulatory frameworks,regulatory impact</data>
