<edge source="CoEvolution" target="EU">
  <data key="d6">116.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project operating under the auspices of the European Union (EU) with a primary goal of bolstering the EU's defensive capabilities against cyber threats, while ensuring compliance with EU directives related to AI security and trustworthiness. The initiative is dedicated to providing transparent, certifiable, and verifiable security assurances for AI models that are shared across the EU. This endeavor addresses cybersecurity threats and aligns with regulatory standards and European values pertaining to technology development.

The EU actively supports the CoEvolution project as a manifestation of its broader strategy to enhance safety and compliance within artificial intelligence (AI) applications. CoEvolution is funded by the EU as a part of its research and innovation agenda, highlighting the union's commitment to technological advancements. Throughout its execution, CoEvolution must adhere to the legal and ethical standards established by the EU, ensuring that it not only meets regulatory expectations but also fosters trust and accountability within AI technology. As such, CoEvolution plays a vital role in supporting the EU's objectives of strengthening cybersecurity and promoting alignment with the EU's values and ethical standards in technology development, particularly regarding trust and governance in AI.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is aligned with EU directives to ensure trust, reliability, and compliance in AI model security across member states.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is aligned with the EU guidelines and regulations regarding artificial intelligence and data protection.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI governance,AI security,compliance,cybersecurity,ethical standards,funding,project framework,project funding,project governance,project oversight,regional focus,regulatory compliance,regulatory support,research collaboration,security assurance,security standards,strategic alignment</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-95e581cb78a2c2aad223dc49965291dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5704cabfb650f5e43d761190f9a6804e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd07e02da457ab40f95f32db9e1c6587&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e3d753a5ba3bfc0d8c4ec414093b1cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b65321e5c497565cf717aab53e5aa7f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7595c8200e32fa30ada5bd766b8a892&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b977bae012f1a149c35d078f2c64ab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65261df93ed337be33236b9008ec65a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34f1982ab2664c79b22a447094fd7c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a296b5c4f24ed1a5eae98b2e605e9835&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-449cdb7f2dbaf658674f7d17457a5b29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4011fe5c8f325cbfb6257057dcfc79c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d57502f9241a83df154e24913d21904</data>
