<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM)">
  <data key="d6">120.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is responsible for managing the AI Model Bill of Materials (MBOM), a crucial framework designed to ensure the robustness, security, and ethical management of AI models throughout their lifecycles. The MBOM plays an essential role by providing detailed security and performance information that facilitates the tracking of model components, thereby promoting transparency and compliance with industry standards. By employing the MBOM, CoEvolution effectively documents vital information related to security credentials and overall management practices of AI models, ensuring that all stakeholders remain informed and that the models adhere to regulatory requirements.

CoEvolution utilizes the MBOM not only for lifecycle management but also to enhance security assurance and ethical oversight of AI models. This comprehensive approach contributes to a thorough assessment of AI models, reinforcing their security and integrity within the CoEvolution project. Overall, the integration of the MBOM allows CoEvolution to align its practices with regulatory standards, thereby fostering responsible and secure AI model management.</data>
  <data key="d8">9,accountability,documentation,ethical management,framework management,lifecycle management,lifecycle oversight,lifecycle tracking,management,model management,model tracking,regulatory compliance,security,security documentation,security framework,security management,security tracking,standards adherence,transparency</data>
