<edge source="CoEvolution" target="European Data Governance ACT">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that seeks to integrate the principles and regulations established by the European Data Governance ACT into its operational framework for responsible data management. The design of CoEvolution is carefully aligned with the requirements set forth by the European Data Governance ACT, particularly regarding the establishment of secure AI systems. The primary objectives of CoEvolution emphasize adherence to the principles of the European Data Governance ACT, focusing on effective data governance within artificial intelligence contexts. Furthermore, CoEvolution is specifically structured to ensure compliance with the regulations pertaining to data usage in AI systems as mandated by the European Data Governance ACT, thereby promoting proper data handling practices in AI models.</data>
  <data key="d8">compliance,data governance,ethical standards,governance,regulation,regulatory alignment,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework compliance</data>
