<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Researchers and Developers">
  <data key="d6">88.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AI Researchers and Developers are integral to the CoEvolution project, which aims to enhance the security, reliability, and ethical standards of artificial intelligence systems. Through their collaboration with CoEvolution, these professionals not only contribute to advancements in the field but also gain valuable insights that drive innovation in AI development. CoEvolution focuses on equipping AI Researchers and Developers with advanced tools, techniques, and frameworks to build more secure AI models, ensuring compliance with established security standards.

The initiative emphasizes the importance of preventing adversarial attacks on AI models and promotes best practices in ethical AI system development. By disseminating cutting-edge research and development insights, CoEvolution fosters innovation and inspires the development of advanced detection and mitigation methods in AI. Through this collaborative effort, CoEvolution plays a pivotal role in improving the knowledge and skills of AI Researchers and Developers, ultimately contributing to the overall advancement of the AI sector.</data>
