<edge source="CoEvolution" target="EUIPO">
  <data key="d6">42.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is set to file a minimum of three patents with the European Union Intellectual Property Office (EUIPO) to safeguard crucial intellectual property developed throughout the duration of its project. The EUIPO plays a vital role by offering a framework for the protection of such intellectual property, including patents and trademarks, generated by the CoEvolution project. This initiative underscores CoEvolution's commitment to protecting its innovations and ensuring that its intellectual contributions are legally secured.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution seeks to file patents at the EUIPO to protect its intellectual property created during the project lifecycle.</data>
