<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Key Exploitable Results (KERs)">
  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to delivering Key Exploitable Results (KERs) aimed at enhancing adoption and addressing challenges within the data exploitation ecosystem. The project’s exploitation strategy is centered around these KERs, which encompass a range of products and services developed from the initiative. These KERs are pivotal to CoEvolution's approach, as they directly respond to market needs and are designed to generate sustainable revenue streams through commercially viable offerings. By focusing on the development of KERs throughout the project, CoEvolution seeks to improve industry efficiency and provide valuable solutions to current market demands.</data>
