<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Data Management Plan">
  <data key="d6">64.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution has developed a comprehensive Data Management Plan aimed at ensuring the ethical handling, management, and assessment of data generated throughout its project. This plan highlights the procedures for data generation, management, and exploitation, placing significant emphasis on sensitive data handling requirements. It serves as a critical deliverable for CoEvolution, guiding the project in its commitment to ethical data practices.

Additionally, the Data Management Plan outlines strategies for managing data in compliance with EU legislation, including the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). It is an integral part of the project documentation, detailing the structured approach for systematically handling and sharing the data produced during the CoEvolution project. Through this plan, CoEvolution demonstrates its dedication to maintaining high standards in data management practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution project will establish a Data Management Plan to detail the management and accessibility of research data.</data>
  <data key="d8">data governance,data handling,data management,data planning,document management,ethical data practices,ethical management,project framework,project management,project methodology,project organization,project planning,sensitive information</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-06a47fdddee4a142d2b715a993f104b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f53ece2cac0b6e9ce607bb71e4557106&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93ceeb9a936cfc772c88beda8e90f8f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b09c33ff0da3223617dcddd9463b4752&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51ae40620fffa7ddd9d8ac206e68a24c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c733bc2ac52924fad86b0ae9233921f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c655315fcd0b9413217de724415bfd65</data>
