<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Model Bill of Materials">
  <data key="d6">36.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that actively incorporates the principles of the AI Model Bill of Materials to enhance ethical AI practices. This framework is essential to CoEvolution's research methodology, aligning with the project's goals of ensuring compliance with EU directives regarding AI management. By integrating the AI Model Bill of Materials concept, CoEvolution emphasizes transparency and adherence to ethical considerations throughout the AI model lifecycle. The AI Model Bill of Materials serves as a fundamental component of CoEvolution's objectives, specifically aimed at describing AI models to ensure their security and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI management,compliance emphasis,ethical integrity,ethical practices,framework component,methodology integration,regulatory framework,transparency</data>
