<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM)">
  <data key="d6">41.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that integrates the AI Model Bill of Materials (AIMBOM) into its architecture to enhance risk assessment and security monitoring within the realm of AI models. The CoEvolution project employs the AIMBOM to provide a structured approach for understanding and managing AI models throughout supply chains. Through this integration, the project aims to strengthen AI model management and bolster security and compliance measures. Overall, CoEvolution leverages the capabilities of AIMBOM to improve oversight and governance of AI models in a systematic and effective manner.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution utilizes AIMBOM to ensure security and robustness in AI model management within supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI model security,compliance,framework integration,model management,project component,project objective,risk management,technological integration</data>
