<edge source="CoEvolution" target="European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that receives funding and support from the European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre. This centre serves as the granting authority for CoEvolution and is dedicated to overseeing initiatives that focus on innovation in cybersecurity, particularly in the area of artificial intelligence (AI). It plays a crucial role in linking governmental support with the execution of projects like CoEvolution, ensuring that they align with broader cybersecurity objectives within the European Union. Overall, the European Cybersecurity Competence Centre facilitates the advancement of cybersecurity technologies through its financial backing and oversight of the CoEvolution initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is funded and regulated by the European Cybersecurity Industrial, Technology and Research Competence Centre, which ensures compliance with cybersecurity standards.</data>
