<edge source="CoEvolution" target="SAP">
  <data key="d6">62.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution collaborates closely with SAP as an industrial partner to implement the outcomes of their joint project and provide essential training. SAP plays a critical role in the CoEvolution initiative, notably as the lead for project scope codification, which underscores its integral function in shaping the overall framework of the project. This effort involves defining the project scope, which is essential for the organization and management of the CoEvolution initiative. Additionally, SAP's involvement supports advancements in AI systems research and applications, while also focusing on enhancing data protection measures within the project, addressing critical security and privacy concerns.

Moreover, SAP is heavily engaged in various tasks related to cybersecurity and innovation, further demonstrating its commitment to the project's success. SAP actively participates in delivering documentation as part of its contributions to the CoEvolution project. Together, CoEvolution and SAP are dedicated to driving innovation while ensuring robust protection in their collaborative efforts.</data>
