<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Model Lifecycle">
  <data key="d6">77.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"CoEvolution provides a structured approach to enhance AI model security throughout its entire lifecycle, from design to deployment.")&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a comprehensive initiative dedicated to enhancing the security and resilience of AI models throughout the entire AI Model Lifecycle. The initiative aims to develop defense mechanisms and establish security assessments at every phase of the lifecycle to protect against adversarial attacks and to address identified risks and challenges. By implementing robust defense strategies across various phases, CoEvolution ensures that security and robustness are integral components of both development and deployment processes. Additionally, it emphasizes the critical need for a systematic approach to security, reinforcing its commitment to safeguarding AI systems by focusing on risks and vulnerabilities throughout the lifecycle. Ultimately, CoEvolution provides a robust framework that oversees all aspects of the AI Model Lifecycle, adapting to emerging threats at each stage to bolster model security.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution framework incorporates monitoring and updating of AI model lifecycles to ensure security and efficiency throughout deployment.</data>
