<edge source="CoEvolution" target="KPI4.1">
  <data key="d6">27.0</data>
  <data key="d7">KPI4.1 is a crucial performance indicator used within the CoEvolution framework, aimed at assessing the effectiveness of context vector design in artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This indicator is closely aligned with CoEvolution's objectives, which emphasize the development of context-specific vectors that enhance AI adaptability. By serving as a goal for CoEvolution, KPI4.1 underscores the importance of incorporating context-awareness into AI models, reflecting the organization's commitment to fostering adaptability and resilience. Furthermore, KPI4.1 plays a significant role in measuring progress within the CoEvolution framework by focusing on the design of context-specific vectors.</data>
