<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AI Community">
  <data key="d6">42.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution engages with the AI Community to foster innovation and promote the adoption of security measures in AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an initiative that aims to introduce its framework to the AI community, which is crucial for the framework's adoption and market impact. The organization targets enhancing the resilience of the AI community against adversarial threats through its various initiatives. Additionally, CoEvolution emphasizes the significance of the AI community in standardizing techniques and sharing knowledge, which are vital for improving security measures. By focusing on these aspects, CoEvolution seeks to foster security and collaboration within the AI community, ultimately contributing to a safer and more resilient AI landscape.</data>
