<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Federated Learning (FL)">
  <data key="d6">67.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution explores and integrates Federated Learning (FL) methods to enhance the robustness, privacy, and efficiency of AI model training while maintaining security in collaborative environments. The initiative is focused on facilitating the implementation of FL into industrial processes, underlining the importance of secure practices in this field. CoEvolution aims to improve collaborative AI model performance by enhancing interaction among decentralized clients during the learning process. It prioritizes secure communication and the assessment of FL aggregation servers within cloud infrastructures, which are crucial for effective federated learning.

To address the threat of adversarial attacks, CoEvolution incorporates FL strategies that bolster the resilience of AI models. This includes methods specifically designed to combat adversarial challenges and enhance the overall security of model training. By emphasizing secure implementation and robust methodologies, CoEvolution is committed to ensuring that federated learning applications in industrial settings are both efficient and resilient to threats.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI model approach,collaboration,collaborative learning,collaborative security,decentralization,decentralized cooperation,decentralized learning,distributed learning,integration,learning strategy,model security,privacy,privacy protection,project goal,security,security focus</data>
