<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Security Assurance Mechanism">
  <data key="d6">55.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution implements the Security Assurance Mechanism to monitor the security and trustworthiness of AI models throughout their lifecycle."&lt;&lt;"monitoring, trust assurance&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is dedicated to providing a comprehensive Security Assurance Mechanism that plays a critical role in the secure and trusted lifecycle of AI models. This mechanism is designed to generate credentials, maintain security and trust, and document the trustworthiness of AI models. CoEvolution utilizes this Security Assurance Mechanism to record assessments and ensure that AI models are securely modified and validated, thereby reinforcing their reliability throughout their operational lifespan.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution utilizes a Security Assurance Mechanism to provide certifications for the security status of AI models.</data>
  <data key="d8">9,compliance,credentialing,model enhancement,security certification,security framework,security monitoring,trust assurance,trust validation</data>
