<edge source="CoEvolution" target="AviSense">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AviSense collaborates with CoEvolution to enhance the perception capabilities of autonomous vehicles and bolster their cyber resilience. AviSense provides advanced perception solutions that are crucial for the autonomous driving tests conducted by CoEvolution. Both entities share a focus on improving cooperative awareness and enhancing the overall resilience of Connected and Autonomous Vehicle (CAV) technology against cyber threats, indicating a strong partnership in their efforts to support the development of safer and more reliable autonomous driving systems.</data>
