<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Multi-Agent-Path Planning (MAPP)">
  <data key="d6">41.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution develops the Multi-Agent-Path Planning (MAPP) framework to enhance cooperative navigation strategies for autonomous vehicles. The organization employs MAPP to improve navigation and performance in joint navigation efforts among these vehicles. By integrating MAPP, CoEvolution aims to facilitate better cooperation and collaborative movement in complex environments, ultimately advancing the capabilities of autonomous vehicles in various use cases.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution seeks to enhance Multi-Agent-Path Planning strategies as part of its overall approach to autonomous vehicle navigation and security.</data>
  <data key="d8">cooperation,cooperative systems,cooperative technology,navigation,navigation improvement,navigation strategy,navigation system,security enhancement,technology integration</data>
