  <data key="d11">1755425151</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution" target="HEU-Sec4AI4Sec">
  <data key="d6">77.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution enhances its security testing processes by leveraging valuable insights from HEU-Sec4AI4Sec, thereby significantly advancing the field of AI security testing. This collaboration is essential as it reinforces the robustness of AI systems throughout their ongoing development phases. HEU-Sec4AI4Sec contributes foundational security improvements that integrate seamlessly into CoEvolution's AI initiatives. The insights provided by HEU-Sec4AI4Sec are instrumental in fortifying CoEvolution's methodologies for AI testing, ultimately ensuring a more secure and resilient development environment for artificial intelligence applications. Through this integration of knowledge and practices, CoEvolution is positioned to improve its AI security testing further, thereby enhancing system resilience and security.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-Sec4AI4Sec's enhancements in AI security testing contribute to CoEvolution's overall security standards.&lt;SEP&gt;HEU-Sec4AI4Sec's focus on enhancing AI security aligns with the CoEvolution mission to improve robustness and trust in AI systems.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI security,collaboration,foundational security,project alignment,project collaboration,project development,project integration,project synergy,security enhancement,security focus,security improvement,security testing,support</data>
