  <data key="d6">24.0</data>
  <data key="d7">KPI-UC2.6 assesses how deterministic the planning processes are in CoEvolution after experiencing a cyber-attack.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.6 is integral to evaluating the mitigation strategies applied by CoEvolution in the context of AI and vehicle planning after attacks.&lt;SEP&gt;KPI-UC2.6 pertains to the determinability of mitigation strategies, which is crucial for the planning aspects in CoEvolution's initiatives.</data>
