<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Security Professionals and Researchers">
  <data key="d6">52.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution aims to enhance security for Security Professionals and Researchers in AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a project that specifically addresses the needs of security professionals by emphasizing the principles of security-by-design and resilience. Its focus on resilience is particularly significant in countering adversarial attacks, making it highly relevant to both security professionals and researchers. These stakeholders play a crucial role in contributing their expertise to enhance the security measures that CoEvolution develops. Furthermore, security professionals and researchers benefit from CoEvolution's commitment to integrating security-by-design principles and fostering resilience in artificial intelligence (AI) models against adversarial threats. Overall, CoEvolution creates a collaborative environment that enhances the effectiveness and robustness of security solutions in the face of evolving challenges.&lt;SEP&gt;Security Professionals and Researchers utilize CoEvolution's knowledge to tackle adversarial threats in network security.</data>
  <data key="d8">adversarial security,expertise contribution,impact on professionals,professional benefit,professional interest,project engagement,research support,security enhancement,security focus,security relevance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a859909fffb7947b2b88ac3fcc588943&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd49d5a257b3871e2279f29bb34ee6c2</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1756144363</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution" target="End Users of AI Systems and General Public">
  <data key="d6">55.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution aims to provide enhanced and trustworthy AI systems to end users in various sectors, ensuring safety and reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is dedicated to ensuring that the end users of AI systems and the general public benefit from trustworthy and safe AI technologies. The project's primary goal is to provide end users with more reliable and ethical AI systems, adhering to high ethical standards. Through its initiatives, CoEvolution aims to create safer AI applications, enhancing both security and trust in these technologies. Ultimately, the CoEvolution project serves the interests of both end users and the general public, focusing on improving the overall quality and safety of AI applications.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution raises awareness about AI system security for End Users and the General Public.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI enhancement,awareness campaign,beneficiary impact,end user benefits,ethical AI,project outcome,public engagement,trust enhancement,user benefit,user safety</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-8a11effda0341e9607fb32b151bd7543&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d69ac7cb43276601482059fe1cb59288&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71d059c64791540cd7b1be431b2bb96a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5c5b42d758f0e912d601391fdcb4fc8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce309416a5f270733627cf964258234f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8782f7bcbf75d4d1028092d25490a43d</data>
