</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Industry and Business Leaders">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution demonstrates value to Industry and Business Leaders for resilient AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is an organization dedicated to enhancing the implementation of artificial intelligence (AI) technologies, particularly focusing on secure and effective usage. The initiatives undertaken by CoEvolution have the potential to significantly influence how industry and business leaders leverage AI within their operations. These leaders, recognized as crucial stakeholders, play an essential role in the success of the CoEvolution project, particularly in terms of maximizing the impact of AI applications. By integrating CoEvolution's strategies and insights, especially those relating to contextual awareness in AI, industry and business leaders can achieve considerable enhancements in operational effectiveness and application outcomes across their respective sectors.</data>
  <data key="d8">application impact,business benefits,business engagement,business relevance,business strategy,industry impact,project engagement,project relevance,strategic integration</data>
