  <data key="d6">37.0</data>
  <data key="d7">IMT is actively involved in the CoEvolution project, contributing significantly as a research partner. It serves as a lead beneficiary, delivering key components essential to the project's overall objectives. IMT’s participation encompasses providing research and technological insights, with a particular focus on developments related to artificial intelligence (AI). Through its various roles, IMT enhances the research goals of the CoEvolution project, ensuring a robust contribution to its success.&lt;SEP&gt;IMT is involved in the CoEvolution project focusing on MVP development as a lead beneficiary.</data>
