<edge source="CoEvolution" target="STS">
  <data key="d6">60.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is a project that includes multiple consortium members, prominently featuring Sphynx Technology Solutions (STS). STS is integral to the CoEvolution consortium, leveraging its expertise in relevant technological domains to facilitate ethical practices in AI technologies. As a key participant, STS actively engages in various events and activities related to CoEvolution, contributing significantly to the collaborative efforts aimed at advancing technological solutions.

In addition to their role in ethical standards, STS is involved in several research initiatives within the CoEvolution project, focusing particularly on research and development in AI safety. The company also collaborates actively in the areas of standardization and the dissemination of project findings. Through its diverse contributions, STS supports the overarching objectives of the CoEvolution project, emphasizing technological innovation and collaboration among consortium members.&lt;SEP&gt;STS is involved in the CoEvolution initiative as an SME, aiding in various research and project activities.&lt;SEP&gt;STS is involved in the CoEvolution consortium and contributes to its projects.</data>
