<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Homomorphic Encryption (HE)">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution is dedicated to implementing Homomorphic Encryption (HE) as a defense mechanism designed to secure communications during interactions involving artificial intelligence models. The project extensively studies the application of Homomorphic Encryption to ensure safe communication within AI systems. As a critical component of the CoEvolution framework, Homomorphic Encryption plays a vital role in safeguarding data privacy while facilitating collaboration. By leveraging this technology, CoEvolution aims to protect privacy effectively during AI computations, thereby enhancing the overall security of AI communications.</data>
  <data key="d8">adversarial defense,data confidentiality,encryption,privacy protection,secure communication,technology application</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-1f13e4e9d2acd6290e2eddd212bdd3df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ba33a72c094c154f14017eb9f433f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f8a78502e4359c56e2de032610b38aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b9d5508965f4ddd6b9dc8dab9cebb0f</data>
