<edge source="CoEvolution" target="Collaborative Learning Paradigm">
  <data key="d6">45.0</data>
  <data key="d7">CoEvolution addresses cybersecurity issues within the Collaborative Learning Paradigm to ensure secure communication among AI agents.&lt;SEP&gt;CoEvolution is a framework that integrates collaborative learning practices to enhance the training of AI models in various environments. It is rooted in the Collaborative Learning Paradigm, which emphasizes the importance of data privacy and model training among distributed users. The methodologies developed within CoEvolution support and are aligned with the principles of collaborative learning paradigms, which aim to improve AI model performance. Additionally, CoEvolution places significant emphasis on securing communication channels between AI agents to mitigate the risk of cybersecurity attacks, further reinforcing its commitment to enhancing both the reliability and efficiency of AI systems through collaborative approaches.&lt;SEP&gt;The Collaborative Learning Paradigm is a focus area for CoEvolution, where multiple models collaborate to improve learning outcomes.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI effectiveness,AI training,collaboration,collaborative defense,cybersecurity measures,data privacy,inter-agent security,learning framework,learning methodology,machine learning improvement</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-79ea744ae4e3f1f659f9ca366d26d3a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-641f4278299d91bb3b1622868a1f623d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05ba33a72c094c154f14017eb9f433f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dd242577c3ba63c0f548e5aa31a5820&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c72c011b17c39e8efb359d372a0af32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6353e9bcf3d45e130811688e5860477</data>
