<edge source="Horizon Europe" target="DESCA">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">DESCA, an organization dedicated to supporting EU research initiatives, plays a crucial role in the management of projects funded under Horizon Europe. It creates model agreements that serve as templates for various project-related agreements, thereby facilitating compliance and collaboration among stakeholders involved in these initiatives. Among its offerings, DESCA provides the Model Consortium Agreement, which is specifically designed for Horizon Europe projects, ensuring structured collaboration and effective project management. Overall, DESCA is instrumental in providing the necessary agreements that streamline and support the management of Horizon Europe funded projects.</data>
