<edge source="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement" target="DESCA">
  <data key="d6">88.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is a model framework designed for organizations participating in Horizon Europe projects. It is fundamentally based on the Model Consortium Agreement provided by DESCA (Development of a European Standard for Consortium Agreements), which plays a critical role in shaping its content and structure. DESCA oversees the guidelines that govern the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement, ensuring that established procedures are followed and that various collaboration aspects, including Access Rights, are clearly articulated.

By offering comprehensive guidelines, DESCA significantly aids in aligning the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement with the necessary requirements for effective collaboration in Horizon Europe initiatives. This ensures clarity and consistency in project collaboration, underlining DESCA's essential role in facilitating the development and adherence to the collaborative aims of Horizon Europe projects. Overall, the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is effectively supported by DESCA, making it a vital instrument for research and innovation collaborations within the Horizon Europe framework.</data>
  <data key="d8">agreement facilitation,agreement framework,collaboration,compliance,documentation,foundational document,framework,framework provision,guidance,guidelines,organizational framework,organizational oversight,organizational role,regulatory framework,research collaboration,template provision</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-f27907e0f1cca34615e2743e211e3915&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9af1226bfbc3ea69059eb3576fcaf4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8daee7887465a1bbc64f6da189934ce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5eb0595846d444fbd08dfeeed4f13a0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c996e92a321a548b9762f96a234cf48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ceb7cbd40f9a45f01986a8223d768e54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23bb168a6eb96b8932c2abd02b87a7b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c811c5c2da7facca7b18e0019c9ea9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419476</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement" target="Granting Authority">
  <data key="d6">32.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is governed by specific provisions set forth by the Granting Authority, which is responsible for providing the necessary funding for the project. The Granting Authority not only awards the grant but also ensures compliance with the financial stipulations detailed in the Consortium Agreement. Furthermore, the Agreement explicitly acknowledges the Granting Authority as the entity that provides funds for the CoEvolution project, highlighting its pivotal role in supporting the initiative and overseeing its financial aspects.</data>
  <data key="d8">compliance,fund oversight,funding,granting body,project funding,project oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f271cb21c3e352192b6e5d9f263eec2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419314</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement" target="General Assembly">
  <data key="d6">47.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The General Assembly, as delineated in the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement, serves as the governing body responsible for decision-making processes and ensuring adherence to the terms of the agreement. It conducts its meetings according to protocols established within the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement and plays a pivotal role in overseeing participation and Access Rights. Additionally, the General Assembly is tasked with the oversight of any modifications to the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement, ensuring that all involved parties comply with its stipulations. Thus, the General Assembly is integral to the governance structure of the CoEvolution Consortium, guiding project execution and maintaining the integrity of the collaborative framework established by the agreement.</data>
  <data key="d8">approval process,compliance,consortium governance,decision-making,governance,management role,meeting procedures</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-7b31cd9f391e84711dd5b3744b4d008a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f737a86267a87605168fd1ae879e6180&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ad85c72a1fdaf22b42cfab6d99532ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419463</data>
</edge>
