<edge source="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement" target="Grant Agreement">
  <data key="d6">44.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is intrinsically linked to the Grant Agreement, which serves as a foundational document for the consortium's operations. The provisions outlined in the Grant Agreement significantly influence the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement, particularly in areas such as access rights and confidentiality. Furthermore, the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement delineates the responsibilities of consortium members in relation to the obligations set forth in the Grant Agreement. Additionally, it is essential for the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement to comply with the terms established by the Grant Agreement to ensure the proper execution of the project.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is tied to the Grant Agreement, setting out the relationship and specific obligations of the Parties involved in the project.</data>
  <data key="d8">compliance,contractual obligations,contractual relationship,foundational document,funding conditions,legal framework,project guidance,project management</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-6599f093b4ec88ee5238eadeb9162efd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72b68418a8ead942187d57bc3764f34d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9958663eec02e383c065626a74bfdabd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5e441f8c44c114214f8184f4a2b10a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8725d84f8b773d46e6200fdd9fab9de7</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419453</data>
</edge>
<edge source="CoEvolution Consortium Agreement" target="DESCA - Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement and the DESCA - Model Consortium Agreement for Horizon Europe are both formal documents that guide the governance and collaboration among consortia involved in Horizon Europe projects. The CoEvolution Consortium Agreement is a specific adaptation of the model agreement provided by DESCA, reflecting the framework established for consortia in these collaborative research initiatives. It is built upon the guidelines provided by the DESCA model, ensuring that the principles and structures outlined are effectively implemented in the context of the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
  <data key="d8">agreement framework,consortium agreement,framework,governance framework,model agreement,project governance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163e8dfb11222dec22dc86de3c28a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419470</data>
</edge>
