  <data key="d11">1755419186</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Grant Agreement">
  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Grant Agreement is a formal document established between the involved Parties and the Granting Authority, which details the funding contributions and project responsibilities. This agreement governs the financial support provided by the Granting Authority, ensuring adherence to the terms outlined in the Consortium Plan. Additionally, the Granting Authority is responsible for issuing the Grant Agreement, which specifies the funding conditions and delineates the responsibilities of all parties involved. Furthermore, the Granting Authority oversees the implementation of the Grant Agreement and retains the authority to suspend payments if compliance issues arise.</data>
  <data key="d8">agreement conditions,compliance oversight,fund management,funding,funding regulations,governance,legal framework</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-9aeb98f7220f8ac33b9ea96243f02f57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee906c164033c38c47ee9b5abf0836f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755422166</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Consortium Agreement">
  <data key="d6">8.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Granting Authority's oversight is essential for the validity and execution of the terms within the Consortium Agreement.</data>
  <data key="d8">governance,oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-8c12a8ce9dbccebc341927add84979a3</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419191</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Granting Authority's Financial Contribution">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Granting Authority provides financial contributions for the Project, which are detailed in the Consortium Plan.</data>
  <data key="d8">financial contribution,funding</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419195</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="General Assembly">
  <data key="d6">13.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The General Assembly can propose changes to the Granting Authority concerning project management and funding decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The General Assembly formulates proposals related to agreements with the Granting Authority, influencing project governance.</data>
  <data key="d8">decision-making,governance,project oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419475</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Coordinator">
  <data key="d6">58.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Coordinator acts on behalf of the beneficiaries in their interactions with the Granting Authority, serving as a crucial intermediary for communication regarding project assignments and claims. This role encompasses several important responsibilities, including administering the financial contributions received from the Granting Authority and ensuring compliance with the project's requirements. The Coordinator is tasked with managing the funds allocated for the project, which includes handling approvals, monitoring project deliverables, and submitting essential reports to the Granting Authority to meet their oversight obligations. By operating under the guidelines and funding stipulations set by the Granting Authority, the Coordinator ensures that all financial protocols are adhered to throughout the duration of the project, thereby facilitating its success.</data>
  <data key="d8">communication,financial administration,financial management,financial oversight,fund management,funding,management,oversight,project oversight,reporting,representation</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-884efa32a7364a4e3afb2c062c3914da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755422173</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Beneficiary">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Beneficiary and the Granting Authority are engaged in a formal relationship governed by the terms specified in the Grant Agreement. The Granting Authority provides funds to Beneficiaries to support their projects while maintaining oversight of the financial transactions related to these grants. Beneficiaries are required to formally notify the Granting Authority prior to transferring ownership or licensing, ensuring compliance with the established regulatory framework. Furthermore, the Beneficiary is accountable to the Granting Authority for adhering to the terms of the agreement, which includes fulfilling any potential liabilities that may arise. Overall, the Granting Authority plays a crucial role in overseeing the terms and conditions applicable to the Beneficiary's acceptance of the grant, ensuring that all parties adhere to the specified requirements.</data>
  <data key="d8">9,accountability,financial support,funding,grant compliance,grant management,notification process,recipient obligations,regulatory oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f209ba7faab244fa0ec2f617b5183fda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-340cab0aeae7a8a4e864f5fb97fb2b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc1f667d5d7b593ff074f4172cecd6e</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755422155</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Access Rights">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Granting Authority determines the Access Rights that Parties have to the Results generated in the project.</data>
  <data key="d8">funding,rights management</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419324</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Project">
  <data key="d6">10.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Granting Authority funds the Project and regulates the financial contributions outlined in the agreements.</data>
  <data key="d8">funding,project support</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755419474</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Granting Authority" target="EU Classified Information">
  <data key="d6">9.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The handling and disclosure of EU Classified Information is tightly regulated by the Granting Authority to ensure security compliance.</data>
  <data key="d8">information handling,security compliance</data>
