<edge source="Granting Authority" target="Beneficiaries">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Granting Authority provides funding to Beneficiaries, who must manage and report on the use of these funds responsibly.&lt;SEP&gt;The beneficiaries of the CoEvolution project are required to report to the granting authority regarding their compliance with data processing regulations. The granting authority plays a crucial role in overseeing agreements and providing support to the beneficiaries, ensuring that they adhere to the established guidelines. Furthermore, the granting authority is responsible for monitoring compliance, and it has the authority to take action should the beneficiaries fail to meet their reporting obligations. It also provides the framework and requirements that beneficiaries must follow in their actions under the CoEvolution Project Document.</data>
