<edge source="Associated Partners" target="Grant Agreement">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Associated Partners are integral to the implementation of the Project, as outlined in the Grant Agreement. They are committed to fulfilling the obligations specified in the Grant Agreement, which includes implementing defined tasks and adhering to the guidelines and responsibilities set forth to ensure project compliance. Although Associated Partners do not directly sign the Grant Agreement, they are defined in relation to it and possess specific roles that influence their responsibilities within the project. Importantly, they operate without receiving funding support, yet their commitment to the terms of the Grant Agreement remains critical to the project's overall success.</data>
  <data key="d8">collaboration,commitment,compliance,contractual obligations,funding limitations,governance,indirect participation,project governance,roles</data>
