<edge source="General Assembly" target="Coordinator">
  <data key="d6">128.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Coordinator communicates with the General Assembly regarding breaches of obligations and payment issues concerning parties involved in their agreements. Acting as an intermediary between the Parties and the Granting Authority, the Coordinator chairs the General Assembly meetings, which are crucial for decision-making processes.

In this role, the Coordinator manages the smooth operations of the General Assembly by facilitating coordination among members, overseeing meetings, and managing the voting process during decision-making. The Coordinator has the authority to act based on the decisions made by the General Assembly, particularly in matters relating to breaches of obligations, which must be reported to the Assembly as part of the Coordinator's oversight responsibilities.

The Coordinator is also responsible for financial management, making this role integral to the assembly's operations. Conversely, the General Assembly oversees the Coordinator, evaluating their performance and can propose changes to their position if coordination tasks are not fulfilled adequately. Additionally, the General Assembly has the authority to hold the Coordinator accountable for any financial mismanagement that might arise.

This collaborative dynamic between the Coordinator and the General Assembly ensures effective governance and accountability within their framework, with the General Assembly also having the power to decide on legal actions against any breaching Party and providing guidance that influences the Coordinator's management actions concerning consortium agreements.</data>
  <data key="d8">authority,compliance,coordination,decision facilitation,decision-making,facilitation,governance,leadership,management,management oversight,organizational structure,oversight</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-8d78b6916c07894b52e49fb0226ca1de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8eaae213c278ba06a759f0d91e6d71c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc042244536a2c477c732ec854a8e51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e00a4e19d0d0ff1473ebdef441a1463&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d70be6cc96049933abcbd5d9cfc8374&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1fd5d76650ba686326c9347bd47e69a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53de78ee256314f49b2496da2bf2ac29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-163e8dfb11222dec22dc86de3c28a3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45c41aa4c4e38dda43fae0f22b2c010&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-876d5a07d8e572ddca68ea75a19f396f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87403324e3568e1b98a5a74b67704968&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2e8770375019a8ec84b226fe246ed3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-561ef15ef8c11dbe41ee0269571778b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b16d7e5b3a3a268a0ce73110385b9440</data>
