<edge source="Background" target="Results">
  <data key="d6">41.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Background is essential for the generation of Results in the project, and access rights pertain to both.&lt;SEP&gt;The Results generated by AVL are intrinsically linked to the Background information and technology provided under Access Rights. These Results, which stem from the collaborative Project, rely heavily on the Background provided by the Parties, reflecting a clear interdependence in their collaboration. Furthermore, Access Rights to the Background are essential for the exploitation of the Results within the Project framework. The information and conditions embedded in the Background play a pivotal role in informing the Results produced during the Project, ensuring that specific criteria for access and use are adhered to.</data>
  <data key="d8">access rights,collaboration,dependency,information usage,interdependence,project outputs,project prerequisites,resource utilization,technology utilization</data>
