  <data key="d7">"The Parties are obligated to maintain the confidentiality of Confidential Information disclosed during the project.")&lt;SEP&gt;Confidential Information is critical to the operations of the Parties involved. The Parties are obligated to safeguard this sensitive data, ensuring that any dissemination of Confidential Information requires prior approval to prevent unauthorized disclosure. Additionally, the Parties must protect Confidential Information belonging to others, adhering strictly to the definitions and stipulations outlined in the CoEvolution Consortium Agreement throughout the implementation of the project. Their responsibilities also encompass the careful management and handling of any Confidential Information shared during the course of the project, further emphasizing the importance of maintaining confidentiality and proper authorization processes.</data>
