<edge source="IMT" target="UPatras">
  <data key="d6">64.0</data>
  <data key="d7">In the CoEvolution project, UPatras has assumed responsibilities previously held by IMT, marking a significant organizational transition within the project's consortium. This change arose from alterations in the leadership of the Principal Investigator, leading to UPatras replacing IMT specifically in this capacity. The transition not only highlights a shift in project roles but also involves a reallocation of partner responsibilities, ensuring continuity in task execution. Overall, these developments signify a notable change in the organizational structure and operational dynamics of the project, reflecting modifications in partnerships as UPatras takes on its new role.</data>
