  <data key="d6">22.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AVL adapts its testbed to ensure compatibility with the CoEvolution framework to enable effective integration.&lt;SEP&gt;AVL adapts their equipment to ensure compatibility with the infrastructure necessary for the CoEvolution framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Framework collaborates with AVL to develop CAV testing infrastructures that enhance vehicle performance and safety.</data>
