<edge source="AVL" target="AVI">
  <data key="d6">46.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AVL and AVI are collaborating on several pilot projects within the CoEvolution initiative, which aims to enhance security for AI models across various applications. Their partnership focuses primarily on addressing challenges related to AI models in the autonomous vehicle sector. Together, they are committed to providing advanced infrastructure for testing autonomous driving capabilities. Specifically, AVL and AVI are also working jointly on CAV (Connected and Autonomous Vehicle) testing infrastructure, which includes the validation of valet parking setups for autonomous vehicles. Through this collaboration, they are advancing the development and security of AI technologies in the field of autonomous driving.&lt;SEP&gt;AVL collaborates with AVI in the CoEvolution project to address challenges in the autonomous vehicles domain, particularly concerning AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Both AVI and AVL are working on different aspects of vehicle technology under the CoEvolution project.</data>
  <data key="d8">collaboration,collaborative effort,common objective,infrastructure development,partnership,project partnership,technological development,testing infrastructure</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-58bbe4f5990fa2bf4939eaf879cf277a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddfc5f9eb88fc57c1e7d42c942cb16c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21c47283aa17272462fab245e43ac76b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c87d6a857aafb6563d655e01caf5221&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd918c8cc0ef3c8f701d30a2593d7cb3</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755424348</data>
</edge>
