<edge source="DIE" target="CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine">
  <data key="d6">34.0</data>
  <data key="d7">DIE is actively engaged in the development of the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine, which is designed to ensure security and effectiveness throughout the entire lifecycle of AI models. As the lead entity on this initiative, DIE is responsible for tasks related to model safety and plays a crucial role in supporting the various stages of the engine's development, including contributions to Task 5.4. The overarching aim of the CoEvolution Security Assurance Engine is to safeguard AI models, thereby enhancing their security and operational reliability.</data>
