<edge source="DIE" target="Task 3.4">
  <data key="d6">42.0</data>
  <data key="d7">DIE leads Task 3.4, a crucial component of the CoEvolution Project, which is centered on data requirements and collection essential for the development of AI models. This leadership role underscores DIE's significant involvement in establishing the data criteria necessary for the AI model lifecycle within the project. Through Task 3.4, DIE is actively addressing and gathering the data needed to support the objectives of the CoEvolution initiative.</data>
