<edge source="DIE" target="Work Package WP5">
  <data key="d6">33.0</data>
  <data key="d7">DIE is the leader and manager of Work Package WP5 within the CoEvolution project. This work package focuses on security assurance and monitoring of AI models throughout their lifecycle. DIE's responsibilities include implementing security assurance techniques and monitoring strategies to enhance the overall security of the AI models being developed. Additionally, DIE is accountable for the deliverable D5.2, which contributes to the project's mission by providing essential technical reporting related to these security efforts.</data>
