<edge source="DIE" target="D5.2">
  <data key="d6">40.0</data>
  <data key="d7">D5.2 and DIE are closely interconnected within the context of their contributions to the security assurance repository. D5.2 is identified as both a deliverable and a correlation point with DIE, which indicates its role in the production of the security assurance repository. Specifically, D5.2 represents the monitoring repository that is delivered by DIE, contributing to the objectives of work package WP5. Meanwhile, DIE is responsible for producing this security assurance and monitoring repository as outlined in D5.2. Furthermore, DIE actively oversees the deliverable D5.2, emphasizing its significant role in the project's overall framework and execution. Together, D5.2 and DIE play critical roles in ensuring the development and management of the project's security assurance mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;D5.2 is produced by DIE, focusing on the security assurance repository for the project.</data>
  <data key="d8">deliverable creation,deliverable responsibility,document responsibility,organizational role,project contribution,project involvement,repository management</data>
