<edge source="UNICA" target="SecML">
  <data key="d6">31.0</data>
  <data key="d7">SecML is an initiative developed and supported by UNICA to provide solutions for mitigating adversarial attacks in machine learning applications. UNICA plays a crucial role by offering the SecML library, which is essential for enhancing the adversarial robustness of AI models. This library aims to improve the defenses against adversarial attacks in machine learning systems, thereby bolstering the overall security and reliability of AI applications.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI enhancement,collaboration,organizational support,security focus,software development,support,tool provision</data>
