<edge source="Security Runtime Monitoring Engine" target="AI MBOM">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The AI MBOM (Model Bill of Materials) structure plays a crucial role in supporting the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine (SRME) by providing essential components necessary for monitoring the operations of artificial intelligence models. The SRME is responsible for managing the AI MBOM, ensuring its authenticity and maintaining the overall integrity of the system through established security protocols. Additionally, the SRME validates and updates the AI MBOM by capturing and processing runtime events from the AI model, thereby ensuring the accuracy and functionality of the AI MBOM. Ultimately, the Security Runtime Monitoring Engine safeguards the integrity of the AI MBOM, facilitating robust monitoring and validation processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Security Runtime Monitoring Engine manages the integrity and updates of the AI MBOM during AI model operations.</data>
  <data key="d8">AI operations,data integrity,data management,integrity monitoring,management,model integrity,monitoring,risk management,structural support,validation</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-eb4040a2488eeffc23e871128baac597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-29a64033d909953d984427106205f924&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6379cdca686a83d4dcc68c446a27b1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4d107384e3edcbe7422a87890a602648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95ef324e25221cc1aac49364c3a0e044</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426434</data>
</edge>
