<edge source="AI MBOM" target="AI Model">
  <data key="d6">52.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AI MBOM documents the various components and processes of the associated AI Model, ensuring accountability and transparency.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM (Artificial Intelligence Model Bill of Materials) is intricately linked to AI models, serving as a detailed repository that outlines their characteristics and security vulnerabilities for enhancement purposes. It acts as a certification for AI models, ensuring adherence to essential security and compliance standards within the CoEvolution ecosystem. Each AI MBOM is uniquely tied to a specific AI model, facilitating comprehensive tracking and providing crucial documentation regarding the model's development and performance. This association is vital for validating the model's trustworthiness and ensuring that all necessary details are available for evaluation. Overall, the AI MBOM plays a critical role in the management and oversight of AI models, enhancing their security and operational reliability.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI Model is uniquely associated with an AI MBOM, which captures information necessary to support its governance and compliance.</data>
  <data key="d8">accountability,association,compliance,documentation,governance,model association,model documentation,security enhancement,tracking,trust certification,validation</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-b217cefad4abec670ed7ca0d4128679d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a591c892291649de34c3de312c2e971a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c366ab8df2f44a9f385a6868c2d6be3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3d1f4cd119004da61bb670635808ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b65576c05d96906d2692fc35b3941f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4c1166600f780f6e57409778e6ccb9</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426062</data>
</edge>
<edge source="AI MBOM" target="EU AI Act">
  <data key="d6">45.0</data>
  <data key="d7">AI MBOM processes adhere to the regulations outlined in the EU AI Act, focusing on ethical AI and risk management.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM is designed to align with the requirements set forth by the EU AI Act, ensuring compliance with both ethical and regulatory standards in the development of artificial intelligence models. It embodies guidelines that are crucial for maintaining ethical practices in AI model creation. Furthermore, updates to the AI MBOM may be influenced by regulatory changes stemming from the EU AI Act, which directly addresses compliance measures for AI models. Additionally, the AI MBOM plays a significant role in ensuring compliance with the EU AI Act by containing vital information pertinent to regulatory compliance related to AI security.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI MBOM must adhere to regulations outlined in the EU AI Act to ensure compliance and trustworthiness of the AI models it certifies.</data>
  <data key="d8">certification,compliance,ethical AI,ethical standards,regulation,regulation compliance,regulation impact,regulatory compliance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-f295eb2f2354216e1d16d8a2d43424b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b217cefad4abec670ed7ca0d4128679d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36176d0f31881be69e8416ed157129c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2be40177ccd661e4813abe35732bfb90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b65576c05d96906d2692fc35b3941f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa4c1166600f780f6e57409778e6ccb9</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755426061</data>
</edge>
