</edge>
<edge source="P4L" target="Trusted Execution Environments">
  <data key="d6">31.0</data>
  <data key="d7">P4L does not rely on specialized hardware but utilizes other security measures like partial Homomorphic Encryption for privacy preservation.&lt;SEP&gt;P4L presents a decentralized alternative for securing user data, emphasizing its independence from Trusted Execution Environments (TEEs). Unlike other systems that rely on specialized hardware, P4L operates without the necessity for TEEs, which sets it apart in the realm of data security. However, it may incorporate TEEs in specific scenarios, such as safeguarding data during decentralized learning processes. Overall, P4L focuses on fully distributed learning, prioritizing infrastructure independence and a robust security framework without the use of specialized hardware.</data>
  <data key="d8">6,hardware use,privacy measures,privacy preservation,security alternatives,security enhancement,system dependency,technology integration,technology reliance</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-0d7f2c53ed2b4b73ced4214f41c6193a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7d7dd122ed2c0928bca9de4f77ffb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755425101</data>
</edge>
<edge source="P4L" target="Peer-to-Peer Learning Systems">
  <data key="d6">17.0</data>
  <data key="d7">P4L is a type of peer-to-peer learning system designed to enhance collaborative learning without centralization.&lt;SEP&gt;P4L is an example of a peer-to-peer learning system designed to provide collaborative learning capabilities without central authority.</data>
  <data key="d8">collaborative learning,decentralized learning,system design,system type</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71006e55cf73aa373312d69b3b443261</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755421426</data>
</edge>
<edge source="P4L" target="Blockchain">
  <data key="d6">31.0</data>
  <data key="d7">P4L is a decentralized learning system that distinguishes itself by not relying on Blockchain technology. It emphasizes a fully distributed architecture, further highlighting its commitment to a decentralized approach in contrast to traditional peer-to-peer systems. By exploring alternatives to Blockchain, P4L achieves a completely decentralized method for coordinating decentralized learning, ensuring there are no centralized dependencies within its design.</data>
  <data key="d8">8,decentralization,system design,technology alternative,technology comparison</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7d7dd122ed2c0928bca9de4f77ffb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-125a6d8c6730e236d423f077d38dc767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1755425993</data>
</edge>
<edge source="P4L" target="Interplanetary File System (IPFS)">
  <data key="d6">37.0</data>
  <data key="d7">"P4L may utilize concepts from the Interplanetary File System (IPFS) in its decentralized framework for data sharing.")&lt;SEP&gt;P4L is a platform that offers an infrastructure-less alternative for data sharing, operating independently of systems like the Interplanetary File System (IPFS). This independence signifies a departure from reliance on external networks, enabling enhanced privacy and flexibility within its framework. P4L is characterized by its self-contained nature, which supports collaborative learning without depending on external systems such as IPFS. Overall, P4L provides a unique solution for data sharing that prioritizes infrastructure independence and user privacy.</data>
  <data key="d8">8,data sharing,decentralization,decentralized architecture,decentralized learning,independence,system design,system independence</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-5092e32b5e7f6b1dc6a316b8941ea4c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdb47fa58e505f36db27509e998c725c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7d7dd122ed2c0928bca9de4f77ffb21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-125a6d8c6730e236d423f077d38dc767&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e06c3c78a2faf8db92a10b50f161ff</data>
