  <data key="d7">P4L leverages Homomorphic Encryption to maintain the privacy and utility of shared gradients during collaborative learning.&lt;SEP&gt;P4L utilizes Homomorphic Encryption during the gradient averaging process to ensure data confidentiality and prevent information leakage.</data>
