<edge source="GDPR" target="CoEvolution Consortium">
  <data key="d6">43.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CoEvolution Consortium is committed to adhering to the GDPR in its handling of personal data throughout its projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The CoEvolution Consortium is dedicated to ensuring compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) in its operations and project implementations. As part of their commitment, they focus on the regulatory implications of GDPR, emphasizing its significance in their activities. The Consortium actively addresses GDPR compliance within their data management practices, particularly concerning the management of personal data in AI projects. This comprehensive approach reflects the Consortium's dedication to upholding data protection standards in all aspects of their work.</data>
