<edge source="Localization AI" target="Localization Beacon Devices">
  <data key="d6">35.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Localization AI is a technology that leverages Localization Beacon Devices to enhance asset tracking and logistics management, particularly within the manufacturing sector. The integration of these beacon devices is crucial for the effective operation of Localization AI, as they significantly improve the accuracy of asset tracking. By utilizing Localization Beacon Devices, Localization AI aims to optimize logistics processes and localization precision for better overall efficiency in managing assets.</data>
