<edge source="Localization Beacon Devices" target="Localization Tag Devices">
  <data key="d6">31.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Localization Beacon Devices and Localization Tag Devices are integral components that together enable the wireless tracking and management of assets. Localization Beacon Devices enhance the tracking capabilities of assets by working in conjunction with Localization Tag Devices. These devices function in tandem, facilitating effective asset tracking through their collaborative operation.</data>
  <data key="d8">asset localization,asset management,complementary devices,tracking synergy,tracking system,tracking technology</data>
