<edge source="CAVs" target="Cooperative Perception">
  <data key="d6">36.0</data>
  <data key="d7">Connected and Automated Vehicles (CAVs) employ Cooperative Perception as a key technology to enhance their environmental awareness and understanding. By sharing sensor data among vehicles, CAVs can improve their ability to model and comprehend their surroundings. This collaboration allows CAVs to improve their environmental awareness and modeling capabilities significantly through the exchange of information among agents. Overall, Cooperative Perception plays a vital role in optimizing the performance and safety of CAVs by fostering a comprehensive understanding of the vehicle's environment through shared data.</data>
  <data key="d8">collaborative strategy,enhanced sensing,environmental awareness,information sharing,sensor collaboration,vehicle networking</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-b5cc533b2db505c23b211fa8248d014e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1085773cd43df1afe7247dd49f7475fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75554414522e9656908eb2a8c6a7c1b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71092d984871a58c8af5088c4c2d7412</data>
