<edge source="National Transportation Safety Board" target="Highway HWY18MH010">
  <data key="d6">44.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The National Transportation Safety Board (NTSB) conducted a thorough investigation into an accident that occurred on Highway HWY18MH010, which involved an autonomous vehicle. This investigation highlights the NTSB's regulatory oversight concerning transportation accidents, as they assessed the implications of the incident for overall transportation safety. The examination of the Highway HWY18MH010 accident is specifically linked to autonomous vehicles, showcasing the NTSB's ongoing efforts to ensure safety standards in emerging transportation technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;The National Transportation Safety Board is responsible for the preliminary report on the traffic incident denoted HWY18MH010.</data>
  <data key="d8">9,accident report,investigation,transportation safety</data>
